rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "If an attacking creature has intimidate, what colors it is matters only as the defending player declares blockers. Once it\'s blocked, changing its colors won\'t change that."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Intimidate looks at the current colors of a creature that has it. Normally, Bladetusk Boar can\'t be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or red creatures. If it\'s turned blue, then it can\'t be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or blue creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-10-17\', \'text\': "If you cast Hypnotic Siren for its bestow cost, and you gain control of a creature with a constellation ability, that ability will trigger when Hypnotic Siren enters the battlefield. You\'ll control that triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura that becomes a creature is no longer put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action. Rather, it becomes unattached and remains on the battlefield as long as it\'s a creature. While it\'s a creature, it can\'t be attached to another permanent or player. An Aura that\'s not attached to a legal permanent or player as defined by its enchant ability and also isn\'t a creature will be put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Auras attached to a creature don\'t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can\'t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "On the stack, a spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It\'s never both, although it\'s an enchantment spell in either case."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow isn\'t countered if its target is illegal as it begins to resolve. Rather, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, it returns to being an enchantment creature spell, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn\'t put into its owner\'s graveyard if it becomes unattached. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its {T} abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it\'s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Although Sightless Brawler or the creature it enchants can\'t attack alone, other attacking creatures don\'t have to attack the same player or planeswalker. For example, Sightless Brawler could attack an opponent and another creature could attack a planeswalker that opponent controls."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura that becomes a creature is no longer put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action. Rather, it becomes unattached and remains on the battlefield as long as it\'s a creature. While it\'s a creature, it can\'t be attached to another permanent or player. An Aura that\'s not attached to a legal permanent or player as defined by its enchant ability and also isn\'t a creature will be put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Auras attached to a creature don\'t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If a creature that can\'t attack alone also must attack if able, its controller must attack with it and another creature if able."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can\'t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield, the Aura stops being an Aura and remains on the battlefield. Control of that permanent doesn\'t change; you\'ll control the resulting enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If you control more than one creature that can\'t attack alone, they can both attack together, even if no other creatures attack."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'In a Two-Headed Giant game (or in another format using the shared team turns option), Sightless Brawler (or the creature it enchants) can attack with a creature controlled by your teammate, even if no other creatures you control attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "On the stack, a spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It\'s never both, although it\'s an enchantment spell in either case."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Sightless Brawler or the creature it enchants can be declared as an attacker only if another creature is declared as an attacker at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Similarly, if you cast an Aura spell with bestow targeting a creature controlled by another player, and that creature is an illegal target when the spell tries to resolve, it will finish resolving as an enchantment creature spell. It will enter the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow isn\'t countered if its target is illegal as it begins to resolve. Rather, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, it returns to being an enchantment creature spell, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn\'t put into its owner\'s graveyard if it becomes unattached. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its {T} abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it\'s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You still control the Aura, even if it\'s enchanting a creature controlled by another player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Although the permanent you control can\'t be a land, the other target can, provided it shares a card type with the first target. For example, you could target an artifact you control and an artifact land controlled by an opponent."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Gaining control of an Aura or Equipment doesn\'t cause it to move, though gaining control of an Equipment will allow you to activate its equip ability to attach it to a creature you control later."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If an inspired ability triggers during your untap step, the ability will be put on the stack at the beginning of your upkeep. If the ability creates one or more token creatures, those creatures won\'t be able to attack that turn (unless they gain haste)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If another spell or ability allows you to change the targets of the ability (or perhaps copy it and choose new targets for the copy), you can change the targets only such that the final set of targets is still legal. For example, if the ability targets a creature you control and a creature an opponent controls, you couldn\'t change just the second target to a noncreature permanent controlled by that player. You could, however, change just the second target to a creature controlled by a different opponent. The two new targets can share a different card type than the two original targets did."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the full exchange can\'t happen, perhaps because one of the targets is illegal as the inspired ability tries to resolve, then nothing happens. No permanents change controllers."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If the inspired ability includes an optional cost, you decide whether to pay that cost as the ability resolves. You can do this even if the creature leaves the battlefield in response to the ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Inspired abilities don\'t trigger when the creature enters the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Inspired abilities trigger no matter how the creature becomes untapped: by the turn-based action at the beginning of the untap step or by a spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The exchange of control lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t expire when Daring Thief leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The relevant card types (that is, the ones a permanent can have) are artifact, creature, enchantment, planeswalker, and tribal.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura that becomes a creature is no longer put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action. Rather, it becomes unattached and remains on the battlefield as long as it\'s a creature. While it\'s a creature, it can\'t be attached to another permanent or player. An Aura that\'s not attached to a legal permanent or player as defined by its enchant ability and also isn\'t a creature will be put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Auras attached to a creature don\'t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Crystalline Nautilus\'s middle ability functions as long as Crystalline Nautilus is on the battlefield, whether it\'s a creature or an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can\'t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield, the Aura stops being an Aura and remains on the battlefield. Control of that permanent doesn\'t change; you\'ll control the resulting enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "On the stack, a spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It\'s never both, although it\'s an enchantment spell in either case."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Similarly, if you cast an Aura spell with bestow targeting a creature controlled by another player, and that creature is an illegal target when the spell tries to resolve, it will finish resolving as an enchantment creature spell. It will enter the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow isn\'t countered if its target is illegal as it begins to resolve. Rather, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, it returns to being an enchantment creature spell, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn\'t put into its owner\'s graveyard if it becomes unattached. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its {T} abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it\'s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You still control the Aura, even if it\'s enchanting a creature controlled by another player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura that becomes a creature is no longer put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action. Rather, it becomes unattached and remains on the battlefield as long as it\'s a creature. While it\'s a creature, it can\'t be attached to another permanent or player. An Aura that\'s not attached to a legal permanent or player as defined by its enchant ability and also isn\'t a creature will be put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Auras attached to a creature don\'t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can\'t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield, the Aura stops being an Aura and remains on the battlefield. Control of that permanent doesn\'t change; you\'ll control the resulting enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If, during your declare attackers step, Mogis\'s Warhound (or the creature it enchants) is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under its controller\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "On the stack, a spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It\'s never both, although it\'s an enchantment spell in either case."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Similarly, if you cast an Aura spell with bestow targeting a creature controlled by another player, and that creature is an illegal target when the spell tries to resolve, it will finish resolving as an enchantment creature spell. It will enter the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The controller of Mogis\'s Warhound or the creature it\'s enchanting chooses which player or planeswalker to attack."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow isn\'t countered if its target is illegal as it begins to resolve. Rather, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, it returns to being an enchantment creature spell, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn\'t put into its owner\'s graveyard if it becomes unattached. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its {T} abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it\'s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You still control the Aura, even if it\'s enchanting a creature controlled by another player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura that becomes a creature is no longer put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action. Rather, it becomes unattached and remains on the battlefield as long as it\'s a creature. While it\'s a creature, it can\'t be attached to another permanent or player. An Aura that\'s not attached to a legal permanent or player as defined by its enchant ability and also isn\'t a creature will be put into its owner\'s graveyard as a state-based action."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Auras attached to a creature don\'t become tapped when the creature becomes tapped. Except in some rare cases, an Aura with bestow remains untapped when it becomes unattached and becomes a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If a permanent with bestow enters the battlefield by any method other than being cast, it will be an enchantment creature. You can\'t choose to pay the bestow cost and have it become an Aura."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the enchanted creature leaves the battlefield, the Aura stops being an Aura and remains on the battlefield. Control of that permanent doesn\'t change; you\'ll control the resulting enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "On the stack, a spell with bestow is either a creature spell or an Aura spell. It\'s never both, although it\'s an enchantment spell in either case."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Similarly, if you cast an Aura spell with bestow targeting a creature controlled by another player, and that creature is an illegal target when the spell tries to resolve, it will finish resolving as an enchantment creature spell. It will enter the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Aura spells, an Aura spell with bestow isn\'t countered if its target is illegal as it begins to resolve. Rather, the effect making it an Aura spell ends, it loses enchant creature, it returns to being an enchantment creature spell, and it resolves and enters the battlefield as an enchantment creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Unlike other Auras, an Aura with bestow isn\'t put into its owner\'s graveyard if it becomes unattached. Rather, the effect making it an Aura ends, it loses enchant creature, and it remains on the battlefield as an enchantment creature. It can attack (and its {T} abilities can be activated, if it has any) on the turn it becomes unattached if it\'s been under your control continuously, even as an Aura, since your most recent turn began."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You still control the Aura, even if it\'s enchanting a creature controlled by another player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers when a creature becomes monstrous won\'t trigger if that creature isn\'t on the battlefield when its monstrosity ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Monstrous isn\'t an ability that a creature has. It\'s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature or loses its abilities, it will continue to be monstrous."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can\'t become monstrous again. If the creature is already monstrous when the monstrosity ability resolves, nothing happens."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The value of each X in Hydra Broodmaster\'s last ability is equal to the value chosen for X when its monstrosity ability was activated."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers when a creature becomes monstrous won\'t trigger if that creature isn\'t on the battlefield when its monstrosity ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Monstrous isn\'t an ability that a creature has. It\'s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature or loses its abilities, it will continue to be monstrous."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can\'t become monstrous again. If the creature is already monstrous when the monstrosity ability resolves, nothing happens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Armament of Nyx continuously checks to see whether the creature it\'s enchanting is an enchantment or not. If the creature isn\'t an enchantment and becomes one, or it is an enchantment and stops being one, the effect will change."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "As long as Deserter\'s Quarters remains tapped, the effect stopping the creature from untapping during its controller\'s untap step remains even if that creature untaps some other way (for example, with Colossal Heroics)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The activated ability can target any creature, not just one that\'s untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Athreos\'s last ability will trigger if a token creature you own dies. The target opponent has the option to pay 3 life, although the token can\'t return to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If there are no legal targets for Athreos\'s last ability (perhaps because each of your opponents has hexproof), it will be removed from the stack with no effect. No one may pay 3 life and you won\'t return the creature card to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter who controlled the creature when it died. Athreos\'s last ability will trigger if you owned that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The target opponent chooses whether to pay 3 life when Athreos\'s last ability resolves. You won\'t return the card to your hand if that player pays 3 life or if the card leaves the graveyard before the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You are a creature\'s owner if the card representing it began the game in your deck, or if it\'s a token that entered the battlefield under your control."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won\'t be counted when determining this."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Counters put on a God remain on it while it\'s not a creature, even if they have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won\'t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The abilities of Gods function as long as they\'re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they\'re creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It\'s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It\'s always a creature spell while it\'s on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Your devotion to two colors is the number of mana symbols among mana costs of permanents you control that are the first color, the second, or both. If an effect counts your devotion to two colors, a hybrid symbol that is both of those colors is counted just once.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Battlefield Thaumaturge\'s first ability doesn\'t change that spell\'s mana cost or mana value. It changes only the amount you actually pay (the “total cost” of the spell)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The cost reduction created by Battlefield Thaumaturge\'s first ability can reduce only the generic portion of the spell\'s total cost. Colored mana requirements aren\'t affected."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The cost reduction is {1} per target creature, even if the spell targets a creature more than once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "To calculate the total cost of an instant or sorcery spell you\'re casting, start with the mana cost (or alternative cost, if applicable), add all cost increases (including additional costs such as those imposed by strive abilities), then subtract all cost reductions (such as the one created by Battlefield Thaumaturge\'s first ability)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Bloodcrazed Hoplite\'s last ability will trigger whenever any +1/+1 counter is placed on it, not just ones due to its heroic ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If Bloodcrazed Hoplite enters the battlefield with +1/+1 counters on it, its last ability will trigger once for each of those counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If multiple +1/+1 counters are placed on Bloodcrazed Hoplite simultaneously, it last ability will trigger once for each of those counters.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Brain Maggot\'s ability causes a zone change with a duration, a new style of ability that\'s somewhat reminiscent of older cards like Tidehollow Sculler. However, unlike Tidehollow Sculler, Brain Maggot has a single ability that creates two one-shot effects: one that exiles the nonland card when the ability resolves, and another that returns the exiled card to its owner\'s hand immediately after Brain Maggot leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If Brain Maggot leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, the opponent will reveal their hand, but no card will be exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Brain Maggot\'s owner leaves the game, the exiled card will return to its owner\'s hand. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The exiled card returns to its owner\'s hand immediately after Brain Maggot leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Cyclops of Eternal Fury\'s ability gives itself haste."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Deicide looks at the card in exile, not the permanent that was exiled, to determine if it is a God. For each of the Gods in the Theros block, it won\'t matter what your devotion to its color(s) was. The card is a God card when not on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "When you search the target\'s controller\'s graveyard, hand, and library, you may leave any cards with that name in the zones they\'re in. You don\'t have to exile them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Dictate of the Twin Gods applies to any damage, not just combat damage. It also doesn\'t matter who controls the source of the damage that\'s being dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If more than one Dictate of the Twin Gods is on the battlefield, damage dealt will double for each one (two of them will end up multiplying the damage by four, three of them by eight, and four of them by sixteen).\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify how damage will be dealt, the player being dealt damage or the controller of the permanent being dealt damage chooses the order to apply the effects. For example, the ability of Decorated Griffin says “Prevent the next 1 combat damage that would be dealt to you this turn.” Suppose you would be dealt 3 combat damage and you activate the ability of Decorated Griffin. You can either (a) prevent 1 damage first and then let Dictate of the Twin Gods\'s effect double the remaining 2 damage, for a result of being dealt 4 damage, or (b) double the damage to 6 and then prevent 1 damage, for a result of being dealt 5 damage."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The source of the damage doesn\'t change. A spell that deals damage will specify the source of the damage, often the spell itself. An ability that deals damage will also specify the source of the damage, although the ability itself will never be that source. Often the source of the ability is also the source of the damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Each of the two creatures that fight deals damage equal to its power to the other. If either one of the creatures isn\'t on the battlefield when the ability that instructs them to fight resolves, no damage is dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Eidolon of Rhetoric will look at the entire turn to see if a player has cast a spell yet that turn, even if Eidolon of Rhetoric wasn\'t on the battlefield when that spell was cast. Specifically, you can\'t cast Eidolon of Rhetoric and then cast another spell that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Harness by Force can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Godsend\'s triggered ability doesn\'t target any creature. You could exile a creature with protection from white, for example. You choose which creature to exile when the ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Godsend\'s triggered ability will trigger only once no matter how many creatures the equipped creature blocks or becomes blocked by."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If Godsend exiles a land card (perhaps because it was turned into a creature and then blocked or was blocked by the equipped creature), opponents can still play land cards with the same name as the exiled card. Godsend stops only the casting of spells.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If Godsend leaves the battlefield, and later another Godsend enters the battlefield, it is a new object (even if the two were represented by the same card). The new Godsend won\'t stop opponents from casting cards with the same name as cards exiled with the first one."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If Bearer of the Heavens dies during an end step, the delayed triggered ability will trigger at the beginning of the next turn\'s end step."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The effect of the ability will destroy all permanents on the battlefield as it resolves. It doesn\'t matter if those permanents were on the battlefield when Bearer of the Heavens died."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If Lightning Diadem\'s target is an illegal target when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and won\'t enter the battlefield. Its triggered ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If Prophetic Flamespeaker deals combat damage to a player multiple times in a turn (if it wasn\'t blocked, for example), its triggered ability will trigger each time."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If you exile a land card, you may play that land only if you have any available land plays. Normally, this means you can play the land only if you haven\'t played a land yet that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The card is exiled face up. Playing it follows the normal rules for playing that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if it\'s a creature card, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If Renowned Weaver is attacking or blocking, and you activate its ability before combat damage is assigned and dealt, it won\'t deal combat damage. If it was blocking a creature, that creature will remain blocked. If you don\'t activate the ability before the combat damage step, it must survive combat for its ability to be activated later."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If Riptide Chimera is the only enchantment you control when its ability resolves, you must return it to its owner\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If you control no enchantments when Riptide Chimera\'s ability resolves (perhaps because Riptide Chimera stops being an enchantment for some reason), then nothing happens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If an inspired ability triggers during your untap step, the ability will be put on the stack at the beginning of your upkeep. If the ability creates one or more token creatures, those creatures won\'t be able to attack that turn (unless they gain haste)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If the inspired ability includes an optional cost, you decide whether to pay that cost as the ability resolves. You can do this even if the creature leaves the battlefield in response to the ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If there\'s an {X} in the mana cost of the card you discarded or the card you wish to search for, X is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Inspired abilities don\'t trigger when the creature enters the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Inspired abilities trigger no matter how the creature becomes untapped: by the turn-based action at the beginning of the untap step or by a spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If an inspired ability triggers during your untap step, the ability will be put on the stack at the beginning of your upkeep. If the ability creates one or more token creatures, those creatures won\'t be able to attack that turn (unless they gain haste)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If the inspired ability includes an optional cost, you decide whether to pay that cost as the ability resolves. You can do this even if the creature leaves the battlefield in response to the ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Inspired abilities don\'t trigger when the creature enters the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Inspired abilities trigger no matter how the creature becomes untapped: by the turn-based action at the beginning of the untap step or by a spell or ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The player who controlled King Macar when its ability triggered will control the artifact token, not the player who controlled the creature that was exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If another player gains control of the enchanted creature, Flamespeaker\'s Will will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You decide whether to sacrifice Flamespeaker\'s Will as its triggered ability resolves. If it\'s not on the battlefield at that time, you can\'t sacrifice it and destroy the target artifact."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If another player gains control of the enchanted creature, Mortal Obstinacy will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You decide whether to sacrifice Mortal Obstinacy as its triggered ability resolves. If it\'s not on the battlefield at that time, you can\'t sacrifice it and destroy the target enchantment."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If multiple creatures you control die at the same time, Dictate of Erebos\'s triggered ability will trigger that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If you and an opponent each control a Dictate of Erebos and a creature dies, a chain reaction happens. First the ability of one player\'s Dictate of Erebos will trigger, causing each opponent to sacrifice a creature. That sacrifice causes the ability of the other player\'s Dictate of Erebos to trigger, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If you control more than one Dictate of Erebos and a creature you control dies, each of the triggered abilities will trigger. Each opponent will sacrifice a creature each time one of those abilities resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'None of the opponents are targeted. An opponent with hexproof would still sacrifice a creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'When the triggered ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is (if that player is an opponent) chooses which creature they will sacrifice, then each other opponent in turn order does the same, then all chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If one or more, but not all, of the targets of the first ability are illegal when that ability tries to resolve, no counters will be placed on illegal targets. You can\'t change the distribution you announced when you activated the ability; the excess counters are just lost."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You announce how many counters will be placed on each target creature as you activate Ajani\'s first ability. Each target must receive at least one counter."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the creature card leaves the graveyard in response to Ritual of the Returned, Ritual of the Returned won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t get a Zombie token."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Use the creature card\'s power and toughness as it last existed in the graveyard to determine the power and toughness of the Zombie token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the target player skips their next turn, you\'ll control the next turn the affected player actually takes."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Multiple player-controlling effects that affect the same player overwrite each other. The last one to be created is the one that works.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The player you\'re controlling is still the active player during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'While controlling another player, you also continue to make your own choices and decisions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'While controlling another player, you make all choices and decisions that player is allowed to make or is told to make during that turn. This includes choices about what spells to cast or what abilities to activate, as well as any decisions called for by triggered abilities or for any other reason.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You also can\'t make any choices or decisions for the player that would be called for by the tournament rules (such as whether to take an intentional draw or whether to call a judge)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You can use only the affected player\'s resources (cards, mana, and so on) to pay costs for that player; you can\'t use your own. Similarly, you can use the affected player\'s resources only to pay that player\'s costs; you can\'t spend them on your costs."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You can\'t make any illegal decisions or illegal choices—you can\'t do anything that player couldn\'t do. You can\'t make choices or decisions for that player that aren\'t called for by the game rules or by any cards, permanents, spells, abilities, and so on. If an effect causes another player to make decisions that the affected player would normally make (such as Master Warcraft does), that effect takes precedence. In other words, if the affected player wouldn\'t make a decision, you wouldn\'t make that decision on their behalf."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You can\'t make the affected player concede. That player may choose to concede at any time, even while you\'re controlling them."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You could gain control of yourself using Worst Fears, but unless you do so to overwrite someone else\'s player-controlling effect, this doesn\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You only control the player. You don\'t control any of their permanents, spells, or abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "Controlling a player doesn\'t allow you to look at that player\'s sideboard. If an effect instructs that player to choose a card from outside the game, you can\'t have that player choose any card."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "While controlling another player, you can see all cards in the game that player can see. This includes cards in that player\'s hand, face-down cards that player controls, and any cards in that player\'s library the player may look at."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the target spell is an illegal target when Countermand tries to resolve, Countermand won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. The target\'s controller won\'t put any cards from the top of their library into their graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You may target a spell that can\'t be countered with Countermand. If you do, when Countermand resolves, the target spell won\'t be countered, but its controller will still put the top four cards of their library into their graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If there are fewer than X cards in that player\'s library, put the creature on the bottom of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Quarry Colossus\'s ability is mandatory. If you control the only creatures when that ability triggers, you must choose a creature you control (which could be Quarry Colossus itself) as the target."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The value of X is determined as the ability resolves. If you control no Plains at that time, put the creature on top of that library.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Iroas\'s last ability prevents all damage dealt to attacking creatures you control, not just combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won\'t be counted when determining this."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Counters put on a God remain on it while it\'s not a creature, even if they have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won\'t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The abilities of Gods function as long as they\'re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they\'re creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It\'s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It\'s always a creature spell while it\'s on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Your devotion to two colors is the number of mana symbols among mana costs of permanents you control that are the first color, the second, or both. If an effect counts your devotion to two colors, a hybrid symbol that is both of those colors is counted just once.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Knowledge and Power\'s ability triggers only once each time you scry, no matter how many cards you look at."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose the target of the ability as it\'s put on the stack. You choose whether to pay {2} as it resolves. You can pay {2} only once each time you scry."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Nyx Infusion continuously checks to see whether the creature it\'s enchanting is an enchantment or not. If the creature isn\'t an enchantment and becomes one, or it is an enchantment and stops being one, the effect will change."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Spite of Mogis isn\'t counted among the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard. It isn\'t put there until after it deals damage and you scry 1."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Squelching Leeches\'s power and toughness will change as the number of Swamps you control changes. Its ability counts all lands you control with the subtype Swamp, not just those named Swamp."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Squelching Leeches\'s power and toughness works in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The value of X is calculated as the ability resolves. The effect won\'t change later in the turn, even if the number of cards in your hand does."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Spiteful Blow without a legal creature and land to target. If one of those targets is illegal when Spiteful Below tries to resolve, the other one will still be destroyed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You make the decision after all the cards are revealed. If you decide not to put the cards into their owners\' graveyards, the card each player draws will be the revealed card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura spell without bestow that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve won\'t resolve and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard. It won\'t enter the battlefield and constellation abilities won\'t trigger. An Aura spell with bestow won\'t be countered this way. It will revert to being an enchantment creature and resolve, entering the battlefield and triggering constellation abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If multiple attacking creatures must be blocked if able, the defending player must assign at least one blocker to each of them if possible. For example, if two such creatures were attacking and there were two potential blockers, they couldn\'t both be assigned to block the same attacker."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The constellation ability doesn\'t force any specific creature to block the target creature."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The defending player must assign at least one blocker to the target creature during the declare blockers step if that player controls any creatures that could block it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'When an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, each constellation ability of permanents you control will trigger. You can put these abilities on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura spell without bestow that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve won\'t resolve and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard. It won\'t enter the battlefield and constellation abilities won\'t trigger. An Aura spell with bestow won\'t be countered this way. It will revert to being an enchantment creature and resolve, entering the battlefield and triggering constellation abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The constellation ability is mandatory. If you are the only legal target (perhaps because your opponent has hexproof), you must target yourself and exile all the cards from your graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'When an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, each constellation ability of permanents you control will trigger. You can put these abilities on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura spell without bestow that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve won\'t resolve and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard. It won\'t enter the battlefield and constellation abilities won\'t trigger. An Aura spell with bestow won\'t be countered this way. It will revert to being an enchantment creature and resolve, entering the battlefield and triggering constellation abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The value of X is determined when the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'When an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, each constellation ability of permanents you control will trigger. You can put these abilities on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'A constellation ability triggers whenever an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. Enchantments with other card types, such as enchantment creatures, will also cause constellation abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "An Aura spell without bestow that has an illegal target when it tries to resolve won\'t resolve and will be put into its owner\'s graveyard. It won\'t enter the battlefield and constellation abilities won\'t trigger. An Aura spell with bestow won\'t be countered this way. It will revert to being an enchantment creature and resolve, entering the battlefield and triggering constellation abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'When an enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, each constellation ability of permanents you control will trigger. You can put these abilities on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Although the tokens are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You declare which player or planeswalker each token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker the original creature is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If another creature becomes or enters the battlefield as a copy of the token, that creature will have haste, but you won\'t exile it. However, if Twinflame creates multiple tokens copying a single creature due to a replacement effect (like the one Doubling Season creates), you\'ll exile each of them."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is a token, the token created by Twinflame copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put that token onto the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else (for example, if the copied creature is a Clone), then the token enters the battlefield as whatever that creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The tokens copy exactly what was printed on the original creature and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The tokens see each other enter the battlefield. If any of them have a triggered ability that triggers whenever a creature enters the battlefield, they\'ll trigger for one another."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'As long as Kruphix is on the battlefield, unused mana will remain in your mana pool as steps and phases end (although it will become colorless). This means you can add mana to your mana pool and spend it during a future step, phase, or turn. Once Kruphix leaves the battlefield, you have until the end of the current step or phase to use the mana before it disappears.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If unused mana in your mana pool has any restrictions or riders associated with it (for example, if it was produced by Cavern of Souls), those restrictions or riders will remain associated with that mana when it becomes colorless.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won\'t be counted when determining this."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Counters put on a God remain on it while it\'s not a creature, even if they have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won\'t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The abilities of Gods function as long as they\'re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they\'re creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It\'s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It\'s always a creature spell while it\'s on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Your devotion to two colors is the number of mana symbols among mana costs of permanents you control that are the first color, the second, or both. If an effect counts your devotion to two colors, a hybrid symbol that is both of those colors is counted just once.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Blinding Flare can target any creature, including those you control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Colossal Heroics can target any creatures, not just ones that are tapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', "[{'date': '2014-04-26', 'text': 'Count the number of Mountains you control when the last ability resolves to determine how much damage is dealt. This includes any land with the subtype Mountain, not just those named Mountain.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Effects that have already applied to the target creatures will continue to apply to them. For example, if Giant Growth had given one of those creatures +3/+3 earlier in the turn, then Polymorphous Rush makes it a copy of Pensive Minotaur (a 2/3 creature), it will become a 5/6 Pensive Minotaur.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If the creatures copy a creature that\'s copying a creature, they will become whatever the chosen creature is copying."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The creature that\'s copied isn\'t targeted by Polymorphous Rush. You choose that creature as the spell resolves. It can be one of the targeted creatures. A creature can become a copy of itself this way, though this usually won\'t have any noticeable effect."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The target creatures copy the printed values of the chosen creature, plus any copy effects that have been applied to it. They won\'t copy counters on that creature or effects that have changed the creature\'s power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "This effect can cause the targets to stop being creatures. For example, if they each become a copy of a land that has become a creature, the effect that turned that land into a creature won\'t be copied. The targets will become noncreature lands."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You must remove all +1/+1 counters from Sage of Hours to activate its ability, even if the number of counters isn\'t a multiple of five. For example, if you remove twelve counters to activate the ability, you\'ll take two extra turns. If you remove three counters, you won\'t take any extra turns."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will resolve before the spell that caused them to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Heroic abilities will trigger only once per spell, even if that spell targets the creature with the heroic ability multiple times.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "Heroic abilities won\'t trigger when a copy of a spell is created on the stack or when a spell\'s targets are changed to include a creature with a heroic ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The creatures and Auras are exiled at the same time. Specifically, if an Aura is a permanent with bestow, it will be exiled. It won\'t stop being an Aura and remain on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability allows you to cast a strive spell without paying its mana cost, you must pay the additional costs for any targets beyond the first.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If all of the spell\'s targets are illegal when the spell tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. If one or more of its targets are legal when it tries to resolve, the spell will resolve and affect only those legal targets. It will have no effect on any illegal targets."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "If such a spell is copied, and the effect that copies the spell allows a player to choose new targets for the copy, the number of targets can\'t be changed. The player may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. If, for one of the targets, the player can\'t choose a new legal target, then it remains unchanged (even if the current target is illegal)."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Solidarity of Heroes can target any creatures, not just ones with +1/+1 counters on them. Notably, heroic abilities of any target creatures that put +1/+1 counters on that creature will resolve before Solidarity of Heroes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "The mana cost and mana value of strive spells don\'t change no matter how many targets they have. Strive abilities affect only what you pay."}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets each spell with a strive ability has and what those targets are as you cast it. It\'s legal to cast such a spell with no targets, although this is rarely a good idea. You can\'t choose the same target more than once for a single strive spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'If you choose both modes, and only one of the cards is still a legal target when Reviving Melody tries to resolve, only that card is returned to your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': "You choose which mode you\'re using—or whether to use both modes—as you\'re casting the spell. Once this choice is made, it can\'t be changed later while the spell is on the stack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'The targeted player will discard a number of cards equal to the power of the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-04-26\', \'text\': \'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrifice to stop you from casting this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast Tormented Thoughts. You can\'t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can\'t sacrifice additional creatures."}]', "[{'date': '2014-04-26', 'text': 'The value of X is calculated as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-04-26', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as the ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2014-04-26', 'text': 'Whether the defending player controls an enchantment or enchanted permanent is checked only as attackers are declared. Once Godhunter Octopus has been declared as an attacker, it will continue to attack even if the defending player loses control of each enchantment or enchanted permanent they controlled.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities are written in the form “Cost: Effect.” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder texts. Static and triggered abilities are unaffected by Oppressive Rays.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-07-18\', \'text\': "The enchanted creature\'s controller can choose to not attack or block with it even if it must attack or block if able. Players can\'t be forced to pay a cost to attack or block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Magma Spray\'s replacement effect will exile the target creature if it would die this turn for any reason, not just due to lethal damage. It applies to the target creature even if Magma Spray deals no damage to it (due to a prevention effect) or Magma Spray deals damage to a different creature (due to a redirection effect)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If Heroes\' Bane\'s power is less than 0 when its second ability resolves, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "The value of X is determined using the power of Heroes\' Bane when the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Casting Eidolon of the Great Revel doesn\'t cause its own ability to trigger. It must be on the battlefield when the spell is cast for its ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "The amount of mana spent to cast a spell doesn\'t change its mana value. For example, a card cast with its morph ability has a mana value of 0 even though {3} was paid."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a spell with {X} in its mana cost includes the value chosen for X.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "As a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color will determine whether any replacement effects that affect creatures entering the battlefield apply to that God. Because replacement effects are considered before the God is on the battlefield, the mana symbols in its mana cost won\'t be counted when determining this."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Counters put on a God remain on it while it\'s not a creature, even if they have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If a God is attacking or blocking and it stops being a creature, it will be removed from combat. It won\'t rejoin combat if it resumes being a creature later during that combat."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a God stops being a creature, it loses the type creature and the creature type God. It continues to be a legendary enchantment.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an effect causes a God to lose all abilities, its ability that causes it to stop being a creature still applies if appropriate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The abilities of Gods function as long as they\'re on the battlefield, regardless of whether they\'re creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The type-changing ability that can make a God not be a creature functions only on the battlefield. It\'s always a creature card in other zones, regardless of your devotion to its color. It\'s always a creature spell while it\'s on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'When a God enters the battlefield, your devotion to its color (including the mana symbols in the mana cost of the God itself) will determine if a creature entered the battlefield or not for abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Your devotion to two colors is the number of mana symbols among mana costs of permanents you control that are the first color, the second, or both. If an effect counts your devotion to two colors, a hybrid symbol that is both of those colors is counted just once.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you reveal a card with mana value 0, such as a land card, you won\'t draw any cards. Otherwise, the card you revealed will be the first card you draw."}]', "[{'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'If you move Armory of Iroas from one creature to another, any +1/+1 counters on the first creature remain where they are.'}, {'date': '2020-11-10', 'text': 'The +1/+1 counter is put on the equipped creature before combat damage is dealt.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If Banishing Light leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If an Aura is exiled this way, its owner chooses what it will enchant as it returns to the battlefield. An Aura put onto the battlefield this way doesn\'t target anything (so it could be attached to a permanent with shroud, for example), but the Aura\'s enchant ability restricts what it can be attached to. If the Aura can\'t legally be attached to anything, it remains in exile for the rest of the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the chosen target is an illegal target by the time Riddle of Lightning tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t scry 3 or reveal any card."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Adler der Wache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'„Selbst aus vielen Meilen Entfernung konnte ich sehen, wie unsere Adler am Himmel Kreise zogen. Sogleich gab ich den Befehl, schneller zu marschieren. Ich wusste, unsere Heimat brauchte uns." —Kanlos, akroischer Hauptmann\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402fb8a9-e189-4b25-b45d-ea215bdaa817\', \'multiverseId\': 380902}, \'multiverseid\': 380902}, {\'name\': \'Águila de la Guardia\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Vi a nuestras águilas volar en círculos a varios estadios de distancia. Fue entonces cuando di la orden de acelerar el paso. Supe que nos necesitaban en casa". —Kanlos, capitán akroniense\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'472ed329-fdd6-43dc-bba0-985074e2543d\', \'multiverseId\': 382057}, \'multiverseid\': 382057}, {\'name\': \'Aigle des veilleurs\', \'text\': \'Vol, vigilance\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "« Même à des lieues d\'ici, je pouvais voir nos aigles tournoyer. J\'ai alors donné l\'ordre d\'accélérer le pas. Je savais que notre cité avait besoin de nous. » —Kanlos, capitaine akroen", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381067&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'654ebe07-e08e-450a-bfb6-f054f9bcda9e\', \'multiverseId\': 381067}, \'multiverseid\': 381067}, {\'name\': \'Aquila della Guardia\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Anche a miglia di distanza, distinguevo le nostre aquile volare in cerchio. Fu allora che diedi l\\\'ordine di affrettare il passo. Sapevo che la nostra patria aveva bisogno di noi." —Kanlos, capitano di Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dec6164-064d-4e41-9f69-d0c2845d84fb\', \'multiverseId\': 381232}, \'multiverseid\': 381232}, {\'name\': \'警備隊の鷲\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「数マイル先からも、我々の鷲が円を描いている姿が見えた。進行速度を上げる命令を出したのは、その時だった。故郷が我々を必要としていることを理解したからだ。」 ――アクロスの隊長、カンロス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bbe518b-6359-40ed-bbd2-468af005236f\', \'multiverseId\': 381397}, \'multiverseid\': 381397}, {\'name\': \'경비대 독수리\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': "\'멀리서도 우리 독수리들이 원을 만들며 돌고 있는 것을 볼 수 있었다. 바로 그때 나는 속도를 올리라고 명령했다. 고향이 위험에 처했다는 것을 알았기 때문이다.\' —아크로스 대장 칸로스", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25a3349b-a4bf-4a01-8ebc-5928ccbf51eb\', \'multiverseId\': 381562}, \'multiverseid\': 381562}, {\'name\': \'Águia da Vigia\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Pude ver nossas águias circulando mesmo a quilômetros de distância. Foi então que dei o comando para acelerarmos a marcha. Sabia que estavam precisando de nós em casa." — Canlos, capitão acrosano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acab1a95-4bf8-45f4-87b1-bb2623376348\', \'multiverseId\': 381727}, \'multiverseid\': 381727}, {\'name\': \'Сторожевой Орел\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'«Я еще издали заметил, как кружат наши орлы. Тогда я отдал команду ускорить шаг. Я знал, что мы были нужны дома». — Канл, акросский капитан\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ea65f4-5fa8-4c87-ad05-3d0a878817f9\', \'multiverseId\': 381892}, \'multiverseid\': 381892}, {\'name\': \'守望雄鹰\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'「从数哩外，就看得到雄鹰在天空盘旋。我立即下令加快步伐。家乡正需要我们。」 ～阿喀洛斯队长坎罗斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7198bfa-8bc7-4157-9e42-8cd1830ad6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 380572}, \'multiverseid\': 380572}, {\'name\': \'守望雄鷹\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'「從數哩外，就看得到雄鷹在天空盤旋。我立即下令加快步伐。家鄉正需要我們。」 ～阿喀洛斯隊長坎羅斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aebfcd0-9744-4846-a577-002fc41c63fb\', \'multiverseId\': 380737}, \'multiverseid\': 380737}]', '[{\'name\': \'Agent des Erebos\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn der Agent des Erebos oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Erebos\' Diener jagen die Wiedergekehrten und mahnen jene, die dieselbe Torheit erwägen.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380861&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad520700-c3e1-469d-b945-2bff2301c1d9\', \'multiverseId\': 380861}, \'multiverseid\': 380861}, {\'name\': \'Agente de Erebos\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Agente de Erebos u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Los siervos de Erebos cazan a los Resurgidos y advierten a aquellos que se plantean la misma locura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'307bf491-6952-4b86-91f3-96a8a25b595f\', \'multiverseId\': 382016}, \'multiverseid\': 382016}, {\'name\': "Agent d\'Érébos", \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que l\'Agent d\'Érébos ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière du joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Les serviteurs d\'Érébos chassent les Reparus et avertissent les fous qui songeraient à faire de même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381026&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f18f9ebf-bf82-4a48-93c0-ec64acfbe577\', \'multiverseId\': 381026}, \'multiverseid\': 381026}, {\'name\': \'Agente di Erebos\', \'text\': "Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta l\'Agente di Erebos o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'I servi di Erebos cacciano i Risvegliati e mettono in guardia coloro che progettano la stessa follia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'512cf9d8-4e72-495c-b95a-b0b906c6c80d\', \'multiverseId\': 381191}, \'multiverseid\': 381191}, {\'name\': \'エレボスの代行者\', \'text\': \'星座 ― エレボスの代行者か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるすべてのカードを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'エレボスの下僕たちは蘇りし者を狩り、同じ過ちを犯そうとする者たちに対して警告をしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b9c53c5-29b1-4e63-b07c-07f947a32272\', \'multiverseId\': 381356}, \'multiverseid\': 381356}, {\'name\': \'에레보스의 하수인\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 에레보스의 하수인이나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어의 무덤에 있는 모든 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'에레보스의 하수인들은 되살아난 자들을 사냥하면서 똑같이 어리석은 생각을 하는 자들에게 경고를 보낸다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31ab3a9c-98b9-4e75-add2-e8fb0a901dde\', \'multiverseId\': 381521}, \'multiverseid\': 381521}, {\'name\': \'Agente de Érebo\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Agente de Érebo ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, exile todos os cards do cemitério do jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Os lacaios de Érebo perseguem os Ressurgidos e advertem todos os que pensam em fazer o mesmo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01968b73-73a0-4de2-a988-20130aa2a35e\', \'multiverseId\': 381686}, \'multiverseid\': 381686}, {\'name\': \'Агент Эреба\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Агент Эреба или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, изгоните все карты из кладбища целевого игрока.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Слуги Эреба охотятся на Возвращенных. Для тех же, у кого хватает безрассудства самому думать об этом, они служат предупреждением.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f87fce2d-5c32-44a7-b5d9-e62de27413ba\', \'multiverseId\': 381851}, \'multiverseid\': 381851}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯的密探\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当厄睿柏斯的密探或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，放逐目标牌手坟墓场中的所有牌。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'厄睿柏斯的仆从四处追捕转世者，警示他人勿入歧途。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20b11a52-716d-42a4-beea-753b554d6eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 380531}, \'multiverseid\': 380531}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯的密探\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當厄睿柏斯的密探或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，放逐目標玩家墳墓場中的所有牌。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'厄睿柏斯的僕從四處追捕轉世者，警示他人勿入歧途。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74943474-992b-4cca-8d82-2b94a0318096\', \'multiverseId\': 380696}, \'multiverseid\': 380696}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani, Mentor der Helden\', \'text\': \'+1: Verteile drei +1/+1-Marken auf eine, zwei oder drei Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst.\\n+1: Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Aura-, Kreaturen- oder Planeswalkerkarte offen vorzeigen und sie auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\n-8: Du erhältst 100 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85aee5d7-3204-42f6-bd89-03a1790bdb06\', \'multiverseId\': 380862}, \'multiverseid\': 380862}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, mentor de héroes\', \'text\': \'+1: Distribuye tres contadores +1/+1 entre una, dos o tres criaturas objetivo que controlas.\\n+1: Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta de aura, criatura o planeswalker que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\\n-8: Ganas 100 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ef6f455-9209-4936-9dd0-6b44041dfff9\', \'multiverseId\': 382017}, \'multiverseid\': 382017}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, mentor de héros\', \'text\': "+1 : Répartissez trois marqueurs +1/+1 entre une, deux ou trois créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez.\\n+1 : Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'aura, de créature ou de planeswalker parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans n\'importe quel ordre.\\n-8 : Vous gagnez 100 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f40587d0-336b-4a69-a94b-54484a29f7f8\', \'multiverseId\': 381027}, \'multiverseid\': 381027}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Mentore di Eroi\', \'text\': \'+1: Distribuisci tre segnalini +1/+1 tra una, due o tre creature bersaglio che controlli.\\n+1: Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta Aura, creatura o planeswalker tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\\n-8: Guadagni 100 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664e6b6e-4310-4ca8-8e64-728a3ac49929\', \'multiverseId\': 381192}, \'multiverseid\': 381192}, {\'name\': \'英雄の導師、アジャニ\', \'text\': \'＋１：あなたのコントロールするクリーチャーを１体、または２体か３体対象とする。それらの上に３個の＋１/＋１カウンターを好きなように割り振って置く。\\n＋１：あなたのライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを見る。あなたはその中からオーラ・カード１枚かクリーチャー・カード１枚かプレインズウォーカー・カード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\\n－８：あなたは100点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'プレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99795b66-d65c-46bd-b238-3dab9171d1ad\', \'multiverseId\': 381357}, \'multiverseid\': 381357}, {\'name\': \'영웅의 스승 아자니\', \'text\': \'+1: 당신이 조종하는 생물 중 하나, 둘 또는 세 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 배분한다.\\n+1: 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 본다. 당신은 그 중에서 마법진, 생물, 또는 플레인즈워커 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\\n-8: 당신은 생명 100점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'플레인즈워커 — 아자니\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e71cf006-21bd-41eb-94fc-0b730de6fafd\', \'multiverseId\': 381522}, \'multiverseid\': 381522}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Mentor dos Heróis\', \'text\': \'+1: Distribua três marcadores +1/+1 entre uma, duas ou três criaturas alvo que você controla.\\n+1: Olhe os quatro cards do topo do seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card de Aura, criatura ou planeswalker dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o resto no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\\n-8: Você ganha 100 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fc7cc2a-761b-4e6a-b24c-dd152bbd7ba1\', \'multiverseId\': 381687}, \'multiverseid\': 381687}, {\'name\': \'Аджани, Наставник Героев\', \'text\': \'+1: распределите три жетона +1/+1 между одним, двумя или тремя целевыми существами под вашим контролем.\\n+1: посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту Ауры, существа или planeswalker-а и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\\n-8: вы получаете 100 жизней.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c59ff9c-1298-43fb-8688-0534cb14f0e2\', \'multiverseId\': 381852}, \'multiverseid\': 381852}, {\'name\': \'英雄明师阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：将三个+1/+1指示物分配给一个，两个或三个目标由你操控的生物。\\n+1：检视你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以展示其中一张灵气、生物或鹏洛客牌，并将其置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\\n-8：你获得100点生命。\', \'type\': \'鹏洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4393f230-c51d-4963-bb07-f83a0d0ccf7f\', \'multiverseId\': 380532}, \'multiverseid\': 380532}, {\'name\': \'英雄明師阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：將三個+1/+1指示物分配給一個，兩個或三個目標由你操控的生物。\\n+1：檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。你可以展示其中一張靈氣、生物或鵬洛客牌，並將其置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\\n-8：你獲得100點生命。\', \'type\': \'鵬洛客～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03eba6ae-1af8-46c2-a6d2-aee1380a98e8\', \'multiverseId\': 380697}, \'multiverseid\': 380697}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Präsenz\', \'text\': \'Streben — Ajanis Präsenz kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{W} mehr.\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+1 und Unzerstörbarkeit. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380863&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1944720-a20b-476d-b096-77f527a7426b\', \'multiverseId\': 380863}, \'multiverseid\': 380863}, {\'name\': \'Presencia de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Presencia de Ajani cuesta {2}{W} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nCualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo obtienen +1/+1 cada una y ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruye" no las destruyen.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd375ab8-818c-4099-8a30-2cf907e56a7d\', \'multiverseId\': 382018}, \'multiverseid\': 382018}, {\'name\': "Présence d\'Ajani", \'text\': "Obstination — La Présence d\'Ajani coûte {2}{W} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nN\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +1/+1 et acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne les détruisent pas.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381028&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b674196a-aaf4-4d17-beed-592c7fa14e29\', \'multiverseId\': 381028}, \'multiverseid\': 381028}, {\'name\': \'Presenza di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — La Presenza di Ajani costa {2}{W} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse prende +1/+1 e ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno e gli effetti che dicono "distruggi" non le distruggono.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'160b2092-75dd-4d43-be8e-5f527bf0c516\', \'multiverseId\': 381193}, \'multiverseid\': 381193}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの存在\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― アジャニの存在を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{W}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに破壊不能を得る。（ダメージや「破壊する」と書かれた効果では、それは破壊されない。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b0e5fcd-8479-41d5-a5f0-37e5c7d2c39f\', \'multiverseId\': 381358}, \'multiverseid\': 381358}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 존재감\', \'text\': \'분투 — 아자니의 존재감은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{W}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +1/+1을 받고 무적을 얻는다. (피해와 "파괴"라고 명시된 효과로 파괴되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54a9ac55-5430-4efe-a756-96257a154f35\', \'multiverseId\': 381523}, \'multiverseid\': 381523}, {\'name\': \'Presença de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Presença de Ajani custa {2}{W} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nQualquer número de criaturas alvo recebe +1/+1 e ganha indestrutível até o final do turno. (Nem dano nem efeitos que dizem "destrua" podem destruí-las.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cada1708-959e-4050-a658-dfc6675c8a06\', \'multiverseId\': 381688}, \'multiverseid\': 381688}, {\'name\': \'Присутствие Аджани\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Присутствия Аджани стоит на {2}{W} больше.\\nЛюбое количество целевых существ получают по +1/+1 и Неразрушимость до конца хода. (Повреждения и эффекты с указанием «уничтожьте» не уничтожают их.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e08854b-0549-48ee-b6e7-478f9812aeec\', \'multiverseId\': 381853}, \'multiverseid\': 381853}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的风采\', \'text\': \'积力～阿耶尼的风采在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{W}来施放。\\n直到回合结束，任意数量的目标生物各得+1/+1且获得不灭异能。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它们消灭。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70fd8c25-55e2-4d4f-8384-fb8790c5df5b\', \'multiverseId\': 380533}, \'multiverseid\': 380533}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的風采\', \'text\': \'積力～阿耶尼的風采在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{W}來施放。\\n直到回合結束，任意數量的目標生物各得+1/+1且獲得不滅異能。（傷害與註明「消滅」的效應不會將它們消滅。)\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14cbadd0-7c28-4de5-b0d5-89ab466faa71\', \'multiverseId\': 380698}, \'multiverseid\': 380698}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akroischer Frontbrecher\', \'text\': \'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der den Akroischen Frontbrecher als Ziel hat, erhält der Akroische Frontbrecher +2/+0 und Einschüchtern bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Zuerst zerbersten die Schilde der Feinde, dann bricht ihre Schlachtordnung zusammen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380864&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2555d77-2409-4e5a-a839-85b06381372b\', \'multiverseId\': 380864}, \'multiverseid\': 380864}, {\'name\': \'Rompelíneas akroniense\', \'text\': \'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo al Rompelíneas akroniense, el Rompelíneas akroniense obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de intimidar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los escudos de los enemigos son los primeros en romperse, y su línea de ataque nunca tarda en seguirlos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45fd9a4f-1aca-40a8-903a-96c4f98c95ed\', \'multiverseId\': 382019}, \'multiverseid\': 382019}, {\'name\': \'Briseur de ligne akroen\', \'text\': "Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible le Briseur de ligne akroen, le Briseur de ligne akroen gagne +2/+0 et acquiert l\'intimidation jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Les boucliers ennemis cèdent d\'abord, rapidement suivis par leurs lignes de combat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381029&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ae0a28-773b-4dd2-bb96-9e39155ea8be\', \'multiverseId\': 381029}, \'multiverseid\': 381029}, {\'name\': \'Spezzaranghi di Akros\', \'text\': \'Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia lo Spezzaranghi di Akros, lo Spezzaranghi di Akros prende +2/+0 e ha intimidire fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gli scudi dei nemici sono i primi a spezzarsi, presto seguiti dalle loro formazioni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d0ac14-29f2-4806-b2b9-69acc3d99fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 381194}, \'multiverseid\': 381194}, {\'name\': \'アクロスの戦線砕き\', \'text\': \'英雄的 ― あなたがアクロスの戦線砕きを対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、アクロスの戦線砕きはターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに威嚇を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'最初に砕けるのは敵の盾であり、時置かずして戦線も崩壊する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b31fec8d-5683-4b4a-8f71-5d068e418ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 381359}, \'multiverseid\': 381359}, {\'name\': \'아크로스 전열 파괴자\', \'text\': \'영웅 — 당신이 아크로스 전열 파괴자를 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 아크로스 전열 파괴자는 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받고 위협 능력을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': \'적의 방패를 제일 먼저 산산조각내고 나면 전선이 바로 앞이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c3d7c4-0f99-46b0-b38f-ce53d45899a9\', \'multiverseId\': 381524}, \'multiverseid\': 381524}, {\'name\': \'Desformador Acrosano\', \'text\': \'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica cujo alvo é Desformador Acrosano, Desformador Acrosano recebe +2/+0 e ganha intimidar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Os escudos dos inimigos são os primeiros a quebrar e a frente de batalha vêm logo em seguida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25e40569-5bcd-4ef5-a785-b9b3a7c23bd8\', \'multiverseId\': 381689}, \'multiverseid\': 381689}, {\'name\': \'Прорвавший Строй Акросец\', \'text\': \'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Прорвавший Строй Акросец, Прорвавший Строй Акросец получает +2/+0 и Устрашение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Первыми ломаются щиты врагов. Вскоре после этого ломаются их боевые порядки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ad69ed2-9133-4c2f-9835-508aafec5607\', \'multiverseId\': 381854}, \'multiverseid\': 381854}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯破阵兵\', \'text\': \'勇行～每当你施放一个以阿喀洛斯破阵兵为目标的咒语时，直到回合结束，阿喀洛斯破阵兵得+2/+0且获得威吓异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': \'先粉碎敌人的盾牌，这样他们的战线就在眼前了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60c5e972-8272-49e9-8ea3-e0e770832f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 380534}, \'multiverseid\': 380534}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯破陣兵\', \'text\': \'勇行～每當你施放一個以阿喀洛斯破陣兵為目標的咒語時，直到回合結束，阿喀洛斯破陣兵得+2/+0且獲得威嚇異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'先粉碎敵人的盾牌，這樣他們的戰線就在眼前了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fe024fd-201f-481b-9243-d2b95ee3b5b3\', \'multiverseId\': 380699}, \'multiverseid\': 380699}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akroischer Mastiff\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': \'Selbst als viele Wachsoldaten abberufen wurden, gab es nie Zweifel daran, dass die Sicherheit von Akros gewährleistet war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a609cf0-9299-42fd-8209-0884662b7f7a\', \'multiverseId\': 380865}, \'multiverseid\': 380865}, {\'name\': \'Mastín akroniense\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro\', \'flavor\': \'Aun cuando muchos de los soldados que protegían Akros se vieron obligados a marchar, la seguridad de la ciudad nunca se puso en duda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8df56efe-c9a0-4bae-9e79-6ff5346144a2\', \'multiverseId\': 382020}, \'multiverseid\': 382020}, {\'name\': \'Dogue akroen\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T} : Engagez la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chien de chasse\', \'flavor\': "Même après le départ de bon nombre des soldats gardant Akros, sa sécurité ne fit pas l\'ombre d\'un doute.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381030&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e087763a-4b1b-474a-a312-6ae7b6fc62e5\', \'multiverseId\': 381030}, \'multiverseid\': 381030}, {\'name\': \'Mastino di Akros\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Segugio\', \'flavor\': \'Anche quando molti dei soldati che vegliavano su Akros dovevano lasciare la polis, non vi era dubbio sulla sua sicurezza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b76529-d0be-4c0a-8e0f-d32086856675\', \'multiverseId\': 381195}, \'multiverseid\': 381195}, {\'name\': \'アクロスの猛犬\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猟犬\', \'flavor\': \'アクロスを守る兵士の多くが招集により不在となっても、その安全には一抹の不安もない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a026eea-1d6d-4507-bfb1-fa0a22117f07\', \'multiverseId\': 381360}, \'multiverseid\': 381360}, {\'name\': \'아크로스 마스티프\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사냥개\', \'flavor\': \'아크로스를 지키던 병사 대부분이 소집되었을 때에도, 도시의 안전을 의심하는 자는 없었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b2a605d-0507-46f6-8e01-e1fa92c8e77e\', \'multiverseId\': 381525}, \'multiverseid\': 381525}, {\'name\': \'Mastim Acrosano\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: Vire a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sabujo\', \'flavor\': \'Mesmo quando muitos dos soldados que protegiam Ácros foram convocados para longe, sua segurança nunca foi questionada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e3b3cf0-1799-49d3-94bc-0764a8a3db33\', \'multiverseId\': 381690}, \'multiverseid\': 381690}, {\'name\': \'Акросский Мастиф\', \'text\': \'{W}, {T}: поверните целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пес\', \'flavor\': \'Даже когда большей части солдат пришлось покинуть Акрос, ни у кого не возникло сомнений в его безопасности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b111a1a-c454-46f7-8b8a-63768b6212be\', \'multiverseId\': 381855}, \'multiverseid\': 381855}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯獒犬\', \'text\': \'{W}，{T}：横置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～猎犬\', \'flavor\': \'就算阿喀洛斯守军空虚，其安全性也毋庸置疑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a7c640-5aef-4563-8957-8c78b0d3d118\', \'multiverseId\': 380535}, \'multiverseid\': 380535}, {\'name\': \'阿喀洛斯獒犬\', \'text\': \'{W}，{T}：橫置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～獵犬\', \'flavor\': \'就算阿喀洛斯守軍空虛，其安全性也毋庸置疑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'105065bd-1690-44b6-a859-37b2916aaac3\', \'multiverseId\': 380700}, \'multiverseid\': 380700}]', '[{\'name\': \'Albtraumhaftes Ende\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Karten auf deiner Hand ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Welch Ironie, dass mancher glaubt, im Schlaf zu sterben wäre ein friedlicher Tod." —Ashiok der Albtraumweber\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'504f5f89-d95a-41f9-9550-a316c29ccf8e\', \'multiverseId\': 380955}, \'multiverseid\': 380955}, {\'name\': \'Final de pesadilla\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Y pensar que algunos creen que es plácido morir durmiendo". —Ashiok, urdidor de pesadillas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'050a5fe3-e493-4074-b4b6-705df7b58279\', \'multiverseId\': 382110}, \'multiverseid\': 382110}, {\'name\': \'Fin cauchemardesque\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de cartes dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Quand je pense que certains croient qu\'il est préférable de mourir pendant son sommeil. » —Ashiok, tisseur de cauchemars", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381120&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c9eb24-b846-4883-84c7-0a38dc5f0fa2\', \'multiverseId\': 381120}, \'multiverseid\': 381120}, {\'name\': \'Incubo Mortale\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari al numero di carte nella tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"E pensare che alcuni ritengono serena la morte nel sonno." —Ashiok, Tessitore di Incubi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a69322d-99ad-4d52-bf09-6c59a3404cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 381285}, \'multiverseid\': 381285}, {\'name\': \'悪夢のような末路\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「眠っている間に息を引き取るのが安らかな死に方だと信じている者がいるとはね。」 ――悪夢の織り手、アショク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bd71f8f-06c9-4ed9-bf87-66999d3a75e1\', \'multiverseId\': 381450}, \'multiverseid\': 381450}, {\'name\': \'악몽 같은 최후\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴 종료까지 -X/-X를 받는다. X는 당신의 손에 있는 카드 수이다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': "\'잠자는 동안 죽는 게 평화로울 거라고 생각하는 사람들이 있다니.\' —악몽을 부르는 아시오크", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a856afce-ca6e-419c-9724-28ed77effba6\', \'multiverseId\': 381615}, \'multiverseid\': 381615}, {\'name\': \'Fim Aterrador\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno, sendo X o número de cards na sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"E pensar que alguns acreditam que morrer dormindo seja uma morte serena." — Ashiok, Tecedor de Pesadelos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a29105-3c6b-497a-9dd4-60c50cfe86c1\', \'multiverseId\': 381780}, \'multiverseid\': 381780}, {\'name\': \'Кошмарный Конец\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -X/-X до конца хода, где Х — количество карт в вашей руке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Подумать только, некоторые считают мирной смерть во сне». — Ашиок, Ткач Кошмаров\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc84ae82-1137-4efb-99af-d23727e9e0f4\', \'multiverseId\': 381945}, \'multiverseid\': 381945}, {\'name\': \'惊魇终局\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-X/-X直到回合结束，X为你的手牌数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「居然有人相信在睡梦中死亡会很安详。」 ～织魇师安梭苛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b08d26a5-ba43-4a66-b57f-c570b4e7c3c2\', \'multiverseId\': 380625}, \'multiverseid\': 380625}, {\'name\': \'驚魘終局\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-X/-X直到回合結束，X為你的手牌數量。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「居然有人相信在睡夢中死亡會很安詳。」 ～織魘師安梭苛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf472b9e-36db-428d-a3dd-b2f45a58b802\', \'multiverseId\': 380790}, \'multiverseid\': 380790}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alle Hoffnung auslöschen\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die keine Verzauberungen sind.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Phenax gewährt die Hoffnung auf Leben, während Pharika den Trost des Todes spendet. Zwischen ihnen steht Erebos, der nichts anderes als die Ewigkeit verspricht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380906&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c61a8822-9833-49cc-b61d-25a3b2dd871d\', \'multiverseId\': 380906}, \'multiverseid\': 380906}, {\'name\': \'Extinguir toda esperanza\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no sean encantamiento.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Mientras Fenax ofrece la esperanza de la vida, Farika concede el consuelo de la muerte. Entre ambos se encuentra Erebos, que no promete sino la eternidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c0e37bd-3494-4b14-be9d-75701db1cd52\', \'multiverseId\': 382061}, \'multiverseid\': 382061}, {\'name\': \'Détruire toute espérance\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures non-enchantements.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Phénax offre l\'espoir de la vie, tandis que Pharika accorde le réconfort de la mort. Érébos se tient entre les deux, et lui ne promet que l\'éternité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaa7517e-2dec-483c-a31c-de1faca3fabc\', \'multiverseId\': 381071}, \'multiverseid\': 381071}, {\'name\': \'Soffocare Ogni Speranza\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature non incantesimo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Fenax offre la speranza della vita, mentre Farika concede il conforto della morte. Tra loro sta Erebos, che nulla promette se non l\'eternità.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6288a64-e72c-48ec-8981-f713f23622da\', \'multiverseId\': 381236}, \'multiverseid\': 381236}, {\'name\': \'全希望の消滅\', \'text\': \'すべてのエンチャントでないクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'フィナックスは生への希望を与え、ファリカは死の安堵を与える。 彼らの間に立ちはだかるのがエレボスである。彼は永遠の時間のみを約束する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d46d907-4919-4c15-90d6-3c58a8a2515e\', \'multiverseId\': 381401}, \'multiverseid\': 381401}, {\'name\': \'모든 희망의 끝\', \'text\': \'부여마법이 아닌 모든 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'페낙스는 생명의 희망을, 페리카는 죽음의 안식을 약속한다. 그들 사이에 오직 영원만을 약속하는 에레보스가 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dce3bbf-3574-448f-9ac6-187a4e5cb12a\', \'multiverseId\': 381566}, \'multiverseid\': 381566}, {\'name\': \'Extinguir Toda Esperança\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas que não forem encantamentos.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Fenax oferece a esperança de vida, enquanto Fárica concede o consolo da morte. Entre eles está Érebo, que não oferece nada além da eternidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'932e6789-d461-4169-b32a-b5cc4561aace\', \'multiverseId\': 381731}, \'multiverseid\': 381731}, {\'name\': \'Лишение Надежд\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все не являющиеся чарами существа.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Фенакс предлагает надежду жизни, а Фарика дарует милосердную смерть. Между ними стоит Эреб, не обещающий ничего, кроме вечности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d50e2eb3-a8ed-42ae-9c72-600556de83fc\', \'multiverseId\': 381896}, \'multiverseid\': 381896}, {\'name\': \'浇熄希望\', \'text\': \'消灭所有非结界的生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'斐纳克许以生命之希望，而芳瑞卡赐予死亡之解脱。厄睿柏斯立于两者之间，仅承诺来世。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658cc6f9-a2be-487c-8aea-7319348666c2\', \'multiverseId\': 380576}, \'multiverseid\': 380576}, {\'name\': \'澆熄希望\', \'text\': \'消滅所有非結界的生物。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'斐納克許以生命之希望，而芳瑞卡賜予死亡之解脫。厄睿柏斯立於兩者之間，僅承諾來世。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b01dca3-ea58-4ecd-8c13-79f69ad5f28b\', \'multiverseId\': 380741}, \'multiverseid\': 380741}]', '[{\'name\': \'An Träumen laben\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine verzauberte Kreatur oder eine Verzauberungskreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir haben den Göttern die Macht gegeben, gegen uns Krieg zu führen. Es ist an der Zeit, sie ihnen wieder zu nehmen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380907&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c262e0b-e3de-45a9-b13c-27c20c3e5b8e\', \'multiverseId\': 380907}, \'multiverseid\': 380907}, {\'name\': \'Banquete de sueños\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura encantada o criatura encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dimos a los dioses el poder de entrar en guerra con nosotros. Ya es hora de que recuperemos ese poder".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86145334-3e93-454e-9c5f-41159a39aa07\', \'multiverseId\': 382062}, \'multiverseid\': 382062}, {\'name\': \'Festin de rêves\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature enchantée ou la créature-enchantement ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous avons donné aux dieux le pouvoir de nous faire la guerre. Le temps est venu de le reprendre. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381072&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2481ad7-830a-4908-876a-7a5a116643b5\', \'multiverseId\': 381072}, \'multiverseid\': 381072}, {\'name\': \'Banchetto di Sogni\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura incantata o una creatura incantesimo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Demmo agli dei il potere di muoverci guerra. Ora è tempo di riprenderci quel potere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ddc8efb-2a39-4d7d-bda9-7df09fc492ff\', \'multiverseId\': 381237}, \'multiverseid\': 381237}, {\'name\': \'夢の饗宴\', \'text\': \'エンチャントされているクリーチャー１体かクリーチャー・エンチャント１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は神々に、我々に対して戦争を仕掛ける力を与えました。今こそ、その力を取り返す時です。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a1f4bb-8bc3-468f-ba25-e2dd89e9a2ba\', \'multiverseId\': 381402}, \'multiverseid\': 381402}, {\'name\': \'꿈의 잔치\', \'text\': \'부여된 생물 또는 부여마법 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': "\'우리는 신들에게 힘을 주었고 그들은 그 힘으로 우리와 싸우고 있다. 이제 우리가 준 힘을 되찾을 때다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbdee3fd-68c2-4922-b25f-f6d5097bec19\', \'multiverseId\': 381567}, \'multiverseid\': 381567}, {\'name\': \'Banquete de Sonhos\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura encantada ou a criatura encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós demos aos deuses o poder de entrar em guerra conosco. É hora de tomar esse poder de volta."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15235639-544b-4013-958f-860256407d52\', \'multiverseId\': 381732}, \'multiverseid\': 381732}, {\'name\': \'Пожирание Грез\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое зачарованное существо или чары существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы сами дали богам силы сражаться с нами. Пора отнять у них эти силы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3073107-8f20-44b1-96cb-1a2f85301d32\', \'multiverseId\': 381897}, \'multiverseid\': 381897}, {\'name\': \'幻梦盛宴\', \'text\': \'消灭目标被结附的生物或结界生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们给了神向我们开战的力量。该是取回这份力量的时候了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91230e37-8e9a-4025-a36b-e0671c6b71dd\', \'multiverseId\': 380577}, \'multiverseid\': 380577}, {\'name\': \'幻夢盛宴\', \'text\': \'消滅目標被結附的生物或結界生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我們給了神向我們開戰的力量。該是取回這份力量的時候了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dbfc737-c415-451a-9969-fbe22ce86720\', \'multiverseId\': 380742}, \'multiverseid\': 380742}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angesehene Weberin\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, opfere die Angesehene Weberin: Bringe einen 1/3 grünen Spinne-Verzauberungskreaturenspielstein mit Reichweite ins Spiel. (Er kann fliegende Kreaturen blocken.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Du denkst, du webst so anmutige Meisterwerke wie ich? Lass mich dir wahre Handwerkskunst zeigen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380974&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfcc830a-5640-452e-863c-85faf522bdb2\', \'multiverseId\': 380974}, \'multiverseid\': 380974}, {\'name\': \'Tejedora insigne\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, sacrificar la Tejedora insigne: Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura encantamiento Araña verde 1/3 con la habilidad de alcance. (Puede bloquear a criaturas con la habilidad de volar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Crees que tu tejido es tan bello como el mío? Deja que te muestre el auténtico significado de tejer".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8555c05d-de44-4ad7-92b9-f1ca52bf14fc\', \'multiverseId\': 382129}, \'multiverseid\': 382129}, {\'name\': \'Tisseuse réputée\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, sacrifiez la Tisseuse réputée : Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature-enchantement 1/3 verte Araignée avec la portée. (Elle peut bloquer les créatures avec le vol.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Vous pensez que votre tissage est aussi beau que le mien ? Laissez-moi vous montrer l\'essence même de cet art. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381139&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19fb271e-b026-426a-83c1-58d30b0918d7\', \'multiverseId\': 381139}, \'multiverseid\': 381139}, {\'name\': \'Tessitrice Rinomata\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, Sacrifica la Tessitrice Rinomata: Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura incantesimo Ragno 1/3 verde con raggiungere. (Può bloccare le creature con volare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Reputi i tuoi tessuti belli quanto i miei? Lascia che ti mostri il vero significato di questa arte."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d03df34-04aa-44a6-9e0a-ba7dd5a68af9\', \'multiverseId\': 381304}, \'multiverseid\': 381304}, {\'name\': \'名高い織り手\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, 名高い織り手を生け贄に捧げる：到達を持つ緑の１/３の蜘蛛・クリーチャー・エンチャント・トークンを１体戦場に出す。（これは飛行を持つクリーチャーをブロックできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「あなた、自分の織物が私のと同じくらい美しいって思っているみたいね。なら、本物の職人技というものをお見せしないとね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'693e3adc-2720-4ca5-8c68-2e479e47f0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 381469}, \'multiverseid\': 381469}, {\'name\': \'유명한 방직공\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, 유명한 방직공을 희생한다: 대공을 가진 1/3 녹색 거미 부여마법 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. (그 생물은 비행을 가진 생물을 방어할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': "\'네 길쌈이 내가 짠 것만큼 아름다울까? 내가 진짜 길쌈이 뭔지 가르쳐주지.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'912166d9-7539-4d52-9bba-cbedf8a06587\', \'multiverseId\': 381634}, \'multiverseid\': 381634}, {\'name\': \'Tecedora Renomada\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, Sacrifique Tecedora Renomada: Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura encantamento verde 1/3 do tipo Aranha com alcance. (Ela pode bloquear criaturas com voar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Você acha que pode tecer peças tão belas quanto as minhas? Deixe-me mostrar-lhe o verdadeiro significado do ofício."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd00aabd-c3f1-46e1-b02c-a92e1d032155\', \'multiverseId\': 381799}, \'multiverseid\': 381799}, {\'name\': \'Знаменитая Ткачиха\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}, пожертвуйте Знаменитую Ткачиху: положите на поле битвы одну фишку чар существа 1/3 зеленый Паук с Захватом. (Она может блокировать существа с Полетом.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Думаешь, твоя ткань может сравниться с моей? Что ж, я покажу тебе, в чем суть этого искусства».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'331523e8-1e2a-40f1-b554-eeb131ea28be\', \'multiverseId\': 381964}, \'multiverseid\': 381964}, {\'name\': \'享誉织匠\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}，牺牲享誉织匠：将一个1/3绿色，具延势异能的蜘蛛衍生结界生物放进战场。（它能阻挡具飞行异能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「你以为你的织品能和我的媲美？让我来告诉你织艺的真谛。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020ef491-1e7f-498b-8d94-295029f3d860\', \'multiverseId\': 380644}, \'multiverseid\': 380644}, {\'name\': \'享譽織匠\', \'text\': \'{1}{G}，犧牲享譽織匠：將一個1/3綠色，具延勢異能的蜘蛛衍生結界生物放進戰場。（它能阻擋具飛行異能的生物。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「你以為你的織品能跟我的媲美？讓我來告訴你織藝的真諦。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b29d81f-9b67-42e2-9c95-d5a7a3a9e6b8\', \'multiverseId\': 380809}, \'multiverseid\': 380809}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arsenal des Iroas\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Aus einiger Entfernung wirken die Waffen makellos, aber in Wirklichkeit sind sie mit Beulen und Flecken übersät. Jede ist so einzigartig wie der Champion, der mit ihr in die Schlacht zog.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e765e898-8cb1-4557-a7bf-d08b4681abda\', \'multiverseId\': 380867}, \'multiverseid\': 380867}, {\'name\': \'Armería de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Desde lejos las armas parecen impolutas, pero lo cierto es que están deslucidas y dentadas; cada una de ellas es tan singular como el campeón que la empuña en la batalla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ea0a2ca-d158-45f4-ac0a-92da742224a2\', \'multiverseId\': 382022}, \'multiverseid\': 382022}, {\'name\': "Armurerie d\'Iroas", \'text\': \'À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "De loin, les armes ont l\'air neuves, mais en fait elles sont ternies et cabossées, chacune aussi unique que le champion qui les avait portées au combat.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381032&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed1357ac-20a9-4aaa-a547-41c2a1b76c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 381032}, \'multiverseid\': 381032}, {\'name\': \'Armeria di Iroas\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Da lontano le armi sembrano integre, ma in realtà sono ossidate e ammaccate. Ognuna è diversa, come il campione che le ha portate in battaglia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e234e1ef-8107-415f-b7ed-77f0f3077196\', \'multiverseId\': 381197}, \'multiverseid\': 381197}, {\'name\': \'イロアスの武器庫\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、その上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'遠目から見ればそれらの武器は新品のように見えるが、実際はそれらは汚れ、へこんでいた。それを戦場に身に着けていたそれぞれの勇者と同じように。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dd996f6-db15-429f-936a-7b6da3e60294\', \'multiverseId\': 381362}, \'multiverseid\': 381362}, {\'name\': \'이로아스의 무기고\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물이 공격할 때마다, 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n장착 {2}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'그 무기들은 멀리서 보면 새것 같았지만, 사실은 변색되고 찌그러져 있어서 전투에서 그 무기들을 휘둘렀던 용사만큼이나 특별했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b13ba8cb-886d-4275-9527-bd1c132123f2\', \'multiverseId\': 381527}, \'multiverseid\': 381527}, {\'name\': \'Arsenal de Iroas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'De longe, as armas parecem imaculadas, mas na verdade, elas estão manchadas e amassadas, cada uma tão única quanto o campeão que a empunhou na batalha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a35cafa-105d-4947-b1c5-0e7484f5630d\', \'multiverseId\': 381692}, \'multiverseid\': 381692}, {\'name\': \'Арсенал Ироя\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует, положите на него один жетон +1/+1.\\nСнарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Издали оружие кажется нетронутым, но вблизи видно, что оно покрыто царапинами и зазубринами. Каждый предмет уникален, как и тот воитель, что использовал его в бою.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c2d1b22-8982-4440-bd74-c0526fb0eb64\', \'multiverseId\': 381857}, \'multiverseid\': 381857}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯的兵械\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'这些武器远看崭新无瑕，近看暗淡无光且凹痕累累，每一件武器都跟带它们上战场的战士同样独一无二。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92c21c3a-a874-482c-b615-8b5ebd34467a\', \'multiverseId\': 380537}, \'multiverseid\': 380537}, {\'name\': \'伊洛安斯的兵械\', \'text\': \'每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'這些武器遠看嶄新無瑕，近看暗淡無光且凹痕累累，每一件武器都跟帶它們上戰場的戰士同樣獨一無二。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6948df8-fa2f-42c7-8a32-b580d5e7342b\', \'multiverseId\': 380702}, \'multiverseid\': 380702}]', '[{\'name\': \'Athreos, Gott der Überfahrt\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Weiß und Schwarz weniger als sieben beträgt, ist Athreos keine Kreatur.\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt, die du besitzt, bringe sie auf deine Hand zurück, falls ein Gegner deiner Wahl nicht 3 Lebenspunkte bezahlt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a493922-5594-4c69-a5ff-ed59597600b6\', \'multiverseId\': 380869}, \'multiverseid\': 380869}, {\'name\': \'Atreos, dios del paso\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al blanco y al negro sea menor que siete, Atreos no es una criatura.\\nSiempre que otra criatura de la cual seas propietario muera, regrésala a tu mano a menos que el oponente objetivo pague 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a53a54-5fb6-49de-b0ba-17241772ba25\', \'multiverseId\': 382024}, \'multiverseid\': 382024}, {\'name\': \'Athréos, dieu du Passage\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au blanc et au noir est inférieure à sept, Athréos n\'est pas une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature que vous possédez meurt, renvoyez-la dans votre main à moins que l\'adversaire ciblé ne paie 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381034&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8086f4a3-c470-46ce-b468-3416ad885c32\', \'multiverseId\': 381034}, \'multiverseid\': 381034}, {\'name\': \'Atreo, Dio del Passaggio\', \'text\': "Indistruttibile\\nFintanto che la tua devozione al bianco e al nero è inferiore a sette, Atreo non è una creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura che possiedi muore, riprendila in mano a meno che un avversario bersaglio non paghi 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5dd426c-f025-4265-8b1c-052500566527\', \'multiverseId\': 381199}, \'multiverseid\': 381199}, {\'name\': \'通行の神、エイスリオス\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの白と黒への信心が７未満であるかぎり、通行の神、エイスリオスはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたがオーナーである他のクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがライフを３点支払わないかぎり、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b7abb5-65ae-4579-865d-95181900767b\', \'multiverseId\': 381364}, \'multiverseid\': 381364}, {\'name\': \'인도의 신 에스리오스\', \'text\': \'무적\\n당신의 백흑 신앙심이 7 미만인 한, 에스리오스는 생물이 아니다.\\n당신이 소유한 다른 생물이 죽을 때마다, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대가 생명 3점을 지불하지 않으면 그 생물을 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54bdadcb-9c4e-47cc-83dd-d4d6d6ab107a\', \'multiverseId\': 381529}, \'multiverseid\': 381529}, {\'name\': \'Atreos, Deus da Passagem\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nEnquanto sua devoção ao branco e ao preto for menor que sete, Atreos não será uma criatura.\\nToda vez que outra criatura que você possui morrer, devolva-a para a sua mão, a menos que o oponente alvo pague 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2279df-f1fb-4cd7-b587-db2c1c2cad2c\', \'multiverseId\': 381694}, \'multiverseid\': 381694}, {\'name\': \'Атрей, Бог Перехода\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nПока ваша Преданность белому и черному меньше семи, Атрей не является существом.\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо, владельцем которого вы являетесь, умирает, верните его в вашу руку, если только целевой оппонент не заплатит 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c76e8d3-63ce-418f-9b07-bb65e0bead4d\', \'multiverseId\': 381859}, \'multiverseid\': 381859}, {\'name\': \'渡亡神雅睿欧斯\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的白黑两色献力小于七，雅睿欧斯便不是生物。\\n每当另一个由你拥有的生物死去时，除非目标对手支付3点生命，否则将它移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da4125ac-0ee2-43ed-b295-f1b1ecc3434e\', \'multiverseId\': 380539}, \'multiverseid\': 380539}, {\'name\': \'渡亡神雅睿歐斯\', \'text\': \'不滅\\n只要你的白黑兩色獻力小於七，雅睿歐斯便不是生物。\\n每當另一個由你擁有的生物死去時，除非目標對手支付3點生命，否則將它移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'558de5e0-5f71-4718-889d-70df0df271b9\', \'multiverseId\': 380704}, \'multiverseid\': 380704}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufstieg der Adler\', \'text\': \'Bringe zwei 2/2 blaue Vogel-Verzauberungskreaturenspielsteine mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel. Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wer der See ein Opfer darbringt, den belohnen die Sterne mit Erkenntnis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eabb417-f33f-413c-8e77-42d049928c71\', \'multiverseId\': 380981}, \'multiverseid\': 380981}, {\'name\': \'Ascenso de águilas\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura encantamiento Ave azules 2/2 con la habilidad de volar. Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Una ofrenda al mar proporciona un reflejo de las estrellas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'290067a0-6915-4bf2-be3d-799c62f58dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 382136}, \'multiverseid\': 382136}, {\'name\': \'Ascension des aigles\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature-enchantement 2/2 bleue Oiseau avec le vol. Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Une offrande à la mer apporte une vision des étoiles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f782cd8-202c-4bff-800e-c425fef61d26\', \'multiverseId\': 381146}, \'multiverseid\': 381146}, {\'name\': \'Volo delle Aquile\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura incantesimo Uccello 2/2 blu con volare. Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Un\'offerta consacrata al mare porta una visione dalle stelle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfcf3a77-5583-48f3-a842-4875d3c3c00f\', \'multiverseId\': 381311}, \'multiverseid\': 381311}, {\'name\': \'鷲の飛翔\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つ青の２/２の鳥・クリーチャー・エンチャント・トークンを２体戦場に出す。占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'海への捧げものが、星々からの見識をもたらす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'473ed755-088c-4a44-996c-a9e3a71e4448\', \'multiverseId\': 381476}, \'multiverseid\': 381476}, {\'name\': \'독수리의 비상\', \'text\': \'비행 능력을 가진 2/2 청색 조류 부여마법 생물 토큰 두 개를 전장에 놓는다. 점술 1. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'바다에 제물을 바치면 별이 통찰력을 내려 준다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f47e59d3-501d-4d7e-9341-4e99baea0c9c\', \'multiverseId\': 381641}, \'multiverseid\': 381641}, {\'name\': \'Ascensão das Águias\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura encantamento azuis 2/2 do tipo Ave com voar. Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Uma oferenda ao mar traz uma visão das estrelas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'283013d0-74d9-4597-b0c3-bcab0e3d8300\', \'multiverseId\': 381806}, \'multiverseid\': 381806}, {\'name\': \'Вылет Орлов\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы две фишки чар существа 2/2 синяя Птица с Полетом. Предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Сделай подношение морю, и обретешь мудрость звезд.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe76f7c3-9477-4d31-9f9f-a3505825e76e\', \'multiverseId\': 381971}, \'multiverseid\': 381971}, {\'name\': \'天鹰展翅\', \'text\': \'将两个2/2蓝色，具飞行异能的鸟衍生结界生物放进战场。占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'给大海的献礼换回来自群星的洞见。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62be7f6b-dc74-487a-9527-2eac3fde7ba9\', \'multiverseId\': 380651}, \'multiverseid\': 380651}, {\'name\': \'天鷹展翅\', \'text\': \'將兩個2/2藍色，具飛行異能的鳥衍生結界生物放進戰場。占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'給大海的獻禮換回來自群星的洞見。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cb0f305-ffa8-4b83-87ff-4b198a928d05\', \'multiverseId\': 380816}, \'multiverseid\': 380816}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannendes Licht\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bannende Licht ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil, bis das Bannende Licht das Spiel verlässt. (Diese bleibende Karte kehrt unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76395933-98e1-49a3-b7d5-7fa04e18a1f1\', \'multiverseId\': 380870}, \'multiverseid\': 380870}, {\'name\': \'Luz de destierro\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Luz de destierro entre al campo de batalla, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente hasta que la Luz de destierro deje el campo de batalla. (Ese permanente regresa bajo el control de su propietario.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a12abcae-5f95-4932-906f-581b7ed3572c\', \'multiverseId\': 382025}, \'multiverseid\': 382025}, {\'name\': \'Lumière de bannissement\', \'text\': "Quand la Lumière de bannissement arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à ce que la Lumière de bannissement quitte le champ de bataille. (Ce permanent revient sous le contrôle de son propriétaire.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381035&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61c028c4-3ba2-408d-ac6d-b54b50dd4ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 381035}, \'multiverseid\': 381035}, {\'name\': \'Luce Esiliatrice\', \'text\': \'Quando la Luce Esiliatrice entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario finché la Luce Esiliatrice non lascia il campo di battaglia. (Quel permanente torna sotto il controllo del suo proprietario.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a738965-6a16-4c44-b149-6fdf05ab126d\', \'multiverseId\': 381200}, \'multiverseid\': 381200}, {\'name\': \'払拭の光\', \'text\': \'払拭の光が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールする土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とし、払拭の光が戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。（そのパーマネントはオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻る。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fafeb71-8c60-47d7-ad6c-3f21ec6be68c\', \'multiverseId\': 381365}, \'multiverseid\': 381365}, {\'name\': \'추방의 빛\', \'text\': \'추방의 빛이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대가 조종하는 대지가 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방의 빛이 전장을 떠날 때까지 추방한다. (그 지속물은 그 소유자의 조종하에 전장으로 돌아온다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc8a44e3-8581-41a6-8990-62c5c57663ac\', \'multiverseId\': 381530}, \'multiverseid\': 381530}, {\'name\': \'Luz Banidora\', \'text\': \'Quando Luz Banidora entrar no campo de batalha, exile a permanente alvo que não seja terreno que um oponente controla até que Luz Banidora deixe o campo de batalha. (Aquela permanente retorna sob o controle de seu dono.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccbb2182-ebbe-4592-8250-f6929026231f\', \'multiverseId\': 381695}, \'multiverseid\': 381695}, {\'name\': \'Изгоняющий Свет\', \'text\': \'Когда Изгоняющий Свет выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент под контролем оппонента до тех пор, пока Изгоняющий Свет не покинет поле битвы. (Тот перманент возвращается под контролем своего владельца.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eadddf05-d17c-47ca-8819-f4dd4e623b5e\', \'multiverseId\': 381860}, \'multiverseid\': 381860}, {\'name\': \'驱逐明光\', \'text\': \'当驱逐明光进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的非地永久物，直到驱逐明光离开战场为止。（该永久物会在其拥有者的操控下移回。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d2436d2-6272-45a7-a60e-0064d3bea0cc\', \'multiverseId\': 380540}, \'multiverseid\': 380540}, {\'name\': \'驅逐明光\', \'text\': \'當驅逐明光進戰場時，放逐目標由對手操控的非地永久物，直到驅逐明光離開戰場為止。（該永久物會在其擁有者的操控下移回。）\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4103c2e-c1ec-439e-b7b2-9591e836d007\', \'multiverseId\': 380705}, \'multiverseid\': 380705}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bassaraturm-Bogenschützin\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher, Reichweite\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': \'Die setessischen Krieger des Bassara-Turms sind für ihre Guerilla-Taktik und ihren geschickten Umgang mit dem Bogen bekannt. Eindringlinge kommen im Nessischen Wald nicht weit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380871&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b64db5ce-5901-41a1-ba49-e77e0f1e0c7e\', \'multiverseId\': 380871}, \'multiverseid\': 380871}, {\'name\': \'Arquera de la Torre de Bassara\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio, alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arquero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los guerreros setessanos de la Torre de Bassara son conocidos por sus tácticas de guerrilla y por su habilidad con el arco. Los intrusos no llegan muy lejos en el Bosque Nessiano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0803db68-22cc-4e29-ac25-62e38808e504\', \'multiverseId\': 382026}, \'multiverseid\': 382026}, {\'name\': \'Archère de la tour de Bassara\', \'text\': \'Défense talismanique, portée\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et archer\', \'flavor\': "Les guerriers setessiens de la tour de Bassara sont connus pour leurs tactiques de guérilla et leur talent au tir à l\'arc. Les intrus qui entrent dans le Bois Nessian ne s\'aventurent jamais très loin.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381036&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75aed486-4cf0-478c-a70f-08594eb1bcb0\', \'multiverseId\': 381036}, \'multiverseid\': 381036}, {\'name\': \'Arciera della Torre Bassara\', \'text\': \'Anti-malocchio, raggiungere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arciere Umano\', \'flavor\': "Le guerriere della Torre Bassara di Setessa sono note per le tattiche di guerriglia e per l\'abilità con l\'arco. Gli intrusi non fanno molta strada nel Bosco Nessian.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a21a934-9af3-48bd-9296-dc5406bfe3b5\', \'multiverseId\': 381201}, \'multiverseid\': 381201}, {\'name\': \'バサーラ塔の弓兵\', \'text\': \'呪禁、到達\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・射手\', \'flavor\': \'バサーラ塔にいるセテッサの戦士たちは、その弓の腕とゲリラ戦法で知られている。ネシアンの森に入った侵入者は、あまり深入りできないだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca42b6df-59b2-4aee-a5bf-0f4dd11a5579\', \'multiverseId\': 381366}, \'multiverseid\': 381366}, {\'name\': \'바사라 탑 궁수\', \'text\': \'방호, 대공\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 궁수\', \'flavor\': \'바사라 탑의 세테사 전사들은 게릴라 전술과 궁술로 유명하다. 네시안 숲에 침입한 자들은 깊이 들어가지 못한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d63c80a6-c1a9-4c47-9ba8-6eee087561a8\', \'multiverseId\': 381531}, \'multiverseid\': 381531}, {\'name\': \'Arqueiro da Torre de Bassara\', \'text\': \'Resistência a magia, alcance\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Arqueiro\', \'flavor\': \'Os guerreiros setessanos da Torre de Bassara são conhecidos pelas táticas de guerrilha e pela habilidade com o arco. Os intrusos não chegam longe na Mata Nessiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6edfdb04-27e6-4325-a0fd-4990626aabea\', \'multiverseId\': 381696}, \'multiverseid\': 381696}, {\'name\': \'Лучница из Бассарской Башни\', \'text\': \'Порчеустойчивость, Захват\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Лучник\', \'flavor\': \'Сетесские воины из Бассарской башни известны своей партизанской тактикой и мастерством в стрельбе из лука. Незваным гостям в Нессийском лесу долго не протянуть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99a2b1af-853f-4dd2-92b4-45cc52e344fe\', \'multiverseId\': 381861}, \'multiverseid\': 381861}, {\'name\': \'巴萨剌塔弓箭手\', \'text\': \'辟邪，延势\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'巴萨剌塔的瑟特萨战士以游击战术和弓技著称。闯入奈西安森林者根本走不远。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7cc673f-91a3-45a2-be9a-783df75f322b\', \'multiverseId\': 380541}, \'multiverseid\': 380541}, {\'name\': \'巴薩剌塔弓箭手\', \'text\': \'辟邪，延勢\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／弓箭手\', \'flavor\': \'巴薩剌塔的瑟特薩戰士以游擊戰術和弓技著稱。闖入奈西安森林者根本走不遠。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26e0288b-ce3b-41b6-9e0c-b5d113a4d978\', \'multiverseId\': 380706}, \'multiverseid\': 380706}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bergung aus der Tiefe\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu eine Spontanzauberkarte deiner Wahl und bis zu eine Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Schicke Bergung aus der Tiefe ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das wahre Fundament von Meletis sind Ideen, nicht Steine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ed3c6e7-7369-4ab6-9f83-0ca8905c0286\', \'multiverseId\': 380971}, \'multiverseid\': 380971}, {\'name\': \'Extraer de las profundidades\', \'text\': \'Regresa hasta una carta de instantáneo objetivo y hasta una carta de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano. Exilia Extraer de las profundidades.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las ideas, y no las piedras, forman los auténticos cimientos de Meletis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef928db0-81ed-49ae-bb14-de2ed67322e5\', \'multiverseId\': 382126}, \'multiverseid\': 382126}, {\'name\': \'Extraction des profondeurs\', \'text\': "Renvoyez dans votre main jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ciblée et jusqu\'à une carte de rituel ciblée de votre cimetière. Exilez l\'Extraction des profondeurs.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les idées, pas les pierres, sont les vraies fondations de Mélétis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4386a00e-4130-4125-9fb3-2d60f8fe855e\', \'multiverseId\': 381136}, \'multiverseid\': 381136}, {\'name\': \'Pescare dagli Abissi\', \'text\': \'Riprendi in mano fino a una carta istantaneo bersaglio e fino a una carta stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Esilia Pescare dagli Abissi.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Non sono pietre, ma idee, a formare le vere fondamenta di Meletis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff08f3de-1c59-49d3-aa10-b34483f8af18\', \'multiverseId\': 381301}, \'multiverseid\': 381301}, {\'name\': \'深海からの引き寄せ\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるインスタント・カードを最大１枚までと、あなたの墓地にあるソーサリー・カードを最大１枚まで対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。深海からの引き寄せを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'メレティスの本当の基盤を形成する礎は石ではなく、知識である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0238e31f-360d-4d8e-81d0-35dba42e8832\', \'multiverseId\': 381466}, \'multiverseid\': 381466}, {\'name\': \'심연에서 끌어당기다\', \'text\': \'순간마법 카드 최대 한 장과 집중마법 카드 최대 한 장을 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 당신의 무덤에서 손으로 되돌린다. 심연에서 끌어당기다를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'멜레티스의 진정한 기반을 이루는 것은 돌이 아니라 생각이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a6083f-d0fc-4595-9445-3fe5fe42abf3\', \'multiverseId\': 381631}, \'multiverseid\': 381631}, {\'name\': \'Puxar das Profundezas\', \'text\': \'Devolva até um card de mágica instantânea alvo e um card de feitiço alvo do seu cemitério para a sua mão. Exile Puxar das Profundezas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'De ideias, e não de pedras, são feitas as fundações de Meletis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a124a3e7-0d39-4c61-9b10-c1931418cf39\', \'multiverseId\': 381796}, \'multiverseid\': 381796}, {\'name\': \'Вытягивание из Глубин\', \'text\': \'Верните не более одной целевой карты мгновенного заклинания и не более одной целевой карты волшебства из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Изгоните Вытягивание из Глубин.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'В основании Мелетиды лежат идеи, а не камни.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87686ece-b58f-4d42-8f18-657c56881bee\', \'multiverseId\': 381961}, \'multiverseid\': 381961}, {\'name\': \'深海捕捞\', \'text\': \'将至多一张目标瞬间牌以及至多一张目标法术牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。放逐深海捕捞。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'迈勒提斯的真正础石乃是个中理念，而非石料本身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ab2c83-a359-476e-a1f3-2d2b3f6eab21\', \'multiverseId\': 380641}, \'multiverseid\': 380641}, {\'name\': \'深海捕撈\', \'text\': \'將至多一張目標瞬間牌以及至多一張目標巫術牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。放逐深海捕撈。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'邁勒提斯的真正礎石乃是箇中理念，而非石料本身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abf98e45-0d7d-472a-a546-d3aede4c7139\', \'multiverseId\': 380806}, \'multiverseid\': 380806}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blendendes Leuchtfeuer\', \'text\': \'Streben — Das Blendende Leuchtfeuer kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {R} mehr.\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380875&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'870b4860-fec3-438c-aab0-1e8b0f92f0ea\', \'multiverseId\': 380875}, \'multiverseid\': 380875}, {\'name\': \'Fulgor cegador\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar el Fulgor cegador cuesta {R} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nCualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo no pueden bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe7ed86-de38-4e10-86a6-ebbcf4074c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 382030}, \'multiverseid\': 382030}, {\'name\': \'Flamboiement aveuglant\', \'text\': "Obstination — Le Flamboiement aveuglant coûte {R} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nN\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées ne peuvent pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381040&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'278910bd-2fd6-4ad1-9682-45313c048718\', \'multiverseId\': 381040}, \'multiverseid\': 381040}, {\'name\': \'Bagliore Accecante\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Il Bagliore Accecante costa {R} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Quelle creature non possono bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2085c183-cea2-493a-9e03-35f46da33486\', \'multiverseId\': 381205}, \'multiverseid\': 381205}, {\'name\': \'眩しい炎\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 眩しい炎を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{R}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。このターン、それらではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa1d571-9fdc-419c-8054-b48b57256abe\', \'multiverseId\': 381370}, \'multiverseid\': 381370}, {\'name\': \'눈이 머는 섬광\', \'text\': \'분투 — 눈이 머는 섬광은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {R}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3adf730f-08ab-4ed8-88a1-633ea1549e10\', \'multiverseId\': 381535}, \'multiverseid\': 381535}, {\'name\': \'Clarão Cegante\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Clarão Cegante custa {R} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nQualquer número de criaturas alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df60a088-b414-4541-a022-968b9e904c51\', \'multiverseId\': 381700}, \'multiverseid\': 381700}, {\'name\': \'Ослепительная Вспышка\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Ослепительной Вспышки стоит на {R} больше.\\nЛюбое количество целевых существ не могут блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a82121c-491a-47ce-aec8-f6fbe8311173\', \'multiverseId\': 381865}, \'multiverseid\': 381865}, {\'name\': \'眩目火光\', \'text\': \'积力～眩目火光在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{R}来施放。\\n任意数量的目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48b93764-5ae2-49ca-a8c3-e02211ac744a\', \'multiverseId\': 380545}, \'multiverseid\': 380545}, {\'name\': \'眩目火光\', \'text\': \'積力～眩目火光在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{R}來施放。\\n任意數量的目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04b25026-969f-4427-9946-48d20b26abe6\', \'multiverseId\': 380710}, \'multiverseid\': 380710}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blinder Raufbold\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {4}{W} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nDer Blinde Raufbold kann nicht alleine angreifen.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+2 und kann nicht alleine angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ee533bd-8cdb-477b-ad6b-5ad2a3bd69c6\', \'multiverseId\': 380991}, \'multiverseid\': 380991}, {\'name\': \'Pendenciero invidente\', \'text\': \'Concesión {4}{W}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nEl Pendenciero invidente no puede atacar solo.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+2 y no puede atacar sola.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7690d97-f7ba-4701-b755-870096d91e6d\', \'multiverseId\': 382146}, \'multiverseid\': 382146}, {\'name\': \'Bagarreur aveugle\', \'text\': "Grâce {4}{W} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nLe Bagarreur aveugle ne peut pas attaquer seul.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+2 et ne peut pas attaquer seule.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28db2398-7362-4044-9ccd-64beb5260738\', \'multiverseId\': 381156}, \'multiverseid\': 381156}, {\'name\': \'Lottatore Cieco\', \'text\': \'Conferire {4}{W} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nIl Lottatore Cieco non può attaccare da solo.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+2 e non può attaccare da sola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Guerriero Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c411c389-1a53-4a75-9b1d-d70c00522317\', \'multiverseId\': 381321}, \'multiverseid\': 381321}, {\'name\': \'盲いた喧嘩屋\', \'text\': \'授与 {4}{W} （このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\n盲いた喧嘩屋は単独では攻撃できない。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋２の修整を受けるとともに、単独では攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d092dfbf-b54d-4ffc-af0c-f92943855467\', \'multiverseId\': 381486}, \'multiverseid\': 381486}, {\'name\': \'눈먼 싸움꾼\', \'text\': \'권능 {4}{W} (이 카드의 권능 비용을 지불하고 발동하면, 이 카드는 생물에게 부여하는 마법진 주문이다. 이 카드는 생물에 부착되지 않은 상태가 되면 다시 생물이 된다.)\\n눈먼 싸움꾼은 혼자 공격할 수 없다.\\n부여된 생물은 +3/+2을 받으며 혼자서 공격할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 인간 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'718d5b67-6828-4e92-b10c-821e052e8043\', \'multiverseId\': 381651}, \'multiverseid\': 381651}, {\'name\': \'Rufião Cego\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {4}{W} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nRufião Cego não pode atacar sozinho.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+2 e não pode atacar sozinha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Humano Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea5f00a4-5faf-46fe-bbd5-ede386bffe43\', \'multiverseId\': 381816}, \'multiverseid\': 381816}, {\'name\': \'Незрячий Боец\', \'text\': \'Дар {4}{W} (Если вы разыгрываете эту карту за ее стоимость Дара, она является заклинанием Ауры со способностью «зачаровать существо». Она снова становится существом, если не прикреплена к существу.)\\nНезрячий Боец не может атаковать в одиночку.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+2 и не может атаковать в одиночку.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Человек Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'374a4dd2-31b3-4475-9205-0cc38bd77953\', \'multiverseId\': 381981}, \'multiverseid\': 381981}, {\'name\': \'盲目喧哗兵\', \'text\': \'神授{4}{W}（如果你支付此牌的神授费用来施放它，则它便是具「结附于生物」的灵气咒语。如果它未结附于生物上，就会再度成为生物。）\\n盲目喧哗兵不能单独进行攻击。\\n所结附的生物得+3/+2且不能单独进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d6abe87-2074-46ed-af2f-a4c1cae5a474\', \'multiverseId\': 380661}, \'multiverseid\': 380661}, {\'name\': \'盲目喧嘩兵\', \'text\': \'神授{4}{W}（如果你支付此牌的神授費用來施放它，則它便是具「結附於生物」的靈氣咒語。如果它未結附於生物上，就會再度成為生物。）\\n盲目喧嘩兵不能單獨進行攻擊。\\n所結附的生物得+3/+2且不能單獨進行攻擊。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～人類／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a4cf7f-76b5-4e75-8467-96c4b6c710fc\', \'multiverseId\': 380826}, \'multiverseid\': 380826}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzdiadem\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn das Blitzdiadem ins Spiel kommt, fügt es einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kämpfe für Keranos und für die Sterblichen. Ich kann darin keinen Widerspruch erkennen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3cfcc21-273e-4efe-a78e-02b495f53fca\', \'multiverseId\': 380946}, \'multiverseid\': 380946}, {\'name\': \'Diadema de relámpago\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la Diadema de relámpago entre al campo de batalla, hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Lucho por Keranos y por los mortales. No veo contradicción alguna".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d163f20-fc4f-4eaf-8ea2-166738220276\', \'multiverseId\': 382101}, \'multiverseid\': 382101}, {\'name\': "Diadème d\'éclair", \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nQuand le Diadème d\'éclair arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Je combats pour Kéranos et pour les mortels. Je n\'y vois aucune contradiction. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381111&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1355ebce-2238-4849-a72e-7475865ae2d0\', \'multiverseId\': 381111}, \'multiverseid\': 381111}, {\'name\': \'Diadema di Fulmini\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando il Diadema di Fulmini entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Combatto per Keranos e per i mortali. Non vedo la contraddizione."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'339317d0-3c4e-4f27-8479-7113a308f4b3\', \'multiverseId\': 381276}, \'multiverseid\': 381276}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の髪飾り\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n稲妻の髪飾りが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。稲妻の髪飾りはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「妾はケラノス様のために、そして定命の者たちのために戦っておる。矛盾などしておらぬわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'388be73f-9a9e-4e8e-b221-64fb8bcf2584\', \'multiverseId\': 381441}, \'multiverseid\': 381441}, {\'name\': \'번개 왕관\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n번개 왕관이 전장에 들어올 때, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 번개 왕관은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\\n부여된 생물은 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': "\'나는 케레노스와 필멸자를 위해 싸운다. 여기엔 어떤 모순도 없다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9bc6f63-2673-40a5-a517-cb3d50e87c73\', \'multiverseId\': 381606}, \'multiverseid\': 381606}, {\'name\': \'Diadema de Raios\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Diadema de Raios entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou jogador alvo.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu luto por Queranos e pelos mortais. Não vejo contradição."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d56d74e-6395-4ac2-8413-5cfcdb155654\', \'multiverseId\': 381771}, \'multiverseid\': 381771}, {\'name\': \'Диадема Молний\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда Диадема Молний выходит на поле битвы, она наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Я сражаюсь за Керана и за смертных. Не вижу в этом противоречий».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e23ee0-d096-4ad1-b12a-2fda9a71da10\', \'multiverseId\': 381936}, \'multiverseid\': 381936}, {\'name\': \'闪电权冠\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当闪电权冠进战场时，它对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「我同时为刻拉诺斯和凡人而战，我看不出这有什么矛盾。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1aacd91-626f-4bce-b3df-a1077436bc6c\', \'multiverseId\': 380616}, \'multiverseid\': 380616}, {\'name\': \'閃電權冠\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n當閃電權冠進戰場時，它對目標生物或玩家造成2點傷害。\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「我同時為刻拉諾斯和凡人而戰，我看不出這有什麼矛盾。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68dd49f8-fd34-4552-b8ca-b3d16696d408\', \'multiverseId\': 380781}, \'multiverseid\': 380781}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutrünstiger Hoplit\', \'text\': \'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der den Blutrünstigen Hopliten als Ziel hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.\\nImmer wenn eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Blutrünstigen Hopliten gelegt wird, entferne eine +1/+1-Marke von einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'499d6a3f-7678-4ef4-840f-e60fa3a37359\', \'multiverseId\': 380876}, \'multiverseid\': 380876}, {\'name\': \'Hoplita sanguinario\', \'text\': \'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo al Hoplita sanguinario, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Hoplita sanguinario.\\nSiempre que se ponga un contador +1/+1 sobre el Hoplita sanguinario, remueve un contador +1/+1 de la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d151208-735e-4346-a677-266b73b61363\', \'multiverseId\': 382031}, \'multiverseid\': 382031}, {\'name\': \'Hoplite sanguinaire\', \'text\': "Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible le Hoplite sanguinaire, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un marqueur +1/+1 est placé sur le Hoplite sanguinaire, retirez un marqueur +1/+1 d\'une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381041&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35ee6ef2-76c6-4883-bced-0f3d6f4d0927\', \'multiverseId\': 381041}, \'multiverseid\': 381041}, {\'name\': \'Oplita Assetato di Sangue\', \'text\': "Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia l\'Oplita Assetato di Sangue, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sull\'Oplita Assetato di Sangue.\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Oplita Assetato di Sangue riceve un segnalino +1/+1, rimuovi un segnalino +1/+1 da una creatura bersaglio controllata da un avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcbd26a3-f14a-4b29-8233-c9ea59279a69\', \'multiverseId\': 381206}, \'multiverseid\': 381206}, {\'name\': \'血に狂った重装歩兵\', \'text\': \'英雄的 ― あなたが血に狂った重装歩兵を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、血に狂った重装歩兵の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n血に狂った重装歩兵の上に＋１/＋１カウンターが１個置かれるたび、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上から＋１/＋１カウンターを１個取り除く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6282e5-3ee8-4526-b3e5-77d9e4c1cd2d\', \'multiverseId\': 381371}, \'multiverseid\': 381371}, {\'name\': \'피에 미친 중장보병\', \'text\': \'영웅 — 당신이 피에 미친 중장보병을 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 피에 미친 중장보병에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n피에 미친 중장보병에 +1/+1 카운터가 놓일 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에서 +1/+1 카운터 하나를 제거한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f075d855-d6ab-4cde-b202-2df889206f52\', \'multiverseId\': 381536}, \'multiverseid\': 381536}, {\'name\': \'Hoplita Sanguinário\', \'text\': \'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Hoplita Sanguinário, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele.\\nToda vez que um marcador +1/+1 for colocado em Hoplita Sanguinário, remova um marcador +1/+1 de uma criatura alvo controlada por um oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c87c02c-6480-4b54-a4c9-69f9ac1dda10\', \'multiverseId\': 381701}, \'multiverseid\': 381701}, {\'name\': \'Одержимый Кровью Гоплит\', \'text\': \'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Одержимый Кровью Гоплит, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Одержимого Кровью Гоплита.\\nКаждый раз, когда на Одержимого Кровью Гоплита помещается жетон +1/+1, удалите один жетон +1/+1 с целевого существа под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e3e3887-e414-47fe-b21a-d4bb88d0995f\', \'multiverseId\': 381866}, \'multiverseid\': 381866}, {\'name\': \'血狂重装步兵\', \'text\': \'勇行～每当你施放一个以血狂重装步兵为目标的咒语时，在血狂重装步兵上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当在血狂重装步兵上放置一个+1/+1指示物时，从目标由对手操控的生物上移去一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20991476-a9bd-4320-a47b-d5ee24d337ed\', \'multiverseId\': 380546}, \'multiverseid\': 380546}, {\'name\': \'血狂重裝步兵\', \'text\': \'勇行～每當你施放一個以血狂重裝步兵為目標的咒語時，在血狂重裝步兵上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n每當在血狂重裝步兵上放置一個+1/+1指示物時，從目標由對手操控的生物上移去一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a96622bc-60d9-426d-9e8d-245804c54e21\', \'multiverseId\': 380711}, \'multiverseid\': 380711}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brut des Thraxes\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Brut des Thraxes ins Spiel kommt, fügt sie einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie du Gebirge kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': "Der Magen jedes Drachen ist randvoll mit Funken aus Purphoros\' Schmiede.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380998&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a337f2e2-7461-47ec-b114-a7229b7cfd2b\', \'multiverseId\': 380998}, \'multiverseid\': 380998}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de Traxes\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Engendro de Traxes entre al campo de batalla, hace daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo igual a la cantidad de montañas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Todos los dragones albergan chispas de la forja de Purforos en su tripa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab507d4d-f544-4784-8761-69bbffa66a19\', \'multiverseId\': 382153}, \'multiverseid\': 382153}, {\'name\': \'Engeance de Thraxes\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Engeance de Thraxes arrive sur le champ de bataille, elle inflige à une cible, créature ou joueur, un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de montagnes que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Les étincelles de la forge de Purphoros emplissent le ventre de tous les dragons.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be1bf361-cb5b-4714-83da-ac20925da365\', \'multiverseId\': 381163}, \'multiverseid\': 381163}, {\'name\': \'Progenie di Traxes\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Progenie di Traxes entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio danno pari al numero di Montagne che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Le scintille della forgia di Purforos riempiono il ventre di ogni drago.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'749dfc6d-17d4-424b-b7ef-2b36e35df420\', \'multiverseId\': 381328}, \'multiverseid\': 381328}, {\'name\': \'トラクシーズの落とし子\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nトラクシーズの落とし子が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。トラクシーズの落とし子はそれに、あなたがコントロールする山の総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'すべてのドラゴンの腹の中には、パーフォロスの炉から生まれた火花が詰まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c408cdbf-4364-40a4-9cfd-352e947a3de9\', \'multiverseId\': 381493}, \'multiverseid\': 381493}, {\'name\': \'트락시스의 자식\', \'text\': \'비행\\n트락시스의 자식이 전장에 들어올 때, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 트락시스의 자식은 그 목표에게 당신이 조종하는 산의 개수만큼의 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'모든 용은 퍼포로스의 용광로에서 튀는 불꽃으로 배를 채운다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf24eb3d-e966-4e9f-8b07-46aa5a37a336\', \'multiverseId\': 381658}, \'multiverseid\': 381658}, {\'name\': \'Prole de Traxes\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Prole de Traxes entra no campo de batalha, ele causa ao jogador ou à criatura alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de Montanhas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'As fagulhas da forja de Púrforo encontram-se no ventre de todos os dragões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23c514fc-070d-404d-9a12-d67fb7aa42ab\', \'multiverseId\': 381823}, \'multiverseid\': 381823}, {\'name\': \'Порождение Тракса\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Порождение Тракса выходит на поле битвы, оно наносит целевому существу или игроку повреждения, равные количеству Гор под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Чрево каждого дракона заполнено искрами из горнила Пирфора.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da88406c-d7a2-4502-b949-396a09c3d3e0\', \'multiverseId\': 381988}, \'multiverseid\': 381988}, {\'name\': \'特剌谢斯后裔\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当特剌谢斯后裔进战场时，它对目标生物或牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于由你操控的山脉数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～龙\', \'flavor\': \'普罗烽斯锻炉里的火花填满了每条巨龙的肚子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'183d6127-0ece-4966-b33b-4426449fd1a4\', \'multiverseId\': 380668}, \'multiverseid\': 380668}, {\'name\': \'特剌謝斯後裔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當特剌謝斯後裔進戰場時，它對目標生物或玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於由你操控的山脈數量。\', \'type\': \'生物～龍\', \'flavor\': \'普羅烽斯鍛爐裡的火花填滿了每條巨龍的肚子。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de51da8-85e8-4ff0-a697-0a9b50e5aba2\', \'multiverseId\': 380833}, \'multiverseid\': 380833}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bund der Helden\', \'text\': \'Streben — Bund der Helden kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1}{G} mehr.\\nBestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Verdopple die Anzahl an +1/+1-Marken auf jeder von ihnen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0aa38d9-0c05-4d96-9613-44eaa3819e31\', \'multiverseId\': 380997}, \'multiverseid\': 380997}, {\'name\': \'Solidaridad de los héroes\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Solidaridad de los héroes cuesta {1}{G} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nElige cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo. Duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre cada una de ellas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d202ce1-f88d-45df-8508-a2f9fcdb9d2e\', \'multiverseId\': 382152}, \'multiverseid\': 382152}, {\'name\': \'Solidarité des héros\', \'text\': "Obstination — La Solidarité des héros coûte {1}{G} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nChoisissez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées. Doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d58a993-2038-4482-bc2d-fd6b23de1426\', \'multiverseId\': 381162}, \'multiverseid\': 381162}, {\'name\': \'Solidarietà tra Eroi\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — La Solidarietà tra Eroi costa {1}{G} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'502be2bb-645b-4bc3-bab6-f6541e38785c\', \'multiverseId\': 381327}, \'multiverseid\': 381327}, {\'name\': \'英雄たちの結束\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 英雄たちの結束を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}{G}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの数を２倍にする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d81c5c-3e0d-473c-ac8b-854449366034\', \'multiverseId\': 381492}, \'multiverseid\': 381492}, {\'name\': \'영웅의 연대\', \'text\': \'분투 — 영웅의 연대는 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {1}{G}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 올려진 +1/+1 카운터의 개수를 각각 두 배로 늘린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f0bf27d-e804-40f7-ac31-5842906e055f\', \'multiverseId\': 381657}, \'multiverseid\': 381657}, {\'name\': \'Solidariedade dos Heróis\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Solidariedade dos Heróis custa {1}{G} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nEscolha qualquer número de criaturas alvo. Dobre o número de marcadores +1/+1 em cada uma delas.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60fc2cb5-3ee0-4aac-a037-26fa0529a112\', \'multiverseId\': 381822}, \'multiverseid\': 381822}, {\'name\': \'Единство Героев\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Единства Героев стоит на {1}{G} больше.\\nВыберите любое количество целевых существ. Удвойте количество жетонов +1/+1 на каждом из них.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1b815f7-03df-442c-b13a-ac65bfcfeb99\', \'multiverseId\': 381987}, \'multiverseid\': 381987}, {\'name\': \'英雄齐心\', \'text\': \'积力～英雄齐心在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{1}{G}来施放。\\n选择任意数量的目标生物。将这些生物上的+1/+1指示物数量加倍。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b67f05a-1ed8-4ed1-b229-5b5d4a3dd4c6\', \'multiverseId\': 380667}, \'multiverseid\': 380667}, {\'name\': \'英雄齊心\', \'text\': \'積力～英雄齊心在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{1}{G}來施放。\\n選擇任意數量的目標生物。將這些生物上的+1/+1指示物數量加倍。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db06d46e-95d9-47e0-aef7-9f4da2bef12f\', \'multiverseId\': 380832}, \'multiverseid\': 380832}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dakra-Mystikerin\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Jeder Spieler deckt die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst die aufgedeckten Karten auf den Friedhof ihrer Besitzer legen. Falls du dies nicht tust, zieht jeder Spieler eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Entscheidungen sind selten so einfach, wie sie scheinen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e982a40-fc0f-444f-88c6-239c593632b5\', \'multiverseId\': 380887}, \'multiverseid\': 380887}, {\'name\': \'Mística de Dakra\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Cada jugador muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Puedes poner las cartas mostradas en los cementerios de sus propietarios. Si no lo haces, cada jugador roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Rara vez una elección es tan sencilla como parece.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909b9306-b43d-464e-918f-cd804d3d6f40\', \'multiverseId\': 382042}, \'multiverseid\': 382042}, {\'name\': \'Mystique dakra\', \'text\': \'{U},{T} : Chaque joueur révèle la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre les cartes révélées dans les cimetières de leurs propriétaires. Si vous ne le faites pas, chaque joueur pioche une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Les choix sont rarement aussi simples qu\'ils ne le paraissent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381052&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d214c06a-fb73-4651-bb75-5a9e5dc373fe\', \'multiverseId\': 381052}, \'multiverseid\': 381052}, {\'name\': \'Mistica delle Dakra\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Ogni giocatore rivela la prima carta del proprio grimorio. Puoi mettere le carte rivelate nei cimiteri dei rispettivi proprietari. Se non lo fai, ogni giocatore pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Di rado le scelte sono semplici come appaiono.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'177a8a9f-169c-42d7-8f83-d16f9aad45ab\', \'multiverseId\': 381217}, \'multiverseid\': 381217}, {\'name\': \'ダクラの神秘家\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。あなたは公開されたすべてのカードをオーナーの墓地に置いてもよい。そうしなかったなら、各プレイヤーはそれぞれカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'簡単な選択など、滅多にない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a93826a-50ee-462a-8577-9c17fd5f0bde\', \'multiverseId\': 381382}, \'multiverseid\': 381382}, {\'name\': \'다크라 신비주의자\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: 각 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 공개한다. 당신은 공개한 카드들을 소유자의 무덤에 넣을 수 있다. 그렇게 하지 않으면, 각 플레이어는 카드를 한 장씩 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인어 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'선택이 보이는 것처럼 간단한 경우는 매우 드물다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f7bf39-a654-4f0a-bdc8-7cd1830a78f4\', \'multiverseId\': 381547}, \'multiverseid\': 381547}, {\'name\': \'Místico de Dakra\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: Cada jogador revela o card do topo do próprio grimório. Você pode colocar os cards revelados nos cemitérios dos donos. Se não fizer isso, cada jogador comprará um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'As escolhas raramente são tão simples quanto parecem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4654a42f-3871-4810-98ca-18b7e15cb2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 381712}, \'multiverseid\': 381712}, {\'name\': \'Мистик из Дакры\', \'text\': \'{U}, {T}: каждый игрок показывает верхнюю карту своей библиотеки. Вы можете положить показанные карты на кладбища их владельцев. Если вы этого не делаете, каждый игрок берет карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Сделать выбор далеко не всегда так просто, как кажется.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'861bc5fe-5fc3-494a-bf66-1295f03492c2\', \'multiverseId\': 381877}, \'multiverseid\': 381877}, {\'name\': \'达克拉秘教徒\', \'text\': \'{U}，{T}：每位牌手各展示其牌库顶牌。你可以将展示出的所有牌分别置入其拥有者的坟墓场。如果你未如此作，则每位牌手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'抉择看似简单，实则困难。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1615112-98be-421e-abb5-d5fa891a9a5b\', \'multiverseId\': 380557}, \'multiverseid\': 380557}, {\'name\': \'達克拉秘教徒\', \'text\': \'{U}，{T}：每位玩家各展示其牌庫頂牌。你可以將展示出的所有牌分別置入其擁有者的墳墓場。如果你未如此作，則每位玩家各抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人魚／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'抉擇看似簡單，實則困難。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e55de1e3-46ed-4bf3-a0fb-54794f6774cf\', \'multiverseId\': 380722}, \'multiverseid\': 380722}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dem Zerfall überlassen\', \'text\': \'Streben — Dem Zerfall überlassen kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{G} mehr.\\nZerstöre eine beliebige Anzahl an Artefakten und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0b545d5-c090-4a4d-bec4-42fe704f2c90\', \'multiverseId\': 380882}, \'multiverseid\': 380882}, {\'name\': \'Entregar al polvo\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar Entregar al polvo cuesta {2}{G} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nDestruye cualquier cantidad de artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db9a47d6-874b-4593-8619-253cc8fbbb36\', \'multiverseId\': 382037}, \'multiverseid\': 382037}, {\'name\': \'Vouer à la poussière\', \'text\': "Obstination — Vouer à la poussière coûte {2}{G} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nDétruisez n\'importe quel nombre d\'artefacts et/ou d\'enchantements ciblés.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381047&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76a7ac4e-f087-4159-b3a2-41dc0b7d20dc\', \'multiverseId\': 381047}, \'multiverseid\': 381047}, {\'name\': \'Relegare nella Polvere\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Relegare nella Polvere costa {2}{G} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nDistruggi un qualsiasi numero di artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faaadd5e-1275-46a5-bff1-ff689330f2e2\', \'multiverseId\': 381212}, \'multiverseid\': 381212}, {\'name\': \'塵への回帰\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 塵への回帰を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{G}多くなる。\\n望む数のアーティファクトやエンチャントを対象とし、それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebcb02b9-3645-4601-8632-04b5afdeea70\', \'multiverseId\': 381377}, \'multiverseid\': 381377}, {\'name\': \'먼지로 화하다\', \'text\': \'분투 — 먼지로 화하다는 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{G}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n마법물체와 부여마법을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체와 부여마법들을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'735c2953-53c6-42fa-992b-4b36a301fce1\', \'multiverseId\': 381542}, \'multiverseid\': 381542}, {\'name\': \'Entregar ao Pó\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Entregar ao Pó custa {2}{G} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nDestrua qualquer número de artefatos e/ou encantamentos alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70201137-7d6f-41e3-ae98-450b374abb22\', \'multiverseId\': 381707}, \'multiverseid\': 381707}, {\'name\': \'Предать Праху\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Предать Праху стоит на {2}{G} больше.\\nУничтожьте любое количество целевых артефактов и (или) чар.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b1920c-3441-431f-92cc-b5d9800da3e5\', \'multiverseId\': 381872}, \'multiverseid\': 381872}, {\'name\': \'托诸尘土\', \'text\': \'积力～托诸尘土在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{G}来施放。\\n消灭任意数量的目标神器和／或结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'105a4fa6-26b8-446c-afaa-39dfeb535891\', \'multiverseId\': 380552}, \'multiverseid\': 380552}, {\'name\': \'托諸塵土\', \'text\': \'積力～托諸塵土在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{G}來施放。\\n消滅任意數量的目標神器和／或結界。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e49ad04-e192-46f2-b2c5-549b26f391e6\', \'multiverseId\': 380717}, \'multiverseid\': 380717}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demütiger der Sterblichen\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn der Demütiger der Sterblichen oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verursachen Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, bis zum Ende des Zuges Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'In Nyx wuchs der Groll der Götter ins Unermessliche und das Land erwachte unter dem finsteren Widerhall ihres Zorns.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429435a6-c77b-4c79-8eec-da84319e3530\', \'multiverseId\': 380932}, \'multiverseid\': 380932}, {\'name\': \'Avasallador de mortales\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Avasallador de mortales u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'La cólera de los dioses se multiplicó en Nyx y la tierra despertó con los ecos oscuros de su ira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f56dd2f-d327-4d69-8984-6c41e8f9bb57\', \'multiverseId\': 382087}, \'multiverseid\': 382087}, {\'name\': \'Oppresseur des mortels\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que l\'Oppresseur des mortels ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : élémental\', \'flavor\': "La rage des dieux se démultiplia dans Nyx et la terre s\'éveilla à ses sombres échos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bacbd943-9ad5-4e5b-b80c-fe43e1648a99\', \'multiverseId\': 381097}, \'multiverseid\': 381097}, {\'name\': \'Umiliatore di Mortali\', \'text\': "Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta l\'Umiliatore di Mortali o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature che controlli hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Elementale\', \'flavor\': "La collera degli dei crebbe in Nyx e la terra si risvegliò all\'eco oscuro della loro furia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'647c4ce6-fd37-44ff-b7f8-a628741a3641\', \'multiverseId\': 381262}, \'multiverseid\': 381262}, {\'name\': \'定命の者の大敵\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 定命の者の大敵か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時までトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'神々の憤怒はニクスにおいて倍化し、大地はそれによって放たれた暗い残響によって揺り起こされた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9169a6a5-8c5f-420f-9478-fa16d80ac47d\', \'multiverseId\': 381427}, \'multiverseid\': 381427}, {\'name\': \'겸손한 필멸자\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 겸손한 필멸자나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'신들의 진노가 닉스에 퍼지면서, 그들의 무시무시한 분노의 메아리에 대지가 깨어났다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4a0c3ba-7b43-45ed-a540-e85fff1e606a\', \'multiverseId\': 381592}, \'multiverseid\': 381592}, {\'name\': \'Humilhador de Mortais\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Humilhador de Mortais ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'A fúria dos deuses se multiplicou em Nyx e a terra acordou com os ecos sombrios de sua raiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f40b5bd-2b36-4694-8c4f-b9c9a75f9d96\', \'multiverseId\': 381757}, \'multiverseid\': 381757}, {\'name\': \'Попирающий Смертных\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Попирающий Смертных или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под вашим контролем получают Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Гнев богов вскипел в Никсе, и земля пробудилась от темных отзвуков их ярости.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'058034bd-b17a-4bf1-b0e3-45e26c0c8ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 381922}, \'multiverseid\': 381922}, {\'name\': \'凡人煞星\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当凡人煞星或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，由你操控的生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'诸神的愤怒在尼兹中成倍增长，而大地黑暗地应和此般怒火而复苏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0eae9a1-76e0-4fa6-872c-8d38514532f5\', \'multiverseId\': 380602}, \'multiverseid\': 380602}, {\'name\': \'凡人煞星\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當凡人煞星或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'諸神的憤怒在尼茲中成倍增長，而大地黑暗地應和此般怒火而復甦。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02eead92-2c72-4210-9189-3072871f61c0\', \'multiverseId\': 380767}, \'multiverseid\': 380767}]', '[{\'name\': \'Deserteursquartier\', \'text\': \'Du kannst bestimmen, das Deserteursquartier während deines Enttappsegments nicht zu enttappen.\\n{6}, {T}: Tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie enttappt nicht während des Enttappsegments ihres Beherrschers, solange das Deserteursquartier getappt bleibt.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'In Akros ist die Strafe für Fahnenflüchtige eine Nacht im Deserteursquartier.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380892&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'248c0758-cb5e-4486-b9a9-19a0dfff4e6f\', \'multiverseId\': 380892}, \'multiverseid\': 380892}, {\'name\': \'Cuarto del desertor\', \'text\': \'Puedes elegir no enderezar el Cuarto del desertor durante tu paso de enderezar.\\n{6}, {T}: Gira la criatura objetivo. No se endereza durante el paso de enderezar de su controlador mientras el Cuarto del desertor permanezca girado.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'En Akros, el castigo que se impone por huir del campo de batalla es una noche en el Cuarto del desertor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef2e6369-2df2-41c3-b6b0-01a5c8e0dbc5\', \'multiverseId\': 382047}, \'multiverseid\': 382047}, {\'name\': \'Quartiers du déserteur\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez choisir de ne pas dégager les Quartiers du déserteur pendant votre étape de dégagement.\\n{6}, {T} : Engagez la créature ciblée. Elle ne se dégage pas pendant l\'étape de dégagement de son contrôleur tant que les Quartiers du déserteur restent engagés.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Dans la cité d\'Akros, fuir le combat est passible d\'une nuit dans les Quartiers du déserteur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381057&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14cbc74f-1b16-4619-8a5c-8797f20403de\', \'multiverseId\': 381057}, \'multiverseid\': 381057}, {\'name\': \'Alloggio del Disertore\', \'text\': "Puoi scegliere di non STAPpare l\'Alloggio del Disertore durante il tuo STAP.\\n{6}, {T}: TAPpa una creatura bersaglio. Non STAPpa durante lo STAP del suo controllore fintanto che l\'Alloggio del Disertore rimane TAPpato.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Ad Akros, la pena per chi fugge da una battaglia è una notte trascorsa nell\'Alloggio del Disertore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe9ae9d8-b5ff-4ebd-861a-5e6f4a5f5bab\', \'multiverseId\': 381222}, \'multiverseid\': 381222}, {\'name\': \'脱走兵の間\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたのアンタップ・ステップに脱走兵の間をアンタップしないことを選んでもよい。\\n{6}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。それは脱走兵の間がタップ状態であり続けるかぎり、それのコントローラーのアンタップ・ステップにアンタップしない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'アクロスでは戦場から脱走した者に対する罰とは、「脱走兵の間」で一晩過ごすことである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c05622c-c44f-47a9-bf38-3b3bf53515f2\', \'multiverseId\': 381387}, \'multiverseid\': 381387}, {\'name\': \'탈영병 지구\', \'text\': \'당신은 당신의 언탭단에 탈영병 지구를 언탭하지 않을 수 있다.\\n{6}, {T}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 탭한다. 그 카드는 탈영병 지구가 탭된 채로 있는 한 그 조종자의 언탭단에 언탭되지 않는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'전장에서 도망친 아크로스 병사는 벌로 탈영병 지구에서 하룻밤을 보내야 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c672029c-a5ef-4fc5-b8e8-7d0d99f872e7\', \'multiverseId\': 381552}, \'multiverseid\': 381552}, {\'name\': \'Alojamento do Desertor\', \'text\': \'Você pode escolher não desvirar Alojamento do Desertor durante sua etapa de desvirar.\\n{6}, {T}: Vire a criatura alvo. Ela não será desvirada durante a etapa de desvirar de seu controlador enquanto Alojamento do Desertor permanecer virado.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Em Ácros, a pena por fugir da batalha é permanecer uma noite no Alojamento do Desertor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a49ea13a-e2a8-4dd6-b55e-7e1d42da17e8\', \'multiverseId\': 381717}, \'multiverseid\': 381717}, {\'name\': \'Казарма Дезертиров\', \'text\': \'Вы можете решить не разворачивать Казарму Дезертиров во время вашего шага разворота.\\n{6}, {T}: поверните целевое существо. Оно не разворачивается во время шага разворота контролирующего его игрока, пока Казарма Дезертиров остается повернутой.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'В Акросе тех, кто бежал с поля битвы, на одну ночь оставляют в Казарме Дезертиров.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'493c9e41-0e52-4064-8656-93f29f151dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 381882}, \'multiverseid\': 381882}, {\'name\': \'逃兵囚营\', \'text\': \'你可以选择于你的重置步骤中不重置逃兵囚营。\\n{6}，{T}：横置目标生物。只要逃兵囚营持续被横置，该生物于其操控者的重置步骤中便不能重置。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'阿喀洛斯对不战而逃者的处罚是在逃兵囚营中禁闭一夜。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66fd2399-a095-418c-8635-0bd2fcd4a534\', \'multiverseId\': 380562}, \'multiverseid\': 380562}, {\'name\': \'逃兵囚營\', \'text\': \'你可以選擇於你的重置步驟中不重置逃兵囚營。\\n{6}，{T}：橫置目標生物。只要逃兵囚營持續被橫置，該生物於其操控者的重置步驟中便不能重置。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'阿喀洛斯對不戰而逃者的處罰是在逃兵囚營中禁閉一夜。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bcbd464-2163-447f-a9df-966e01f009ca\', \'multiverseId\': 380727}, \'multiverseid\': 380727}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Flotte aussenden\', \'text\': \'Streben — Die Flotte aussenden kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1} mehr.\\nBis zum Ende des Zuges erhält eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl „Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, bringe einen 1/1 weißen Soldat-Kreaturenspielstein getappt und angreifend ins Spiel."\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad8859a-9044-476b-9050-bda078a062d4\', \'multiverseId\': 380944}, \'multiverseid\': 380944}, {\'name\': \'Flota a la carga\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar Flota a la carga cuesta {1} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nHasta el final del turno, cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo ganan cada una "Siempre que esta criatura ataque, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Soldado blanca 1/1 girada y atacando".\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90f3f983-6c9f-461c-88fc-fc5004fb4184\', \'multiverseId\': 382099}, \'multiverseid\': 382099}, {\'name\': \'Déployer la flotte\', \'text\': "Obstination — Déployer la flotte coûte {1} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nJusqu\'à la fin du tour, n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées gagnent chacune « À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, mettez sur le champ de bataille, engagé et attaquant, un jeton de créature 1/1 blanche Soldat. »", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a0cfad-004e-4e46-bed1-cba6daeefec5\', \'multiverseId\': 381109}, \'multiverseid\': 381109}, {\'name\': \'Arrembaggio della Flotta\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — L\\\'Arrembaggio della Flotta costa {1} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse ha "Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Soldato 1/1 bianca TAPpata e attaccante" fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'420e30dd-5891-438a-8809-0a8e2de0b2d3\', \'multiverseId\': 381274}, \'multiverseid\': 381274}, {\'name\': \'船団の出航\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 船団の出航を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで「このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、タップ状態で攻撃している白の１/１の兵士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11cfe5d5-97ba-446a-8e24-54f750b01c7b\', \'multiverseId\': 381439}, \'multiverseid\': 381439}, {\'name\': \'함대 출진\', \'text\': "분투 — 함대 출진은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {1}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지, 그 생물들은 각각 \'이 생물이 공격할 때마다, 1/1 백색 병사 생물 토큰 한 개를 탭되어서 공격하고 있는 채로 전장에 놓는다\'를 얻는다.", \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d7e902-c329-4ff9-a7e5-af88ca48d422\', \'multiverseId\': 381604}, \'multiverseid\': 381604}, {\'name\': \'Lançar a Frota\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Lançar a Frota custa {1} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nAté o final do turno, qualquer número de criaturas alvo ganha "Toda vez que esta criatura atacar, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura 1/1 branca do tipo Soldado virada e atacando."\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c941d3ba-4fae-490a-919d-b3031a43015b\', \'multiverseId\': 381769}, \'multiverseid\': 381769}, {\'name\': \'Спуск Флота\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Спуска Флота стоит на {1} больше.\\nДо конца хода любое количество целевых существ получают способность «Каждый раз, когда это существо атакует, положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа 1/1 белый Солдат повернутой и атакующей».\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53c93b13-19c5-408e-abb7-546785e8cb5b\', \'multiverseId\': 381934}, \'multiverseid\': 381934}, {\'name\': \'舰队启航\', \'text\': \'积力～舰队启航在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{1}来施放。\\n直到回合结束，任意数量的目标生物各获得「每当此生物攻击时，将一个1/1白色士兵衍生生物横置放进战场且正进行攻击。」\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a666b54-856d-4a17-9cc7-298f2021fa94\', \'multiverseId\': 380614}, \'multiverseid\': 380614}, {\'name\': \'艦隊啟航\', \'text\': \'積力～艦隊啟航在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{1}來施放。\\n直到回合結束，任意數量的目標生物各獲得「每當此生物攻擊時，將一個1/1白色士兵衍生生物橫置放進戰場且正進行攻擊。」\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc5f00de-2e59-4eb4-ba49-e60802d75a3e\', \'multiverseId\': 380779}, \'multiverseid\': 380779}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Meute anstacheln\', \'text\': \'Streben — Die Meute anstacheln kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{R} mehr.\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +2/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380985&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df49326a-12e4-4cf8-8c7d-48cccef17db6\', \'multiverseId\': 380985}, \'multiverseid\': 380985}, {\'name\': \'Incitar a la turba\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar Incitar a la turba cuesta {2}{R} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nCualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo obtienen +2/+0 cada una y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394c829a-72ad-47a3-b524-4c93aa4ebb8f\', \'multiverseId\': 382140}, \'multiverseid\': 382140}, {\'name\': \'Haranguer la foule\', \'text\': "Obstination — Haranguer la foule coûte {2}{R} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nN\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +2/+0 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381150&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cb68fcf-135e-4f89-92b3-40f6e8b28202\', \'multiverseId\': 381150}, \'multiverseid\': 381150}, {\'name\': \'Incitare la Folla\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Incitare la Folla costa {2}{R} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse prende +2/+0 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aae9c34c-7643-4986-b8ab-11228eab8a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 381315}, \'multiverseid\': 381315}, {\'name\': \'群衆の決起\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 群衆の決起を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{R}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともにトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4996c544-a30f-409b-9daa-6387df7c0436\', \'multiverseId\': 381480}, \'multiverseid\': 381480}, {\'name\': \'군중 선동\', \'text\': \'분투 — 군중 선동은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{R}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +2/+0을 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6e58d75-0b62-4b22-bf87-ed26ae0f6fdb\', \'multiverseId\': 381645}, \'multiverseid\': 381645}, {\'name\': \'Incitar a Turba\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Incitar a Turba custa {2}{R} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nQualquer número de criaturas alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aecb4f4-feda-4e7b-9aa1-972ea0c81270\', \'multiverseId\': 381810}, \'multiverseid\': 381810}, {\'name\': \'Поднять Толпу\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Поднять Толпу стоит на {2}{R} больше.\\nЛюбое количество целевых существ получают по +2/+0 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381975&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e6af91c-f755-425d-a520-0b67543bec56\', \'multiverseId\': 381975}, \'multiverseid\': 381975}, {\'name\': \'煽动暴民\', \'text\': \'积力～煽动暴民在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{R}来施放。\\n直到回合结束，任意数量的目标生物各得+2/+0且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45160006-71ff-40cb-bb04-1db63b003907\', \'multiverseId\': 380655}, \'multiverseid\': 380655}, {\'name\': \'煽動暴民\', \'text\': \'積力～煽動暴民在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{R}來施放。\\n直到回合結束，任意數量的目標生物各得+2/+0且獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a16a895b-cc16-420c-b2ad-d11d38ffa0c7\', \'multiverseId\': 380820}, \'multiverseid\': 380820}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Zeichen deuten\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 3, decke dann die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die umgewandelten Manakosten dieser Karte betragen. (Betrachte für Hellsicht 3 die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380935&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'663cf712-2274-454b-8d2c-83dfcef069da\', \'multiverseId\': 380935}, \'multiverseid\': 380935}, {\'name\': \'Interpretar las señales\', \'text\': \'Adivina 3, luego muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Roba una cantidad de cartas igual al coste de maná convertido de esa carta. (Para adivinar 3, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c40768-1281-4a36-aaac-68980a21e93f\', \'multiverseId\': 382090}, \'multiverseid\': 382090}, {\'name\': \'Interpréter les signes\', \'text\': "Regard 3, puis révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Piochez un nombre de cartes égal au coût converti de mana de cette carte. (Pour appliquer regard 3, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'679b4cc7-7234-40ea-b7dc-2d678942b3f3\', \'multiverseId\': 381100}, \'multiverseid\': 381100}, {\'name\': \'Interpretare i Segni\', \'text\': \'Profetizza 3, poi rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Pesca un numero di carte pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta. (Per profetizzare 3, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab81f7e-127b-4f1e-b2eb-d0566a87456c\', \'multiverseId\': 381265}, \'multiverseid\': 381265}, {\'name\': \'啓示の解読\', \'text\': \'占術３を行い、その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい枚数のカードを引く。（占術３を行うには、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードを見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードを望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'691a7391-783d-4781-b577-26bd37c9df8c\', \'multiverseId\': 381430}, \'multiverseid\': 381430}, {\'name\': \'징조 해석\', \'text\': \'점술 3을 한 후, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 그 주문의 전환마나비용과 같은 수의 카드를 뽑는다. (점술 3을 하려면, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드들 중 원하는 만큼을 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓고 나머지를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 원하는 순서대로 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3235687-b71c-4941-8ba5-2c44d2a4598f\', \'multiverseId\': 381595}, \'multiverseid\': 381595}, {\'name\': \'Interpretar os Sinais\', \'text\': \'Use vidência 3 e revele o card do topo do seu grimório. Compre um número de cards equivalente ao custo de mana convertido daquele card. (Para usar vidência 3, olhe os três cards do topo do seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles no fundo do seu grimório e o resto no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b24539-b56f-4218-a9c7-82c1cca893ea\', \'multiverseId\': 381760}, \'multiverseid\': 381760}, {\'name\': \'Чтение Знаков\', \'text\': \'Предскажите 3, затем покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Возьмите количество карт, равное конвертированной мана-стоимости той карты. (Чтобы предсказать 3, посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите любое количество из них в низ вашей библиотеки, а остальные на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7539cca-19ee-4b95-8fbe-8b6bd767a63a\', \'multiverseId\': 381925}, \'multiverseid\': 381925}, {\'name\': \'解读预兆\', \'text\': \'占卜3，然后展示你的牌库顶牌。抓若干牌，其数量等同于该牌的总法术力费用。（占卜3的流程是检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bce9de2-9568-4d61-b3e5-276a99e5132d\', \'multiverseId\': 380605}, \'multiverseid\': 380605}, {\'name\': \'解讀預兆\', \'text\': \'占卜3，然後展示你的牌庫頂牌。抽若干牌，其數量等同於該牌的總魔法力費用。（占卜3的流程是檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌，然後將其中任意數量的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底，其餘則以任意順序置於你牌庫頂。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38e67233-d263-4838-a444-a526ca6700c1\', \'multiverseId\': 380770}, \'multiverseid\': 380770}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnerhuf der Pheres-Herde\', \'text\': \'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der den Donnerhuf der Pheres-Herde als Ziel hat, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf den Donnerhuf der Pheres-Herde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zentaur, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Fleisch und Knochen oder Stern und Schatten. Meine Keule kennt da keinen Unterschied."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aad7578e-740e-4b01-99bc-9a9b8f47c5e1\', \'multiverseId\': 380966}, \'multiverseid\': 380966}, {\'name\': \'Cascotrueno del clan Feres\', \'text\': \'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo al Cascotrueno del clan Feres, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre el Cascotrueno del clan Feres.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero centauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carne y hueso o estrellas y sombra. A mi garrote le da lo mismo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ec3d34-85ab-4c01-808a-3e2edb2f403e\', \'multiverseId\': 382121}, \'multiverseid\': 382121}, {\'name\': \'Sabot-de-foudre du clan Phérès\', \'text\': \'Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible le Sabot-de-foudre du clan Phérès, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Sabot-de-foudre du clan Phérès.\', \'type\': \'Créature : centaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Chair et os ou étoile et ombre. Mon gourdin ne fait pas la différence. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381131&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cbbf58f-8706-4f9b-8d7a-040b92d0ab1c\', \'multiverseId\': 381131}, \'multiverseid\': 381131}, {\'name\': \'Zampatonante della Banda Feres\', \'text\': \'Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia la Zampatonante della Banda Feres, metti due segnalini +1/+1 sulla Zampatonante della Banda Feres.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Centauro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carne e ossa o stelle e ombra. Non fa differenza per la mia mazza."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68443d99-aa06-4e54-aedf-810c6421a0d8\', \'multiverseId\': 381296}, \'multiverseid\': 381296}, {\'name\': \'フィーリーズ団の雷鳴蹄\', \'text\': \'英雄的 ― あなたがフィーリーズ団の雷鳴蹄を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、フィーリーズ団の雷鳴蹄の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「その対象が肉であれ、骨であれ、星であれ、影であろうが、私の棍棒にかかれば何だって関係ないさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb24b1cb-6d54-45b0-bad1-21330670d1e9\', \'multiverseId\': 381461}, \'multiverseid\': 381461}, {\'name\': \'피레스 무리 천둥발굽\', \'text\': \'영웅 — 당신이 피레스 무리 천둥발굽을 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 피레스 무리 천둥발굽에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 켄타우로스 전사\', \'flavor\': "\'뼈와 살, 별과 그림자. 내 몽둥이 앞에서는 다 똑같은 것들이지.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0babd8ba-eb75-4d14-9e14-0457fdd4d4f1\', \'multiverseId\': 381626}, \'multiverseid\': 381626}, {\'name\': \'Casco-de-trovão do Bando Feres\', \'text\': \'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Casco-de-trovão do Bando Feres, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Casco-de-trovão do Bando Feres.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Centauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carne e osso ou estrelas e sombras. Não faz diferença para a minha clava."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7e9e882-78dd-42ce-9cba-85949b4d08fb\', \'multiverseId\': 381791}, \'multiverseid\': 381791}, {\'name\': \'Громоног из Племени Ферий\', \'text\': \'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Громоног из Племени Ферий, положите два жетона +1/+1 на Громонога из Племени Ферий.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кентавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Мускулы и кости или звезды и тень. Для моей дубины разницы нет».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'308bd525-d2da-4981-b4f7-0bf135fd0e92\', \'multiverseId\': 381956}, \'multiverseid\': 381956}, {\'name\': \'斐力兹族雷蹄兵\', \'text\': \'勇行～每当你施放一个以斐力兹族雷蹄兵为目标的咒语时，在斐力兹族雷蹄兵上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～半人马／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「不管是凡间骨肉还是天界星影，对我的棍棒来说没有差别。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f863123f-c328-4bb3-9a78-c0fcee6fb26e\', \'multiverseId\': 380636}, \'multiverseid\': 380636}, {\'name\': \'斐力茲族雷蹄兵\', \'text\': \'勇行～每當你施放一個以斐力茲族雷蹄兵為目標的咒語時，在斐力茲族雷蹄兵上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～半人馬／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「不管是凡間骨肉還是天界星影，對我的棍棒來說沒有差別。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fba19cb0-068a-4fcd-ac2b-68f90a1fd361\', \'multiverseId\': 380801}, \'multiverseid\': 380801}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dreiste Diebin\', \'text\': \'Inspiriert — Immer wenn die Dreiste Diebin enttappt wird, kannst du die Kontrolle über eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die du kontrollierst, und eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert und die mit dieser bleibenden Karte einen Kartentyp gemeinsam hat, tauschen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Das erste Opfer des Krieges ist die Ehrlichkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b422cf0-ca2f-48a0-b786-b79f20ed7d1e\', \'multiverseId\': 380888}, \'multiverseid\': 380888}, {\'name\': \'Ladrona temeraria\', \'text\': \'Inspiración — Siempre que la Ladrona temeraria se enderece, puedes intercambiar el control del permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controlas y el permanente objetivo que controla un oponente que comparte un tipo de carta con él.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'La honestidad es la primera baja de una guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97756445-9311-4be2-a833-f8ecae56c339\', \'multiverseId\': 382043}, \'multiverseid\': 382043}, {\'name\': \'Voleuse audacieuse\', \'text\': "Inspiration — À chaque fois que la Voleuse audacieuse devient dégagée, vous pouvez échanger le contrôle d\'un permanent non-terrain ciblé que vous contrôlez contre celui d\'un permanent ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle qui partage un type de carte avec lui.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "L\'honnêteté est la première victime de la guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381053&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3e6e946-9db1-4e5e-a7f8-0289ff79cbbc\', \'multiverseId\': 381053}, \'multiverseid\': 381053}, {\'name\': \'Ladra Audace\', \'text\': \'Ispirazione — Ogniqualvolta la Ladra Audace viene STAPpata, puoi scambiare il controllo di un permanente non terra bersaglio che controlli e un permanente bersaglio controllato da un avversario che condivide con esso un tipo di carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': "L\'onestà è la prima vittima della guerra.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3f9c43-257c-4c20-b485-adb2d478001b\', \'multiverseId\': 381218}, \'multiverseid\': 381218}, {\'name\': \'果敢な泥棒\', \'text\': \'神啓 ― 果敢な泥棒がアンタップ状態になるたび、あなたがコントロールする土地でないパーマネント１つと、それと共通のカード・タイプを持つ、対戦相手がコントロールするパーマネント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれらのコントロールを交換してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'戦争での最初の犠牲者は、誠実さである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b2d9a3a-05a7-489c-83af-99c55932f8aa\', \'multiverseId\': 381383}, \'multiverseid\': 381383}, {\'name\': \'대담한 도둑\', \'text\': \'영감 — 대담한 도둑이 언탭될 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 대지가 아닌 지속물, 그리고 그 카드와 카드 유형을 공유하는 상대가 조종하는 지속물을 각각 목표로 정한다. 당신은 두 지속물의 조종권을 교환할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': \'전쟁에서 가장 먼저 죽는 것은 정직함이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59db8b3b-fbbe-4c42-a0f4-b0a4832968af\', \'multiverseId\': 381548}, \'multiverseid\': 381548}, {\'name\': \'Ladrão Ousado\', \'text\': \'Inspirado — Toda vez que Ladrão Ousado é desvirado, você pode permutar o controle de uma permanente alvo que não seja terreno sob seu controle por uma permanente alvo sob o controle de um oponente que tenha o mesmo tipo de card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'A honestidade é a primeira baixa de guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7494c91-160f-43c8-8ea6-678e546cdb1d\', \'multiverseId\': 381713}, \'multiverseid\': 381713}, {\'name\': \'Дерзкая Воровка\', \'text\': \'Одухотворение — Каждый раз, когда Дерзкая Воровка становится развернутой, вы можете поменяться контролем над целевым не являющимся землей перманентом под вашим контролем и целевым перманентом под контролем оппонента, у которого есть такой же тип карты.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Честность — первая жертва войны.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1f72794-2d6d-4f76-8775-6cb718b2b9ac\', \'multiverseId\': 381878}, \'multiverseid\': 381878}, {\'name\': \'大胆的窃贼\', \'text\': \'启悟～每当大胆的窃贼成为未横置时，选择目标由你操控之非地永久物，以及目标由对手操控、且与前者有共通牌类别之永久物。你可以交换两者的操控权。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'诚信是战争的首个牺牲品。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f17308b-5de2-430c-85e4-46df78b29397\', \'multiverseId\': 380558}, \'multiverseid\': 380558}, {\'name\': \'大膽的竊賊\', \'text\': \'啟悟～每當大膽的竊賊成為未橫置時，選擇目標由你操控之非地永久物，以及目標由對手操控、且與前者有共通牌類別之永久物。你可以交換兩者的操控權。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'誠信是戰爭的首個犧牲品。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da7c9f4b-5fb3-4b67-8a5f-69ce58e4aebd\', \'multiverseId\': 380723}, \'multiverseid\': 380723}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eichenherz-Dryaden\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn die Eichenherz-Dryaden oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe, Dryade\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich weiß nicht, ob sich der Wald veränderte, als sie ihn durchquerten. Aber ich weiß, dass ich mich verändert habe." —Ianthe, setessische Jägerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2863089-f509-45bf-8787-fed4f76ef37b\', \'multiverseId\': 380959}, \'multiverseid\': 380959}, {\'name\': \'Dríadas corarroble\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que las Dríadas corarroble u otro encantamiento entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo gana +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Dríada ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"No sé si el bosque era distinto tras su paso por él. Pero sé que yo sí". —Iante, cazadora setessana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'660bf4cc-1b3f-4b18-825f-b0f8327707e3\', \'multiverseId\': 382114}, \'multiverseid\': 382114}, {\'name\': \'Dryades au cœur de chêne\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que les Dryades au cœur de chêne ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la créature ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nymphe et dryade\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ignore si la forêt était différente après leur passage. Mais moi je l\'étais. » —Ianthé, guerrière setessienne", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381124&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84b281e3-0f3c-477a-9f83-7320775de308\', \'multiverseId\': 381124}, \'multiverseid\': 381124}, {\'name\': \'Driadi Cuore di Quercia\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta le Driadi Cuore di Quercia o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Driade Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'"Non so se la foresta fosse diversa dopo il loro passaggio. So che io lo ero." —Iante, cacciatrice di Setessa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae95d0c4-a581-4fdf-a6ed-54e5c232cfe2\', \'multiverseId\': 381289}, \'multiverseid\': 381289}, {\'name\': \'樫心のドライアド\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 樫心のドライアドか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ・ドライアド\', \'flavor\': \'「彼らが通過した後に、森が変わったかは私には分からない。だが、私自身が変わったことは分かる。」 ――セテッサの狩人、イアンセ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e3fa30-5540-4a03-9574-e03761de6878\', \'multiverseId\': 381454}, \'multiverseid\': 381454}, {\'name\': \'참나무심장 드라이어드\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 참나무심장 드라이어드나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 님프 드라이어드\', \'flavor\': "\'그들이 지나간 뒤에 숲이 바뀌었는지는 모른다. 하지만 나는 바뀌었다.\' —세테사의 사냥꾼 이안데", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97fc0b28-3238-4113-a6db-8fce6d60c3c8\', \'multiverseId\': 381619}, \'multiverseid\': 381619}, {\'name\': \'Dríades Coração-de-carvalho\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Dríades Coração-de-carvalho ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Ninfa Dríade\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu não sei de que maneira a floresta mudou quando elas passaram. Mas eu sei que ela mudou." — Iante, caçadora setessana\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92cd844c-b817-4d05-8d43-9f1885f1d8d9\', \'multiverseId\': 381784}, \'multiverseid\': 381784}, {\'name\': \'Дриады Сердца Дуба\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Дриады Сердца Дуба или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, целевое существо получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Нимфа Дриада\', \'flavor\': \'«Не знаю, изменился ли лес после того, как они прошли. Знаю, что изменилась я сама». — Иантэ, сетесская охотница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20c74eb7-067f-49de-bfc3-7a2968cd887c\', \'multiverseId\': 381949}, \'multiverseid\': 381949}, {\'name\': \'橡心树灵\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当橡心树灵或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，目标生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～宁芙／树灵\', \'flavor\': \'「我不知道树林在他们通过后有没有变化。但我知道我改变了。」 ～瑟特萨猎人依安忒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'569186f6-e646-40fd-b1d0-d9cf387eb7b9\', \'multiverseId\': 380629}, \'multiverseid\': 380629}, {\'name\': \'橡心樹靈\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當橡心樹靈或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，目標生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～寧芙／樹靈\', \'flavor\': \'「我不知道樹林在他們通過後有沒有變化。但我知道我改變了。」 ～瑟特薩獵人依安忒\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c38dcfa-aeda-4831-99a9-69b407e7567d\', \'multiverseId\': 380794}, \'multiverseid\': 380794}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon der Blüten\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn das Eidolon der Blüten oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Verlorene Seelen werden vom emotionalen Widerhall der Dryaden-Versammlungen magisch angezogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'053a2693-8b93-4843-9a2c-586735199cc5\', \'multiverseId\': 380903}, \'multiverseid\': 380903}, {\'name\': \'Eidolón de flores\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Eidolón de flores u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Los ecos emotivos de las reuniones de dríadas atraen a las almas perdidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6276f595-aaf1-479b-9d0f-51da47c39b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 382058}, \'multiverseid\': 382058}, {\'name\': \'Eidôlon des fleurs\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que l\'Eidôlon des fleurs ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': "L\'écho émotionnel des rassemblements de dryades attire les âmes perdues.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381068&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee1b8337-faf7-452e-83e2-d646925856a9\', \'multiverseId\': 381068}, \'multiverseid\': 381068}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione dei Boccioli\', \'text\': "Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta l\'Apparizione dei Boccioli o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Spirito\', \'flavor\': "L\'eco emotivo dei concili di driadi attrae le anime perdute.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f2631d-d48c-4597-a0a3-8a97b8000af6\', \'multiverseId\': 381233}, \'multiverseid\': 381233}, {\'name\': \'開花の幻霊\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 開花の幻霊か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'ドライアドの集会から発せられる叙情的な残響が、迷いし魂たちを引き寄せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f198320c-04b9-413b-a032-55470bedd495\', \'multiverseId\': 381398}, \'multiverseid\': 381398}, {\'name\': \'꽃의 에이돌론\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 꽃의 에이돌론이나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'드라이어드의 서정적인 메아리는 길 잃은 영혼들을 끌어들인다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f822d3e2-64c2-48ae-8142-28d1a2279405\', \'multiverseId\': 381563}, \'multiverseid\': 381563}, {\'name\': \'Eidolon da Florescência\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Eidolon da Florescência ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Os ecos emocionais das reuniões de dríades atraem almas perdidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46fc3fe2-8baf-4eac-80d5-3b38006e1f7d\', \'multiverseId\': 381728}, \'multiverseid\': 381728}, {\'name\': \'Эйдолон Цветения\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Эйдолон Цветения или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Отзвуки эмоций от собраний дриад привлекают заблудшие души.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae68225d-a15f-43a9-9cb5-8218c9c8b08c\', \'multiverseId\': 381893}, \'multiverseid\': 381893}, {\'name\': \'花丛幻灵\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当花丛幻灵或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'树灵聚集时的激动回声吸引了迷失的灵魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48de38a1-548e-4f54-b99d-64332c89f126\', \'multiverseId\': 380573}, \'multiverseid\': 380573}, {\'name\': \'花叢幻靈\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當花叢幻靈或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'樹靈聚集時的激動回聲吸引了迷失的靈魂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b6de992-6c16-4db0-a689-72777f2f5a8b\', \'multiverseId\': 380738}, \'multiverseid\': 380738}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon der Redekunst\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler kann nicht mehr als einen Zauberspruch in jedem Zug wirken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist die Seele eines Philosophen, der verhungerte, als er die Geheimnisse des Universums zu ergründen suchte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'751e65b9-fc02-42a5-9374-1f08f28719b0\', \'multiverseId\': 380904}, \'multiverseid\': 380904}, {\'name\': \'Eidolón de la retórica\', \'text\': \'Ningún jugador puede lanzar más de un hechizo cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Es el alma de un filósofo que murió de inanición mientras contemplaba el universo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'232115a4-6998-4042-976b-47dbf01f5a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 382059}, \'multiverseid\': 382059}, {\'name\': \'Eidôlon de la rhétorique\', \'text\': "Aucun joueur ne peut lancer plus d\'un sort par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': "C\'est l\'âme d\'un philosophe, mort de faim tandis qu\'il contemplait l\'univers.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381069&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff0f9830-de7f-4f57-b427-5d65131f4924\', \'multiverseId\': 381069}, \'multiverseid\': 381069}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione della Retorica\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore non può lanciare più di una magia per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Spirito\', \'flavor\': "È l\'anima di un filosofo che perì di fame mentre contemplava l\'universo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27469e25-5947-40f1-8415-185b7b5c3d3d\', \'multiverseId\': 381234}, \'multiverseid\': 381234}, {\'name\': \'弁論の幻霊\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーは、毎ターン１つしか呪文を唱えられない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'それは宇宙について熟考するあまり、餓死した哲人の魂である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c8d306-f349-43e7-92ab-065d90634db4\', \'multiverseId\': 381399}, \'multiverseid\': 381399}, {\'name\': \'웅변의 에이돌론\', \'text\': \'각 플레이어는 매 턴 한 개를 초과해서 주문을 발동할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'그것은 우주에 대해 생각하다가 굶어 죽은 철학자의 영혼이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb833ca-4eb2-4fff-b167-830f4f8089db\', \'multiverseId\': 381564}, \'multiverseid\': 381564}, {\'name\': \'Eidolon da Retórica\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador não pode conjurar mais de uma mágica a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'É a alma de um filósofo que morreu de fome contemplando o universo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30a56aa5-96c0-4a2d-9292-a5660095fd8e\', \'multiverseId\': 381729}, \'multiverseid\': 381729}, {\'name\': \'Эйдолон Риторики\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок не может разыгрывать более одного заклинания за ход.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Это душа философа, который умер от голода, размышляя над природой вселенной.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc281f52-f859-4f50-9bde-07358e5e8192\', \'multiverseId\': 381894}, \'multiverseid\': 381894}, {\'name\': \'巧辞幻灵\', \'text\': \'每位牌手每回合不能施放一个以上的咒语。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'曾有哲人废寝忘食探究寰宇奥秘，其饥亡灵魂盘桓至今。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc419f81-cc62-4efa-a5a2-9889f9d4daf6\', \'multiverseId\': 380574}, \'multiverseid\': 380574}, {\'name\': \'巧辭幻靈\', \'text\': \'每位玩家每回合不能施放一個以上的咒語。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'曾有哲人廢寢忘食探究寰宇奧秘，其飢亡靈魂盤桓至今。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'667851e6-5416-4f0b-a0ab-b17047b2098f\', \'multiverseId\': 380739}, \'multiverseid\': 380739}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eidolon des großen Festes\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Zauberspruch mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 3 oder weniger wirkt, fügt das Eidolon des großen Festes diesem Spieler 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Geist\', \'flavor\': \'Xenagos feierte, während Theros brannte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380905&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5a540df-e37e-424d-8a3a-0b9901deac21\', \'multiverseId\': 380905}, \'multiverseid\': 380905}, {\'name\': \'Eidolón del gran festín\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo con coste de maná convertido de 3 o menos, el Eidolón del gran festín hace 2 puntos de daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Espíritu\', \'flavor\': \'Xenagos festejaba mientras Theros ardía.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a91de5-7efe-42d4-8946-051842800fb2\', \'multiverseId\': 382060}, \'multiverseid\': 382060}, {\'name\': \'Eidôlon de la Grande célébration\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort ayant un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 3, l\'Eidôlon de la Grande célébration inflige 2 blessures à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : esprit\', \'flavor\': \'Xénagos célébrait tandis que Theros brûlait.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'654c85cf-f019-4cb3-870e-dea148f04399\', \'multiverseId\': 381070}, \'multiverseid\': 381070}, {\'name\': \'Apparizione del Gran Baccanale\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 3, l\'Apparizione del Gran Baccanale infligge 2 danni a quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Spirito\', \'flavor\': \'Xenagos si abbandonò ai bagordi mentre Theros bruciava.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31adad33-efd5-4094-9f76-a42142f80d5b\', \'multiverseId\': 381235}, \'multiverseid\': 381235}, {\'name\': \'大歓楽の幻霊\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人が点数で見たマナ・コストが３点以下の呪文を１つ唱えるたび、大歓楽の幻霊はそのプレイヤーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — スピリット\', \'flavor\': \'テーロスが燃え盛る中、ゼナゴスは喝采を挙げていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12658da5-d50b-4a80-8361-c686dcb0ec7d\', \'multiverseId\': 381400}, \'multiverseid\': 381400}, {\'name\': \'거대한 축제의 에이돌론\', \'text\': \'플레이어가 전환마나비용이 3 이하인 주문을 발동할 때마다, 거대한 축제의 에이돌론은 그 플레이어에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 신령\', \'flavor\': \'제나고스는 테로스가 불타는 동안 축제를 열었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bcacfb2-dce1-4aa8-83ba-fe47e12894a9\', \'multiverseId\': 381565}, \'multiverseid\': 381565}, {\'name\': \'Eidolon da Grande Festança\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjura uma mágica com custo de mana convertido de 3 ou menos, Eidolon da Grande Festança causa 2 pontos de dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Espírito\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto Theros queimava, Xenagos festejava.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d31b8a89-0a84-4ca7-8741-11884d468d04\', \'multiverseId\': 381730}, \'multiverseid\': 381730}, {\'name\': \'Эйдолон Великой Пирушки\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает заклинание с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 3 или меньше, Эйдолон Великой Пирушки наносит 2 повреждения тому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Дух\', \'flavor\': \'Ксенаг пировал, а Терос горел.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f18538a-694f-41d7-98a9-d537a6fca82e\', \'multiverseId\': 381895}, \'multiverseid\': 381895}, {\'name\': \'盛欢幻灵\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手施放总法术力费用等于或小于3的咒语时，盛欢幻灵对该牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～精怪\', \'flavor\': \'塞洛斯陷入烈焰时，谢纳戈斯正乐在其中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c049828f-a1c1-46ac-8652-85e101786b21\', \'multiverseId\': 380575}, \'multiverseid\': 380575}, {\'name\': \'盛歡幻靈\', \'text\': \'每當任一玩家施放總魔法力費用等於或小於3的咒語時，盛歡幻靈對該玩家造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～精靈\', \'flavor\': \'塞洛斯陷入烈焰時，謝納戈斯正樂在其中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28cdb382-bb22-4e71-83fa-e4e3ebbdc3e1\', \'multiverseId\': 380740}, \'multiverseid\': 380740}]', '[{\'name\': \'Einblicke des Kruphix\', \'text\': \'Decke die obersten sechs Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm davon bis zu drei Verzauberungskarten auf deine Hand und lege den Rest der aufgedeckten Karten auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Verheißung des Horizonts ist eine Mischung aus Ungewissheit und Hoffnung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bec1ef92-1191-42fb-8627-67e6bd750ddd\', \'multiverseId\': 380942}, \'multiverseid\': 380942}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia de Krufix\', \'text\': \'Muestra las seis primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon hasta tres cartas de encantamiento que se encuentren entre ellas en tu mano y el resto de las cartas mostradas en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El horizonte es tentador tanto por su incertidumbre como por su potencial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aa974b1-378b-4b8a-b212-e2caadbdb931\', \'multiverseId\': 382097}, \'multiverseid\': 382097}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacité de Kruphix\', \'text\': "Révélez les six cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez jusqu\'à trois cartes d\'enchantement parmi elles dans votre main et les autres cartes révélées dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'horizon est attirant, tant par son incertitude que par son potentiel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a90561-fe96-437f-8bcf-426fb6fd8f12\', \'multiverseId\': 381107}, \'multiverseid\': 381107}, {\'name\': \'Intuizione di Krufix\', \'text\': \'Rivela le prime sei carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungi alla tua mano fino a tre carte incantesimo scelte tra esse e metti le altre carte rivelate nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'orizzonte è affascinante sia per la sua incertezza che per il suo potenziale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aa368ff-34dc-4110-880e-fa00daeb8fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 381272}, \'multiverseid\': 381272}, {\'name\': \'クルフィックスの洞察力\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上から６枚のカードを公開する。それらの中からエンチャント・カードを最大３枚まであなたの手札に加え、残りの公開されたカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'地平の彼方は、その不確実性と可能性の両方において、人の興味をかき立てる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d796b4de-06bf-4875-9bd9-18e0657445e2\', \'multiverseId\': 381437}, \'multiverseid\': 381437}, {\'name\': \'크루픽스의 지혜\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 여섯 장을 공개한다. 이렇게 공개된 카드 중 부여마법 카드를 최대 세 장까지 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'지평선은 불확실성과 가능성으로 애타게 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06f3ed9b-68a3-486b-8613-7594402c8b56\', \'multiverseId\': 381602}, \'multiverseid\': 381602}, {\'name\': \'Visão de Crufix\', \'text\': \'Revele os seis cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque até três cards de encantamento dentre eles na sua mão e o restante dos cards revelados no seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O horizonte é tentador, tanto por sua incerteza quanto por seu potencial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c065d182-dd01-4639-b026-5cfe479e9d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 381767}, \'multiverseid\': 381767}, {\'name\': \'Предчувствие Круфикса\', \'text\': \'Покажите шесть верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Положите не более трех находящихся среди них карт чар в вашу руку, а остальные показанные карты — на ваше кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Горизонт манит неопределенностью и широтой возможностей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40d38692-06ac-44b7-b103-6d0d98fc9621\', \'multiverseId\': 381932}, \'multiverseid\': 381932}, {\'name\': \'克罗芬斯的洞察\', \'text\': \'展示你牌库顶的六张牌。将其中至多三张结界牌置于你手上，其余则置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'地平线的诱人之处，正在于充满不确定性与潜力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bd5aea1-8b94-48df-99c4-46c4602f7b06\', \'multiverseId\': 380612}, \'multiverseid\': 380612}, {\'name\': \'克羅芬斯的洞察\', \'text\': \'展示你牌庫頂的六張牌。將其中至多三張結界牌置於你手上，其餘則置入你的墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'地平線的誘人之處，正在於充滿不確定性與潛力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8245fcbd-0d28-4620-84cc-86c3a14e2e1d\', \'multiverseId\': 380777}, \'multiverseid\': 380777}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entweihende Plage\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Verzauberung oder ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Für die Götter sind wir nichts weiter als Insekten. Vielleicht zeugt das von ihrer Weisheit." —Perisophia die Philosophin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4bd0da2-b4b9-4301-b455-920aca2357b8\', \'multiverseId\': 380891}, \'multiverseid\': 380891}, {\'name\': \'Plaga de profanación\', \'text\': \'Destruye el encantamiento o tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Los dioses nos ven como insectos. Quizá sea un enfoque sabio". —Perisofia, la filósofa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ba90ba6-c7a7-4ca3-a733-ccc1e78f128d\', \'multiverseId\': 382046}, \'multiverseid\': 382046}, {\'name\': \'Peste de profanation\', \'text\': "Détruisez l\'enchantement ou le terrain ciblé.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Les dieux nous considèrent comme des insectes. Peut-être cela reflète-t-il une certaine sagesse ? » —Périsophia la philosophe\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381056&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48479d50-8dc6-40f5-894a-50e99eb9baeb\', \'multiverseId\': 381056}, \'multiverseid\': 381056}, {\'name\': \'Piaga della Profanazione\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un incantesimo o una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Gli dei ci vedono come insetti. Forse in questo c\\\'è un fondo di saggezza." —Perisofia la filosofa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5821f6ae-4e4b-4843-bb84-1e955dcb9521\', \'multiverseId\': 381221}, \'multiverseid\': 381221}, {\'name\': \'冒涜の疫病\', \'text\': \'エンチャント１つか土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「神々は私たちの事を虫けらとでも思っているようね。それはそれで、ひとつの良い例えなのかもしれないわね。」 ――哲人ペリソフィア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c61d65-1c0c-49c6-9e4c-5239df1b65e8\', \'multiverseId\': 381386}, \'multiverseid\': 381386}, {\'name\': \'신성모독 전염병\', \'text\': \'부여마법 또는 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': "\'신들은 우리를 벌레로 여긴다. 아마도 그게 지혜일 것이다.\' —철학자 페리소피아", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d24fe6-c894-409d-b309-946b75399c25\', \'multiverseId\': 381551}, \'multiverseid\': 381551}, {\'name\': \'Praga da Profanação\', \'text\': \'Destrua o encantamento ou terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Os deuses nos veem como insetos. Talvez haja sabedoria nisso." — Perisofia, a filósofa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e5abb55-5ec6-410e-9d48-b28ddb6984a9\', \'multiverseId\': 381716}, \'multiverseid\': 381716}, {\'name\': \'Оскверняющий Мор\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевые чары или землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Боги считают нас насекомыми. Быть может, в этом есть мудрость». — философ Перисофия\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3ceaf3d-73ee-445b-b113-e3a15b75d5eb\', \'multiverseId\': 381881}, \'multiverseid\': 381881}, {\'name\': \'渎圣灾难\', \'text\': \'消灭目标结界或地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「众神视我们为蝼蚁。其中或蕴含着智慧。」 ～哲人珀里索菲娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed423d26-d369-4f23-acb9-7d5a5d603dc1\', \'multiverseId\': 380561}, \'multiverseid\': 380561}, {\'name\': \'瀆聖災難\', \'text\': \'消滅目標結界或地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「眾神視我們為螻蟻，其中或蘊含著智慧。」 ～哲人珀里索菲婭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b1fa1bb-c496-4487-8fde-e8ef8002434c\', \'multiverseId\': 380726}, \'multiverseid\': 380726}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erbitterter Widerstand\', \'text\': \'Streben — Erbitterter Widerstand kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {R}{W} mehr.\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +2/+0, Erstschlag und Wachsamkeit.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Hopliten ließen vor den Toren von Akros die Taktiken des berüchtigten Kytheon Iora und seiner Freischärler wieder aufleben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380893&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e127096-5059-4d74-8907-a64768e804fa\', \'multiverseId\': 380893}, \'multiverseid\': 380893}, {\'name\': \'Resistencia desesperada\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Resistencia desesperada cuesta {R}{W} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nCualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo obtienen +2/+0 cada una y ganan las habilidades de dañar primero y vigilancia hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'En los portales akronienses, los hoplitas recuperaron las tácticas de los infames milicianos de Kytheon Iora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe798884-26dc-4746-840a-87b32c19aa7a\', \'multiverseId\': 382048}, \'multiverseid\': 382048}, {\'name\': \'Dernier ressort\', \'text\': "Obstination — Le Dernier ressort coûte {R}{W} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nN\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +2/+0 et acquièrent l\'initiative et la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Aux portes d\'Akros, les hoplites renouaient avec les tactiques des miliciens infâmes de Kytheon Iora.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381058&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a62d75e1-40e9-4022-909c-69ab01a86a3c\', \'multiverseId\': 381058}, \'multiverseid\': 381058}, {\'name\': \'Resistenza Disperata\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — La Resistenza Disperata costa {R}{W} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse prende +2/+0 e ha attacco improvviso e cautela fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Ai cancelli di Akros, gli opliti riportarono in campo le tattiche dei famigerati miliziani di Kytheon Iora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'108f0646-0b83-4922-b7d1-f8badbd407c4\', \'multiverseId\': 381223}, \'multiverseid\': 381223}, {\'name\': \'捨て身の抵抗\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 捨て身の抵抗を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{R}{W}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで＋２/＋０の修整を受けるとともに先制攻撃と警戒を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'アクロスの門前で、重装歩兵たちはキテオン・イオラの悪名高き非正規隊の戦術を再現した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'227f23f9-1db7-477c-9c37-ede60cc716fb\', \'multiverseId\': 381388}, \'multiverseid\': 381388}, {\'name\': \'필사적인 저항\', \'text\': \'분투 — 필사적인 저항은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {R}{W}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +2/+0을 받고 선제공격과 경계를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'중장보병들은 아크로스 관문에서 키세온 이오라의 악명 높은 게릴라 전술을 부활시켰다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1dbb2d5-2c34-4d27-8f37-eb53860cdd94\', \'multiverseId\': 381553}, \'multiverseid\': 381553}, {\'name\': \'Resistência Desesperada\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Resistência Desesperada custa {R}{W} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nQualquer número de criaturas alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha iniciativa e vigilância até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Nos portões acrosanos, os hoplitas reviveram as táticas das tropas irregulares infames de Quiteon Iora.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fdb793d-fa39-426b-a5fb-8df31d635c07\', \'multiverseId\': 381718}, \'multiverseid\': 381718}, {\'name\': \'Отчаянная Оборона\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Отчаянной Обороны стоит на {R}{W} больше.\\nЛюбое количество целевых существ получают по +2/+0 и Первый удар и Бдительность до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'У ворот Акроса гоплиты повторили то, что когда-то сделали нерегулярные войска печально известного Китеона Иоры.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755e99f9-ce8d-459a-8f12-13bcdd31896b\', \'multiverseId\': 381883}, \'multiverseid\': 381883}, {\'name\': \'奋绝抵抗\', \'text\': \'积力～奋绝抵抗在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{R}{W}来施放。\\n直到回合结束，任意数量的目标生物各得+2/+0且获得先攻与警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在阿喀洛斯城下，库忒昂伊俄拉恶名昭彰的游勇战术重现重装步兵阵中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d57a517-14b7-4e3e-aaa2-19ad16293cb9\', \'multiverseId\': 380563}, \'multiverseid\': 380563}, {\'name\': \'奮絕抵抗\', \'text\': \'積力～奮絕抵抗在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{R}{W}來施放。\\n直到回合結束，任意數量的目標生物各得+2/+0且獲得先攻與警戒異能。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'在阿喀洛斯城下，庫忒昂伊俄拉惡名昭彰的游勇戰術重現重裝步兵陣中。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e61d583-4862-4bfd-a2aa-2f0365974137\', \'multiverseId\': 380728}, \'multiverseid\': 380728}]', "[{'name': 'Ernte-Alseiden', 'text': 'Konstellation — Immer wenn die Ernte-Alseiden oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verhindere allen Schaden, der in diesem Zug einer Kreatur deiner Wahl zugefügt würde.', 'type': 'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe', 'flavor': 'Nicht alle Schilde sind aus Eisen oder Bronze.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380928&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96260e08-a981-44b4-a367-340515ed23ae', 'multiverseId': 380928}, 'multiverseid': 380928}, {'name': 'Alseides guardacosecha', 'text': 'Constelación — Siempre que las Alseides guardacosecha u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, prevén todo el daño que se le fuera a hacer a la criatura objetivo este turno.', 'type': 'Criatura encantamiento — Ninfa', 'flavor': 'No todos los escudos están forjados con hierro o bronce.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382083&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '788fb65d-8244-4c0e-a197-488dcdbd2156', 'multiverseId': 382083}, 'multiverseid': 382083}, {'name': 'Alséïdes des moissons', 'text': 'Constellation — À chaque fois que les Alséïdes des moissons ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, prévenez, ce tour-ci, toutes les blessures qui seraient infligées à une créature ciblée.', 'type': 'Créature-enchantement : nymphe', 'flavor': 'Les boucliers ne sont pas tous faits de fer ou de bronze.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381093&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3ef218b-d100-4032-9178-93bcb84f59e7', 'multiverseId': 381093}, 'multiverseid': 381093}, {'name': 'Alseidi del Raccolto', 'text': 'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta le Alseidi del Raccolto o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto a una creatura bersaglio in questo turno.', 'type': 'Creatura Incantesimo — Ninfa', 'flavor': 'Non tutti gli scudi sono forgiati nel ferro o nel bronzo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381258&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '432624b1-e2b4-4e63-89d2-19a6bbfbf7b0', 'multiverseId': 381258}, 'multiverseid': 381258}, {'name': '収穫守りのアルセイド', 'text': '星座 ― 収穫守りのアルセイドか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それに与えられるすべてのダメージを軽減する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ', 'flavor': 'すべての盾が鉄や青銅で作られているわけではない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381423&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '452d8dbd-caea-4751-9eb9-7403adde938e', 'multiverseId': 381423}, 'multiverseid': 381423}, {'name': '수확감시자 알세이드', 'text': '성좌 — 수확감시자 알세이드나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 이번 턴에 그 생물이 입을 모든 피해를 방지한다.', 'type': '부여마법 생물 — 님프', 'flavor': '모든 방패가 철이나 청동으로 만든 건 아니다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381588&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c47e415c-9d6b-44d3-8c9d-1c9cccb07c6f', 'multiverseId': 381588}, 'multiverseid': 381588}, {'name': 'Alseídes da Colheita', 'text': 'Constelação — Toda vez que Alseídes da Colheita ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, previna todo o dano que seria causado à criatura alvo neste turno.', 'type': 'Criatura Encantamento — Ninfa', 'flavor': 'Nem todos os escudos são forjados com ferro ou bronze.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381753&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4527f9a7-da0a-40f1-9f58-9d985ca1d21b', 'multiverseId': 381753}, 'multiverseid': 381753}, {'name': 'Альсеиды, Хранительницы Урожая', 'text': 'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Альсеиды, Хранительницы Урожая или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены целевому существу в этом ходу.', 'type': 'Чары Существо — Нимфа', 'flavor': 'Не все щиты выкованы из железа или бронзы.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381918&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '804723a8-7a67-4e66-9c40-27cea1a96679', 'multiverseId': 381918}, 'multiverseid': 381918}, {'name': '佑丰蔻灵', 'text': '星彩～每当佑丰蔻灵或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，防止本回合中将对目标生物造成的所有伤害。', 'type': '结界生物～宁芙', 'flavor': '并非所有盾牌都以铜铁铸造。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380598&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64bbd43f-2aac-4e9d-bddc-701186d888cf', 'multiverseId': 380598}, 'multiverseid': 380598}, {'name': '佑豐蔻靈', 'text': '星彩～每當佑豐蔻靈或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，防止本回合中將對目標生物造成的所有傷害。', 'type': '結界生物～寧芙', 'flavor': '並非所有盾牌都以銅鐵鑄造。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380763&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ebc0135f-f2b1-4cea-a25c-728c623fa33d', 'multiverseId': 380763}, 'multiverseid': 380763}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fest des gefallenen Gottes\', \'text\': \'Bringe vier 2/2 rote und grüne Satyr-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Xenagos ist gefallen und ohne ihn wurde die Welt zu einem finsteren Ort. Womit sonst könnten wir diese Finsternis füllen als mit Wut?" —Guruthes, Schüler des Xenagos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0523ad04-2236-4e02-b76b-f2aaf881af57\', \'multiverseId\': 380977}, \'multiverseid\': 380977}, {\'name\': \'Festín del dios caído\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla cuatro fichas de criatura Sátiro rojas y verdes 2/2 con la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Xenagos ha caído, y el mundo se oscurece sin él. ¿Qué podría llenar esas tinieblas sino nuestra ira?". —Gurutes, discípulo de Xenagos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc3bfbf-c97f-4916-88ee-efcd8d4933d8\', \'multiverseId\': 382132}, \'multiverseid\': 382132}, {\'name\': \'Célébration du dieu vaincu\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille quatre jetons de créature 2/2 rouge et verte Satyre avec la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Xénagos est mort, et le monde s\'assombrit en son absence. Excepté notre rage, qu\'est-ce qui pourra remplir cette obscurité ? » —Guruthès, disciple de Xénagos", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6457af4a-c894-4fc6-a970-462968176d56\', \'multiverseId\': 381142}, \'multiverseid\': 381142}, {\'name\': \'Baccanale del Dio Caduto\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia quattro pedine creatura Satiro 2/2 rosse e verdi con rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Xenagos è caduto e il mondo senza di lui si fa buio. Cos\\\'altro può colmare quell\\\'oscurità, se non la nostra collera?" —Gurutes, discepolo di Xenagos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23541dd7-e2c0-4972-b2de-3130889a1dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 381307}, \'multiverseid\': 381307}, {\'name\': \'倒れし神の宴\', \'text\': \'速攻を持つ赤であり緑である２/２のサテュロス・クリーチャー・トークンを４体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼナゴス様が倒され、あのお方無き世界は闇に飲まれる。その闇を埋めるのは、我々の怒り以外に何があるだろうか？」 ――ゼナゴスの信奉者、グルシーズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da4ea387-309f-47db-851b-abec5e603846\', \'multiverseId\': 381472}, \'multiverseid\': 381472}, {\'name\': \'몰락한 신의 축제\', \'text\': \'신속 능력을 가진 적색이며 녹색인 2/2 사티로스 생물 토큰 네 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': "\'제나고스는 몰락했고 그가 없는 세계는 어둠뿐이다. 우리가 분노 외에 무엇으로 그 어둠을 채워야 하는가?\' —제나고스의 사도 그루테스", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13ffff3c-509f-4d70-ba48-48e15afeaa86\', \'multiverseId\': 381637}, \'multiverseid\': 381637}, {\'name\': \'Festança do Deus Caído\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha quatro fichas de criatura vermelha e verde 2/2 do tipo Sátiro com ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Xenagos decaiu e o mundo ficou mais sombrio sem ele. O que pode preencher essa escuridão senão a nossa raiva?" — Gurutes, discípulo de Xenagos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5e70542-8ff2-45e3-bcd0-2055a1f41d15\', \'multiverseId\': 381802}, \'multiverseid\': 381802}, {\'name\': \'Гулянка Павшего Бога\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы четыре фишки существа 2/2 красный и зеленый Сатир с Ускорением.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ксенаг пал, и без него мир погрузился во тьму. Что же заполнит эту тьму, если не наша ярость?» — Гурут, ученик Ксенага\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf8d633-8cee-4c08-977d-3020da82686d\', \'multiverseId\': 381967}, \'multiverseid\': 381967}, {\'name\': \'殒神狂欢\', \'text\': \'将四个2/2红绿双色，具敏捷异能的羊蹄人衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「谢纳戈斯已殒落，世界随之陷入黑暗。除了我们的怒火，还有什么能将黑暗填满？」 ～谢纳戈斯的信徒古律忒斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2199b01-68e7-4de2-8dbd-6bec46e414f6\', \'multiverseId\': 380647}, \'multiverseid\': 380647}, {\'name\': \'殞神狂歡\', \'text\': \'將四個2/2紅綠雙色，具敏捷異能的羊蹄人衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「謝納戈斯已殞落，世界隨之陷入黑暗。除了我們的怒火，還有什麼能將黑暗填滿？」 ～謝納戈斯的信徒古律忒斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29da023d-309e-41e5-b9b0-4795c58fe4fa\', \'multiverseId\': 380812}, \'multiverseid\': 380812}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfeder-Cocatrisk\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)\\nFliegend, Todesberührung\\n{5}{G}{U}: Monstrum 3. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Cocatrisk\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380910&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8badc792-a783-4bd5-b8bf-acd5cfdebe16\', \'multiverseId\': 380910}, \'multiverseid\': 380910}, {\'name\': \'Cocatriz plumaveloz\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nVuela, toque mortal.\\n{5}{G}{U}: Monstruosidad 3. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cocatriz\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b542eff-67a7-427e-b502-29bc9dfb5ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 382065}, \'multiverseid\': 382065}, {\'name\': \'Cocatrix lesteplume\', \'text\': "Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nVol, contact mortel\\n{5}{G}{U} : Monstruosité 3. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)", \'type\': \'Créature : cocatrix\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381075&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f442cc8-be60-43b9-a830-d9656816063b\', \'multiverseId\': 381075}, \'multiverseid\': 381075}, {\'name\': \'Coccatrice Rapidapiuma\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nVolare, tocco letale\\n{5}{G}{U}: Mostruosità 3. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Coccatrice\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8cca65e-aadb-43bb-aa87-b05801871da2\', \'multiverseId\': 381240}, \'multiverseid\': 381240}, {\'name\': \'速羽根のコカトリス\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\n飛行、接死\\n{5}{G}{U}：怪物化３を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。これは怪物的になる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — コカトリス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d56a5a0-c25f-4c38-8945-d307f60c15ff\', \'multiverseId\': 381405}, \'multiverseid\': 381405}, {\'name\': \'가벼운 깃털 코카트리스\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)\\n비행, 치명타\\n{5}{G}{U}: 괴수화 3. (이 생물이 괴수화하지 않았다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 올려놓는다. 이 생물은 괴수화한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코카트리스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6c2311-b4b4-4cce-8031-a440f777563d\', \'multiverseId\': 381570}, \'multiverseid\': 381570}, {\'name\': \'Cocatriz Pena-veloz\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nVoar, toque mortífero\\n{5}{G}{U}: Monstruosidade 3. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cocatriz\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe179f63-e7a2-47d4-8420-f0150fc4a415\', \'multiverseId\': 381735}, \'multiverseid\': 381735}, {\'name\': \'Быстрокрылый Куролиск\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nПолет, Смертельное касание\\n{5}{G}{U}: Чудовищность 3. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него три жетона +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Куролиск\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4dd95c7-5a1f-40bf-b215-c524cb8a034a\', \'multiverseId\': 381900}, \'multiverseid\': 381900}, {\'name\': \'飞羽石化鸡蛇\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n飞行，死触\\n{5}{G}{U}：蛮化3。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置三个+1/+1指示物且它蛮化。）\', \'type\': \'生物～石化鸡蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06060bbe-4c51-458f-a9e3-c03ea722cfe3\', \'multiverseId\': 380580}, \'multiverseid\': 380580}, {\'name\': \'飛羽石化雞蛇\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）\\n飛行，死觸\\n{5}{G}{U}：蠻化3。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置三個+1/+1指示物且它蠻化。）\', \'type\': \'生物～石化雞蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e46a5c4c-b16c-4db2-855f-662c1d7646e0\', \'multiverseId\': 380745}, \'multiverseid\': 380745}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flugformation\', \'text\': \'Streben — Die Flugformation kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{U} mehr.\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+1 und Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380860&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8158865c-f565-4812-b4d0-10ba249b9313\', \'multiverseId\': 380860}, \'multiverseid\': 380860}, {\'name\': \'Formación aérea\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Formación aérea cuesta {2}{U} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nCualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo obtienen +1/+1 cada una y ganan la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec97a6a6-2f9d-454c-aaa4-a0f81bdef39e\', \'multiverseId\': 382015}, \'multiverseid\': 382015}, {\'name\': \'Formation aérienne\', \'text\': "Obstination — La Formation aérienne coûte {2}{U} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nN\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +1/+1 et acquièrent le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381025&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b496fe7-383b-4dc1-847e-bc32f78b4bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 381025}, \'multiverseid\': 381025}, {\'name\': \'Formazione Aerea\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — La Formazione Aerea costa {2}{U} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse prende +1/+1 e ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af3f67a7-9154-4ebe-87a4-043be3b8ceb8\', \'multiverseId\': 381190}, \'multiverseid\': 381190}, {\'name\': \'空中隊形\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 空中隊形を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{U}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4727b342-43aa-4a1d-9066-083fe46ae3f1\', \'multiverseId\': 381355}, \'multiverseid\': 381355}, {\'name\': \'공습 대형\', \'text\': \'분투 — 공습 대형은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{U}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +1/+1을 받고 비행을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da429241-899c-4b01-83d6-b65ef368ab24\', \'multiverseId\': 381520}, \'multiverseid\': 381520}, {\'name\': \'Formação Aérea\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Formação Aérea custa {2}{U} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nQualquer número de criaturas alvo recebe +1/+1 e ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68833790-7d69-4ff7-b3ea-ca2307ecd6e9\', \'multiverseId\': 381685}, \'multiverseid\': 381685}, {\'name\': \'Воздушное Построение\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Воздушного Построения стоит на {2}{U} больше.\\nЛюбое количество целевых существ получают по +1/+1 и Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f57aadec-b424-4574-a8c5-4375609877a6\', \'multiverseId\': 381850}, \'multiverseid\': 381850}, {\'name\': \'空中列阵\', \'text\': \'积力～空中列阵在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{U}来施放。\\n直到回合结束，任意数量的目标生物各得+1/+1且获得飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c67ed53-1e1a-4a3b-9434-72ced6151bac\', \'multiverseId\': 380530}, \'multiverseid\': 380530}, {\'name\': \'空中列陣\', \'text\': \'積力～空中列陣在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{U}來施放。\\n直到回合結束，任意數量的目標生物各得+1/+1且獲得飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3416250-d2dd-4b4f-93ab-d9af60a0f84b\', \'multiverseId\': 380695}, \'multiverseid\': 380695}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flächenbrand-Zerberus\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Monstrum 1. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nWenn der Flächenbrand-Zerberus monströs wird, fügt er jedem Gegner und jeder Kreatur, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381022&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d9d6931-5777-423b-98a8-bc55e92f6f32\', \'multiverseId\': 381022}, \'multiverseid\': 381022}, {\'name\': \'Cerbero incendiario\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Monstruosidad 1. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nCuando el Cerbero incendiario se convierta en monstruoso, hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente y a cada criatura que controlan tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Perro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d90fee2f-cfb5-4b69-a79a-afa807a7dd5a\', \'multiverseId\': 382177}, \'multiverseid\': 382177}, {\'name\': \'Cerbère du feu dévastateur\', \'text\': "{5}{R}{R} : Monstruosité 1. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nQuand le Cerbère du feu dévastateur devient monstrueux, il inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire et à chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent.", \'type\': \'Créature : chien de chasse\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381187&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'164990ab-144a-4241-aa72-418737b4d6a0\', \'multiverseId\': 381187}, \'multiverseid\': 381187}, {\'name\': "Cerbero dell\'Incendio Indomabile", \'text\': "{5}{R}{R}: Mostruosità 1. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nQuando il Cerbero dell\'Incendio Indomabile diventa mostruoso, infligge 2 danni a ogni avversario e a ogni creatura controllata dai tuoi avversari.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Segugio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'461f5184-f446-404a-9911-c3bdfa68fc3f\', \'multiverseId\': 381352}, \'multiverseid\': 381352}, {\'name\': \'燎原の火のケルベロス\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}：怪物化１を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\n燎原の火のケルベロスが怪物的になったとき、燎原の火のケルベロスは各対戦相手とあなたの対戦相手がコントロールする各クリーチャーに、それぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猟犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab3b4691-1f83-479e-b070-4eb7ff7f936d\', \'multiverseId\': 381517}, \'multiverseid\': 381517}, {\'name\': \'들불 켈베로스\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: 괴수화 1. (이 생물이 괴수화하지 않았다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다. 이 생물은 괴수화한다.)\\n들불 켈베로스가 괴수화할 때, 당신의 상대들과 그 상대들이 조종하는 생물들에게 각각 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사냥개\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5aac3f85-917a-4123-a4a3-59775cf823bb\', \'multiverseId\': 381682}, \'multiverseid\': 381682}, {\'name\': \'Cérbero Incendiário\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Monstruosidade 1. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\\nQuando Cérbero Incendiário se torna monstruoso, ele causa 2 pontos de dano a cada oponente e a cada criatura controlada pelos seus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sabujo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a478d39-f3f5-4e1a-9317-fc750198c9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 381847}, \'multiverseid\': 381847}, {\'name\': \'Цербер Пожара\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Чудовищность 1. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него один жетон +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\\nКогда Цербер Пожара становится чудовищным, он наносит по 2 повреждения каждому оппоненту и каждому существу под контролем ваших оппонентов.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пес\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fefc59e1-a447-47f3-b2c1-6d5202e10d43\', \'multiverseId\': 382012}, \'multiverseid\': 382012}, {\'name\': \'野火狱犬\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}：蛮化1。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且它蛮化。）\\n当野火狱犬蛮化时，它对每位对手及由对手操控的每个生物各造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～猎犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93856954-083b-45e7-8695-0dab34f88a48\', \'multiverseId\': 380692}, \'multiverseid\': 380692}, {\'name\': \'野火獄犬\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}：蠻化1。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物且它蠻化。）\\n當野火獄犬蠻化時，它對每位對手及由對手操控的每個生物各造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～獵犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eed47c60-54b8-4e52-a2f4-895c0bece61c\', \'multiverseId\': 380857}, \'multiverseid\': 380857}]', '[{\'name\': \'Furchtbringer-Lampaden\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn die Furchtbringer-Lampaden oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Einschüchtern bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder Kreaturen, mit denen sie eine Farbe gemeinsam hat, nicht geblockt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380901&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8dc542e-893c-46a9-b792-40b82ca99b78\', \'multiverseId\': 380901}, \'multiverseid\': 380901}, {\'name\': \'Lampas portapavor\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que las Lampas portapavor u otro encantamiento entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de intimidar hasta el final del turno. (No puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas que compartan un color con ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f929b0-b416-4a71-8d42-b61daee68869\', \'multiverseId\': 382056}, \'multiverseid\': 382056}, {\'name\': "Lampades porteuses de l\'effroi", \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que les Lampades porteuses de l\'effroi ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la créature ciblée acquiert l\'intimidation jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures qui partagent une couleur avec elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nymphe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381066&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0535ec12-9f28-4746-85a1-fadb5184896c\', \'multiverseId\': 381066}, \'multiverseid\': 381066}, {\'name\': \'Lampiadi del Terrore\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta le Lampiadi del Terrore o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio ha intimidire fino alla fine del turno. (Non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature che condividono con essa un colore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe4737b-6f42-4abe-b35a-ae9b0f6e26f0\', \'multiverseId\': 381231}, \'multiverseid\': 381231}, {\'name\': \'戦慄運びのランパード\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 戦慄運びのランパードか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで威嚇を得る。（それはアーティファクト・クリーチャーかそれと共通の色を持つクリーチャー以外にはブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65102c08-2264-4fe7-8dfb-ac44ba37d32e\', \'multiverseId\': 381396}, \'multiverseid\': 381396}, {\'name\': \'공포를 부르는 램파드\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 공포를 부르는 램파드나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 위협을 얻는다. (이 생물은 마법물체 생물 및/또는 자신과 색을 공유하는 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 님프\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66fdb516-545d-408b-b3c7-a7d683ce9fe4\', \'multiverseId\': 381561}, \'multiverseid\': 381561}, {\'name\': \'Lâmpades Medonhas\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Lâmpades Medonhas ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo ganha intimidar até o final do turno. (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas artefato e/ou criaturas que compartilharem uma cor com ela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad5ac926-981e-4499-8e45-f2ce9065ff6a\', \'multiverseId\': 381726}, \'multiverseid\': 381726}, {\'name\': \'Несущие Ужас Лампады\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Несущие Ужас Лампады или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, целевое существо получает Устрашение до конца хода. (Оно может быть заблокировано только артефактами существами и (или) существами, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него.)\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Нимфа\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'763d95c3-34b4-4fac-984b-1fa6a3924064\', \'multiverseId\': 381891}, \'multiverseid\': 381891}, {\'name\': \'引怖冥灵\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当引怖冥灵或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，目标生物获得威吓异能直到回合结束。（它只能被神器生物和／或与它有共通颜色的生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'结界生物～宁芙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb04010-3991-4b5d-a4e7-2441dd1a9711\', \'multiverseId\': 380571}, \'multiverseid\': 380571}, {\'name\': \'引怖冥靈\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當引怖冥靈或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，目標生物獲得威嚇異能直到回合結束。（它只能被神器生物和／或與它有共通顏色的生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'結界生物～寧芙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3cef5c8-02bf-458b-9b95-11441586e71a\', \'multiverseId\': 380736}, \'multiverseid\': 380736}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebieter des Gelages\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments zieht jeder Gegner eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Im Übermaß wird jedes Vergnügen zur Qual. Dämonen haben diese Formel zur Perfektion gebracht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd1f1b26-fc52-4b8e-9e58-39f4d11eee80\', \'multiverseId\': 380950}, \'multiverseid\': 380950}, {\'name\': \'Maestro del festín\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, cada oponente roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Todo placer, si se lleva al exceso, se convierte en tormento. Es una fórmula que los demonios han perfeccionado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ef8b768-f327-4537-aaa9-dd21607d9189\', \'multiverseId\': 382105}, \'multiverseid\': 382105}, {\'name\': \'Maître du festin\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, chaque adversaire pioche une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : démon\', \'flavor\': "Tout plaisir, une fois porté à l\'extrême, devient un tourment. C\'est une formule que les démons ont su perfectionner.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381115&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15dc3bea-d5db-4328-9edf-c2c90bfd3eba\', \'multiverseId\': 381115}, \'multiverseid\': 381115}, {\'name\': \'Signore del Banchetto\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, ogni avversario pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Demone\', \'flavor\': "Qualsiasi piacere, se portato all\'eccesso, diviene un tormento. I demoni hanno perfezionato questo paradigma.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f88846bd-29e7-4731-ab68-09d6a944c7d2\', \'multiverseId\': 381280}, \'multiverseid\': 381280}, {\'name\': \'饗宴の主\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、各対戦相手はそれぞれカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'どのような悦楽も、度が過ぎれば苦痛となる。これはデーモンたちが完成させた方式である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11619544-681e-4304-aaf0-34899550e9e9\', \'multiverseId\': 381445}, \'multiverseid\': 381445}, {\'name\': \'축제의 달인\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 각 상대는 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'어떤 쾌락이든 지나치면 고통이 된다. 그게 바로 악마들이 갈고닦은 수법이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b4db714-49da-4cbe-8e9d-9ca7142b5e7b\', \'multiverseId\': 381610}, \'multiverseid\': 381610}, {\'name\': \'Mestre do Banquete\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início da sua manutenção, cada oponente compra um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Qualquer prazer em excesso se torna um tormento. Os demônios aperfeiçoaram esta fórmula.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b26449fc-139b-494c-9e41-82a2bd7e8536\', \'multiverseId\': 381775}, \'multiverseid\': 381775}, {\'name\': \'Повелитель Пиров\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки каждый оппонент берет одну карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'Любое наслаждение становится пыткой, если довести его до предела. Эту формулу демоны отработали в совершенстве.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8399bba9-e267-45cd-b96f-7a50f1e2cecc\', \'multiverseId\': 381940}, \'multiverseid\': 381940}, {\'name\': \'盛宴大师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，每位对手各抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'任何欢愉过了头，就会变成煎熬。恶魔已将此法则臻至完善。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2315fb85-faac-4aef-ad02-4cc2dd1cd008\', \'multiverseId\': 380620}, \'multiverseid\': 380620}, {\'name\': \'盛宴大師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在你的維持開始時，每位對手各抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'任何歡愉過了頭，就會變成煎熬。惡魔已將此法則臻至完善。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4d524cc-2216-4daf-bc8c-fce6deacbc94\', \'multiverseId\': 380785}, \'multiverseid\': 380785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebot der Karametra\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler ein Land für Mana tappt, erhöht dieser Spieler seinen Manavorrat um ein zusätzliches Mana eines beliebigen Typs, den dieses Land erzeugt hat.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich weigere mich zuzulassen, dass die Torheit der Sterblichen die Heimat zerstört, die ich für sie erschaffen habe."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380896&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caf26f40-bef5-48c2-a1ea-7581281a53e0\', \'multiverseId\': 380896}, \'multiverseid\': 380896}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Karametra\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSiempre que un jugador gire una tierra para obtener maná, ese jugador agrega un maná de un tipo que produjo esa tierra a su reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Me niego a que la locura de los mortales ponga en peligro el hogar que creé para ellos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'052dd768-452b-4ce1-923c-d3be503f8a76\', \'multiverseId\': 382051}, \'multiverseid\': 382051}, {\'name\': \'Précepte de Karametra\', \'text\': "Flash\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur engage un terrain pour du mana, ce joueur ajoute à sa réserve un mana de n\'importe quel type que ce terrain produisait.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Je refuse de laisser la folie des mortels mettre en danger le foyer que je leur ai créé. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381061&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7a90b5e-1cbb-4a68-ad08-36f6958df415\', \'multiverseId\': 381061}, \'multiverseid\': 381061}, {\'name\': \'Dettami di Karametra\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore TAPpa una terra per attingere mana, quel giocatore aggiunge alla sua riserva di mana un mana di qualsiasi tipo quella terra abbia prodotto.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi rifiuto di permettere che la follia dei mortali metta a repentaglio la dimora che ho creato per loro."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'271842b7-34c3-4ef0-b43d-113a212d7221\', \'multiverseId\': 381226}, \'multiverseid\': 381226}, {\'name\': \'ケイラメトラの指図\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nプレイヤー１人がマナを引き出す目的で土地を１つタップするたび、そのプレイヤーはその土地が生み出したいずれかのタイプのマナ１点を自分のマナ・プールに加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「定命の者の愚かさによって、私が彼らのために創りし家を脅威にさらすことは許さぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb80268-4431-4c98-af4e-9c1d2c0c9c26\', \'multiverseId\': 381391}, \'multiverseid\': 381391}, {\'name\': \'카라메트라의 규율\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n플레이어가 마나를 얻기 위해 대지를 탭할 때마다, 그 플레이어는 그 대지가 생성한 마나 유형 중 하나를 골라 자신의 마나풀에 추가로 한 개 담는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': "\'내가 필멸자를 위해 만든 고향이 그들의 어리석음 때문에 위험에 처하도록 내버려두지 않겠다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06e31c8d-fb90-48e9-8424-b1451b437ce7\', \'multiverseId\': 381556}, \'multiverseid\': 381556}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Carametra\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nToda vez que um jogador virar um terreno para gerar mana, ele adicionará um mana à própria reserva de mana de qualquer tipo que aquele terreno gerar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu me recuso a permitir que esta tolice dos mortais coloque em risco o lar que construí para eles."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0f4844e-3b8d-4d77-a6af-f926d629f4a3\', \'multiverseId\': 381721}, \'multiverseid\': 381721}, {\'name\': \'Веление Караметры\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКаждый раз, когда игрок поворачивает землю для получения маны, тот игрок добавляет в свое хранилище маны одну ману любого типа, произведенного той землей.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не дам глупости смертных поставить под угрозу дом, который я для них построила».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b416898-a946-4143-b798-137c7ca64293\', \'multiverseId\': 381886}, \'multiverseid\': 381886}, {\'name\': \'卡拉美特拉的旨意\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n每当牌手横置一个地以产生法术力时，该牌手加一点法术力到他的法术力池中，其类别为该地刚才已产生之类别。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我不允许凡人的愚行威胁到我为他们建造的家园。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b28f32e9-5aa8-443c-ac57-d2e2786cdfaa\', \'multiverseId\': 380566}, \'multiverseid\': 380566}, {\'name\': \'卡拉美特拉的旨意\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n每當玩家橫置一個地以產生魔法力時，該玩家加一點魔法力到他的魔法力池中，其類別為該地剛才已產生之類別。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「我不允許凡人的愚行威脅到我為他們建造的家園。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed746ab3-a1e1-497d-8d6a-36ad691f9992\', \'multiverseId\': 380731}, \'multiverseid\': 380731}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebot der Zwillingsgötter\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFalls eine Quelle einer bleibenden Karte oder einem Spieler Schadenspunkte zufügen würde, fügt sie dieser bleibenden Karte oder diesem Spieler stattdessen doppelt so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Iroas und Mogis unterscheiden sich in ihrer Persönlichkeit so sehr wie in ihrem Aussehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380898&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d13f5b9-d8cc-4840-99db-2379a9974752\', \'multiverseId\': 380898}, \'multiverseid\': 380898}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de los dioses gemelos\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSi una fuente fuera a hacer daño a un permanente o jugador, en vez de eso, hace el doble de ese daño a ese permanente o jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Iroas y Mogis son tan distintos en apariencia como lo son en personalidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb1e6996-e51b-49c3-af10-b68efde58d79\', \'multiverseId\': 382053}, \'multiverseid\': 382053}, {\'name\': \'Précepte des dieux jumeaux\', \'text\': \'Flash\\nSi une source devait infliger des blessures à un permanent ou un joueur, elle inflige à la place le double de ces blessures à ce permanent ou à ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Iroas et Mogis diffèrent autant par l\'apparence que par la personnalité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381063&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'636063e9-1a08-4aca-89ca-3593a901c4ba\', \'multiverseId\': 381063}, \'multiverseid\': 381063}, {\'name\': \'Dettami degli Dei Gemelli\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nSe una fonte sta per infliggere danno a un permanente o a un giocatore, infligge invece il doppio di quel danno a quel permanente o a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "Iroas e Mogis sono tanto diversi nell\'aspetto quanto nella personalità.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'908c0962-92ec-44b7-98b9-d058298ddecc\', \'multiverseId\': 381228}, \'multiverseid\': 381228}, {\'name\': \'双子神の指図\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nいずれかの発生源がパーマネントまたはプレイヤーにダメージを与えるなら、代わりにそれはそのパーマネントまたはプレイヤーにその点数の２倍のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'イロアスとモーギスは見た目だけでなく、その性格もまったく異なる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e335b64d-0697-4621-9a3f-d2ab3dca2b84\', \'multiverseId\': 381393}, \'multiverseid\': 381393}, {\'name\': \'쌍둥이 신의 규율\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n어느 원천이 지속물이나 플레이어에게 피해를 입히려 한다면, 대신에 그 원천은 그 피해를 두 배로 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'이로아스와 모기스는 성격이 다른 만큼 겉모습도 다르다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5037738-71e6-4727-907f-848fad7780a2\', \'multiverseId\': 381558}, \'multiverseid\': 381558}, {\'name\': \'Decreto dos Deuses Gêmeos\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nSe uma fonte for causar dano a uma permanente ou a um jogador, em vez disso, ela causará o dobro daquele dano àquela permanente ou jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Iroas e Mogis são tão diferentes na aparência quanto na personalidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381723&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c107ce26-fed3-4799-87c0-1f3d8970943f\', \'multiverseId\': 381723}, \'multiverseid\': 381723}, {\'name\': \'Веление Богов-Близнецов\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nЕсли источник должен нанести повреждения перманенту или игроку, вместо этого он наносит те повреждения тому перманенту или игроку в двойном размере.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Ирой и Могий внешне отличаются друг от друга так же сильно, как и внутренне.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d23e89a-39f9-454f-97b7-d08d816c14f3\', \'multiverseId\': 381888}, \'multiverseid\': 381888}, {\'name\': \'双子神的旨意\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n若某来源将对任一永久物或牌手造成伤害，则改为它对该永久物或牌手造成两倍的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'伊洛安斯和墨癸斯不仅外表迥异，个性也截然不同。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72dad7d4-8d82-4a32-9d8e-2be61ab2ce7d\', \'multiverseId\': 380568}, \'multiverseid\': 380568}, {\'name\': \'雙子神的旨意\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n若某來源將對任一永久物或玩家造成傷害，則改為它對該永久物或玩家造成兩倍的傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'伊洛安斯和墨癸斯不僅外表迥異，個性也截然不同。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68f6957a-7de8-4373-8be5-b099403fb48e\', \'multiverseId\': 380733}, \'multiverseid\': 380733}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebot des Erebos\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur stirbt, die du kontrollierst, opfert jeder Gegner eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein Leid bereitet mir kein Vergnügen, aber es ist unausweichlich. Sobald du dein Schicksal akzeptiert hast, wirst du die Ewigkeit erträglicher finden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380894&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17186f39-762f-42f1-81c2-f5ba170ccf1a\', \'multiverseId\': 380894}, \'multiverseid\': 380894}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Erebos\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controles muera, cada oponente sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu sufrimiento no me produce placer, pero es necesario. En cuanto aceptes tu destino, la eternidad te resultará más tolerable".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f5649e5-7c66-4223-b620-d99cb3801c34\', \'multiverseId\': 382049}, \'multiverseid\': 382049}, {\'name\': "Précepte d\'Érébos", \'text\': "Flash\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez meurt, chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Je n\'éprouve aucun plaisir à vous faire souffrir, mais c\'est nécessaire. Une fois que vous aurez accepté votre destin, vous trouverez l\'éternité plus tolérable. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381059&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f753aa51-d0bc-435b-8d76-ce46654fed7b\', \'multiverseId\': 381059}, \'multiverseid\': 381059}, {\'name\': \'Dettami di Erebos\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura che controlli muore, ogni avversario sacrifica una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non traggo alcun piacere dalle vostre sofferenze, ma sono necessarie. Dopo che avrete accettato il vostro destino, l\\\'eternità sarà più semplice da tollerare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cfb2436-2a95-45b4-bf40-1d1bfebe748d\', \'multiverseId\': 381224}, \'multiverseid\': 381224}, {\'name\': \'エレボスの指図\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーが１体死亡するたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の苦しむ様に悦楽など感じぬが、必要なことなのでな。自らの運命を受け入れるようになれば、永遠の時も少しは我慢できるものとなるだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'021103a8-2a9e-48ad-ba17-2f2b53aaac41\', \'multiverseId\': 381389}, \'multiverseid\': 381389}, {\'name\': \'에레보스의 규율\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n당신이 조종하는 생물이 죽을 때마다, 각 상대는 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': "\'나도 네 고통이 즐겁지 않으나, 이는 해야만 하는 일이다. 운명을 받아들이고 나면 영원한 시간이 견딜만해 질 것이다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c11928b4-fb47-4376-8d1d-ed2de68be626\', \'multiverseId\': 381554}, \'multiverseid\': 381554}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Érebo\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nToda vez que uma criatura que você controla morre, cada oponente sacrifica uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu não sinto prazer em fazê-lo sofrer, mas é necessário. Depois que você aceitar seu destino, a eternidade ficará bem mais tolerável."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c76c61a0-ed50-47ab-8a37-a5f11984dfab\', \'multiverseId\': 381719}, \'multiverseid\': 381719}, {\'name\': \'Веление Эреба\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКаждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем умирает, каждый оппонент жертвует существо.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Мне не приносят удовольствие твои страдания, но это необходимо. Как только ты смиришься со своей судьбой, тебе будет проще перенести вечность».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad1d3955-27dd-46d9-b523-8e659124e4a0\', \'multiverseId\': 381884}, \'multiverseid\': 381884}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯的旨意\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n每当一个由你操控的生物死去时，每位对手各牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我并不以你的痛苦为乐，但这是你的必经之路。一旦你接受自己的命运，就会发现来世还好过些。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f6b297a-82dc-488a-a467-3653d633ffe3\', \'multiverseId\': 380564}, \'multiverseid\': 380564}, {\'name\': \'厄睿柏斯的旨意\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n每當一個由你操控的生物死去時，每位對手各犧牲一個生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「我並不以你的痛苦為樂，但這是你的必經之路。一旦你接受自己的命運，就會發現來世還好過些。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9375304-94ca-41d9-86cd-3ae024030b93\', \'multiverseId\': 380729}, \'multiverseid\': 380729}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebot des Heliod\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„In unserem Krieg hat Heliod uns Sterblichen manchmal seine Gunst zuteilwerden lassen, doch an anderen Tagen verweigerte er seine Hilfe. Sind wir nichts als Schachfiguren für ihn?" —Polyxene die Zweiflerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380895&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a417b3c-bdcb-4780-a3e7-b3569c5619c2\', \'multiverseId\': 380895}, \'multiverseid\': 380895}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Heliod\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"En nuestra guerra, Heliod concedió ciertos favores a los mortales; pero en otras ocasiones no prestó su ayuda. ¿Acaso seguimos siendo meras piezas de un juego a sus ojos?" —Polixene, la Escéptica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d66db6-5fdc-400f-bd6f-45c1b6cd775b\', \'multiverseId\': 382050}, \'multiverseid\': 382050}, {\'name\': "Précepte d\'Héliode", \'text\': \'Flash\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Dans notre guerre, Héliode a accordé des faveurs aux mortels, et pourtant cela n\'a pas toujours été le cas. Ne sommes-nous rien de plus que des pions pour lui ? » —Polyxène le sceptique", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381060&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a960149a-e7f2-487b-92a6-35ab9b73e03d\', \'multiverseId\': 381060}, \'multiverseid\': 381060}, {\'name\': \'Dettami di Eliod\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nLe creature che controlli prendono +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Nella nostra guerra, Eliod talvolta ha concesso la sua benedizione ai mortali, ma altre volte non è venuto in nostro aiuto. Non siamo forse altro che pedine, per lui?" —Polissena la Scettica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad797461-3b51-44ec-bf8b-0676f9e88e48\', \'multiverseId\': 381225}, \'multiverseid\': 381225}, {\'name\': \'ヘリオッドの指図\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「私達の戦争では、ヘリオッドは定命の者に恩恵を授けることも、助力を渋ることもありました。彼にとって、私達は遊戯のための駒に過ぎないのかしら？」 ――懐疑的なポリクシュネー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e08640d7-8a21-473d-b3fa-968207ce7787\', \'multiverseId\': 381390}, \'multiverseid\': 381390}, {\'name\': \'헬리아드의 규율\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n당신이 조종하는 생물들은 +2/+2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': "\'우리가 전쟁을 치르는 동안 헬리아드는 필멸자들을 도우면서도, 한편으로는 외면했다. 신에게 우리는 아직도 장기말에 불과한가?\' —의심 많은 폴릭세네", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9fff47f-eb09-4ac3-8db3-22aa3d8e3b89\', \'multiverseId\': 381555}, \'multiverseid\': 381555}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Heliode\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nAs criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Em nossa guerra, Heliode deu aos mortais algumas dádivas. Porém, em outros momentos, ele se negou a ajudar. Será que ainda somos apenas peças de um jogo para ele?" — Polixena, a Questionadora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6f4421-d6ec-4a34-b93e-25cf642fec1e\', \'multiverseId\': 381720}, \'multiverseid\': 381720}, {\'name\': \'Веление Гелиода\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nСущества под вашим контролем получают +2/+2.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«В войне Гелиод порой благоволил смертным, а порой воздерживался от помощи. Неужели мы для него — лишь фигуры на доске?» — Поликсена, Сомневающаяся\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d8d0b60-dd6e-49cb-81c2-f5e591f5b6d3\', \'multiverseId\': 381885}, \'multiverseid\': 381885}, {\'name\': \'赫利欧德的旨意\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n由你操控的生物得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「在这战争中，赫利欧德时而赐予凡人恩惠，时而拒伸援手。我们只不过是他的棋子吗？」 ～疑神论者波吕谢涅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6c4888f-d076-461e-99d2-f5be3f59162e\', \'multiverseId\': 380565}, \'multiverseid\': 380565}, {\'name\': \'赫利歐德的旨意\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n由你操控的生物得+2/+2。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「在這戰爭中，赫利歐德時而賜予凡人恩惠，時而拒伸援手。我們只不過是他的棋子嗎？」 ～疑神論者波呂謝涅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e99ad49-b349-4965-a2ae-0a0a3b75e184\', \'multiverseId\': 380730}, \'multiverseid\': 380730}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gebot des Kruphix\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nZu Beginn des Ziehsegments jedes Spielers zieht dieser Spieler eine zusätzliche Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Wissen ist grausam. Es wird dir das Herz brechen und deine Loyalität auf die Probe stellen. Bist du sicher, dass du mit diesem Fluch belegt werden möchtest?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380897&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d2b5dd6-111d-4d4a-9db8-b021bb64264e\', \'multiverseId\': 380897}, \'multiverseid\': 380897}, {\'name\': \'Mandato de Krufix\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nAl comienzo del paso de robar de cada jugador, ese jugador roba una carta adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El conocimiento es cruel. Te romperá el corazón y pondrá a prueba tus lealtades. ¿Seguro que quieres esa maldición?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b74bf9-845e-4b30-a415-69abc6aa62ad\', \'multiverseId\': 382052}, \'multiverseid\': 382052}, {\'name\': \'Précepte de Kruphix\', \'text\': "Flash\\nAu début de l\'étape de pioche de chaque joueur, ce joueur pioche une carte supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La connaissance est cruelle. Elle vous brisera le cœur et mettra votre loyauté à l\'épreuve. Êtes-vous sûr de vouloir cette malédiction ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381062&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'392876c5-b13b-41d4-9eef-55c9b4928007\', \'multiverseId\': 381062}, \'multiverseid\': 381062}, {\'name\': \'Dettami di Krufix\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nAll\'inizio dell\'acquisizione di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore pesca una carta addizionale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La conoscenza è crudele. Ti spezzerà il cuore e metterà alla prova la tua fedeltà. Sei certo di desiderare questa sciagura?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1166067b-287b-477d-bc0e-ed42bd0f1735\', \'multiverseId\': 381227}, \'multiverseid\': 381227}, {\'name\': \'クルフィックスの指図\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n各プレイヤーのドロー・ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはカードを追加で１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「知識は残酷である。それはお前の心を挫き、忠誠心を試すことになる。お前は本当にこの呪いを求めるのか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9add5263-9960-451b-938a-7ad60fafb432\', \'multiverseId\': 381392}, \'multiverseid\': 381392}, {\'name\': \'크루픽스의 규율\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n각 플레이어의 뽑기단 시작에, 그 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 추가로 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': "\'지식은 잔혹하다. 그것은 너의 심장을 부숴버리고 충성을 시험할 것이다. 그대는 정말로 이 저주를 원하는가?\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0569781f-ebba-4aac-86cb-d4e8068c6916\', \'multiverseId\': 381557}, \'multiverseid\': 381557}, {\'name\': \'Decreto de Crufix\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nNo início da etapa de compra de cada jogador, aquele jogador compra um card adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O conhecimento é cruel. Ele vai partir seu coração e testar suas alianças. Tem certeza de que deseja esta maldição?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0635979e-ac38-4182-bea5-e819477e7375\', \'multiverseId\': 381722}, \'multiverseid\': 381722}, {\'name\': \'Веление Круфикса\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nВ начале шага взятия карты каждого игрока тот игрок берет дополнительную карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Знание жестоко. Оно разобьет тебе сердце и испытает на прочность твою верность. Тебе точно нужно это проклятие?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a407cc87-5e55-41ff-8ccb-2df3f42dd999\', \'multiverseId\': 381887}, \'multiverseid\': 381887}, {\'name\': \'克罗芬斯的旨意\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n在每位牌手的抓牌步骤开始时，该牌手额外抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「知识是残酷的。它会让你心碎，并考验你的忠诚。你确定要承受这个诅咒吗？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e82e8c9c-d260-4618-96bb-093fd177d05e\', \'multiverseId\': 380567}, \'multiverseid\': 380567}, {\'name\': \'克羅芬斯的旨意\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n在每位玩家的抽牌步驟開始時，該玩家額外抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「知識是殘酷的。它會讓你心碎，並考驗你的忠誠。你確定要承受這個詛咒嗎？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2417913a-c098-48cf-b962-0e9be643a939\', \'multiverseId\': 380732}, \'multiverseid\': 380732}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßiger Zyklop\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Monstrum 3. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zyklop\', \'flavor\': \'Der Zyklop hatte gelernt, nie einen Hirten zu verschlingen. Wer sollte sonst die nächste Herde heranzüchten?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'033b5cc2-a279-4c87-9682-4070c69a2fb9\', \'multiverseId\': 380918}, \'multiverseid\': 380918}, {\'name\': \'Cíclope glotón\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Monstruosidad 3. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cíclope\', \'flavor\': \'El cíclope había aprendido que nunca debía comerse a un pastor. En vez de eso, arrojaba a un lado la "semilla" para que hiciera crecer un nuevo rebaño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6da984-b5fd-4ede-8471-e395bf66ff06\', \'multiverseId\': 382073}, \'multiverseid\': 382073}, {\'name\': \'Cyclope glouton\', \'text\': "{5}{R}{R} : Monstruosité 3. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)", \'type\': \'Créature : cyclope\', \'flavor\': "Le cyclope savait qu\'il ne fallait jamais manger les bergers. Alors il reposa le « noyau » du troupeau pour en faire pousser un nouveau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381083&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc964f60-2351-4fe3-ab07-1e8a34385a95\', \'multiverseId\': 381083}, \'multiverseid\': 381083}, {\'name\': \'Ciclope Ingordo\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Mostruosità 3. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': \'Il ciclope aveva imparato a non divorare mai un pastore. Metteva invece delicatamente da parte il "nocciolo" per far crescere un nuovo gregge.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e58cf71e-ec8b-493f-a573-120f4b71667c\', \'multiverseId\': 381248}, \'multiverseid\': 381248}, {\'name\': \'暴食するサイクロプス\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}：怪物化３を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。これは怪物的になる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サイクロプス\', \'flavor\': \'サイクロプスは、羊飼いを食べないことを覚えた。そして「種」が新たな群れを育てるよう、それを優しく放り捨てた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23e3f82a-c6ad-43be-905a-549f3301950d\', \'multiverseId\': 381413}, \'multiverseid\': 381413}, {\'name\': \'걸신들린 키클롭스\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: 괴수화 3. (이 생물이 괴수화하지 않았다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 올려놓는다. 이 생물은 괴수화한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 키클롭스\', \'flavor\': \'키클롭스는 양치기를 먹으면 안 된다는 것을 깨달았다. 대신에 "씨"를 남겨 두어 새로운 양 떼를 키우게 하기로 했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80168fae-8284-4c85-97db-32c90e10583f\', \'multiverseId\': 381578}, \'multiverseid\': 381578}, {\'name\': \'Ciclope Glutão\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Monstruosidade 3. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': \'O ciclope aprendeu a nunca comer um pastor. Em vez disso, ele separa com cuidado a "semente" para que gere um novo rebanho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d052d242-dd1a-4507-9bbe-2f5490dde61b\', \'multiverseId\': 381743}, \'multiverseid\': 381743}, {\'name\': \'Прожорливый Циклоп\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}: Чудовищность 3. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него три жетона +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Циклоп\', \'flavor\': \'Циклоп знал, что пастуха есть не стоит. Он словно косточку отбросил его в сторону, чтобы бедняга смог вырастить новое стадо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26cec8f1-9d24-46fd-b7c7-fa4ff9eec212\', \'multiverseId\': 381908}, \'multiverseid\': 381908}, {\'name\': \'暴食独眼巨人\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}：蛮化3。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置三个+1/+1指示物且它蛮化。）\', \'type\': \'生物～独眼巨人\', \'flavor\': \'独眼巨人学会了不再吃牧羊人。他将这个「小不点」温柔地扔到一旁，让他重新养一群羊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'747ee6ed-b834-4ba4-80f4-0b4e5221fa15\', \'multiverseId\': 380588}, \'multiverseid\': 380588}, {\'name\': \'暴食獨眼巨人\', \'text\': \'{5}{R}{R}：蠻化3。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置三個+1/+1指示物且它蠻化。）\', \'type\': \'生物～獨眼巨人\', \'flavor\': \'獨眼巨人學會了不再吃牧羊人。他將這個「小不點」溫柔地扔到一旁，讓他重新養一群羊。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6636f881-4d56-460a-9a99-9c815ba24dfc\', \'multiverseId\': 380753}, \'multiverseid\': 380753}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefräßiges Leucrocota\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\n{6}{G}: Monstrum 3. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Ein hungriges Leucrocota ist gefährlich. Ein sattes Leucrocota ist wütend und gefährlich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a4403e5-a63d-4f77-9965-dbb0fd6b730f\', \'multiverseId\': 380973}, \'multiverseid\': 380973}, {\'name\': \'Leucrocota voraz\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\n{6}{G}: Monstruosidad 3. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'El hambre hace que las leucrocotas sean peligrosas. Tener el estómago lleno hace que se enfurezcan y sean aún más peligrosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5951b043-ccd5-48c7-b7ca-8012bdb6fb3b\', \'multiverseId\': 382128}, \'multiverseid\': 382128}, {\'name\': \'Leucrotta vorace\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\n{6}{G} : Monstruosité 3. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': \'La faim rend la leucrotta dangereuse. Un ventre rempli la rend dangereuse et enragée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5b26191-0a03-4aef-a7e5-646c35f23b04\', \'multiverseId\': 381138}, \'multiverseid\': 381138}, {\'name\': \'Leucrotta Famelica\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\n{6}{G}: Mostruosità 3. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'La fame rende pericolosa una leucrotta. La sazietà la rende pericolosa e furente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47f7eb39-af20-4e8e-aee4-14a0a706029e\', \'multiverseId\': 381303}, \'multiverseid\': 381303}, {\'name\': \'貪欲なるレウクロッタ\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{6}{G}：怪物化３を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを３個置く。これは怪物的になる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'空腹はレウクロッタを危険にする。満腹はレウクロッタを怒らせ、危険にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec893a5a-922e-469d-a056-ed00c425beb0\', \'multiverseId\': 381468}, \'multiverseid\': 381468}, {\'name\': \'굶주린 류크로코타\', \'text\': \'경계\\n{6}{G}: 괴수화 3. (이 생물이 괴수화하지 않았다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 세 개를 올려놓는다. 이 생물은 괴수화한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': \'굶주린 류크로코타는 위험하다. 배부른 류크로코타는 화가 나 있고 위험하다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'769e3847-f441-460b-b5f0-6b08f8126509\', \'multiverseId\': 381633}, \'multiverseid\': 381633}, {\'name\': \'Leucrócota Voraz\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\n{6}{G}: Monstruosidade 3. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': \'Com fome, a leucrócota é um animal perigoso. De barriga cheia, ela é um animal furioso e perigoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01118055-4fb8-41e6-9ca4-28dab0b75f96\', \'multiverseId\': 381798}, \'multiverseid\': 381798}, {\'name\': \'Ненасытная Левкрокота\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\n{6}{G}: Чудовищность 3. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него три жетона +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': \'Голод делает левкрокоту опасной. Набитое брюхо делает ее злой и опасной.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b7e43ac-cb34-4fe9-b3e6-844d429e1043\', \'multiverseId\': 381963}, \'multiverseid\': 381963}, {\'name\': \'贪食鬣狗狮\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{6}{G}：蛮化3。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置三个+1/+1指示物且它蛮化。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': \'饥饿的鬣狗狮很危险，吃饱的则愤怒又危险。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee29c434-5233-4c77-96b1-5ac30629a812\', \'multiverseId\': 380643}, \'multiverseid\': 380643}, {\'name\': \'貪食鬣狗獅\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n{6}{G}：蠻化3。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置三個+1/+1指示物且它蠻化。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': \'飢餓的鬣狗獅很危險，吃飽的則憤怒又危險。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'136955d9-9169-45e0-8cb5-48dd6556627e\', \'multiverseId\': 380808}, \'multiverseid\': 380808}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gegenbefehl\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Sein Beherrscher legt die obersten vier Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die körperlichen Schmerzen waren nichts im Vergleich zu den Qualen, die sein Verstand durchlebte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380883&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d690e6d-6d11-4648-a1f6-7180bf1120d6\', \'multiverseId\': 380883}, \'multiverseid\': 380883}, {\'name\': \'Contraorden\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Su controlador pone las cuatro primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El dolor físico no era nada comparado con la agonía de su mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c58ef829-fa01-4e62-848d-cb47511483c4\', \'multiverseId\': 382038}, \'multiverseid\': 382038}, {\'name\': \'Contrordre\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé. Son contrôleur met les quatre cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La douleur physique n\'était rien comparée à la souffrance dans son esprit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381048&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49bcb9d-2d67-4756-b65c-76412a5a3283\', \'multiverseId\': 381048}, \'multiverseid\': 381048}, {\'name\': \'Contrordine\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio. Il suo controllore mette nel suo cimitero le prime quattro carte del suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Il dolore fisico era nulla a confronto dell\'agonia nella sua mente.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'001d1c63-ce64-48d8-b7ca-4649eff1ca4b\', \'multiverseId\': 381213}, \'multiverseid\': 381213}, {\'name\': \'撤回命令\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。それのコントローラーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から４枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'精神を苛む苦痛は、肉体的な苦痛の比ではなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'053825ce-800d-4730-a41b-90a774122e21\', \'multiverseId\': 381378}, \'multiverseid\': 381378}, {\'name\': \'철회\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다. 그 주문의 조종자는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 네 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'그가 겪는 정신적 고통에 비하면 육체의 고통은 아무것도 아니었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d2d0fa8-5c7e-495a-9fb4-2cdc27b88959\', \'multiverseId\': 381543}, \'multiverseid\': 381543}, {\'name\': \'Contra-ordem\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo. Seu controlador coloca os quatro cards do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A dor física não era nada comparada à agonia em sua mente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39f830cb-f8ed-4201-8c5d-6de894d10cd9\', \'multiverseId\': 381708}, \'multiverseid\': 381708}, {\'name\': \'Контрприказ\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание. Контролирующий его игрок кладет четыре верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Физическая боль не шла ни в какое сравнение с агонией, что разрывала его разум.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65293a05-ebca-4526-937f-3e728a6ab0d5\', \'multiverseId\': 381873}, \'multiverseid\': 381873}, {\'name\': \'勒令撤销\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。其操控者将其牌库顶的四张牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'肉体的疼痛远远比不上心灵的创痛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8bace2b-0ba8-4bb3-82de-b0378910bba3\', \'multiverseId\': 380553}, \'multiverseid\': 380553}, {\'name\': \'勒令撤銷\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。其操控者將其牌庫頂的四張牌置入其墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'肉體的疼痛遠遠比不上心靈的創痛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a94745a2-5377-4587-9abe-abd2442ba217\', \'multiverseId\': 380718}, \'multiverseid\': 380718}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geistesriss-Lamia\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn die Geistesriss-Lamia oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wirft jeder Gegner eine Karte aus seiner Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Lamia\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Raubtiere wittern die Angst ihrer Beute, die Lamia aber wird von Wahnsinn angezogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87fce503-1212-4eef-9667-b3abe1a71d91\', \'multiverseId\': 381014}, \'multiverseid\': 381014}, {\'name\': \'Lamia arrancarrazón\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que la Lamia arrancarrazón u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, cada oponente descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Lamia\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos depredadores perciben el miedo en su presa, pero es la locura lo que atrae a la lamia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'380884e6-28c4-49fc-9d4d-727100716311\', \'multiverseId\': 382169}, \'multiverseid\': 382169}, {\'name\': \'Lamie psychoctome\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que la Lamie psychoctome ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, chaque adversaire se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : lamie\', \'flavor\': \'Certains prédateurs sentent la peur chez leur proie, mais la lamie est attirée par la folie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381179&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f59a6c-8d20-4732-b058-c0309ed8f0ed\', \'multiverseId\': 381179}, \'multiverseid\': 381179}, {\'name\': \'Lamia Straziamente\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta la Lamia Straziamente o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ogni avversario scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Lamia\', \'flavor\': \'Alcuni predatori percepiscono la paura della preda, ma la lamia è attratta dalla follia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5005d2ba-6ee8-4cac-8fd1-cfeca2b44960\', \'multiverseId\': 381344}, \'multiverseid\': 381344}, {\'name\': \'精神感化のラミア\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 精神感化のラミアか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれカードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ラミア\', \'flavor\': \'捕食者の中には、獲物が感じている恐怖を感じられるものもいる。一方、ラミアは獲物の狂気に引き寄せられるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c057a0d3-e86c-431a-b01f-52acbc98a64e\', \'multiverseId\': 381509}, \'multiverseid\': 381509}, {\'name\': \'생각을 찢는 라미아\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 생각을 찢는 라미아나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 각 상대는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 라미아\', \'flavor\': \'어떤 포식자들은 먹이의 공포를 느낄 수 있지만, 라미아는 광기에 이끌린다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687f3ae2-5d01-409d-ae31-512d999ba70b\', \'multiverseId\': 381674}, \'multiverseid\': 381674}, {\'name\': \'Lâmia Enlouquecedora\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Lâmia Enlouquecedora ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, cada oponente descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Lâmia\', \'flavor\': \'Alguns predadores sentem o medo na presa, mas a lâmia é atraída pela loucura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2cb32c2-d154-4503-9098-d45918247a86\', \'multiverseId\': 381839}, \'multiverseid\': 381839}, {\'name\': \'Раздирающая Мысли Ламия\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Раздирающая Мысли Ламия или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, каждый оппонент сбрасывает одну карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Ламия\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторые хищники способны чувствовать страх своих жертв. Ламию же привлекает безумие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7018e2c5-ff56-41c2-bf08-482fc15d073b\', \'multiverseId\': 382004}, \'multiverseid\': 382004}, {\'name\': \'裂念拉弥亚\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当裂念拉弥亚或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，每位对手各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～拉弥亚\', \'flavor\': \'有些掠食者能察觉到猎物的恐惧，但拉弥亚则会受疯狂吸引。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bd09611-c324-4438-863d-040bffd21582\', \'multiverseId\': 380684}, \'multiverseid\': 380684}, {\'name\': \'裂念拉彌亞\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當裂念拉彌亞或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，每位對手各棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～拉彌亞\', \'flavor\': \'有些掠食者能察覺到獵物的恐懼，但拉彌亞則會受瘋狂吸引。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0337f0ca-84bd-4cf8-b5db-69b5148cf543\', \'multiverseId\': 380849}, \'multiverseid\': 380849}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geißel der Flotten\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Geißel der Flotten ins Spiel kommt, bringe alle Kreaturen mit Widerstandskraft X oder weniger, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Inseln ist, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Krake\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99ea0f7d-1164-4cd9-84d4-61bb222ffaa6\', \'multiverseId\': 380989}, \'multiverseid\': 380989}, {\'name\': \'Azote de las flotas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Azote de las flotas entre al campo de batalla, regresa cada criatura con resistencia de X o menos que controlan tus oponentes a la mano de su propietario, donde X es la cantidad de islas que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f9d8973-0d0b-43c9-99af-91af93360b38\', \'multiverseId\': 382144}, \'multiverseid\': 382144}, {\'name\': \'Fléau des flottes\', \'text\': "Quand le Fléau des flottes arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez chaque créature que vos adversaires contrôlent avec une endurance inférieure ou égale à X dans la main de son propriétaire, X étant le nombre d\'îles que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba519a97-79fd-40a6-82a1-dc334aac181b\', \'multiverseId\': 381154}, \'multiverseid\': 381154}, {\'name\': \'Flagello delle Flotte\', \'text\': \'Quando il Flagello delle Flotte entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare ogni creatura controllata dai tuoi avversari con costituzione pari o inferiore a X in mano al suo proprietario, dove X è il numero di Isole che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da42da74-45f2-4eba-90be-1f215d66cd11\', \'multiverseId\': 381319}, \'multiverseid\': 381319}, {\'name\': \'船団の災い魔\', \'text\': \'船団の災い魔が戦場に出たとき、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするタフネスがＸ以下の各クリーチャーをそれぞれオーナーの手札に戻す。Ｘはあなたがコントロールする島の総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — クラーケン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b3f6e70-e917-45a4-a9fb-192c23554feb\', \'multiverseId\': 381484}, \'multiverseid\': 381484}, {\'name\': \'함대의 재앙\', \'text\': \'함대의 재앙이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 상대들이 조종하는 방어력이 X 이하인 생물들을 각각 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다. X는 당신이 조종하는 섬의 수이다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 크라켄\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1727bff-da53-48a7-b1a9-f1c1aa5be719\', \'multiverseId\': 381649}, \'multiverseid\': 381649}, {\'name\': \'Flagelo das Frotas\', \'text\': \'Quando Flagelo das Frotas entrar no campo de batalha, devolva cada criatura controlada pelos seus oponentes com resistência X ou menos para a mão de seu dono, sendo X o número de Ilhas que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kraken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce70ee90-3284-4c47-b9bd-ec045f2e254f\', \'multiverseId\': 381814}, \'multiverseid\': 381814}, {\'name\': \'Бич Кораблей\', \'text\': \'Когда Бич Кораблей выходит на поле битвы, верните каждое существо под контролем ваших оппонентов с выносливостью X или меньше в руку его владельца, где X — количество Островов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кракен\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f7c2332-fc04-43cc-aff3-1625c3c6f4ee\', \'multiverseId\': 381979}, \'multiverseid\': 381979}, {\'name\': \'船舰祸害\', \'text\': \'当船舰祸害进战场时，将由对手操控且防御力等于或小于X的所有生物移回其拥有者手上，X为由你操控的海岛数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨海兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79cdcec2-c189-4a77-bc6d-c19d9d6842c4\', \'multiverseId\': 380659}, \'multiverseid\': 380659}, {\'name\': \'船艦禍害\', \'text\': \'當船艦禍害進戰場時，將由對手操控且防禦力等於或小於X的所有生物移回其擁有者手上，X為由你操控的海島數量。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨海獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3232490-1b6c-4c80-829a-25c06ce15c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 380824}, \'multiverseid\': 380824}]', '[{\'name\': \'Getarnte Sirene\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)\\nFliegend\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sirene\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist nicht der Wind, der die Steine zum Singen bringt." —Kallaphe die Seefahrerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53139e4e-d5ec-476a-8cb9-d5eb013a2cc5\', \'multiverseId\': 380880}, \'multiverseid\': 380880}, {\'name\': \'Sirena encubierta\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\\nVuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'"No es la voz del viento lo que canta entre las piedras". —Calafa, la marinera\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e741caa-d00e-4139-aa3b-195d01cb6dd3\', \'multiverseId\': 382035}, \'multiverseid\': 382035}, {\'name\': \'Sirène dissimulée\', \'text\': \'Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\\nVol\', \'type\': \'Créature : sirène\', \'flavor\': "« Ce n\'est pas la voix du vent qui chante sur les rochers. » —Callaphe le marin", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381045&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7c4b9af-23d9-460e-acaa-7daeadf23880\', \'multiverseId\': 381045}, \'multiverseid\': 381045}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Celata\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\\nVolare\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'"Non è la voce del vento a cantare tra le rocce." —Callafe il marinaio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a04fab8-1ec5-4068-8106-2266e15c2b8d\', \'multiverseId\': 381210}, \'multiverseid\': 381210}, {\'name\': \'擬態するセイレーン\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\\n飛行\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — セイレーン\', \'flavor\': \'「あれは風が石に当たって鳴いている音なんかじゃないわ。」 ――船乗りのカラフィ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29107cdb-e1b9-4e5f-b087-97a7d8299c5f\', \'multiverseId\': 381375}, \'multiverseid\': 381375}, {\'name\': \'망토를 두른 세이렌\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)\\n비행\', \'type\': \'생물 — 세이렌\', \'flavor\': "\'저 소리는 바위에 바람이 불어서 나는 소리가 아니오.\' —뱃사람 칼라피", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f870e58-90fc-4ce8-96d3-6bc884c78d19\', \'multiverseId\': 381540}, \'multiverseid\': 381540}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Camuflada\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\\nVoar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquela não é a voz do vento que canta nas pedras." — Calafe, a marinheira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce52cea2-5c68-492d-a1d6-ce03cb32da0a\', \'multiverseId\': 381705}, \'multiverseid\': 381705}, {\'name\': \'Укрытая Сирена\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\\nПолет\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сирена\', \'flavor\': \'«Это не ветер поет среди утесов». — Каллафа Мореплавательница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3b22b5-07c1-4502-9c40-925e65f1707d\', \'multiverseId\': 381870}, \'multiverseid\': 381870}, {\'name\': \'隐匿塞连\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\\n飞行\', \'type\': \'生物～塞连\', \'flavor\': \'「这声音并不是穿石的风鸣。」 ～水手卡莱斐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d380378-cf90-401d-a89f-4af9bdd60a25\', \'multiverseId\': 380550}, \'multiverseid\': 380550}, {\'name\': \'隱匿塞連\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）\\n飛行\', \'type\': \'生物～塞連\', \'flavor\': \'「這聲音並不是穿石的風鳴。」 ～水手卡萊斐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d4c372a-ccfa-4343-888a-d00fa1c6d12a\', \'multiverseId\': 380715}, \'multiverseid\': 380715}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gewaltsames Einspannen\', \'text\': \'Streben — Gewaltsames Einspannen kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{R} mehr.\\nÜbernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Enttappe diese Kreaturen. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d7a5734-fb88-43f6-aa19-8732918ab95e\', \'multiverseId\': 380927}, \'multiverseid\': 380927}, {\'name\': \'Dominar por la fuerza\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar Dominar por la fuerza cuesta {2}{R} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nGana el control de cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo hasta el final del turno. Endereza esas criaturas. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b645bd9-74c3-4005-a665-5492d75aecfc\', \'multiverseId\': 382082}, \'multiverseid\': 382082}, {\'name\': \'Harnacher par la force\', \'text\': "Obstination — Harnacher par la force coûte {2}{R} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nAcquérez le contrôle de n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381092&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cbc477e-a97c-46ea-ad9f-b4774499951b\', \'multiverseId\': 381092}, \'multiverseid\': 381092}, {\'name\': \'Imbrigliare con la Forza\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Imbrigliare con la Forza costa {2}{R} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nPrendi il controllo di un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quelle creature. Hanno rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18156026-3177-4574-8a2c-d0e4446cf3c9\', \'multiverseId\': 381257}, \'multiverseid\': 381257}, {\'name\': \'力による操縦\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 力による操縦を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{R}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。ターン終了時までそれらのコントロールを得る。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。それらはターン終了時まで速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c7377e6-2504-4405-bc32-14d08394627e\', \'multiverseId\': 381422}, \'multiverseid\': 381422}, {\'name\': \'힘으로 고삐를 채우다\', \'text\': \'분투 — 힘으로 고삐를 채우다는 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{R}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지 그 생물들의 조종권을 얻는다. 그 생물들을 언탭한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 신속을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80aaf130-e0ff-415c-a1c3-74be509b1c95\', \'multiverseId\': 381587}, \'multiverseid\': 381587}, {\'name\': \'Dominar à Força\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Dominar à Força custa {2}{R} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nGanhe o controle de qualquer número de criaturas alvo até o final do turno. Desvire aquelas criaturas. Elas ganham ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42f37e5d-e1f5-4fd4-8d68-057bb946c5ba\', \'multiverseId\': 381752}, \'multiverseid\': 381752}, {\'name\': \'Усмирение Силой\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Усмирения Силой стоит на {2}{R} больше.\\nПолучите контроль над любым количеством целевых существ до конца хода. Разверните те существа. Они получают Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88ed5377-6962-43cc-95b0-295d03c1c49c\', \'multiverseId\': 381917}, \'multiverseid\': 381917}, {\'name\': \'勇力驯服\', \'text\': \'积力～勇力驯服在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{R}来施放。\\n获得任意数量的目标生物之操控权直到回合结束。重置这些生物。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eaa2568-1619-445d-8966-0a8ed2e0884a\', \'multiverseId\': 380597}, \'multiverseid\': 380597}, {\'name\': \'勇力馴服\', \'text\': \'積力～勇力馴服在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{R}來施放。\\n獲得任意數量的目標生物之操控權直到回合結束。重置這些生物。它們獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb6bd84-dcfd-44b3-a7ac-bd0298cd11b5\', \'multiverseId\': 380762}, \'multiverseid\': 380762}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gigant der Verdammnis\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn der Gigant der Verdammnis oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Lähmende Furcht kündigt ihn an. Ein fauler Gestank begleitet ihn. Der Tod erinnert an sein Kommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5571d3c8-7fa9-4fdb-8369-934b299495f1\', \'multiverseId\': 380900}, \'multiverseid\': 380900}, {\'name\': \'Gigante estela de ruina\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Gigante estela de ruina u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un terror paralizante lo precede. Un hedor nauseabundo lo acompaña. La muerte camina tras sus pasos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35f0eb68-a4ab-46d6-aa2d-125bb8733d16\', \'multiverseId\': 382055}, \'multiverseid\': 382055}, {\'name\': \'Géant au sillage funeste\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que le Géant au sillage funeste ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : géant\', \'flavor\': "Une peur paralysante le précède. Une puanteur âcre l\'accompagne. La mort suit dans son sillage.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381065&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703e1438-3628-43a8-a1b6-179b9b670c6b\', \'multiverseId\': 381065}, \'multiverseid\': 381065}, {\'name\': \'Gigante dalla Scia Funesta\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta il Gigante dalla Scia Funesta o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -1/-1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Una paura opprimente lo precede. Un miasma nauseante lo accompagna. La morte ne segue il passaggio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e07856c8-c9de-41de-9655-ddc7560aef33\', \'multiverseId\': 381230}, \'multiverseid\': 381230}, {\'name\': \'破滅喚起の巨人\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 破滅喚起の巨人か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'凍り付く様な恐怖がそれに先行し、不快な臭気がそれに伴い、その後に続くのは死である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49d5fac0-7db7-4c8f-80cb-f9894939396e\', \'multiverseId\': 381395}, \'multiverseid\': 381395}, {\'name\': \'파멸을 초래하는 거인\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 파멸을 초래하는 거인이나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신의 상대들이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 -1/-1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': \'극심한 공포가 앞서고 지독한 악취가 동행하며 죽음이 그 뒤를 따른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbcfb7e4-bfc5-45e5-a7bd-81226ceaef0f\', \'multiverseId\': 381560}, \'multiverseid\': 381560}, {\'name\': \'Gigante do Rastro Funesto\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Gigante do Rastro Funesto ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, as criaturas que seus oponentes controlam recebem -1/-1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'O pavor o precede. Um cheiro pútrido o acompanha. A morte segue em seu rastro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d74d04-331b-4db7-9f69-6efc3f088b4c\', \'multiverseId\': 381725}, \'multiverseid\': 381725}, {\'name\': \'Гигант Надвигающегося Рока\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Гигант Надвигающегося Рока или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, существа под контролем ваших оппонентов получают -1/-1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Леденящий ужас предваряет его появление. Отвратительная вонь сопровождает его. Смерть идет по его следам.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ed7036d-f12e-40bd-8a1b-6b581437529d\', \'multiverseId\': 381890}, \'multiverseid\': 381890}, {\'name\': \'唤终巨人\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当唤终巨人或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，由对手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'身前恐惧蔓延。身畔恶臭随行。身后尸横遍野。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8df197f9-3fa0-406c-b1cb-06df539a66ed\', \'multiverseId\': 380570}, \'multiverseid\': 380570}, {\'name\': \'喚終巨人\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當喚終巨人或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，由對手操控的生物得-1/-1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'身前恐懼蔓延。身畔惡臭隨行。身後屍橫遍野。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9aede40a-f580-459c-ac20-57c0a13e78fd\', \'multiverseId\': 380735}, \'multiverseid\': 380735}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldbalg-Ochse\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn der Goldbalg-Ochse oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, muss eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug geblockt werden, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Ochse\', \'flavor\': \'Die Verlockung, sich den goldenen Balg des Ochsen anzueignen, ist so unwiderstehlich wie tödlich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380923&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'293a47e2-f4cf-45b2-b8f2-7b380a68d642\', \'multiverseId\': 380923}, \'multiverseid\': 380923}, {\'name\': \'Buey lomo dorado\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Buey lomo dorado u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo debe ser bloqueada este turno si se puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Buey\', \'flavor\': \'La tentación de hacerse con la piel dorada del buey es tan irresistible como mortal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb4f884-e1fe-4571-9c6b-50af1e5d7d9a\', \'multiverseId\': 382078}, \'multiverseid\': 382078}, {\'name\': "Bœuf à la peau d\'or", \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que le Bœuf à la peau d\'or ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la créature ciblée doit être bloquée ce tour-ci si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : bovidé\', \'flavor\': "La tentation de s\'emparer de la peau d\'or du bœuf est aussi irrésistible que fatale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381088&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c85ba96a-513e-4259-9f01-e9ab8b758811\', \'multiverseId\': 381088}, \'multiverseid\': 381088}, {\'name\': "Bue dal Vello d\'Oro", \'text\': "Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta il Bue dal Vello d\'Oro o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio deve essere bloccata in questo turno, se possibile.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Bue\', \'flavor\': "La tentazione di prendere il vello d\'oro del bue è tanto irresistibile quanto fatale.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b872bd78-d62f-4de8-984d-b84fdd613e37\', \'multiverseId\': 381253}, \'multiverseid\': 381253}, {\'name\': \'黄金皮の雄牛\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 黄金皮の雄牛か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それは可能ならブロックされなければならない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 雄牛\', \'flavor\': \'雄牛の黄金皮を得たいという誘惑は、死への誘惑と同じくらい抑え難いものである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95bea414-7233-4f98-9d07-afe3d847bb77\', \'multiverseId\': 381418}, \'multiverseid\': 381418}, {\'name\': \'황금가죽 황소\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 황금가죽 황소나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 가능하면 이번 턴에 방어되어야 한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 황소\', \'flavor\': \'그 소의 황금 가죽이 가진 매력은 거부할 수 없을 정도로 강렬하면서도 치명적이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecb417a9-885c-4105-83df-8c55572460a3\', \'multiverseId\': 381583}, \'multiverseid\': 381583}, {\'name\': \'Boi do Couro Dourado\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Boi do Couro Dourado ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo deverá ser bloqueada neste turno se estiver apta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Boi\', \'flavor\': \'A tentação de arrancar o couro dourado do boi é tão irresistível quanto fatal.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8762960b-f28c-479a-8d4a-f3586a7c5087\', \'multiverseId\': 381748}, \'multiverseid\': 381748}, {\'name\': \'Златошкурый Бык\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Златошкурый Бык или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, целевое существо должно быть заблокировано в этом ходу, если это возможно.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Бык\', \'flavor\': \'Искушение завладеть его золотой шкурой непреодолимо и смертоносно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cc742bd-f6f5-4da2-8e6e-6320990368c1\', \'multiverseId\': 381913}, \'multiverseid\': 381913}, {\'name\': \'金皮公牛\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当金皮公牛或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，目标生物本回合若能被阻挡，则须如此作。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～牛\', \'flavor\': \'取得金牛皮的诱惑令人无法抗拒，但也同样致命。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41ed9dc0-30ba-4ca4-b153-bd9c6bc3bc40\', \'multiverseId\': 380593}, \'multiverseid\': 380593}, {\'name\': \'金皮公牛\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當金皮公牛或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，目標生物本回合若能被阻擋，則須如此作。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～牛\', \'flavor\': \'取得金牛皮的誘惑令人無法抗拒，但也同樣致命。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74704da0-e99f-4578-acac-c2261ac74914\', \'multiverseId\': 380758}, \'multiverseid\': 380758}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldene Hirschkuh\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist dir nicht gestattet, sie zu jagen, Sterblicher. Begnüge dich mit dem Anblick ihrer Schönheit." —Nylea, Göttin der Jagd\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0b8be39-e82f-4395-99a6-a8dedcb2f134\', \'multiverseId\': 380922}, \'multiverseid\': 380922}, {\'name\': \'Cierva dorada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"No te pertenece y no tienes derecho a cazarla, mortal. Conténtate solo con su belleza". —Nylea, diosa de la caza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077e8a4b-b945-48ff-9476-3298526f95fc\', \'multiverseId\': 382077}, \'multiverseid\': 382077}, {\'name\': \'Biche dorée\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élan\', \'flavor\': "« Tu n\'as nul droit de la chasser, mortel. Contente-toi d\'admirer sa beauté. » —Nyléa, déesse de la Chasse", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381087&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6891f48a-67f6-47e5-9070-d6dc44190c4c\', \'multiverseId\': 381087}, \'multiverseid\': 381087}, {\'name\': "Cerva d\'Oro", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"Non ti è dato di cacciarla, mortale. Ti basti la sua mera bellezza." —Nylea, dea della caccia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d22fef6-4a4c-46dc-9f9a-e98ad518370f\', \'multiverseId\': 381252}, \'multiverseid\': 381252}, {\'name\': \'黄金の雌鹿\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「それはお前が狩って良いものではないぞ、定命の者よ。その優美さを鑑賞するにとどめて満足するがいい。」 ――狩猟の神、ナイレア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e6cc74d-037b-4f40-85ff-db4814855769\', \'multiverseId\': 381417}, \'multiverseid\': 381417}, {\'name\': \'황금 암사슴\', \'text\': \'{T}: {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘크\', \'flavor\': "\'네 사냥감이 아니다, 필멸자여. 그 아름다움만을 즐겨라.\' —사냥의 신 닐리아", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87b8ea22-1f60-4777-a4a3-934bb095d3bd\', \'multiverseId\': 381582}, \'multiverseid\': 381582}, {\'name\': \'Cerva Dourada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'"Você não tem permissão para caçá-la, mortal. Contente-se em admirar sua beleza." — Niléia, deusa da caça\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc889776-9a23-4432-ba35-c6b2289a36ba\', \'multiverseId\': 381747}, \'multiverseid\': 381747}, {\'name\': \'Золотая Лань\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {G} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вапити\', \'flavor\': \'«Не тебе охотится на нее, смертный. Для тебя — лишь ее красота». — Нилея, богиня охоты\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f19e86d6-14c3-4cce-88c9-f553c4ef0e0c\', \'multiverseId\': 381912}, \'multiverseid\': 381912}, {\'name\': \'金角牝鹿\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「凡人，别妄想狩猎它。能欣赏它的美就该知足了。」 ～猎神倪勒娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d43398ad-21cd-4537-99f5-68939656a260\', \'multiverseId\': 380592}, \'multiverseid\': 380592}, {\'name\': \'金角牝鹿\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}到你的魔法力池中。\', \'type\': \'生物～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'「凡人，別妄想狩獵牠。能欣賞牠的美就該知足了。」 ～獵神倪勒婭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57f81343-1754-4e61-b444-6c9f22f04381\', \'multiverseId\': 380757}, \'multiverseid\': 380757}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goldgeschmiedeter Wachposten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Chimäre\', \'flavor\': \'Von den Göttern gesegnet. Von den Sterblichen ersehnt. Niemandem verpflichtet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380924&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50af6fb1-3e92-4d6a-8934-bbc1c2a111d0\', \'multiverseId\': 380924}, \'multiverseid\': 380924}, {\'name\': \'Centinela forjado en oro\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Quimera\', \'flavor\': \'Los dioses lo bendicen. Los mortales lo codician. Ninguno de ellos puede someterlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd125930-d1cb-4593-a496-fce980f92bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 382079}, \'multiverseid\': 382079}, {\'name\': "Sentinelle forgée d\'or", \'text\': \'Vol\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : chimère\', \'flavor\': "Bénie par les dieux. Convoitée par les mortels. Redevable à nul d\'entre eux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381089&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703c3137-edd4-425d-bf7b-47fe3a3b7314\', \'multiverseId\': 381089}, \'multiverseid\': 381089}, {\'name\': "Sentinella Forgiata nell\'Oro", \'text\': \'Volare\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Chimera\', \'flavor\': \'Benedetta dagli dei. Desiderata dai mortali. Sottomessa a nessuno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b42f59ed-1a97-4091-ac8f-060421a67ca1\', \'multiverseId\': 381254}, \'multiverseid\': 381254}, {\'name\': \'黄金造りの歩哨\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — キマイラ\', \'flavor\': \'神々によって祝福され、定命の者たちによって渇望され、いずれの恩義も受けず。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98bbfd1-7d33-4392-90f8-841f62f2c577\', \'multiverseId\': 381419}, \'multiverseid\': 381419}, {\'name\': \'황금 보초\', \'text\': \'비행\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 키메라\', \'flavor\': \'신들에게 축복받고 필멸자들이 갈구하지만 어느 쪽에도 기울지 않는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9a47faf-f87a-4f81-8376-5c3a9df19062\', \'multiverseId\': 381584}, \'multiverseid\': 381584}, {\'name\': \'Sentinela Forjada em Ouro\', \'text\': \'Voar\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Quimera\', \'flavor\': \'Abençoada pelos deuses. Cobiçada pelos mortais. Leal a nenhum deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'798d0494-6131-409c-b43b-5ab4e6581c5c\', \'multiverseId\': 381749}, \'multiverseid\': 381749}, {\'name\': \'Выкованный из Золота Страж\', \'text\': \'Полет\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Химера\', \'flavor\': \'Благословенна богами. Желанна людьми. Не признательна никому.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c1b52a-f64e-4c65-9d6e-a9539a3f6e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 381914}, \'multiverseid\': 381914}, {\'name\': \'金铸哨兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\', \'type\': \'神器生物～盖美拉\', \'flavor\': \'随诸神降福，任众生祈盼，仍无偏无倚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65aa045c-ed76-4280-b35b-a5ec8a0ce4a3\', \'multiverseId\': 380594}, \'multiverseid\': 380594}, {\'name\': \'金鑄哨兵\', \'text\': \'飛行\', \'type\': \'神器生物～蓋美拉\', \'flavor\': \'隨諸神降福，任眾生祈盼，仍無偏無倚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43d63e9-0fd2-4b38-baec-8a39e44fd043\', \'multiverseId\': 380759}, \'multiverseid\': 380759}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gorgoblut\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+3 und hat Todesberührung. (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Meinen Adoptivkindern wird dieselbe Liebe zuteil." —Pharika, Göttin der Gebrechen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4bc8fe1-c47d-417e-b3a9-6c3a66c8c427\', \'multiverseId\': 380868}, \'multiverseid\': 380868}, {\'name\': \'Aspecto de gorgona\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+3 y tiene la habilidad de toque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Mis hijos adoptivos son amados por igual". —Farika, diosa de la aflicción\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffd0c943-4425-4576-9e0f-a840c7bb70e8\', \'multiverseId\': 382023}, \'multiverseid\': 382023}, {\'name\': \'Aspect de la gorgone\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+3 et a le contact mortel. (Le nombre de blessures qu\'elle inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« J\'aime tout autant les enfants que j\'adopte. » —Pharika, déesse de l\'Affliction", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381033&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961a311f-6f21-4af8-be01-54de9d116590\', \'multiverseId\': 381033}, \'multiverseid\': 381033}, {\'name\': \'Sembianze della Gorgone\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+3 e ha tocco letale. (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"I miei figli adottivi sono amati al pari degli altri." —Farika, dea dell\\\'afflizione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08405a36-abef-4a71-8e63-0e73bf11949f\', \'multiverseId\': 381198}, \'multiverseid\': 381198}, {\'name\': \'ゴルゴンの血\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋３の修整を受けるとともに接死を持つ。（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「私は養子として受け入れた子供たちにも、等しく愛情をかけていますよ。」 ――苦悶の神、ファリカ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e2e88c-8877-4d8e-a4eb-cab3772531ba\', \'multiverseId\': 381363}, \'multiverseid\': 381363}, {\'name\': \'고르곤의 상\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+3을 받고 치명타를 가진다. (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': "\'나는 데려온 아이들도 똑같이 사랑하지.\' —고통의 신 파리카", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71faeedd-12ab-4911-a1e8-535b7e333167\', \'multiverseId\': 381528}, \'multiverseid\': 381528}, {\'name\': \'Aspecto de Górgona\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+3 e tem toque mortífero. (Qualquer quantidade de dano que aquela criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Meus filhos adotivos não são menos amados." — Fárica, deusa do padecimento\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b046ee-512a-47f5-8480-0de84ba5d773\', \'multiverseId\': 381693}, \'multiverseid\': 381693}, {\'name\': \'Облик Горгоны\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+3 и имеет Смертельное касание. (Любое количество повреждений, которое оно наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Моих приемных детей я люблю не меньше». — Фарика, богиня недуга\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db22d02-c154-4ccc-9ad1-daf38e6f337d\', \'multiverseId\': 381858}, \'multiverseid\': 381858}, {\'name\': \'蛇发妖外貌\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+3且具有死触异能。（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「我收养的孩子也同样会得到宠爱。」 ～折磨神芳瑞卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd7786e9-994f-41cb-a083-477ef74f09a6\', \'multiverseId\': 380538}, \'multiverseid\': 380538}, {\'name\': \'蛇髮妖外貌\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+3且具有死觸異能。（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「我收養的孩子也同樣會得到寵愛。」 ～折磨神芳瑞卡\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bed8e90-11c5-4af8-be14-fcf51c44628a\', \'multiverseId\': 380703}, \'multiverseid\': 380703}]', "[{'name': 'Gottesheil', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+3.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur eine oder mehrere Kreaturen blockt oder von einer oder mehreren Kreaturen geblockt wird, kannst du eine dieser Kreaturen ins Exil schicken.\\nGegner können keine Karten mit dem gleichen Namen wie Karten wirken, die mit Gottesheil ins Exil geschickt wurden.\\nAusrüsten {3}', 'type': 'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380921&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f0a2e55-1a10-4151-a24d-2d4e5aa689eb', 'multiverseId': 380921}, 'multiverseid': 380921}, {'name': 'Filo divino', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+3.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada bloquee o sea bloqueada por una o más criaturas, puedes exiliar una de esas criaturas.\\nLos oponentes no pueden lanzar cartas con el mismo nombre que las cartas exiliadas con el Filo divino.\\nEquipar {3}.', 'type': 'Artefacto legendario — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382076&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9131920b-b3b2-42df-a3a3-6952a9556433', 'multiverseId': 382076}, 'multiverseid': 382076}, {'name': 'Don du ciel', 'text': 'La créature équipée gagne +3/+3.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée bloque ou devient bloquée par au moins une créature, vous pouvez exiler une de ces créatures.\\nLes adversaires ne peuvent pas lancer de cartes ayant le même nom que les cartes exilées par le Don du ciel.\\nÉquipement {3}', 'type': 'Artefact légendaire : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381086&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1592afe-4a6a-4d48-a961-38cd76f216cd', 'multiverseId': 381086}, 'multiverseid': 381086}, {'name': 'Nemesi degli Dei', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+3.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata blocca o viene bloccata da una o più creature, puoi esiliare una di quelle creature.\\nGli avversari non possono lanciare carte con lo stesso nome delle carte esiliate dalla Nemesi degli Dei.\\nEquipaggiare {3}', 'type': 'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381251&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b906525-d863-47f6-85ef-78d067a11eb6', 'multiverseId': 381251}, 'multiverseid': 381251}, {'name': '神送り', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが、１体以上のクリーチャーをブロックするか１体以上のクリーチャーにブロックされた状態になるたび、あなたはそれらのクリーチャーのうち１体を追放してもよい。\\n対戦相手は、神送りによって追放されているカードと同じ名前を持つカードを唱えられない。\\n装備{3}', 'type': '伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381416&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba6bb21b-2796-42d5-8eb1-7b1b4cd43ffa', 'multiverseId': 381416}, 'multiverseid': 381416}, {'name': '신의 선물', 'text': '장착된 생물은 +3/+3을 받는다.\\n장착한 생물이 방어하거나 하나 이상의 생물에게 방어 당할 때마다, 당신은 그 생물 중 하나를 추방할 수 있다.\\n상대들은 신의 선물로 추방한 카드들과 같은 이름을 가진 카드들을 발동할 수 없다.\\n장착 {3}', 'type': '전설적 마법물체 — 장비', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381581&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3fd0527-e60a-465f-8465-5fd5771cb6fa', 'multiverseId': 381581}, 'multiverseid': 381581}, {'name': 'Mensageira dos Deuses', 'text': 'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+3.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada bloquear ou for bloqueada por uma ou mais criaturas, você poderá exilar uma daquelas criaturas.\\nOs oponentes não podem conjurar cards com o mesmo nome de cards exilados por Mensageira dos Deuses.\\nEquipar {3}', 'type': 'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381746&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5812fe0-cf84-486e-a906-418197f1c0c5', 'multiverseId': 381746}, 'multiverseid': 381746}, {'name': 'Божий Дар', 'text': 'Снаряженное существо получает +3/+3.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо блокирует или становится заблокировано одним или несколькими существами, вы можете изгнать одно из тех существ.\\nОппоненты не могут разыгрывать карты с такими же именами, как у карт, изгнанных Божьим Даром.\\nСнарядить {3}', 'type': 'Легендарный Артефакт — Снаряжение', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381911&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8ee93af-0db9-4a63-bf6b-f271d6e6ee15', 'multiverseId': 381911}, 'multiverseid': 381911}, {'name': '承阳剑', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物得+3/+3。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物阻挡一个或数个生物或被一个或数个生物阻挡时，你可以放逐后者生物之一。\\n对手不能施放与以承阳剑放逐之牌同名的牌。\\n佩带{3}', 'type': '传奇神器～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380591&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ec9d1ac-c579-4938-9e86-1940c905322f', 'multiverseId': 380591}, 'multiverseid': 380591}, {'name': '承陽劍', 'text': '佩帶此武具的生物得+3/+3。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物阻擋一個或數個生物或被一個或數個生物阻擋時，你可以放逐後者生物之一。\\n對手不能施放與以承陽劍放逐之牌同名的牌。\\n佩帶{3}', 'type': '傳奇神器～武具', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380756&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b4c9172-175c-418b-aaff-e612da020ffb', 'multiverseId': 380756}, 'multiverseid': 380756}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gottesjäger-Oktopus\', \'text\': \'Der Gottesjäger-Oktopus kann nicht angreifen, falls der verteidigende Spieler keine Verzauberung oder verzauberte bleibende Karte kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oktopus\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich will es Thassa Tropfen um Tropfen gleichtun und der Göttin zeigen, was wahre Macht ist." —Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380920&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1577518-01f8-4d1e-bd56-db09dfd57288\', \'multiverseId\': 380920}, \'multiverseid\': 380920}, {\'name\': \'Pulpo cazadioses\', \'text\': \'El Pulpo cazadioses no puede atacar a menos que el jugador defensor controle un encantamiento o un permanente encantado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pulpo\', \'flavor\': \'"Igualaré a Tassa gota a gota y le mostraré a una diosa lo que es el auténtico poder". —Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'465e0cef-6460-447f-887c-709d51baba7f\', \'multiverseId\': 382075}, \'multiverseid\': 382075}, {\'name\': \'Pieuvre chasse-dieu\', \'text\': \'La Pieuvre chasse-dieu ne peut pas attaquer à moins que le joueur défenseur ne contrôle un enchantement ou un permanent enchanté.\', \'type\': \'Créature : pieuvre\', \'flavor\': "« Déesse ou non, je montrerai à Thassa ce qu\'est le véritable pouvoir. » —Kiora", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381085&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6930f6d2-db7a-4e64-b2e5-9b86719e54c7\', \'multiverseId\': 381085}, \'multiverseid\': 381085}, {\'name\': \'Piovra Cacciadei\', \'text\': \'La Piovra Cacciadei non può attaccare a meno che il giocatore in difesa non controlli un incantesimo o un permanente incantato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Piovra\', \'flavor\': \'"Risponderò a Thassa goccia con goccia e mostrerò a una divinità cosa sia il vero potere." —Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'215a2881-62e8-40c4-8453-f04b9b4849c8\', \'multiverseId\': 381250}, \'multiverseid\': 381250}, {\'name\': \'神狩りの大ダコ\', \'text\': \'神狩りの大ダコは、防御プレイヤーがエンチャントかエンチャントされているパーマネントをコントロールしていないかぎり攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — タコ\', \'flavor\': \'「タッサとはその一滴一滴まで突き合わせ、神に本当の力とは何なのかをお見せ致しましょう。」 ――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ae76577-1e9b-4e8c-974a-37a88793b6bd\', \'multiverseId\': 381415}, \'multiverseid\': 381415}, {\'name\': \'신사냥꾼 문어\', \'text\': \'신사냥꾼 문어는 수비플레이어가 부여마법이나 부여된 지속물을 조종하지 않는 한 공격할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 문어\', \'flavor\': "\'마지막 한 방울까지 타사에게 맞서서 신에게 진정한 힘이 무엇인지 보여주도록 하지.\' —키오라", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9e62677-3878-43e1-b759-62af68aff83e\', \'multiverseId\': 381580}, \'multiverseid\': 381580}, {\'name\': \'Polvo Caçador de Deuses\', \'text\': \'Polvo Caçador de Deuses não pode atacar a menos que o jogador defensor controle um encantamento ou uma permanente encantada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Polvo\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vou enfrentar Tassa gota a gota e mostrar a um deus o que é o verdadeiro poder." — Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1becf389-2129-4438-8b22-b4b23009f7d9\', \'multiverseId\': 381745}, \'multiverseid\': 381745}, {\'name\': \'Спрут, Охотник на Богов\', \'text\': \'Спрут, Охотник на Богов не может атаковать, если только защищающийся игрок не контролирует чары или зачарованный перманент.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Спрут\', \'flavor\': \'«Капля за каплей я сравняюсь с Тассой и покажу богине, что такое настоящее могущество». — Киора\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95a46032-2222-40bd-b55e-4e3a57f17d33\', \'multiverseId\': 381910}, \'multiverseid\': 381910}, {\'name\': \'捕神章鱼\', \'text\': \'除非防御牌手操控结界或被结附的永久物，否则捕神章鱼不能攻击。\', \'type\': \'生物～章鱼\', \'flavor\': \'「我将与塔萨全面较量，让神看看什么是真正的力量。」 ～奇奥拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6586c45f-e209-4294-a996-44a5d4253e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 380590}, \'multiverseid\': 380590}, {\'name\': \'捕神章魚\', \'text\': \'除非防禦玩家操控結界或被結附的永久物，否則捕神章魚不能攻擊。\', \'type\': \'生物～章魚\', \'flavor\': \'「我將與塔薩全面較量，讓神看看什麼是真正的力量。」 ～奇奧拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dc7c1ca-0ceb-4a1c-8cf6-7680f705dab7\', \'multiverseId\': 380755}, \'multiverseid\': 380755}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gottesmord\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl ins Exil. Falls die ins Exil geschickte Karte eine Gott-Karte ist, durchsuche den Friedhof, die Hand und die Bibliothek ihres Beherrschers nach einer beliebigen Anzahl an Karten mit dem gleichen Namen wie diese Karte und schicke sie ins Exil; dieser Spieler mischt dann seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist vollbracht." —Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bd238a5-6a84-4f55-8b0d-924145efb816\', \'multiverseId\': 380890}, \'multiverseid\': 380890}, {\'name\': \'Deicidio\', \'text\': \'Exilia el encantamiento objetivo. Si la carta exiliada es una Deidad, busca en el cementerio, la mano y la biblioteca de su controlador cualquier cantidad de cartas con el mismo nombre que esa carta y exílialas, luego ese jugador baraja su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Concedido". —Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f55dc9dc-0bf2-4a5d-92df-c9da55a0b1e5\', \'multiverseId\': 382045}, \'multiverseid\': 382045}, {\'name\': \'Théobole\', \'text\': "Exilez l\'enchantement ciblé. Si la carte exilée est une carte de dieu, cherchez dans le cimetière, la main et la bibliothèque de son contrôleur n\'importe quel nombre de cartes ayant le même nom que cette carte et exilez-les, puis ce joueur mélange sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est fait. » —Elspeth", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381055&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a20bc73f-abd8-45d6-8f19-c89739f05bda\', \'multiverseId\': 381055}, \'multiverseid\': 381055}, {\'name\': \'Deicidio\', \'text\': \'Esilia un incantesimo bersaglio. Se la carta esiliata è una carta Dio, passa in rassegna il cimitero, la mano e il grimorio del suo controllore per un qualsiasi numero di carte con lo stesso nome di quella carta ed esiliale, poi quel giocatore rimescola il suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È finita." —Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c9b865-1651-47d7-84c1-d2813ac923ef\', \'multiverseId\': 381220}, \'multiverseid\': 381220}, {\'name\': \'神討ち\', \'text\': \'エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。追放されたカードが神・カードであるなら、そのコントローラーの墓地と手札とライブラリーから、そのカードと同じ名前を持つカードを望む枚数探し、それらを追放する。その後、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「これで終わりです。」 ――エルズペス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6181d8b9-8c08-4081-a6c2-59ba44f9daa9\', \'multiverseId\': 381385}, \'multiverseid\': 381385}, {\'name\': \'신을 죽이다\', \'text\': \'부여마법 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법을 추방한다. 추방한 카드가 신 카드라면, 그 카드의 조종자의 무덤과 손, 서고에서 그 카드의 이름과 같은 이름의 카드를 원하는 만큼 찾아 추방한 후, 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"이것으로 끝입니다." —엘스페스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b77c9984-4160-40e3-85d7-408a7d372bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 381550}, \'multiverseid\': 381550}, {\'name\': \'Deicídio\', \'text\': \'Exile o encantamento alvo. Se o card exilado for um Deus, procure no cemitério, mão e grimório do seu controlador qualquer número de cards com o mesmo nome daquele card e exile-os. Depois, aquele jogador embaralha o próprio grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Está feito." — Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a77737f-2fda-4982-ac34-d42fb49b2e76\', \'multiverseId\': 381715}, \'multiverseid\': 381715}, {\'name\': \'Богоубийство\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевые чары. Если изгнанная карта является картой Бога, найдите на кладбище, в руке и в библиотеке контролирующего ее игрока любое количество карт с таким же именем, как у той карты, и изгоните их, затем тот игрок тасует свою библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Вот и все». — Элспет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb2e0149-6533-4576-9b94-78472f617efe\', \'multiverseId\': 381880}, \'multiverseid\': 381880}, {\'name\': \'弑神\', \'text\': \'放逐目标结界。如果所放逐的牌是神牌，则从其操控者的坟墓场、手牌及牌库中搜寻任意数量与之同名的牌并将它们放逐，然后该牌手将其牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「全结束了。」 ～艾紫培\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be015a01-a2f4-4277-a127-48c5c6cb5b92\', \'multiverseId\': 380560}, \'multiverseid\': 380560}, {\'name\': \'弒神\', \'text\': \'放逐目標結界。如果所放逐的牌是神牌，則從其操控者的墳墓場、手牌及牌庫中搜尋任意數量與之同名的牌並將它們放逐，然後該玩家將其牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「全結束了。」 ～艾紫培\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'317bfbd7-182b-49c9-b6d1-2433978eb8b9\', \'multiverseId\': 380725}, \'multiverseid\': 380725}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gottloses Toben\', \'text\': \'Alle Kreaturen erhalten +2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Koste jeden Moment aus, es könnte dein letzter sein." —Xenagos, Gott des Hedonismus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c431c1f-998e-4a64-8703-540b6e870083\', \'multiverseId\': 380983}, \'multiverseid\': 380983}, {\'name\': \'Fiesta del abandono\', \'text\': \'Todas las criaturas obtienen +2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Disfruta cada momento, pues podría ser el último". —Xenagos, dios del deleite\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e88733d-5d9b-4f1f-9579-f5a791a4d3ec\', \'multiverseId\': 382138}, \'multiverseid\': 382138}, {\'name\': "Ripaille de l\'abandon", \'text\': "Toutes les créatures gagnent +2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Jouissez de chaque instant, car il pourrait être le dernier. » —Xénagos, dieu de la Débauche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a5bd037-6d6f-4dd3-a5fb-7d2ef34d2fd7\', \'multiverseId\': 381148}, \'multiverseid\': 381148}, {\'name\': "Baccanale dell\'Abbandono", \'text\': \'Tutte le creature prendono +2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Assapora ogni momento, poiché potrebbe essere l\\\'ultimo." —Xenagos, dio della dissolutezza\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40f452e0-e9df-48bd-89f3-1a9ac2660d49\', \'multiverseId\': 381313}, \'multiverseid\': 381313}, {\'name\': \'奔放なる遊戯\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーは、ターン終了時まで＋２/-２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「すべての瞬間を楽しめ。それが最後になるとも限らぬからな。」 ――歓楽の神、ゼナゴス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe6b290-b943-45ae-908c-8c0cb0126d31\', \'multiverseId\': 381478}, \'multiverseid\': 381478}, {\'name\': \'방종의 날뜀\', \'text\': \'모든 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/-2를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': "\'매 순간을 만끽하라구, 그게 네 마지막이 될 수도 있으니까.\' —유흥의 신 제나고스", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a008281a-39d3-4eaa-8679-5e38948c9707\', \'multiverseId\': 381643}, \'multiverseid\': 381643}, {\'name\': \'Folia do Abandono\', \'text\': \'Todas as criaturas recebem +2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Aproveite cada momento, pois pode ser o último." — Xenagos, deus da festança\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'453448b0-a0c5-4a8d-aa1a-a929331873bd\', \'multiverseId\': 381808}, \'multiverseid\': 381808}, {\'name\': \'Неудержимый Кутеж\', \'text\': \'Все существа получают +2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Цени каждое мгновение, ведь оно может оказаться последним». — Ксенаг, бог разгула\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ffc8a8-761c-48c5-9bdd-140190c072c1\', \'multiverseId\': 381973}, \'multiverseid\': 381973}, {\'name\': \'荒弃嬉闹\', \'text\': \'所有生物得+2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「拥抱每一刻，因为你随时可能死去。」 ～贪欢神谢纳戈斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8347348b-d3ac-483d-a3e8-b51251e13a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 380653}, \'multiverseid\': 380653}, {\'name\': \'荒棄嬉鬧\', \'text\': \'所有生物得+2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「擁抱每一刻，因為你隨時可能死去。」 ～貪歡神謝納戈斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac4d9699-d216-4d3c-9b9f-18817807eff3\', \'multiverseId\': 380818}, \'multiverseid\': 380818}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grausame Fütterung\', \'text\': \'Streben — Grausame Fütterung kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{B} mehr.\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+0 und Lebensverknüpfung. (Schaden, der von einer Kreatur mit Lebensverknüpfung zugefügt wird, lässt ihren Beherrscher ebenso viele Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380884&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca54efc3-f32b-4b34-acb4-5052f3d98aa3\', \'multiverseId\': 380884}, \'multiverseid\': 380884}, {\'name\': \'Cena cruel\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Cena cruel cuesta {2}{B} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nCualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo obtienen +1/+0 cada una y ganan la habilidad de vínculo vital hasta el final del turno. (El daño hecho por una criatura con vínculo vital también hace que su controlador gane esa misma cantidad de vidas.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97b11642-7e36-45f6-b057-0b25396f129f\', \'multiverseId\': 382039}, \'multiverseid\': 382039}, {\'name\': \'Alimentation cruelle\', \'text\': "Obstination — L\'Alimentation cruelle coûte {2}{B} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nN\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +1/+0 et acquièrent le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures infligées par une créature avec le lien de vie font aussi gagner autant de points de vie à son contrôleur.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381049&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'165ee270-1b91-415c-84b6-c26f05f893d4\', \'multiverseId\': 381049}, \'multiverseid\': 381049}, {\'name\': \'Pasto Crudele\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Il Pasto Crudele costa {2}{B} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse prende +1/+0 e ha legame vitale fino alla fine del turno. (Il danno inflitto da una creatura con legame vitale fa anche guadagnare al suo controllore altrettanti punti vita.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a5a8267-1941-4bc0-afa5-8f97d3d93f09\', \'multiverseId\': 381214}, \'multiverseid\': 381214}, {\'name\': \'残忍な食餌\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 残忍な食餌を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{B}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで＋１/＋０の修整を受けるとともに絆魂を得る。（絆魂を持つクリーチャーがダメージを与えると、さらにそのコントローラーはその点数分のライフを得る。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d97dd2-035a-47b5-be17-ae6559cf2795\', \'multiverseId\': 381379}, \'multiverseid\': 381379}, {\'name\': \'잔인한 식사\', \'text\': \'분투 — 잔인한 식사는 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{B}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +1/+0을 받고 생명연결을 얻는다. (생명연결 능력을 가진 생물이 피해를 입히면, 그 생물의 조종자는 그 피해만큼의 생명점을 얻는다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'047fac93-ddf6-4467-ab0b-e86770aa6e67\', \'multiverseId\': 381544}, \'multiverseid\': 381544}, {\'name\': \'Alimentação Cruel\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Alimentação Cruel custa {2}{B} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nQualquer número de criaturas alvo recebe +1/+0 e ganha vínculo com a vida até o final do turno. (O dano causado por uma criatura com vínculo com a vida também faz com que seu controlador ganhe uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f346cf0-8faf-438a-bb16-d932b465537c\', \'multiverseId\': 381709}, \'multiverseid\': 381709}, {\'name\': \'Жестокая Кормежка\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Жестокой Кормежки стоит на {2}{B} больше.\\nЛюбое количество целевых существ получают по +1/+0 и Цепь жизни до конца хода. (Повреждения, наносимые существом с Цепью жизни, также заставляют контролирующего его игрока получить такое же количество жизней.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2581275f-2a88-408d-94f3-9e8f4df48350\', \'multiverseId\': 381874}, \'multiverseid\': 381874}, {\'name\': \'残酷进食\', \'text\': \'积力～残酷进食在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{B}来施放。\\n直到回合结束，任意数量的目标生物各得+1/+0且获得系命异能。（具系命异能之生物所造成的伤害会让其操控者获得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51d24a23-dd3d-4d6a-8167-50360578e176\', \'multiverseId\': 380554}, \'multiverseid\': 380554}, {\'name\': \'殘酷進食\', \'text\': \'積力～殘酷進食在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{B}來施放。\\n直到回合結束，任意數量的目標生物各得+1/+0且獲得繫命異能。（具繫命異能之生物所造成的傷害會讓其操控者獲得等量的生命。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53af713-fd83-4626-999d-16064f0e4f62\', \'multiverseId\': 380719}, \'multiverseid\': 380719}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmiger Wächter\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn der Grimmige Wächter oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': "Gelegentlich verirren sich auch die Lebenden an die Ufer der Flüsse, aber Athreos\' Wächter sorgen dafür, dass nur die Toten übersetzen.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380925&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b8e8ce-35ed-49ae-bd37-7568865fb8b8\', \'multiverseId\': 380925}, \'multiverseid\': 380925}, {\'name\': \'Guardián siniestro\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Guardián siniestro u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'En ocasiones, los vivos deambulan por los Ríos, pero los guardas de Atreos se aseguran de que solo pasen los muertos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1409bfb-1ebb-448d-825e-195a86a7b05f\', \'multiverseId\': 382080}, \'multiverseid\': 382080}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre garde\', \'text\': \'Constellation — À chaque fois que le Sinistre garde ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : zombie\', \'flavor\': "Parfois, les vivants errent jusqu\'aux Fleuves, mais les gardiens d\'Athréos ne laissent passer que les morts.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381090&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37690943-ee85-4851-b470-e0178c9a09b3\', \'multiverseId\': 381090}, \'multiverseid\': 381090}, {\'name\': \'Tetro Guardiano\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta il Tetro Guardiano o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'Talvolta i vivi raggiungono i Fiumi, ma i custodi di Atreo si assicurano che siano solo i morti a passare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cdc52ee-1c0e-4a44-9ba6-ec17d440515b\', \'multiverseId\': 381255}, \'multiverseid\': 381255}, {\'name\': \'厳かな守護者\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 厳かな守護者か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'時折生者が河に辿りつくことがあるが、そこを通過するのが死者だけであることを確実にしているのがエイスリオスの管理人たちである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38f8cf8a-410b-4bf1-a848-4d02f194f9f1\', \'multiverseId\': 381420}, \'multiverseid\': 381420}, {\'name\': \'음산한 수호자\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 음산한 수호자나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'가끔 산 자들이 강 근처를 배회하지만 에스리오스의 관리자들은 죽은 자들만 통과시킨다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d731e0d-9d75-4c0f-9baf-1c3a7a1cd788\', \'multiverseId\': 381585}, \'multiverseid\': 381585}, {\'name\': \'Guardião Sinistro\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Guardião Sinistro ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'Às vezes, os vivos caminham até os Rios, mas os guardiões de Atreos garantem que só os mortos atravessem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c2c4564-c42e-45ff-a968-1619fbe46be6\', \'multiverseId\': 381750}, \'multiverseid\': 381750}, {\'name\': \'Мрачный Хранитель\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Мрачный Хранитель или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'Временами к Рекам приходят и живые, но стражники Атрея пропускают лишь мертвецов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471d4afc-ff66-4be7-bb47-e661a1aa1091\', \'multiverseId\': 381915}, \'multiverseid\': 381915}, {\'name\': \'狰狞守卫\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当狰狞守卫或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'偶尔会有活人在河边游荡，但雅睿欧斯的护卫将确保只有死者才能渡河。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbd485a1-3a41-41db-9c74-e738d6b5c0af\', \'multiverseId\': 380595}, \'multiverseid\': 380595}, {\'name\': \'猙獰守衛\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當猙獰守衛或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，每位對手各失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'偶爾會有活人在河邊游蕩，但雅睿歐斯的護衛將確保只有死者才能渡河。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ecff6d-be58-4f03-86ef-32543aa7c271\', \'multiverseId\': 380760}, \'multiverseid\': 380760}]', "[{'name': 'Halle des Triumphes', 'text': 'Sowie die Halle des Triumphes ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nKreaturen der bestimmten Farbe, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.', 'type': 'Legendäres Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Helden handeln ohne Gedanken an Ruhm oder Belohnung. Anerkennung ist lediglich eine Folge, kein Ziel.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380926&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f36b3db4-095a-4c13-904d-1a8feb56749b', 'multiverseId': 380926}, 'multiverseid': 380926}, {'name': 'Sala del triunfo', 'text': 'En cuanto la Sala del triunfo entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\nLas criaturas que controlas del color elegido obtienen +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefacto legendario', 'flavor': 'Los héroes actúan sin pensar en la gloria o las recompensas. Esos premios son consecuencias, no objetivos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382081&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5a62f8d-0b25-4b65-b66f-d3245c5df90f', 'multiverseId': 382081}, 'multiverseid': 382081}, {'name': 'Mégaron du triomphe', 'text': 'Au moment où le Mégaron du triomphe arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez de la couleur choisie gagnent +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefact légendaire', 'flavor': 'Les héros agissent sans songer à la gloire ou aux récompenses. Les gratifications sont une conséquence, pas un but.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381091&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0284405e-ebe9-45ff-a665-ae119e466294', 'multiverseId': 381091}, 'multiverseid': 381091}, {'name': 'Sala del Trionfo', 'text': 'Mentre la Sala del Trionfo entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\nLe creature che controlli del colore scelto prendono +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefatto Leggendario', 'flavor': 'Gli eroi agiscono senza pensare alla gloria o alle ricompense. Le lodi sono una conseguenza, non un traguardo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381256&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '99d2f635-4638-479b-a9d5-2525facae1c9', 'multiverseId': 381256}, 'multiverseid': 381256}, {'name': '凱旋の間', 'text': '凱旋の間が戦場に出るに際し、色を１色選ぶ。\\nあなたがコントロールするその選ばれた色のクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。', 'type': '伝説のアーティファクト', 'flavor': '英雄は、栄光や報酬のことなど考えずに行動する。称賛とは結果であり、目的にあらず。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381421&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cb086ff-78be-4529-9260-84488634bb44', 'multiverseId': 381421}, 'multiverseid': 381421}, {'name': '승리의 전당', 'text': '승리의 전당이 전장에 들어올 때, 색 하나를 고른다.\\n선택한 색을 가진 당신이 조종하는 생물은 +1/+1을 얻는다.', 'type': '전설적 마법물체', 'flavor': '영웅은 영광이나 대가에 관계없이 행동한다. 포상은 결과일 뿐, 목적이 아니다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381586&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6c34f34-7387-4614-9403-b6b0f3561e2f', 'multiverseId': 381586}, 'multiverseid': 381586}, {'name': 'Salão do Triunfo', 'text': 'Conforme Salão do Triunfo entra no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor.\\nAs criaturas que você controla da cor escolhida ganham +1/+1.', 'type': 'Artefato Lendário', 'flavor': 'Os heróis agem sem pensar em glória ou recompensas. Gratificações são consequências, não objetivos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381751&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0484ae81-59df-4bd7-aad9-5c97b250afc8', 'multiverseId': 381751}, 'multiverseid': 381751}, {'name': 'Триумфальный Зал', 'text': 'При выходе Триумфального Зала на поле битвы выберите цвет.\\nНаходящиеся под вашим контролем существа выбранного цвета получают +1/+1.', 'type': 'Легендарный Артефакт', 'flavor': 'Герои действуют, не думая о славе и о наградах. Почести — это следствие, а не цель.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381916&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd672461e-7d5f-47af-984f-dbd783608c98', 'multiverseId': 381916}, 'multiverseid': 381916}, {'name': '凯旋大厅', 'text': '于凯旋大厅进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n由你操控的该色生物得+1/+1。', 'type': '传奇神器', 'flavor': '英雄不是因为荣耀或奖励才出手的。获得荣誉是自然结果，而非目标。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380596&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce202bc1-c373-46ab-8c7f-418128b003f8', 'multiverseId': 380596}, 'multiverseid': 380596}, {'name': '凱旋大廳', 'text': '於凱旋大廳進戰場時，選擇一種顏色。\\n由你操控的該色生物得+1/+1。', 'type': '傳奇神器', 'flavor': '英雄不是因為榮耀或獎勵才出手的。獲得榮譽是自然結果，而非目標。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380761&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '987eb7af-e1ae-4b69-988c-f35538710d0c', 'multiverseId': 380761}, 'multiverseid': 380761}]", "[{'name': 'Heldenverschlingerin', 'text': 'Die Heldenverschlingerin kommt mit vier +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\n{2}{G}{G}: Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf die Heldenverschlingerin, wobei X gleich ihrer Stärke ist.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Hydra', 'flavor': 'Reisende berichten, dass Hydras sich die eigenen Köpfe abbeißen, um noch tödlicher zu werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380929&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4b241c3-d434-4674-b84e-6362d59de210', 'multiverseId': 380929}, 'multiverseid': 380929}, {'name': 'Ruina de héroes', 'text': 'La Ruina de héroes entra al campo de batalla con cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\n{2}{G}{G}: Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la Ruina de héroes, donde X es su fuerza.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hidra', 'flavor': 'Las historias de los viajeros cuentan que las hidras se arrancan sus propias cabezas a mordiscos para ser más letales.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382084&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5618e83-c15d-4f60-a471-60f0a78f5556', 'multiverseId': 382084}, 'multiverseid': 382084}, {'name': 'Fléau des héros', 'text': 'Le Fléau des héros arrive sur le champ de bataille avec quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur lui.\\n{2}{G}{G} : Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Fléau des héros, X étant sa force.', 'type': 'Créature : hydre', 'flavor': 'Selon les contes de voyage, les hydres arrachent leurs propres têtes pour se rendre encore plus dangereuses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381094&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '728d6dce-2707-47e2-b7e9-86b6ad69e8d2', 'multiverseId': 381094}, 'multiverseid': 381094}, {'name': 'Flagello degli Eroi', 'text': 'Il Flagello degli Eroi entra nel campo di battaglia con quattro segnalini +1/+1.\\n{2}{G}{G}: Metti X segnalini +1/+1 sul Flagello degli Eroi, dove X è la sua forza.', 'type': 'Creatura — Idra', 'flavor': 'I racconti dei viandanti sostengono che le idre si stacchino le teste a morsi per rendersi ancora più letali.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381259&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cf2c5a2-bd4f-4241-91a1-5011ad5c5424', 'multiverseId': 381259}, 'multiverseid': 381259}, {'name': '英雄たちを破滅させるもの', 'text': '英雄たちを破滅させるものは＋１/＋１カウンターが４個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{G}{G}：英雄たちを破滅させるものの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。Ｘはこれのパワーに等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ハイドラ', 'flavor': '旅人たちのうわさ話によれば、ハイドラはより強くなるために、自らの首を噛み切り落とすらしい。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381424&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c3e6dcd-5fdd-4269-8a67-d5a6dbad68e5', 'multiverseId': 381424}, 'multiverseid': 381424}, {'name': '영웅의 재앙', 'text': '영웅의 재앙은 +1/+1 카운터 네 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{2}{G}{G}: 영웅의 재앙에 +1/+1 카운터를 X개 올려놓는다. X는 그 카드의 공격력이다.', 'type': '생물 — 히드라', 'flavor': '여행자들이 말하길, 히드라는 더 강해지기 위해 자기 목을 물어뜯는다고 한다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381589&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cbaa41a-f129-4c78-b343-c10a0a93808b', 'multiverseId': 381589}, 'multiverseid': 381589}, {'name': 'Perdição dos Heróis', 'text': 'Perdição dos Heróis entra no campo de batalha com quatro marcadores +1/+1.\\n{2}{G}{G}:Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 em Perdição dos Heróis, sendo X seu poder.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hidra', 'flavor': 'De acordo com as histórias dos viajantes, as hidras arrancam as próprias cabeças para se tornarem mais letais.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381754&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e493477f-f252-46a7-905a-5238b5975956', 'multiverseId': 381754}, 'multiverseid': 381754}, {'name': 'Погибель Героев', 'text': 'Погибель Героев выходит на поле битвы с четырьмя жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\\n{2}{G}{G}: положите X жетонов +1/+1 на Погибель Героев, где X — значение ее силы.', 'type': 'Существо — Гидра', 'flavor': 'Бывалые путешественники утверждают, что гидры сами откусывают себе головы, чтобы стать еще опаснее.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381919&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da5b292a-516c-4643-9618-a72fa68b99ab', 'multiverseId': 381919}, 'multiverseid': 381919}, {'name': '英雄灾祸', 'text': '英雄灾祸进战场时上面有四个+1/+1指示物。\\n{2}{G}{G}：在英雄灾祸上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为其力量。', 'type': '生物～多头龙', 'flavor': '旅人间相传着：多头龙会咬掉自己的头，以便变得更致命。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380599&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ca092de-9537-4452-91da-447607225c18', 'multiverseId': 380599}, 'multiverseid': 380599}, {'name': '英雄災禍', 'text': '英雄災禍進戰場時上面有四個+1/+1指示物。\\n{2}{G}{G}：在英雄災禍上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為其力量。', 'type': '生物～多頭龍', 'flavor': '旅人間相傳著：多頭龍會咬掉自己的頭，以便變得更致命。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380764&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08ceecaf-d90a-4988-bc89-7d6c43ae7aa1', 'multiverseId': 380764}, 'multiverseid': 380764}]", "[{'name': 'Hemmende Strahlen', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht angreifen oder blocken, falls ihr Beherrscher nicht {3} bezahlt.\\nAktivierte Fähigkeiten der verzauberten Kreatur kosten beim Aktivieren {3} mehr.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380960&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae7bdf94-1254-4a16-9749-8343a7e48b6c', 'multiverseId': 380960}, 'multiverseid': 380960}, {'name': 'Rayos opresivos', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede atacar o bloquear a menos que su controlador pague {3}.\\nCuesta {3} más activar las habilidades activadas de la criatura encantada.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382115&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f11a0702-1f8e-4ed0-89cd-e0ee298a9d6f', 'multiverseId': 382115}, 'multiverseid': 382115}, {'name': 'Rayons oppressants', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut pas attaquer ou bloquer à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {3}.\\nLes capacités activées de la créature enchantée coûtent {3} de plus à activer.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381125&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f15b0c4-f26e-4285-ad39-f860320177f6', 'multiverseId': 381125}, 'multiverseid': 381125}, {'name': 'Raggi Opprimenti', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata non può attaccare o bloccare a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {3}.\\nLe abilità attivate della creatura incantata costano {3} in più per essere attivate.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381290&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92964caa-fb8c-46cc-9250-0b565f24b6e8', 'multiverseId': 381290}, 'multiverseid': 381290}, {'name': '抑圧的な光線', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それのコントローラーが{3}を支払わないかぎり、攻撃したりブロックしたりできない。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーの起動型能力は、それを起動するためのコストが{3}多くなる。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381455&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e010cd24-3f04-4392-826d-52e78fdc0333', 'multiverseId': 381455}, 'multiverseid': 381455}, {'name': '숨막히는 광선', 'text': '생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 그 생물의 조종자가 {3}을 지불하지 않는 한 공격하거나 방어할 수 없다.\\n부여된 생물의 활성화 능력은 활성화하는 데 {3}이 더 든다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381620&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19f1192c-5b86-474e-a355-59f3b931c1ac', 'multiverseId': 381620}, 'multiverseid': 381620}, {'name': 'Raios Opressores', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada não pode atacar ou bloquear a menos que seu controlador pague {3}.\\nAs habilidades ativadas da criatura encantada custam {3} a mais para serem ativadas.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381785&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea200652-e8d6-4d80-a3a9-7c08678de39f', 'multiverseId': 381785}, 'multiverseid': 381785}, {'name': 'Лучи Подавления', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо не может атаковать или блокировать, если только контролирующий его игрок не заплатит {3}.\\nАктивация активируемых способностей зачарованного существа стоит на {3} больше.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381950&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82ab696b-20d3-4be8-af37-4411bc444421', 'multiverseId': 381950}, 'multiverseid': 381950}, {'name': '压迫射线', 'text': '结附于生物\\n除非所结附之生物的操控者支付{3}，否则它不能进行攻击或阻挡。\\n所结附之生物的起动式异能增加{3}来起动。', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380630&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44245e37-bcdd-4b75-946c-308c2af38da7', 'multiverseId': 380630}, 'multiverseid': 380630}, {'name': '壓迫射線', 'text': '結附於生物\\n除非所結附之生物的操控者支付{3}，否則它不能進行攻擊或阻擋。\\n所結附之生物的起動式異能增加{3}來起動。', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380795&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53d9248f-5334-4bc9-8bd4-19d9d5fff504', 'multiverseId': 380795}, 'multiverseid': 380795}]", '[{\'name\': \'Himmelsbindung\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn die Himmelsbindung oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die keine Verzauberung ist, ins Exil. Bringe diese Karte zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a338bd06-2aec-4a4d-babb-dfc2ee65c9ce\', \'multiverseId\': 380995}, \'multiverseid\': 380995}, {\'name\': \'Vínculo celeste\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Vínculo celeste u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea un encantamiento. Regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'455aa43a-55d7-49dc-9947-712278c82292\', \'multiverseId\': 382150}, \'multiverseid\': 382150}, {\'name\': \'Lien céleste\', \'text\': \'Constellation — À chaque fois que le Lien céleste ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, exilez un permanent non-enchantement ciblé. Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e31c8fb3-4062-4525-a00f-73416652ad9e\', \'multiverseId\': 381160}, \'multiverseid\': 381160}, {\'name\': \'Vincolo Celeste\', \'text\': "Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta il Vincolo Celeste o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, esilia un permanente non incantesimo bersaglio. Rimetti sul campo di battaglia quella carta sotto il controllo del suo proprietario all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bf18efa-527a-4065-b994-221ca4718744\', \'multiverseId\': 381325}, \'multiverseid\': 381325}, {\'name\': \'空封じ\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 空封じか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、エンチャントでないパーマネント１つを対象とし、それを追放する。次の終了ステップの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a07ef8-b447-427e-b8ff-bda15b00feac\', \'multiverseId\': 381490}, \'multiverseid\': 381490}, {\'name\': \'하늘 결박\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 하늘 결박이나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 부여마법이 아닌 지속물을 목표로 정한다. 그 지속물을 추방한다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그렇게 추방된 카드를 소유자의 조종 하에 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d6b565b-6f4d-4e1c-ac78-9b7de9b10f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 381655}, \'multiverseid\': 381655}, {\'name\': \'Prisão Celeste\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Prisão Celeste ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, exile a permanente alvo que não seja encantamento. Devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3787a2f-4699-4263-b818-2b6e3bd35fb3\', \'multiverseId\': 381820}, \'multiverseid\': 381820}, {\'name\': \'Небесное Связывание\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Небесное Связывание или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, изгоните целевой не являющийся чарами перманент. Верните ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'765b11fb-768a-4161-9a00-aa1d69f50ae9\', \'multiverseId\': 381985}, \'multiverseid\': 381985}, {\'name\': \'缚空咒\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当缚空咒或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，放逐目标非结界的永久物。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将所放逐的牌在其拥有者的操控下返回战场。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0822dba-36b6-433a-8891-30fed3828cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 380665}, \'multiverseid\': 380665}, {\'name\': \'縛空咒\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當縛空咒或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，放逐目標非結界的永久物。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將所放逐的牌在其擁有者的操控下返回戰場。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e8b3af-691a-44af-a0ab-df8127a0c8fe\', \'multiverseId\': 380830}, \'multiverseid\': 380830}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelsspeer-Kavallerie\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDoppelschlag (Diese Kreatur fügt sowohl Erstschlags- als auch normalen Kampfschaden zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Bete, dass ihr Speer dich zuerst erreicht. Ihr Greif ist nicht so gnädig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba78d5d-36e4-435f-b6de-bdb00dc2cbf2\', \'multiverseId\': 380996}, \'multiverseid\': 380996}, {\'name\': \'Caballería de lanceras celestes\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nDaña dos veces. (Esta criatura daña primero y también hace daño de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'Reza para que su lanza te alcance primero. Su grifo es menos agradable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eafcecb-d358-4916-8565-e8189e81cc49\', \'multiverseId\': 382151}, \'multiverseid\': 382151}, {\'name\': \'Cavalerie lanceciel\', \'text\': "Vol\\nDouble initiative (Cette créature inflige des blessures de combat d\'initiative et des blessures de combat normales.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Priez d\'être frappé d\'abord par sa lance. Son griffon est moins charitable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2b5dfc-251f-474c-8d8c-ff0b90aa5fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 381161}, \'multiverseid\': 381161}, {\'name\': \'Cavalleria della Lancia Celeste\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nDoppio attacco (Questa creatura infligge sia danno da combattimento da attacco improvviso che danno da combattimento regolare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Prega che la sua lancia ti raggiunga per prima. Il suo grifone è meno clemente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68089f3b-5e2c-4ac6-9c22-a178d5a3fb76\', \'multiverseId\': 381326}, \'multiverseid\': 381326}, {\'name\': \'空槍の騎兵\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n二段攻撃（このクリーチャーは先制攻撃と通常の戦闘ダメージの両方を与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の槍が先に到達するように祈ることだ。彼女のグリフィンはそこまで優しくはないからな。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbbec1e1-d74b-4c34-8103-04c1bfce711c\', \'multiverseId\': 381491}, \'multiverseid\': 381491}, {\'name\': \'하늘창 기병\', \'text\': \'비행\\n이단공격 (이 생물은 선제공격 전투피해와 일반 전투피해를 같이 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'그녀가 던지는 창에 먼저 맞기를 기도하라. 그녀의 그리핀보다는 창이 더 자비로울 테니.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57146077-914b-4f37-9472-8ced8448eb0a\', \'multiverseId\': 381656}, \'multiverseid\': 381656}, {\'name\': \'Cavalaria da Lança Celeste\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nGolpe duplo (Esta criatura causa tanto o dano de iniciativa quanto o de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Torça para que a lança atinja você primeiro. O grifo dela é menos piedoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ac0d16-5698-4ad1-b8d2-2d57b60eedee\', \'multiverseId\': 381821}, \'multiverseid\': 381821}, {\'name\': \'Верховая Небесная Копейщица\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nДвойной удар (Это существо наносит боевые повреждения как на этапе Первого удара, так и на этапе обычных повреждений.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Молись, чтобы первым тебя достало ее копье. Ее грифон не так милосерден.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf34d5c8-99bd-4711-afc9-85f5fdfac2ca\', \'multiverseId\': 381986}, \'multiverseid\': 381986}, {\'name\': \'空矛骑兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n连击（此生物能造成先攻伤害以及普通战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'祈祷她的长矛先刺中你吧，落入她的狮鹫爪下只会更惨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'744f70a3-2098-4410-a312-f775e846e089\', \'multiverseId\': 380666}, \'multiverseid\': 380666}, {\'name\': \'空矛騎兵\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n連擊（此生物能造成先攻傷害以及普通戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'祈禱她的長矛先刺中你吧，落入她的獅鷲爪下只會更慘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64cf860d-56e9-40ac-ad34-b7de46550038\', \'multiverseId\': 380831}, \'multiverseid\': 380831}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hirnmade\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Hirnmade ins Spiel kommt, zeigt ein Gegner deiner Wahl die Karten auf seiner Hand offen vor, und du bestimmst eine Karte darunter, die kein Land ist. Schicke diese Karte ins Exil, bis die Hirnmade das Spiel verlässt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48b662c6-b132-4528-884c-21f3f1ccfd57\', \'multiverseId\': 380877}, \'multiverseid\': 380877}, {\'name\': \'Larva cerebral\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Larva cerebral entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo muestra su mano y tú eliges de ahí una carta que no sea tierra. Exilia esa carta hasta que la Larva cerebral deje el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Insecto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f07ca36c-ea70-40af-9025-5152a08135c6\', \'multiverseId\': 382032}, \'multiverseid\': 382032}, {\'name\': \'Ver de cervelle\', \'text\': "Quand le Ver de cervelle arrive sur le champ de bataille, l\'adversaire ciblé révèle sa main et vous y choisissez une carte non-terrain. Exilez cette carte jusqu\'à ce que le Ver de cervelle quitte le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : insecte\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381042&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'103eb6e3-c4b9-4a81-bc2a-fa860011a756\', \'multiverseId\': 381042}, \'multiverseid\': 381042}, {\'name\': \'Larva Cerebrale\', \'text\': \'Quando la Larva Cerebrale entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio rivela la sua mano e tu scegli una carta non terra da essa. Esilia quella carta finché la Larva Cerebrale non lascia il campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Insetto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad4eb7a-b8c1-4f6d-a820-fbc2b26ac6c5\', \'multiverseId\': 381207}, \'multiverseid\': 381207}, {\'name\': \'脳蛆\', \'text\': \'脳蛆が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札を公開し、あなたはその中から土地でないカードを１枚選ぶ。そのカードを脳蛆が戦場を離れるまで追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3777025a-74fd-47e6-9c74-2b11e7683256\', \'multiverseId\': 381372}, \'multiverseid\': 381372}, {\'name\': \'뇌 구더기\', \'text\': \'뇌 구더기가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 자신의 손에 있는 카드를 공개하고 당신은 그 중 대지가 아닌 카드 하나를 선택한다. 뇌 구더기가 전장을 떠날 때까지 그 카드를 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 곤충\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b82d540-9f3a-4293-88cb-04e42a1cfffc\', \'multiverseId\': 381537}, \'multiverseid\': 381537}, {\'name\': \'Verme Cerebral\', \'text\': \'Quando Verme Cerebral entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo revela a própria mão e você escolhe um card dela que não seja um terreno. Exile aquele card até Verme Cerebral deixar o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Inseto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d970a0c-7461-4318-a59d-1f7f49086912\', \'multiverseId\': 381702}, \'multiverseid\': 381702}, {\'name\': \'Мозговой Червь\', \'text\': \'Когда Мозговой Червь выходит на поле битвы, целевой оппонент показывает свою руку, и вы выбираете из нее не являющуюся землей карту. Изгоните ту карту до тех пор, пока Мозговой Червь не покинет поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Насекомое\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fad35f1-1297-45c4-83c9-8082ea4d3c7f\', \'multiverseId\': 381867}, \'multiverseid\': 381867}, {\'name\': \'坏脑蛆\', \'text\': \'当坏脑蛆进战场时，目标对手展示其手牌且你选择其中一张非地牌。放逐该牌，直到坏脑蛆离开战场为止。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～昆虫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e04e5168-e88a-4d5d-8771-f7549a1022c8\', \'multiverseId\': 380547}, \'multiverseid\': 380547}, {\'name\': \'壞腦蛆\', \'text\': \'當壞腦蛆進戰場時，目標對手展示其手牌且你選擇其中一張非地牌。放逐該牌，直到壞腦蛆離開戰場為止。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～昆蟲\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'340aaf7e-2e4f-4219-a687-8b728716cfd8\', \'multiverseId\': 380712}, \'multiverseid\': 380712}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hohepriester von Tethmos\', \'text\': \'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der den Hohepriester von Tethmos als Ziel hat, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Tod ist Tyrannei. Und jeder Tyrannei muss ein Ende gesetzt werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ae38bd5-d11d-4248-a608-10589b2eb13e\', \'multiverseId\': 381011}, \'multiverseid\': 381011}, {\'name\': \'Gran sacerdote de Tetmos\', \'text\': \'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo al Gran sacerdote de Tetmos, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con un coste de maná convertido de 2 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo felino\', \'flavor\': \'"La muerte es tiranía. Y como tal, debemos oponernos a ella".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb8eb17f-2394-41cf-9dc8-bd324bca3b06\', \'multiverseId\': 382166}, \'multiverseid\': 382166}, {\'name\': \'Grand prêtre de Tethmos\', \'text\': \'Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible le Grand prêtre de Tethmos, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée de votre cimetière avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 2.\', \'type\': \'Créature : chat et clerc\', \'flavor\': "« La mort est une tyrannie. Comme toute tyrannie, il faut s\'y opposer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381176&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2292fb6d-b020-4b16-940b-dc2a6af20036\', \'multiverseId\': 381176}, \'multiverseid\': 381176}, {\'name\': \'Sommo Sacerdote di Tethmos\', \'text\': \'Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia il Sommo Sacerdote di Tethmos, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 2 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"La morte è tirannide. Come tutti i despoti, deve essere contrastata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02f8aa78-5d43-4154-a230-4b14ba9983ae\', \'multiverseId\': 381341}, \'multiverseid\': 381341}, {\'name\': \'テツモスの大神官\', \'text\': \'英雄的 ― あなたがテツモスの大神官を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、あなたの墓地にある点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「死は圧政である。他の圧政と同様に、それは抵抗されなければならない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8118f331-9cae-4394-8615-0b94f946070f\', \'multiverseId\': 381506}, \'multiverseid\': 381506}, {\'name\': \'테스모스 고위 성직자\', \'text\': \'영웅 — 테스모스 고위 성직자를 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 2 이하인 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 성직자\', \'flavor\': "\'죽음은 폭정이다. 모든 폭정에 그러하듯, 이에도 저항해야만 한다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ace48e7-58eb-4b8e-acef-a445777abb60\', \'multiverseId\': 381671}, \'multiverseid\': 381671}, {\'name\': \'Alto Sacerdote de Tétimos\', \'text\': \'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Alto Sacerdote de Tétimos, devolva o card de criatura alvo com custo de mana convertido de 2 ou menos do seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'"A morte é uma tirania. Como toda tirania, ela deve ser combatida."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caae5d34-5b02-4ed9-af38-2e1014cdf7ec\', \'multiverseId\': 381836}, \'multiverseid\': 381836}, {\'name\': \'Верховный Жрец Тетма\', \'text\': \'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Верховный Жрец Тетма, верните целевую карту существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью 2 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Священник\', \'flavor\': \'«Смерть — это тирания. И как с любой тиранией, с ней нужно бороться».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbff7ed7-fcb8-4d48-8892-1e29edd0b93f\', \'multiverseId\': 382001}, \'multiverseid\': 382001}, {\'name\': \'忒特摩斯高阶僧侣\', \'text\': \'勇行～每当你施放一个以忒特摩斯高阶僧侣为目标的咒语时，将目标总法术力费用等于或小于2的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡如同暴政，而暴政必遭反抗。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22cce9cf-c7b9-4ef5-ab6a-5bb9185159fe\', \'multiverseId\': 380681}, \'multiverseid\': 380681}, {\'name\': \'忒特摩斯高階僧侶\', \'text\': \'勇行～每當你施放一個以忒特摩斯高階僧侶為目標的咒語時，將目標總魔法力費用等於或小於2的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡如同暴政，而暴政必遭反抗。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ce6132f-32d2-49fc-a3d8-73755cb28ab2\', \'multiverseId\': 380846}, \'multiverseid\': 380846}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hybris\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und alle an sie angelegten Auren auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Du möchtest etwas über Nyx erfahren? So sei es." —Phenax, Gott der Täuschung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b114fc70-d611-4db1-833c-28521dcd69f2\', \'multiverseId\': 380931}, \'multiverseid\': 380931}, {\'name\': \'Arrogancia\', \'text\': \'Regresa la criatura objetivo y todas las auras anexadas a ella a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Deseas aprender de Nyx? Muy bien". —Fenax, dios del engaño\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b3a71f-3eee-4c84-85ff-2a659d551942\', \'multiverseId\': 382086}, \'multiverseid\': 382086}, {\'name\': \'Hubris\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez une créature ciblée et toutes les auras qui lui sont attachées dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous voulez connaître Nyx ? Très bien. » —Phénax, dieu de la Fourberie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381096&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4f1f74-80d8-4336-ab73-ca027731d996\', \'multiverseId\': 381096}, \'multiverseid\': 381096}, {\'name\': \'Hybris\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare una creatura bersaglio e tutte le Aure ad essa assegnate in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Desideri conoscere Nyx? Molto bene." —Fenax, dio dell\\\'inganno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f8e4c9-44b9-48df-9d45-1affeca32031\', \'multiverseId\': 381261}, \'multiverseid\': 381261}, {\'name\': \'傲慢\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それとそれにつけられているすべてのオーラをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ニクスについて知りたいと申すか？よろしい。」 ――欺瞞の神、フィナックス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ceeae98-0598-4565-a762-d0062c175eb5\', \'multiverseId\': 381426}, \'multiverseid\': 381426}, {\'name\': \'오만\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물과 그 생물에 부착된 모든 마법진을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': "\'닉스에 대해 더 알고 싶은가? 잘 됐군.\' —속임수의 신 페낙스", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'573e39d0-d004-4eaa-9b94-3c9f67f210ef\', \'multiverseId\': 381591}, \'multiverseid\': 381591}, {\'name\': \'Arrogância\', \'text\': \'Devolva a criatura alvo e todas as Auras anexadas a ela para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Você deseja aprender sobre Nyx? Pois bem." — Fenax, deus da enganação\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'736b9b2a-cec7-491d-9068-782765b609fb\', \'multiverseId\': 381756}, \'multiverseid\': 381756}, {\'name\': \'Спесь\', \'text\': \'Верните целевое существо и все прикрепленные к нему Ауры в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты хочешь узнать про Никс? Что ж, хорошо». — Фенакс, бог обмана\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfebce7e-848f-4286-8b86-e4a48bad9215\', \'multiverseId\': 381921}, \'multiverseid\': 381921}, {\'name\': \'傲睨\', \'text\': \'将目标生物及结附于其上的所有灵气移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你希望了解尼兹？很好。」 ～欺瞒神斐纳克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cdb7eb6-91b1-4b43-9301-b7beea1c097f\', \'multiverseId\': 380601}, \'multiverseid\': 380601}, {\'name\': \'傲睨\', \'text\': \'將目標生物及結附於其上的所有靈氣移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「你希望了解尼茲？很好。」 ～欺瞞神斐納克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c11526d3-0b89-4367-a935-818008b1cbcf\', \'multiverseId\': 380766}, \'multiverseid\': 380766}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hydra-Brutwächterin\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: Monstrum X. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nWenn die Hydra-Brutwächterin monströs wird, bringe X X/X grüne Hydra-Kreaturenspielsteine ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97dad31d-37c9-4e87-9825-354794a97628\', \'multiverseId\': 380933}, \'multiverseid\': 380933}, {\'name\': \'Hidra ama de la progenie\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: Monstruosidad X. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nCuando la Hidra ama de la progenie se convierta en monstruosa, pon en el campo de batalla X fichas de criatura Hidra verdes X/X.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7cbdf39-e884-4e92-a146-d95b870a5a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 382088}, \'multiverseid\': 382088}, {\'name\': \'Maître de couvée hydre\', \'text\': "{X}{X}{G} : Monstruosité X. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nQuand le Maître de couvée hydre devient monstrueux, mettez sur le champ de bataille X jetons de créature X/X verte Hydre.", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1f68611-0297-4375-aa12-f0d38dea92f5\', \'multiverseId\': 381098}, \'multiverseid\': 381098}, {\'name\': \'Idra Protettrice della Covata\', \'text\': "{X}{X}{G}: Mostruosità X. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nQuando l\'Idra Protettrice della Covata diventa mostruosa, metti sul campo di battaglia X pedine creatura Idra X/X verdi.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb586d38-f9dc-4a1e-9fc8-cf6e08b640e2\', \'multiverseId\': 381263}, \'multiverseid\': 381263}, {\'name\': \'ハイドラの繁殖主\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}：怪物化Ｘを行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\nハイドラの繁殖主が怪物的になったとき、緑のＸ/Ｘのハイドラ・クリーチャー・トークンをＸ体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'961d6286-214f-46d6-8c2d-9f6ff8582513\', \'multiverseId\': 381428}, \'multiverseid\': 381428}, {\'name\': \'번식하는 히드라\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: 괴수화 X. (이 생물이 괴수화하지 않았다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 X 개를 올려놓는다. 이 생물은 괴수화한다.)\\n번식하는 히드라가 괴수화할 때, X/X 녹색 히드라 토큰 X개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 히드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381593&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6711a25-0170-49e5-a6f9-e9ad8c21a9c7\', \'multiverseId\': 381593}, \'multiverseid\': 381593}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Criadeira\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: Monstruosidade X. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\\nQuando Hidra Criadeira se tornar monstruosa, coloque no campo de batalha X fichas de criatura verde X/X do tipo Hidra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e31a2066-360f-4252-b0b0-bc87993a7d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 381758}, \'multiverseid\': 381758}, {\'name\': \'Гидра-Породительница\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}: Чудовищность X. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него X жетонов +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\\nКогда Гидра-Породительница становится чудовищной, положите на поле битвы X фишек существа X/X зеленая Гидра.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a7b1bd3-5c45-45c8-9824-c1092d0d6026\', \'multiverseId\': 381923}, \'multiverseid\': 381923}, {\'name\': \'护卵多头龙\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}：蛮化X。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物且它蛮化。）\\n当护卵多头龙蛮化时，将X个X/X绿色多头龙衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a26f4f5c-776b-473a-aa4e-5e19d9e0dafa\', \'multiverseId\': 380603}, \'multiverseid\': 380603}, {\'name\': \'護卵多頭龍\', \'text\': \'{X}{X}{G}：蠻化X。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物且它蠻化。）\\n當護卵多頭龍蠻化時，將X個X/X綠色多頭龍衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物～多頭龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03b2c989-332d-40a7-9eb0-0922521e4594\', \'multiverseId\': 380768}, \'multiverseid\': 380768}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hypnotische Sirene\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {5}{U}{U} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nFliegend\\nDu kontrollierst die verzauberte Kreatur.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Sirene\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07f2f23a-4306-44ba-b151-e38d9b88f02f\', \'multiverseId\': 380934}, \'multiverseid\': 380934}, {\'name\': \'Sirena hipnótica\', \'text\': \'Concesión {5}{U}{U}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nVuela.\\nTú controlas la criatura encantada.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Sirena\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95ff805f-44ee-404e-ac71-7ce2df6b4189\', \'multiverseId\': 382089}, \'multiverseid\': 382089}, {\'name\': \'Sirène hypnotique\', \'text\': "Grâce {5}{U}{U} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nVol\\nVous contrôlez la créature enchantée.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 et a le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : sirène\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381099&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0aab08a-5330-4809-a92b-e65e94ba7b48\', \'multiverseId\': 381099}, \'multiverseid\': 381099}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Ipnotica\', \'text\': \'Conferire {5}{U}{U} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nVolare\\nControlli la creatura incantata.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 e ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Sirena\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3811445-3f19-4c7e-9093-f774749a4335\', \'multiverseId\': 381264}, \'multiverseid\': 381264}, {\'name\': \'惑乱のセイレーン\', \'text\': \'授与 {5}{U}{U} （このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\n飛行\\nあなたはエンチャントされているクリーチャーをコントロールする。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — セイレーン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cade74c8-62ba-41e2-8ef0-c4f6523fe406\', \'multiverseId\': 381429}, \'multiverseid\': 381429}, {\'name\': \'최면 세이렌\', \'text\': \'권능 {5}{U}{U} (이 카드의 권능 비용을 지불하고 발동하면, 이 카드는 생물에게 부여하는 마법진 주문이다. 이 카드는 생물에 부착되지 않은 상태가 되면 다시 생물이 된다.)\\n비행\\n당신이 부여된 생물을 조종한다.\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받고 비행을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 세이렌\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6bf0f12-009a-482b-a0ed-5d05a81b5a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 381594}, \'multiverseid\': 381594}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Hipnótica\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {5}{U}{U} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nVoar\\nVocê controla a criatura encantada.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 e tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Sirena\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f38597d2-0575-4174-909b-e1beeaeef789\', \'multiverseId\': 381759}, \'multiverseid\': 381759}, {\'name\': \'Гипнотическая Сирена\', \'text\': \'Дар {5}{U}{U} (Если вы разыгрываете эту карту за ее стоимость Дара, она является заклинанием Ауры со способностью «зачаровать существо». Она снова становится существом, если не прикреплена к существу.)\\nПолет\\nВы контролируете зачарованное существо.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 и имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Сирена\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b97cbd7-6ffd-4783-9875-75b1c6d8b624\', \'multiverseId\': 381924}, \'multiverseid\': 381924}, {\'name\': \'催眠塞连\', \'text\': \'神授{5}{U}{U}（如果你支付此牌的神授费用来施放它，则它便是具「结附于生物」的灵气咒语。如果它未结附于生物上，就会再度成为生物。）\\n飞行\\n你操控所结附的生物。\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1且具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～塞连\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c04e446e-9894-4407-942b-4185ab846704\', \'multiverseId\': 380604}, \'multiverseid\': 380604}, {\'name\': \'催眠塞連\', \'text\': \'神授{5}{U}{U}（如果你支付此牌的神授費用來施放它，則它便是具「結附於生物」的靈氣咒語。如果它未結附於生物上，就會再度成為生物。）\\n飛行\\n你操控所結附的生物。\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1且具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～塞連\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a1e2b1-259c-4c98-9e31-314f037d88f3\', \'multiverseId\': 380769}, \'multiverseid\': 380769}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hörnerhagel\', \'text\': \'Bringe zwei 2/3 rote Minotaurus-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Eile ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Minotaurus kann zwischen Menschen, Satyren und Tritoniern keinen Unterschied erkennen. Fleisch ist Fleisch.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380911&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d09b2aa-2177-4b58-9f2c-20c9880a0077\', \'multiverseId\': 380911}, \'multiverseid\': 380911}, {\'name\': \'Ráfaga de cuernos\', \'text\': \'Pon en el campo de batalla dos fichas de criatura Minotauro rojas 2/3 con la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Un minotauro no distingue entre humano, sátiro y tritónido. Todos son carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90a76a98-07df-4567-a683-01db1b661e5d\', \'multiverseId\': 382066}, \'multiverseid\': 382066}, {\'name\': \'Concert de cornes\', \'text\': \'Mettez sur le champ de bataille deux jetons de créature 2/3 rouge Minotaure avec la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Un minotaure ne fait pas la différence entre un humain, un satyre et un triton. C\'est toujours de la viande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381076&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b77d80f-6dfc-4b55-8f71-69c23ab58acc\', \'multiverseId\': 381076}, \'multiverseid\': 381076}, {\'name\': \'Raffica di Corna\', \'text\': \'Metti sul campo di battaglia due pedine creatura Minotauro 2/3 rosse con rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Un minotauro non distingue tra umani, satiri e marinidi. Sono tutti carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e4b8c5-daf5-46b5-9c15-d53b489a5051\', \'multiverseId\': 381241}, \'multiverseid\': 381241}, {\'name\': \'双角の連続襲撃\', \'text\': \'速攻を持つ赤の２/３のミノタウルス・クリーチャー・トークンを２体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ミノタウルスは人間とサテュロスとトリトンを区別しない。それらはすべて肉である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ee32c30-0641-426f-8585-eb999757dbc5\', \'multiverseId\': 381406}, \'multiverseid\': 381406}, {\'name\': \'뿔 달린 질풍\', \'text\': \'신속을 가진 2/3 적색 미노타우로스 생물 토큰 두 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'미노타우로스는 인간과 사티로스, 트리톤을 구별하지 않는다. 다 고기일 뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28e93f11-d16a-4ad4-b7c3-d0d2bd0d7a4c\', \'multiverseId\': 381571}, \'multiverseid\': 381571}, {\'name\': \'Comoção de Chifres\', \'text\': \'Coloque no campo de batalha duas fichas de criatura vermelhas 2/3 do tipo Minotauro com ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Um minotauro não vê diferença entre humanos, sátiros e talassidos. Todos são carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae53bff-7508-46c7-acd5-243263973380\', \'multiverseId\': 381736}, \'multiverseid\': 381736}, {\'name\': \'Вихрь Рогов\', \'text\': \'Положите на поле битвы две фишки существа 2/3 красный Минотавр с Ускорением.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Минотавр не различает людей, сатиров и тритонов. Для него это все мясо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255f0782-3c72-41d6-bc74-61409ba70532\', \'multiverseId\': 381901}, \'multiverseid\': 381901}, {\'name\': \'犄角疾刺\', \'text\': \'将两个2/3红色，具敏捷异能的牛头怪衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'牛头怪分辨不出人类、羊蹄人和屈东。就都是肉类而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'722df592-7c4f-4318-83ad-fed9e76837dc\', \'multiverseId\': 380581}, \'multiverseid\': 380581}, {\'name\': \'犄角疾刺\', \'text\': \'將兩個2/3紅色，具敏捷異能的牛頭怪衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'牛頭怪分辨不出人類、羊蹄人和屈東。就都是肉類而已。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8d8a6ab-1563-4e83-a747-5920615a555c\', \'multiverseId\': 380746}, \'multiverseid\': 380746}]', '[{\'name\': \'In die Dunkelheit\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält -2/-0 und kann nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'In seiner Verzweiflung flehte der Soldat Phenax an, er möge ihm die Kraft geben, dem Blick der Gorgo zu entkommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dd5b3cd-cc59-4d94-b179-3d567985ee1f\', \'multiverseId\': 380878}, \'multiverseid\': 380878}, {\'name\': \'Lanzar hacia las tinieblas\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene -2/-0 y no puede bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Desesperado, el soldado rezó a Fenax y le imploró la fuerza para burlar la mirada de la gorgona.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc79a1c2-4e0f-485d-bea8-f0f36959bb5b\', \'multiverseId\': 382033}, \'multiverseid\': 382033}, {\'name\': \'Projeter dans les ténèbres\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne -2/-0 et ne peut pas bloquer.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'En désespoir de cause, le soldat supplia Phénax de lui donner le pouvoir de résister au regard de la gorgone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381043&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'babfc041-7aad-4ba2-8b74-559f0727ef96\', \'multiverseId\': 381043}, \'multiverseid\': 381043}, {\'name\': "Gettare nell\'Oscurità", \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende -2/-0 e non può bloccare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Disperato, il soldato pregò Fenax perché gli concedesse il potere di sfuggire allo sguardo della gorgone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76dbec3a-2588-4895-a9a5-661338331edf\', \'multiverseId\': 381208}, \'multiverseid\': 381208}, {\'name\': \'闇への投入\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、－２/－０の修整を受けるとともに、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'絶望の中で兵士たちは、ゴルゴンの視線を欺く力を求めてフィナックスに祈りをささげた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd283c20-6c8d-4d38-af31-dfa980c17dc3\', \'multiverseId\': 381373}, \'multiverseid\': 381373}, {\'name\': \'암흑에 빠지다\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 -2/-0을 받으며 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'절망 속에서 병사는 페낙스에게 고르곤의 눈을 속일 힘을 빌며 기도했다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9223480-b9a3-462c-b28c-abbadaefbcb0\', \'multiverseId\': 381538}, \'multiverseid\': 381538}, {\'name\': \'Lançar na Escuridão\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe -2/-0 e não pode bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'No desespero, o soldado rezou para Fenax, implorando pelo poder de enganar o olhar da górgona.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5ba9e3c-76df-491f-bfde-0fc70ad230f9\', \'multiverseId\': 381703}, \'multiverseid\': 381703}, {\'name\': \'Низвержение во Тьму\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает -2/-0 и не может блокировать.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'В отчаянии солдат взмолился Фенаксу, прося сил выдержать взгляд горгоны.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5130c53a-f348-443e-aa6d-bd2c14e55c9a\', \'multiverseId\': 381868}, \'multiverseid\': 381868}, {\'name\': \'没入黑暗\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得-2/-0且不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'士兵绝望地向斐纳克祈祷，恳求他赐予可以避开蛇发妖瞪视的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48689b2c-b35d-4c36-8499-32a2a3fa4624\', \'multiverseId\': 380548}, \'multiverseid\': 380548}, {\'name\': \'沒入黑暗\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得-2/-0且不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'士兵絕望地向斐納克祈禱，懇求他賜予可以避開蛇髮妖瞪視的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03973051-5985-40ea-a79a-8317dc54c8e4\', \'multiverseId\': 380713}, \'multiverseid\': 380713}]', '[{\'name\': \'Iroas, Gott des Sieges\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Rot und Weiß weniger als sieben beträgt, ist Iroas keine Kreatur.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, können nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.\\nVerhindere allen Schaden, der angreifenden Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f4f770-7b26-462a-99e0-b73836b0f160\', \'multiverseId\': 380936}, \'multiverseid\': 380936}, {\'name\': \'Iroas, dios de la victoria\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al rojo y al blanco sea menor que siete, Iroas no es una criatura.\\nLas criaturas que controlas no pueden ser bloqueadas excepto por dos o más criaturas.\\nPrevén todo el daño que se les fuera a hacer a las criaturas atacantes que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af0e6a9e-cfdd-480c-a2bd-7c40e72367dc\', \'multiverseId\': 382091}, \'multiverseid\': 382091}, {\'name\': \'Iroas, dieu de la Victoire\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au rouge et au blanc est inférieure à sept, Iroas n\'est pas une créature.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas être bloquées excepté par deux créatures ou plus.\\nPrévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées aux créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e00c395-0ee8-47b4-807c-b8e6a8892578\', \'multiverseId\': 381101}, \'multiverseid\': 381101}, {\'name\': \'Iroas, Dio della Vittoria\', \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nFintanto che la tua devozione al rosso e al bianco è inferiore a sette, Iroas non è una creatura.\\nLe creature che controlli non possono essere bloccate tranne che da due o più creature.\\nPrevieni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto alle creature attaccanti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66edc100-4720-471e-9170-6b931df1bb48\', \'multiverseId\': 381266}, \'multiverseid\': 381266}, {\'name\': \'勝利の神、イロアス\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの赤と白への信心が７未満であるかぎり、勝利の神、イロアスはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは、２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。\\nあなたがコントロールする攻撃クリーチャーに与えられるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb350209-9157-4552-ae38-d30c5d6c509a\', \'multiverseId\': 381431}, \'multiverseid\': 381431}, {\'name\': \'승리의 신 이로아스\', \'text\': \'무적\\n당신의 적백 신앙심이 7 미만인 한, 이로아스는 생물이 아니다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물들은 두 개 이상의 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.\\n당신이 조종하는 공격생물들이 입으려고 하는 모든 피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c679b96c-a9d4-4b4f-aa6d-5e4c310bb676\', \'multiverseId\': 381596}, \'multiverseid\': 381596}, {\'name\': \'Iroas, Deus da Vitória\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nEnquanto sua devoção ao vermelho e ao branco for menor que sete, Iroas não será uma criatura.\\nAs criaturas que você controla só podem ser bloqueadas por duas ou mais criaturas.\\nPrevina todo o dano que seria causado às criaturas atacantes que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4b9eac5-ccb4-4c6b-8c23-2fe60cb1f612\', \'multiverseId\': 381761}, \'multiverseid\': 381761}, {\'name\': \'Ирой, Бог Победы\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nПока ваша Преданность красному и белому меньше семи, Ирой не является существом.\\nСущества под вашим контролем не могут быть заблокированы менее чем двумя существами.\\nПредотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены атакующим существам под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'106b894b-4c4e-497d-8a68-5669a9912fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 381926}, \'multiverseid\': 381926}, {\'name\': \'胜利神伊洛安斯\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的红白两色献力小于七，伊洛安斯便不是生物。\\n由你操控的生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。\\n防止将对由你操控且进行攻击的生物造成的所有伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16a75bfa-4dc4-4093-90a6-aaf332e4de32\', \'multiverseId\': 380606}, \'multiverseid\': 380606}, {\'name\': \'勝利神伊洛安斯\', \'text\': \'不滅\\n只要你的紅白兩色獻力小於七，伊洛安斯便不是生物。\\n由你操控的生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。\\n防止將對由你操控且進行攻擊的生物造成的所有傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c320d6b-12fb-4bf6-9cdc-564806e8e3a6\', \'multiverseId\': 380771}, \'multiverseid\': 380771}]', '[{\'name\': \'Keranos, Gott der Stürme\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Blau und Rot weniger als sieben beträgt, ist Keranos keine Kreatur.\\nZeige die erste Karte, die du in jedem Zug ziehst, offen vor. Immer wenn du auf diese Weise eine Länderkarte vorzeigst, ziehe eine Karte. Immer wenn du auf diese Weise eine Karte vorzeigst, die kein Land ist, fügt Keranos einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa02acaa-8654-4fe6-9b33-6bcee1af3f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 380937}, \'multiverseid\': 380937}, {\'name\': \'Keranos, dios de las tormentas\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al azul y al rojo sea menor que siete, Keranos no es una criatura.\\nMuestra la primera carta que robes en cada uno de tus turnos. Siempre que muestres una carta de tierra de esta manera, roba una carta. Siempre que muestres una carta que no sea tierra de esta manera, Keranos hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f0c86f-d159-45cd-bb1b-e1f1d0277640\', \'multiverseId\': 382092}, \'multiverseid\': 382092}, {\'name\': \'Kéranos, dieu des Tempêtes\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au bleu et au rouge est inférieure à sept, Kéranos n\'est pas une créature.\\nRévélez la première carte que vous piochez à chacun de vos tours. À chaque fois que vous révélez une carte de terrain de cette manière, piochez une carte. À chaque fois que vous révélez une carte non-terrain de cette manière, Kéranos inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381102&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'503197bd-897a-47b5-83ba-84658ae89fc4\', \'multiverseId\': 381102}, \'multiverseid\': 381102}, {\'name\': \'Keranos, Dio delle Tempeste\', \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nFintanto che la tua devozione al blu e al rosso è inferiore a sette, Keranos non è una creatura.\\nRivela la prima carta che peschi in ciascuno dei tuoi turni. Ogniqualvolta riveli una carta terra in questo modo, pesca una carta. Ogniqualvolta riveli una carta non terra in questo modo, Keranos infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91730b24-2cac-4726-a7d4-3e0d3918562c\', \'multiverseId\': 381267}, \'multiverseid\': 381267}, {\'name\': \'嵐の神、ケラノス\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの青と赤への信心が７未満であるかぎり、嵐の神、ケラノスはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたの毎ターン、あなたが最初に引くカードを公開する。これによりあなたが土地カードを公開するたび、カードを１枚引く。これによりあなたが土地でないカードを公開するたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。嵐の神、ケラノスはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1d0c7df-a450-4653-86b7-3942cdc09a00\', \'multiverseId\': 381432}, \'multiverseid\': 381432}, {\'name\': \'폭풍의 신 케레노스\', \'text\': \'무적\\n당신의 청적 신앙심이 7 미만인 한, 케레노스는 생물이 아니다.\\n당신이 매 턴마다 뽑는 첫 카드를 공개한다. 당신이 이런 식으로 대지 카드를 공개할 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다. 당신이 이런 식으로 대지가 아닌 카드를 공개할 때마다, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 케레노스는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44e464f5-eb15-4579-8afc-a302c065f4cc\', \'multiverseId\': 381597}, \'multiverseid\': 381597}, {\'name\': \'Queranos, Deus das Tempestades\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nEnquanto sua devoção ao azul e ao vermelho for menor que sete, Queranos não será uma criatura.\\nRevele o primeiro card que você comprar a cada turno. Toda vez que revelar um card de terreno desta forma, compre um card. Toda vez que você revelar um card que não seja terreno desta forma, Queranos causará 3 pontos de dano ao jogador ou criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a7fd3a7-357f-4726-ab08-0550f1abf553\', \'multiverseId\': 381762}, \'multiverseid\': 381762}, {\'name\': \'Керан, Бог Бурь\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nПока ваша Преданность синему и красному меньше семи, Керан не является существом.\\nПокажите первую карту, которую вы берете в каждом вашем ходу. Каждый раз, когда вы таким образом показываете карту земли, возьмите карту. Каждый раз, когда вы таким образом показываете карту, не являющуюся землей, Керан наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fef860b2-35f0-4425-ad18-6eac538ca61c\', \'multiverseId\': 381927}, \'multiverseid\': 381927}, {\'name\': \'风暴神刻拉诺斯\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的蓝红两色献力小于七，刻拉诺斯便不是生物。\\n展示你在自己的每个回合中所抓的第一张牌。每当你以此法展示出一张地牌时，抓一张牌。每当你以此法展示出一张非地牌时，刻拉诺斯对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ff762c-d236-47ec-8789-066b73775ff0\', \'multiverseId\': 380607}, \'multiverseid\': 380607}, {\'name\': \'風暴神刻拉諾斯\', \'text\': \'不滅\\n只要你的藍紅兩色獻力小於七，刻拉諾斯便不是生物。\\n展示你在自己的每個回合中所抽的第一張牌。每當你以此法展示出一張地牌時，抽一張牌。每當你以此法展示出一張非地牌時，刻拉諾斯對目標生物或玩家造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e380eb5-b36d-4533-9ee0-878b6cbb3fa0\', \'multiverseId\': 380772}, \'multiverseid\': 380772}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kioras Rückruf\', \'text\': \'Streben — Kioras Rückruf kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {U} mehr.\\nBringe eine beliebige Anzahl an Verzauberungen deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ac041f-4d72-4acb-8b54-23b26678935a\', \'multiverseId\': 380939}, \'multiverseid\': 380939}, {\'name\': \'Destitución de Kiora\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Destitución de Kiora cuesta {U} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nRegresa cualquier cantidad de encantamientos objetivo a las manos de sus propietarios.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'621b4fe1-482e-4e65-9372-8d549bf6844b\', \'multiverseId\': 382094}, \'multiverseid\': 382094}, {\'name\': \'Rejet de Kiora\', \'text\': "Obstination — Le Rejet de Kiora coûte {U} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nRenvoyez n\'importe quel nombre d\'enchantements ciblés dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381104&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c7ea721-0d01-4f30-a39d-864824deed70\', \'multiverseId\': 381104}, \'multiverseid\': 381104}, {\'name\': \'Congedo di Kiora\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Il Congedo di Kiora costa {U} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nFai tornare un qualsiasi numero di incantesimi bersaglio in mano ai rispettivi proprietari.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fcf6cbd-b201-46d4-b189-a76e22a98eb4\', \'multiverseId\': 381269}, \'multiverseid\': 381269}, {\'name\': \'キオーラの放逐\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― キオーラの放逐を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{U}多くなる。\\n望む数のエンチャントを対象とし、それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'170e38a0-0f6b-4b3f-9655-87938f6e53a4\', \'multiverseId\': 381434}, \'multiverseid\': 381434}, {\'name\': \'키오라의 일축\', \'text\': \'분투 — 키오라의 일축은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {U}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n부여마법을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법들을 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32bbb67d-3aef-4118-9685-53401aef811b\', \'multiverseId\': 381599}, \'multiverseid\': 381599}, {\'name\': \'Exoneração de Kiora\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Exoneração de Kiora custa {U} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nDevolva qualquer número de encantamentos alvo para as mãos de seus donos.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6b8cd22-7244-4faa-8d91-70d5daa5122a\', \'multiverseId\': 381764}, \'multiverseid\': 381764}, {\'name\': \'Отказ Киоры\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Отказа Киоры стоит на {U} больше.\\nВерните любое количество целевых чар в руки их владельцев.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e10b94c8-b85f-4973-b73d-42868e2f06cd\', \'multiverseId\': 381929}, \'multiverseid\': 381929}, {\'name\': \'奇奥拉的驱散\', \'text\': \'积力～奇奥拉的驱散在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{U}来施放。\\n将任意数量的目标结界移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e1cc8c-5da0-47b9-a378-bd58ad2d773a\', \'multiverseId\': 380609}, \'multiverseid\': 380609}, {\'name\': \'奇奧拉的驅散\', \'text\': \'積力～奇奧拉的驅散在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{U}來施放。\\n將任意數量的目標結界移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d2436f-b2ef-422a-962f-894200625142\', \'multiverseId\': 380774}, \'multiverseid\': 380774}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klingenzahn-Keiler\', \'text\': \'Einschüchtern (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder Kreaturen, mit denen sie eine Farbe gemeinsam hat, nicht geblockt werden.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wildschwein\', \'flavor\': \'Die Todessenke ist das Territorium der Minotauren und vieler weiterer Kreaturen, die den Geschmack von Menschenfleisch zu schätzen wissen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e538238-5a0a-4f07-8ac1-c31d4800f05b\', \'multiverseId\': 380874}, \'multiverseid\': 380874}, {\'name\': \'Jabalí colmillo afilado\', \'text\': \'Intimidar. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas que compartan un color con ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Jabalí\', \'flavor\': \'El Cañón Rugidomortal alberga a minotauros y a muchas otras criaturas que comparten el gusto por el sabor de la carne humana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce996da2-29b7-47e3-a3a1-d67648fc4990\', \'multiverseId\': 382029}, \'multiverseid\': 382029}, {\'name\': \'Sanglier lamecroc\', \'text\': \'Intimidation (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures qui partagent une couleur avec elle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : sanglier\', \'flavor\': "Le canyon de Beuglemort est le refuge des minotaures et de bon nombre d\'autres créatures partageant leur appétit pour la chair humaine.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381039&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'746ca88c-4971-4704-9f06-f5bf30a5054d\', \'multiverseId\': 381039}, \'multiverseid\': 381039}, {\'name\': \'Cinghiale Zannaffilata\', \'text\': \'Intimidire (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature che condividono con essa un colore.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cinghiale\', \'flavor\': \'Nel Canyon Muggito di Morte dimorano minotauri e molte altre creature che condividono la passione per il sapore della carne umana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6cef123-6e32-44c5-96fc-bb944fe6e999\', \'multiverseId\': 381204}, \'multiverseid\': 381204}, {\'name\': \'刃牙の猪\', \'text\': \'威嚇（このクリーチャーはアーティファクト・クリーチャーか、これと共通の色を持つクリーチャー以外にはブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猪\', \'flavor\': \'死呻き峡谷はミノタウルスをはじめ、人の肉の味を好むクリーチャーたちが数多く生息する地である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13b58fba-8a91-4df8-845c-8cef6bfcea1d\', \'multiverseId\': 381369}, \'multiverseid\': 381369}, {\'name\': \'칼날엄니 멧돼지\', \'text\': \'위협 (이 생물은 마법물체 생물 및/또는 자신과 색을 공유하는 생물에게만 방어될 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 멧돼지\', \'flavor\': \'살기어린 함성의 골짜기는 미노타우로스와 식인 취미를 공유하는 다른 많은 생물들의 고향이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e81a6904-21ba-4415-90c4-7b7b7ef49e0e\', \'multiverseId\': 381534}, \'multiverseid\': 381534}, {\'name\': \'Javali Presa de Navalha\', \'text\': \'Intimidar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas artefato e/ou criaturas que compartilhem uma cor com ela.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Javali\', \'flavor\': \'O Desfiladeiro do Urro Mortal é o lar de minotauros e muitas outras criaturas que apreciam a carne humana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381699&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36519de-93c8-41fa-9029-035e9b7394e4\', \'multiverseId\': 381699}, \'multiverseid\': 381699}, {\'name\': \'Саблезубый Вепрь\', \'text\': \'Устрашение (Это существо может быть заблокировано только артефактами существами и (или) существами, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вепрь\', \'flavor\': \'Каньон Глотка Смерти стал домом для минотавров и многих других существ, разделяющих их аппетит к человеческой плоти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38359ec9-de58-4885-8640-ed97e28008ce\', \'multiverseId\': 381864}, \'multiverseid\': 381864}, {\'name\': \'刃牙野猪\', \'text\': \'威吓（此生物只能被神器生物和／或与它有共通颜色的生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野猪\', \'flavor\': \'牛头怪和许多同样嗜食人肉的生物都以亡啸谷为家。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdd9526f-52fa-4980-990d-c30a968b03ae\', \'multiverseId\': 380544}, \'multiverseid\': 380544}, {\'name\': \'刃牙野豬\', \'text\': \'威嚇（此生物只能被神器生物和／或與它有共通顏色的生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物～野豬\', \'flavor\': \'牛頭怪和許多同樣嗜食人肉的生物都以亡嘯谷為家。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fcf971f-fe9e-406c-82ea-c953fd77963c\', \'multiverseId\': 380709}, \'multiverseid\': 380709}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kolossaler Heldenmut\', \'text\': \'Streben — Kolossaler Heldenmut kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1}{G} mehr.\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +2/+2. Enttappe diese Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380881&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7c16705-90ab-4ce2-9f86-2c555ac17875\', \'multiverseId\': 380881}, \'multiverseid\': 380881}, {\'name\': \'Heroicos colosales\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar los Heroicos colosales cuesta {1}{G} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nCualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo obtienen +2/+2 cada una hasta el final del turno. Endereza esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2e09fcf-13bd-4241-ae94-93577c6feff4\', \'multiverseId\': 382036}, \'multiverseid\': 382036}, {\'name\': \'Bravoure colossale\', \'text\': "Obstination — La Bravoure colossale coûte {1}{G} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nN\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381046&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d37cc2f1-2f24-4334-872d-4a41c0dbf01d\', \'multiverseId\': 381046}, \'multiverseid\': 381046}, {\'name\': \'Eroismo Colossale\', \'text\': "Sforzo — L\'Eroismo Colossale costa {1}{G} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse prende +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno. STAPpa quelle creature.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c189e7f0-3470-4117-b440-9f71d786bb37\', \'multiverseId\': 381211}, \'multiverseid\': 381211}, {\'name\': \'壮大な英雄譚\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 壮大な英雄譚を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}{G}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9f09c21-5fc9-45dc-81a6-fa01144ce617\', \'multiverseId\': 381376}, \'multiverseid\': 381376}, {\'name\': \'거대한 영웅심\', \'text\': \'분투 — 거대한 영웅심은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {1}{G}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 +2/+2를 받는다. 그 생물들을 언탭한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed071611-36d4-4f89-8a01-650578e07b29\', \'multiverseId\': 381541}, \'multiverseid\': 381541}, {\'name\': \'Heróis Colossais\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Heróis Colossais custa {1}{G} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nQualquer número de criaturas alvo recebe +2/+2 até o final do turno. Desvire aquelas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbda0b8b-3c5c-4b22-b27e-a5b449303d47\', \'multiverseId\': 381706}, \'multiverseid\': 381706}, {\'name\': \'Колоссальный Героизм\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Колоссального Героизма стоит на {1}{G} больше.\\nЛюбое количество целевых существ получают по +2/+2 до конца хода. Разверните те существа.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30cefb0e-2d7c-4a4b-a364-befcd78396a4\', \'multiverseId\': 381871}, \'multiverseid\': 381871}, {\'name\': \'巨身勇行\', \'text\': \'积力～巨身勇行在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{1}{G}来施放。\\n任意数量的目标生物各得+2/+2直到回合结束。重置这些生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f230731d-6b2a-4322-a989-38957bb29dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 380551}, \'multiverseid\': 380551}, {\'name\': \'巨身勇行\', \'text\': \'積力～巨身勇行在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{1}{G}來施放。\\n任意數量的目標生物各得+2/+2直到回合結束。重置這些生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef4b8ba-323d-424c-a11f-6197b599e3f6\', \'multiverseId\': 380716}, \'multiverseid\': 380716}]', "[{'name': 'Kriegshäuptling der Pheres-Herde', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nAndere Zentaur-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1, haben Wachsamkeit und verursachen Trampelschaden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zentaur, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Die berüchtigten Kriegshäuptlinge der Pheres-Herde kämpfen mit der Stärke von Minotauren und der Weisheit von Sphinxen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380967&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '207a67da-3be5-446e-bca4-506037422e7b', 'multiverseId': 380967}, 'multiverseid': 380967}, {'name': 'Jefe de guerra del clan Feres', 'text': 'Vigilancia, arrolla.\\nLas otras criaturas Centauro que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y tienen las habilidades de vigilancia y arrollar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero centauro', 'flavor': 'Los famosos jefes de guerra del clan Feres luchan con la fuerza de los minotauros y la sagacidad de las esfinges.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382122&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4103d52-d83e-4b22-8fa8-7843796654cf', 'multiverseId': 382122}, 'multiverseid': 382122}, {'name': 'Chef de guerre du clan Phérès', 'text': 'Vigilance, piétinement\\nLes autres créatures Centaure que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et ont la vigilance et le piétinement.', 'type': 'Créature : centaure et guerrier', 'flavor': 'Les célèbres chefs de guerre du clan Phérès combattent avec la puissance du minotaure et la sagacité du sphinx.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381132&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8c85230-2074-4581-9546-4e1bb5d95909', 'multiverseId': 381132}, 'multiverseid': 381132}, {'name': 'Condottiero della Banda Feres', 'text': 'Cautela, travolgere\\nLe altre creature Centauro che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno cautela e travolgere.', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Centauro', 'flavor': 'I celebri condottieri della Banda Feres combattono con la potenza dei minotauri e la sagacia delle sfingi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381297&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1d54721-fb3d-49b6-9729-b6aa938b0fa4', 'multiverseId': 381297}, 'multiverseid': 381297}, {'name': 'フィーリーズ団の戦長', 'text': '警戒、トランプル\\nあなたがコントロールする他のケンタウルス・クリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに警戒とトランプルを持つ。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・戦士', 'flavor': '名高いフィーリーズ団の戦長は、ミノタウルスのごとき剛力とスフィンクスのごとき洞察力をもって戦う。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381462&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7e27d5cf-3071-4f86-8c1b-bc6b8f8feec1', 'multiverseId': 381462}, 'multiverseid': 381462}, {'name': '피레스 무리 대족장', 'text': '경계, 돌진\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 켄타우로스 생물들은 +1/+1을 받고 경계와 돌진을 가진다.', 'type': '생물 — 켄타우로스 전사', 'flavor': '피레스 무리의 유명한 대족장들은 미노타우로스의 힘과 스핑크스의 지혜를 가지고 싸운다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381627&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4fab506c-da69-45db-acb5-09244052a307', 'multiverseId': 381627}, 'multiverseid': 381627}, {'name': 'Comandante do Bando Feres', 'text': 'Vigilância, atropelar\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo Centauro que você controla recebem +1/+1 e têm vigilância e atropelar.', 'type': 'Criatura — Centauro Guerreiro', 'flavor': 'Os renomados comandantes do Bando Feres lutam com a força dos minotauros e a sagacidade das esfinges.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381792&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a99f0ba8-fd01-40a0-926b-8448255b1f03', 'multiverseId': 381792}, 'multiverseid': 381792}, {'name': 'Боевой Вождь из Племени Ферий', 'text': 'Бдительность, Пробивной удар\\nДругие существа-Кентавры под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и имеют Бдительность и Пробивной удар.', 'type': 'Существо — Кентавр Воин', 'flavor': 'Прославленные боевые вожди из племени Ферий в бою обладают силой минотавров и проницательностью сфинксов.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381957&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34ab5d63-0d5b-44fb-bc6e-e2844269e31b', 'multiverseId': 381957}, 'multiverseid': 381957}, {'name': '斐力兹族战酋长', 'text': '警戒，践踏\\n由你操控的其他半人马生物得+1/+1且具有警戒与践踏异能。', 'type': '生物～半人马／战士', 'flavor': '斐力兹族声名远播的战酋长既能与牛头怪角力，又能与史芬斯斗智。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380637&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b30a48db-402b-4ea8-b594-29d0c5253a37', 'multiverseId': 380637}, 'multiverseid': 380637}, {'name': '斐力茲族戰酋長', 'text': '警戒，踐踏\\n由你操控的其他半人馬生物得+1/+1且具有警戒與踐踏異能。', 'type': '生物～半人馬／戰士', 'flavor': '斐力茲族聲名遠播的戰酋長既能與牛頭怪角力，又能與史芬斯鬥智。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380802&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edc3c275-554c-4e98-8c5b-d64939c6108d', 'multiverseId': 380802}, 'multiverseid': 380802}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kriegshündin des Mogis\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {2}{R} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nDie Kriegshündin des Mogis greift in jedem Zug an, falls möglich.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und greift in jedem Zug an, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Hund\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19db8830-867b-4ee8-826f-4269f26beb3e\', \'multiverseId\': 380951}, \'multiverseid\': 380951}, {\'name\': \'Sabueso de guerra de Mogis\', \'text\': \'Concesión {2}{R}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nEl Sabueso de guerra de Mogis ataca cada turno si puede.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y ataca cada turno si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Perro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22e458ca-c47c-4eb7-9d33-2a7c85289668\', \'multiverseId\': 382106}, \'multiverseid\': 382106}, {\'name\': \'Chienne de guerre de Mogis\', \'text\': "Grâce {2}{R} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nLa Chienne de guerre de Mogis attaque à chaque tour si possible.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et attaque à chaque tour si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : chien de chasse\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381116&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d83934-221a-4ac2-b330-e8e5dabea023\', \'multiverseId\': 381116}, \'multiverseid\': 381116}, {\'name\': \'Segugio da Guerra di Mogis\', \'text\': \'Conferire {2}{R} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nIl Segugio da Guerra di Mogis attacca ogni turno, se può farlo.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 e attacca ogni turno, se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Segugio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dd11a53-3b16-4a13-91d0-f3985cc97b64\', \'multiverseId\': 381281}, \'multiverseid\': 381281}, {\'name\': \'モーギスの軍用犬\', \'text\': \'授与 {2}{R} （このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\nモーギスの軍用犬は可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受けるとともに、可能なら毎ターン攻撃する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 猟犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'269c6c09-831a-45c3-b155-a72f89450b5f\', \'multiverseId\': 381446}, \'multiverseid\': 381446}, {\'name\': \'모기스의 투견\', \'text\': \'권능 {2}{R} (이 카드의 권능 비용을 지불하고 발동하면, 이 카드는 생물에게 부여하는 마법진 주문이다. 이 카드는 생물에 부착되지 않은 상태가 되면 다시 생물이 된다.)\\n모기스의 투견은 가능하면 매 턴마다 공격한다.\\n부여된 생물은 +2/+2를 받고 가능하면 매 턴마다 공격한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 사냥개\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f93ba01-bdb4-411c-b68a-833e0a5c9986\', \'multiverseId\': 381611}, \'multiverseid\': 381611}, {\'name\': \'Cão de Guerra de Mogis\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {2}{R} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nCão de Guerra de Mogis ataca a cada turno se estiver apto.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e ataca a cada turno se estiver apta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Sabujo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2769a5d-01b2-4cb9-9858-c1751f18f303\', \'multiverseId\': 381776}, \'multiverseid\': 381776}, {\'name\': \'Боевой Пес Могия\', \'text\': \'Дар {2}{R} (Если вы разыгрываете эту карту за ее стоимость Дара, она является заклинанием Ауры со способностью «зачаровать существо». Она снова становится существом, если не прикреплена к существу.)\\nБоевой Пес Могия атакует в каждом ходу, если может.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и атакует в каждом ходу, если может.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Пес\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'026fc9c1-a494-4f8c-9d07-66edd93333e8\', \'multiverseId\': 381941}, \'multiverseid\': 381941}, {\'name\': \'墨癸斯的战猎犬\', \'text\': \'神授{2}{R}（如果你支付此牌的神授费用来施放它，则它便是具「结附于生物」的灵气咒语。如果它未结附于生物上，就会再度成为生物。）\\n墨癸斯的战猎犬每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且每回合若能攻击，则必须攻击。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～猎犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0dde760-61bf-43d5-89d9-ac3d5946a36c\', \'multiverseId\': 380621}, \'multiverseid\': 380621}, {\'name\': \'墨癸斯的戰獵犬\', \'text\': \'神授{2}{R}（如果你支付此牌的神授費用來施放它，則它便是具「結附於生物」的靈氣咒語。如果它未結附於生物上，就會再度成為生物。）\\n墨癸斯的戰獵犬每回合若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2且每回合若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～獵犬\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7f189d8-ae6b-42e7-9703-ccfb94e24e5e\', \'multiverseId\': 380786}, \'multiverseid\': 380786}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kriegsschwingen-Sirene\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nHeroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der die Kriegsschwingen-Sirene als Ziel hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Kriegsschwingen-Sirene.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sirene, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Einst stürzte ihr Gesang Seeleute ins Verderben. Nun führt sie sie zu Ruhm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03a94231-2e59-4e3c-9513-c620c0004a08\', \'multiverseId\': 381020}, \'multiverseid\': 381020}, {\'name\': \'Sirena ala beligerante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nHeroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo a la Sirena ala beligerante, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Sirena ala beligerante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado sirena\', \'flavor\': \'En otro tiempo cantaba para guiar a los marineros a su perdición. Ahora los guía hacia la gloria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af69d24-4bb5-482c-925c-717bbbd28a42\', \'multiverseId\': 382175}, \'multiverseid\': 382175}, {\'name\': \'Sirène aile-de-guerre\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nHéroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible la Sirène aile-de-guerre, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Sirène aile-de-guerre.\', \'type\': \'Créature : sirène et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Autrefois, son chant attirait les marins vers leur trépas. Aujourd\'hui il les mène vers la gloire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381185&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e464cbb-10b4-4b12-a96f-6fe9b53b1d41\', \'multiverseId\': 381185}, \'multiverseid\': 381185}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Alaguerriera\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nEroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia la Sirena Alaguerriera, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Sirena Alaguerriera.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Sirena\', \'flavor\': \'Un tempo il suo canto conduceva i marinai alla loro dannazione. Ora li guida verso la gloria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'446296bb-c4e9-4445-ad0f-c79ae3845262\', \'multiverseId\': 381350}, \'multiverseid\': 381350}, {\'name\': \'戦争翼のセイレーン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n英雄的 ― あなたが戦争翼のセイレーンを対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、戦争翼のセイレーンの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — セイレーン・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'彼女はかつて、その歌で船乗りたちを破滅に導いていた。今は彼らを栄光に導こうとしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d063ccf-a71d-460d-90b2-d278a0a4a6b5\', \'multiverseId\': 381515}, \'multiverseid\': 381515}, {\'name\': \'전쟁날개 세이렌\', \'text\': \'비행\\n영웅 — 당신이 전쟁날개 세이렌을 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 전쟁날개 세이렌에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 세이렌 병사\', \'flavor\': \'한때 그녀는 노래로 선원들을 파멸로 이끌었다. 이제 그녀는 그들을 영광으로 인도한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a964736-4d23-4860-b26d-8ad4e347f72b\', \'multiverseId\': 381680}, \'multiverseid\': 381680}, {\'name\': \'Sirena Asa-de-guerra\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nHeroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Sirena Asa-de-guerra, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Sirena Asa-de-guerra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sirena Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Outrora suas canções levavam os marinheiros para a morte. Agora, ela os leva para a glória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3865eaa7-6f21-4d60-9abd-a01e8e92ebdf\', \'multiverseId\': 381845}, \'multiverseid\': 381845}, {\'name\': \'Сирена-Воительница\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nГероизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Сирена-Воительница, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Сирену-Воительницу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сирена Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Когда-то своей песней она зазывала моряков на смерть. Теперь она ведет их к славе.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3492d91d-1076-4f74-98ba-9de3ec487547\', \'multiverseId\': 382010}, \'multiverseid\': 382010}, {\'name\': \'战翼塞连\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n勇行～每当你施放一个以战翼塞连为目标的咒语时，在战翼塞连上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～塞连／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'过去，她的歌声将水手引向覆灭。如今，她带领他们走向荣耀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f8b12dc-5b6c-49a6-989b-b8b031c035e0\', \'multiverseId\': 380690}, \'multiverseid\': 380690}, {\'name\': \'戰翼塞連\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n勇行～每當你施放一個以戰翼塞連為目標的咒語時，在戰翼塞連上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～塞連／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'過去，她的歌聲將水手引向覆滅。如今，她帶領他們走向榮耀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd0ca42e-a75f-43f4-a88e-3b1a691ff6c0\', \'multiverseId\': 380855}, \'multiverseid\': 380855}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kristalliner Nautilus\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {3}{U}{U} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nWenn der Kristalline Nautilus das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, opfere ihn.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +4/+4 und hat „Wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, opfere sie."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nautilus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97502cfb-29aa-4f96-b5ce-aed3b8d5db69\', \'multiverseId\': 380885}, \'multiverseid\': 380885}, {\'name\': \'Nautilo cristalino\', \'text\': \'Concesión {3}{U}{U}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nCuando el Nautilo cristalino sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad, sacrifícalo.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +4/+4 y tiene "Cuando esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad, sacrifícala".\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Nautilo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e325d7fe-8c90-43ae-bce9-fb4e3c865f82\', \'multiverseId\': 382040}, \'multiverseid\': 382040}, {\'name\': \'Nautile cristallin\', \'text\': "Grâce {3}{U}{U} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nQuand le Nautile cristallin devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité, sacrifiez-le.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +4/+4 et a « Quand cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité, sacrifiez-la. »", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nautile\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381050&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7248cc87-09c2-45c6-8e6a-6a7304bcbce9\', \'multiverseId\': 381050}, \'multiverseid\': 381050}, {\'name\': \'Nautilo Cristallino\', \'text\': \'Conferire {3}{U}{U} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nQuando il Nautilo Cristallino diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità, sacrificalo.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +4/+4 e ha "Quando questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità, sacrificala".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Nautilo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e038436-ff60-4538-bd36-73c8f1f1fe6c\', \'multiverseId\': 381215}, \'multiverseid\': 381215}, {\'name\': \'水晶オウムガイ\', \'text\': \'授与 {3}{U}{U} （このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\n水晶オウムガイが呪文や能力の対象になったとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋４/＋４の修整を受けるとともに「このクリーチャーが呪文や能力の対象になったとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — オウムガイ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65903200-0133-453a-b3dc-a4a843241384\', \'multiverseId\': 381380}, \'multiverseid\': 381380}, {\'name\': \'수정 앵무조개\', \'text\': "권능 {3}{U}{U} (이 카드의 권능 비용을 지불하고 발동하면, 이 카드는 생물에게 부여하는 마법진 주문이다. 이 카드는 생물에 부착되지 않은 상태가 되면 다시 생물이 된다.)\\n수정 앵무조개가 주문이나 능력의 목표가 되었을 때, 크리스탈 앵무조개를 희생한다.\\n부여된 생물은 +4/+4를 받고 \'이 생물이 주문이나 능력의 목표가 되었을 때 이 생물을 희생한다\'를 가진다.", \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 앵무조개\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee831bf0-8383-486c-a67f-b61c9474fb73\', \'multiverseId\': 381545}, \'multiverseid\': 381545}, {\'name\': \'Náutilo Cristalino\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {3}{U}{U} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nQuando Náutilo Cristalino se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade, sacrifique-o.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +4/+4 e tem "Quando esta criatura for alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade, sacrifique-a."\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Náutilo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d940db2-39d8-4b25-bf49-089734a0697d\', \'multiverseId\': 381710}, \'multiverseid\': 381710}, {\'name\': \'Кристальный Наутилус\', \'text\': \'Дар {3}{U}{U} (Если вы разыгрываете эту карту за ее стоимость Дара, она является заклинанием Ауры со способностью «зачаровать существо». Она снова становится существом, если не прикреплена к существу.)\\nКогда Кристальный Наутилус становится целью заклинания или способности, пожертвуйте его.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +4/+4 и имеет способность «Когда это существо становится целью заклинания или способности, пожертвуйте его».\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Наутилус\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7356490-ea5e-456f-8846-4e7b9480c706\', \'multiverseId\': 381875}, \'multiverseid\': 381875}, {\'name\': \'晶澈鹦鹉螺\', \'text\': \'神授{3}{U}{U}（如果你支付此牌的神授费用来施放它，则它便是具「结附于生物」的灵气咒语。如果它未结附于生物上，就会再度成为生物。）\\n当晶澈鹦鹉螺成为咒语或异能的目标时，将它牺牲。\\n所结附的生物得+4/+4且具有「当此生物成为咒语或异能的目标时，将它牺牲。」\', \'type\': \'结界生物～鹦鹉螺\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'725e9418-c88a-4605-9745-7c3d44f8d1cb\', \'multiverseId\': 380555}, \'multiverseid\': 380555}, {\'name\': \'晶澈鸚鵡螺\', \'text\': \'神授{3}{U}{U}（如果你支付此牌的神授費用來施放它，則它便是具「結附於生物」的靈氣咒語。如果它未結附於生物上，就會再度成為生物。）\\n當晶澈鸚鵡螺成為咒語或異能的目標時，將它犧牲。\\n所結附的生物得+4/+4且具有「當此生物成為咒語或異能的目標時，將它犧牲。」\', \'type\': \'結界生物～鸚鵡螺\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee9e55a4-4c7c-49ea-b68e-1da952151c4f\', \'multiverseId\': 380720}, \'multiverseid\': 380720}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kruphix, Gott der Horizonte\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Grün und Blau weniger als sieben beträgt, ist Kruphix keine Kreatur.\\nEs gibt keine Obergrenze für die Anzahl an Karten, die du auf der Hand halten darfst.\\nFalls unverbrauchtes Mana aus deinem Manavorrat entfernt würde, wird dieses Mana stattdessen farblos.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98cb9ac0-4b94-486d-8495-047346b74d0c\', \'multiverseId\': 380941}, \'multiverseid\': 380941}, {\'name\': \'Krufix, dios de los horizontes\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al verde y al azul sea menor que siete, Krufix no es una criatura.\\nTu mano no tiene tamaño máximo.\\nSi fuera a vaciarse maná no utilizado de tu reserva de maná, en vez de eso, ese maná se convierte en incoloro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d94d0ff-31a6-445c-a0ab-b1b31926cca1\', \'multiverseId\': 382096}, \'multiverseid\': 382096}, {\'name\': \'Kruphix, dieu des Horizons\', \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au vert et au bleu est inférieure à sept, Kruphix n\'est pas une créature.\\nIl n\'y a pas de limite au nombre de cartes dans votre main.\\nSi du mana inutilisé devait être vidé de votre réserve, ce mana devient incolore à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381106&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'023e1cb8-97e8-4da4-841c-e9b8f063b456\', \'multiverseId\': 381106}, \'multiverseid\': 381106}, {\'name\': \'Krufix, Dio degli Orizzonti\', \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nFintanto che la tua devozione al verde e al blu è inferiore a sette, Krufix non è una creatura.\\nNon hai un limite massimo di carte nella tua mano.\\nSe del mana inutilizzato sta per essere rimosso dalla tua riserva di mana, quel mana diventa invece incolore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51279938-3c56-49b5-b9d8-f4249dd25f91\', \'multiverseId\': 381271}, \'multiverseid\': 381271}, {\'name\': \'彼方、クルフィックス\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの緑と青への信心が７未満であるかぎり、彼方の神、クルフィックスはクリーチャーではない。\\nあなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n使われなかったマナがあなたのマナ・プールから無くなるなら、その代わりにそのマナは無色となる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd5a7cf5-36fb-4b2b-92c3-63066e9d1017\', \'multiverseId\': 381436}, \'multiverseid\': 381436}, {\'name\': \'지평선의 신 크루픽스\', \'text\': \'무적\\n당신의 녹청 신앙심이 7 미만인 한, 크루픽스는 생물이 아니다.\\n당신의 손은 크기 제한이 없다.\\n당신의 마나풀에 남아있는 마나가 비워지려고 하면, 그 마나는 대신에 무색 마나가 된다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2a44f99-4269-401b-acce-143a86baf6be\', \'multiverseId\': 381601}, \'multiverseid\': 381601}, {\'name\': \'Crufix, Deus dos Horizontes\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nEnquanto sua devoção ao verde e ao azul for menor que sete, Crufix não será uma criatura.\\nNão há limite para o número máximo de cards em sua mão.\\nSe o mana não usado for ser esvaziado da sua reserva de mana, em vez disso, aquele mana se tornará incolor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44a4564a-13ff-44d6-ba3b-d0676ac41d45\', \'multiverseId\': 381766}, \'multiverseid\': 381766}, {\'name\': \'Круфикс, Бог Горизонтов\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nПока ваша Преданность зеленому и синему меньше семи, Круфикс не является существом.\\nРазмер вашей руки неограничен.\\nЕсли ваше хранилище маны должно опустошиться от неиспользованной маны, та мана становится бесцветной вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a826279-01b6-49e8-8067-c64c2f4f66e3\', \'multiverseId\': 381931}, \'multiverseid\': 381931}, {\'name\': \'天际神克罗芬斯\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的绿蓝两色献力小于七，克罗芬斯便不是生物。\\n你的手牌数量没有上限。\\n如果未利用的法术力将从你的法术力池消失，改为这些法术力成为无色。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'215f3e2b-b096-4198-80d1-fe4a46671250\', \'multiverseId\': 380611}, \'multiverseid\': 380611}, {\'name\': \'天際神克羅芬斯\', \'text\': \'不滅\\n只要你的綠藍兩色獻力小於七，克羅芬斯便不是生物。\\n你的手牌數量沒有上限。\\n如果未利用的魔法力將從你的魔法力池消失，改為這些魔法力成為無色。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e80bbd5-19f5-45b1-a573-b7559d887430\', \'multiverseId\': 380776}, \'multiverseid\': 380776}]', '[{\'name\': \'König Makar der Goldverfluchte\', \'text\': \'Inspiriert — Immer wenn König Makar der Goldverfluchte enttappt wird, kannst du eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, bringe einen farblosen Artefaktspielstein namens Gold ins Spiel. Er hat „Opfere dieses Artefakt: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45c49cb5-0fef-4596-bf1b-625760ab08f0\', \'multiverseId\': 380938}, \'multiverseid\': 380938}, {\'name\': \'Rey Macar, el maldecido áureo\', \'text\': \'Inspiración — Siempre que el Rey Macar, el maldecido áureo se enderece, puedes exiliar la criatura objetivo. Si lo haces, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de artefacto incolora llamada Oro. Tiene "Sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4180babc-8e5a-4b0c-b952-f56cfe1ca233\', \'multiverseId\': 382093}, \'multiverseid\': 382093}, {\'name\': "Macar, le roi au toucher d\'or", \'text\': "Inspiration — À chaque fois que Macar, le roi au toucher d\'or devient dégagé, vous pouvez exiler une créature ciblée. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton d\'artefact incolore appelé Or. Il a « Sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381103&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9bbe031-8ceb-4370-8f47-748f9ca362de\', \'multiverseId\': 381103}, \'multiverseid\': 381103}, {\'name\': "Re Macar, il Maledetto dall\'Oro", \'text\': \'Ispirazione — Ogniqualvolta Re Macar, il Maledetto dall\\\'Oro viene STAPpato, puoi esiliare una creatura bersaglio. Se lo fai, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina artefatto incolore chiamata Oro. Ha "Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bcf284e-de95-412a-9668-576d84b13bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 381268}, \'multiverseid\': 381268}, {\'name\': \'黄金の呪いのマカール王\', \'text\': \'神啓 ― 黄金の呪いのマカール王がアンタップ状態になるたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれを追放してもよい。そうしたなら、「金」と言う名前の無色のアーティファクト・トークンを１つ戦場に出す。それは「このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのマナ・プールに好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ea46afa-eb45-4119-9585-647973ff22a1\', \'multiverseId\': 381433}, \'multiverseid\': 381433}, {\'name\': \'황금의 저주를 받은 왕 마카르\', \'text\': \'영감 — 황금의 저주를 받은 왕 마카르가 언탭될 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 추방할 수 있다. 그렇게 하면, 이름이 금인 무색 마법물체 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 마법물체는 "이 마법물체를 희생한다: 당신의 마나풀에 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다."라는 능력을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 인간\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb7da25-9fe9-426c-9dec-10881b8f01ec\', \'multiverseId\': 381598}, \'multiverseid\': 381598}, {\'name\': \'Macar, Rei do Toque Maldito\', \'text\': \'Inspirado — Toda vez que Macar, Rei do Toque Maldito, é desvirado, você pode exilar a criatura alvo. Se fizer isso, coloque uma ficha de artefato incolor com o nome Ouro no campo de batalha. Ela tem "Sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor a sua reserva de mana."\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61c80526-48b1-4398-9f71-c898f5d07728\', \'multiverseId\': 381763}, \'multiverseid\': 381763}, {\'name\': \'Царь Макарий, Проклятый Золотом\', \'text\': \'Одухотворение — Каждый раз, когда Царь Макарий, Проклятый Золотом становится развернутым, вы можете изгнать целевое существо. Если вы это делаете, положите на поле битвы одну фишку бесцветного артефакта с именем Золото. Она имеет способность «Пожертвуйте этот артефакт: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны».\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2221c51-3a01-4b52-821e-8cd8669d97b7\', \'multiverseId\': 381928}, \'multiverseid\': 381928}, {\'name\': \'点金咒马卡耳王\', \'text\': \'启悟～每当点金咒马卡耳王成为未橫置时，你可以放逐目标生物。若你如此作，将一个名称为黄金的无色衍生神器放进战场。它具有「牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物～人类\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f46bcd-4304-4688-99bb-6956877c1dff\', \'multiverseId\': 380608}, \'multiverseid\': 380608}, {\'name\': \'點金咒馬卡耳王\', \'text\': \'啟悟～每當點金咒馬卡耳王成為未橫置時，你可以放逐目標生物。若你如此作，將一個名稱為黃金的無色衍生神器放進戰場。它具有「犧牲此神器：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。」\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物～人類\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02f85dd2-5880-49fd-98a0-c60bfd42344d\', \'multiverseId\': 380773}, \'multiverseid\': 380773}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leoniden-Ikonoklastin\', \'text\': \'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der die Leoniden-Ikonoklastin als Ziel hat, zerstöre eine Verzauberungskreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Sterne gehören an den Nachthimmel. Dies ist unsere Welt und wir sind unsere eigenen Herren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a1459c-f405-4c13-928f-5e227cd5b080\', \'multiverseId\': 380945}, \'multiverseid\': 380945}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta leonina\', \'text\': \'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo a la Iconoclasta leonina, destruye la criatura encantamiento objetivo que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Las estrellas deben permanecer en el cielo nocturno. Este es nuestro mundo, y somos nuestros propios amos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b853e31-3509-4d33-b6b6-0b15b8bc2132\', \'multiverseId\': 382100}, \'multiverseid\': 382100}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclaste léonine\', \'text\': "Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible l\'Iconoclaste léonine, détruisez une créature-enchantement ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et moine\', \'flavor\': \'« Les étoiles appartiennent au ciel nocturne. Ceci est notre monde, et nous sommes nos propres maîtres. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'853a40de-586d-42fd-9d2f-4e69df05e271\', \'multiverseId\': 381110}, \'multiverseid\': 381110}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta Leonid\', \'text\': "Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia l\'Iconoclasta Leonid, distruggi una creatura incantesimo bersaglio controllata da un avversario.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Monaco Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Il posto delle stelle è nel cielo notturno. Questo è il nostro mondo e noi siamo padroni di noi stessi."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'942e04c6-c9a1-4876-bdb4-3b922c1d901f\', \'multiverseId\': 381275}, \'multiverseid\': 381275}, {\'name\': \'レオニンの偶像破壊者\', \'text\': \'英雄的 ― あなたがレオニンの偶像破壊者を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、対戦相手がコントロールするクリーチャー・エンチャント１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「星々は夜空にあるべきです。ここは我々の世界。そして我々の事は我々が決めます。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38fcccb9-db50-4667-ac32-55ba73ec663e\', \'multiverseId\': 381440}, \'multiverseid\': 381440}, {\'name\': \'레오닌 우상파괴자\', \'text\': \'영웅 — 당신이 레오닌 우상파괴자를 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 상대가 조종하는 부여마법 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 수도승\', \'flavor\': "\'별들은 밤하늘에 속해 있다. 이곳은 우리의 세계이며, 우리가 우리 자신의 주인이다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51aee0e5-9795-49b0-ade9-2fdbf6ed6e75\', \'multiverseId\': 381605}, \'multiverseid\': 381605}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta Leonino\', \'text\': \'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Iconoclasta Leonino, destrua a criatura encantamento alvo que um oponente controle.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Monge\', \'flavor\': \'"O lugar das estrelas é no céu. Este é o nosso mundo e nós somos nossos senhores."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8519791c-1907-4082-9f77-833799d0a016\', \'multiverseId\': 381770}, \'multiverseid\': 381770}, {\'name\': \'Леонинская Бунтарка\', \'text\': \'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Леонинская Бунтарка, уничтожьте целевые чары существо под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Монах\', \'flavor\': \'«Звездам место на ночном небе. Это наш мир, и мы сами себе хозяева».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3aeb327-e398-4e6a-bc08-445f55d31600\', \'multiverseId\': 381935}, \'multiverseid\': 381935}, {\'name\': \'反逆狮族\', \'text\': \'勇行～每当你施放一个以反逆狮族为目标的咒语时，消灭目标由对手操控的结界生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「星辰属于夜空。这是我们的世界，我们才是自己的主人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c7bc9dd-d5e5-49ea-8803-36a8dd5c5789\', \'multiverseId\': 380615}, \'multiverseid\': 380615}, {\'name\': \'反逆獅族\', \'text\': \'勇行～每當你施放一個以反逆獅族為目標的咒語時，消滅目標由對手操控的結界生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「星辰屬於夜空。這是我們的世界，我們才是自己的主人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'306e437d-d450-46cc-b0ee-4b4deef0af5d\', \'multiverseId\': 380780}, \'multiverseid\': 380780}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magmagischt\', \'text\': \'Die Magmagischt fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls diese Kreatur in diesem Zug sterben würde, schicke sie stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': "Der uralte Drache Thraxes schläft in Purphoros\' heiligem Gipfel. Wenn er sich in seinen Träumen regt, so regt sich auch der Berg.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1e5627f-5020-42a6-bbe5-23eb849f1432\', \'multiverseId\': 380947}, \'multiverseid\': 380947}, {\'name\': \'Rocío de magma\', \'text\': \'El Rocío de magma hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Si esa criatura fuese a morir este turno, en vez de eso, exíliala.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El viejo dragón Traxes duerme en la cumbre sagrada de Purforos. Cuando se estremece en sueños, también lo hace la montaña.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382102&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2f1c8d0-22fc-40fe-ba40-678fe794ccec\', \'multiverseId\': 382102}, \'multiverseid\': 382102}, {\'name\': \'Giclée de magma\', \'text\': \'La Giclée de magma inflige 2 blessures à la créature ciblée. Si cette créature devait mourir ce tour-ci, exilez-la à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'ancêtre dragon Thraxes sommeille sous le pic sacré de Purphoros. Quand ses rêves le troublent, la montagne tremble.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381112&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a558f994-1e9f-4971-b508-d7691a5a7294\', \'multiverseId\': 381112}, \'multiverseid\': 381112}, {\'name\': \'Spruzzo di Magma\', \'text\': \'Lo Spruzzo di Magma infligge 2 danni a una creatura bersaglio. Se quella creatura sta per morire in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'antico drago Traxes dorme nel cuore della vetta sacra a Purforos. Quando sussulta nel sonno, la montagna fa altrettanto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8a12732-43be-4b04-8688-bcdf581f904c\', \'multiverseId\': 381277}, \'multiverseid\': 381277}, {\'name\': \'マグマのしぶき\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。マグマのしぶきはそれに２点のダメージを与える。そのクリーチャーがこのターンに死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'古代ドラゴンのトラクシーズはパーフォロスの聖なる山の中に眠る。まどろみの中で身体を揺らせば、山も共に揺れる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f701e399-80f8-4b5d-a303-523c697e19cf\', \'multiverseId\': 381442}, \'multiverseid\': 381442}, {\'name\': \'용암 분사\', \'text\': \'생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 용암 분사는 그 생물에 피해 2점을 입힌다. 그 생물이 이 턴에 죽게 된다면, 대신 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'고룡 트락시스는 퍼포로스의 성스러운 산봉우리에서 잔다. 트락시스가 꿈꾸면서 뒤척거리면 산도 뒤척인다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a9a2a4e-22fc-45ef-b63d-3f5b9fa519d3\', \'multiverseId\': 381607}, \'multiverseid\': 381607}, {\'name\': \'Esguicho de Magma\', \'text\': \'Esguicho de Magma causa 2 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Se aquela criatura for morrer neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O dragão ancestral Traxes dorme no pico sagrado de Púrforo. Quando ele se revira em seus sonhos, a montanha treme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c863c112-5f31-4e6d-9cee-b3a7e92e4aff\', \'multiverseId\': 381772}, \'multiverseid\': 381772}, {\'name\': \'Выброс Магмы\', \'text\': \'Выброс Магмы наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу. Если то существо должно умереть в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'На священном пике Пирфора спит древний дракон Тракс. Когда он ворочается во сне, ворочается и гора.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'930f3100-41b2-4b6a-9df3-1659e108652e\', \'multiverseId\': 381937}, \'multiverseid\': 381937}, {\'name\': \'岩浆喷散\', \'text\': \'岩浆喷散对目标生物造成2点伤害。如果本回合中该生物将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'远古巨龙特剌谢斯沉眠于普罗烽斯的圣峰之中。当他在睡梦中翻身时，山脉也会跟着震动。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c193b45a-dd41-4f8e-8fbe-42f4e5d3769d\', \'multiverseId\': 380617}, \'multiverseid\': 380617}, {\'name\': \'岩漿噴散\', \'text\': \'岩漿噴散對目標生物造成2點傷害。若該生物於本回合中將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'遠古巨龍特剌謝斯沉眠於普羅烽斯的聖峰之中。當他在睡夢中翻身時，山脈也會跟著震動。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c8642df-dce7-4300-b0ef-14ade0a405f7\', \'multiverseId\': 380782}, \'multiverseid\': 380782}]', "[{'name': 'Mana-Zusammenfluss', 'text': '{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Fünf Flüsse umrahmen Theros, ihr Wasser älter als die Welt selbst.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380948&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f77c9f72-fb65-49de-807b-eb481d665595', 'multiverseId': 380948}, 'multiverseid': 380948}, {'name': 'Confluencia de maná', 'text': '{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega un maná de cualquier color a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Cinco ríos rodean Theros, y por ellos fluyen aguas más antiguas que el propio mundo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382103&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a730efe8-874e-4ba1-af9a-69867c23e9b6', 'multiverseId': 382103}, 'multiverseid': 382103}, {'name': 'Confluence de mana', 'text': '{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Cinq fleuves entourent Theros, leurs eaux plus anciennes encore que le monde lui-même.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381113&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bcbe0ab7-2b58-41a7-b1cf-4b868aa3dfbd', 'multiverseId': 381113}, 'multiverseid': 381113}, {'name': 'Confluenza di Mana', 'text': '{T}, Paga 1 punto vita: Aggiungi un mana di qualsiasi colore alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Cinque fiumi circondano Theros, carichi di acque più antiche del mondo stesso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381278&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb1274a8-e860-413e-9fe4-0b322b320e66', 'multiverseId': 381278}, 'multiverseid': 381278}, {'name': 'マナの合流点', 'text': '{T}, ライフを１点支払う：あなたのマナ・プールに、好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'テーロスの周りを五つの河が取り囲み、その世界より古き水が流れている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381443&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '223170a4-23ec-4bfe-a977-ba733565f8e3', 'multiverseId': 381443}, 'multiverseid': 381443}, {'name': '마나 합류점', 'text': '{T}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: 당신의 마나풀에 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 담는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '세계보다 더 오래된 다섯 줄기의 강이 테로스를 감싸고 흐른다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381608&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0af36520-df80-4690-a7d2-4e26992fbd07', 'multiverseId': 381608}, 'multiverseid': 381608}, {'name': 'Confluência de Mana', 'text': '{T}, Pague 1 ponto de vida: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Cinco rios circundam Theros, fluindo com águas mais antigas do que o próprio mundo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381773&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c853faba-490c-454b-a007-2c3d036f1a31', 'multiverseId': 381773}, 'multiverseid': 381773}, {'name': 'Слияние Маны', 'text': '{T}, заплатите 1 жизнь: добавьте одну ману любого цвета в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Терос окружают пять рек, воды которых древнее самого мира.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381938&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f23ff561-92eb-497e-b88d-ffff7b6a6304', 'multiverseId': 381938}, 'multiverseid': 381938}, {'name': '魔力聚流', 'text': '{T}，支付1点生命：加一点任意颜色的法术力到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '五河环绕着塞洛斯，河中流淌着比这个世界更古老的水。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380618&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6f116f7-a339-4c4d-83de-51b3c2ca5bb0', 'multiverseId': 380618}, 'multiverseid': 380618}, {'name': '魔力聚流', 'text': '{T}，支付1點生命：加一點任意顏色的魔法力到你的魔法力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '五河環繞著塞洛斯，河中流淌著比這個世界更古老的水。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380783&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28368b14-2845-4178-88b9-b268361a1b4d', 'multiverseId': 380783}, 'multiverseid': 380783}]", "[{'name': 'Marktfeier', 'text': 'Verzaubert ein Land\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erhöht sein Beherrscher seinen Manavorrat um zwei Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben (zusätzlich zu dem Mana, das dieses Land erzeugt).', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': 'Handel ist immer das Fundament von Frieden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380949&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7480892a-edbb-4ac5-a18e-4656f79a06f6', 'multiverseId': 380949}, 'multiverseid': 380949}, {'name': 'Festival del mercado', 'text': 'Encantar tierra.\\nSiempre que se gire la tierra encantada para obtener maná, su controlador agrega dos manás de cualquier combinación de colores a su reserva de maná (además del maná que produce la tierra).', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': 'El comercio es siempre la base de la paz.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382104&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d8789c5-0586-407c-abf4-6d781f455e0a', 'multiverseId': 382104}, 'multiverseid': 382104}, {'name': 'Marché du festival', 'text': 'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute deux manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de son choix à sa réserve (en plus du mana produit par le terrain).', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': 'Le commerce est toujours la fondation de la paix.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381114&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e484bd3a-998a-4200-9345-b48a04d3e52b', 'multiverseId': 381114}, 'multiverseid': 381114}, {'name': 'Festa del Mercato', 'text': 'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge due mana in qualsiasi combinazione di colori alla sua riserva di mana (in aggiunta al mana prodotto dalla terra).', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': 'Il commercio è sempre alla base della pace.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381279&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3bae6bb1-90fe-4fce-a7a8-a5f0ebdbcba8', 'multiverseId': 381279}, 'multiverseid': 381279}, {'name': '市場の祝祭', 'text': 'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは好きな色の組み合わせのマナ２点を自分のマナ・プールに加える。（その土地が生み出すマナに追加される）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': '交易は常に平和の基礎である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381444&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a66ac49c-7f49-40d7-bb4f-bed83f97288a', 'multiverseId': 381444}, 'multiverseid': 381444}, {'name': '시장 축제', 'text': '대지에 부여\\n부여된 대지가 마나를 얻기 위해 탭될 때마다, 그 조종자는 그 대지가 원래 생산하는 마나에 추가로 원하는 색 조합의 마나 두 개를 자신의 마나풀에 담는다.', 'type': '부여마법 — 마법진', 'flavor': '상업은 언제나 평화의 기반이다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381609&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b833b60a-5190-470d-8b1d-5deb70bd1ce0', 'multiverseId': 381609}, 'multiverseid': 381609}, {'name': 'Festival do Mercado', 'text': 'Encantar terreno\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado é virado para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona dois manas de qualquer combinação de cores à sua reserva de mana (além do mana que o terreno gera).', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': 'O comércio é sempre a base para a paz.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381774&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '535eb9f9-8e72-46e7-b1d5-197cc98663f1', 'multiverseId': 381774}, 'multiverseid': 381774}, {'name': 'Праздник на Базаре', 'text': 'Зачаровать землю\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованная земля поворачивается для получения маны, контролирующий ее игрок добавляет две маны в любой комбинации цветов в свое хранилище маны (в дополнение к мане, которую производит земля).', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': 'Торговля всегда становится основой мира.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381939&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17ffcbe2-b370-4821-9073-edee89c8a818', 'multiverseId': 381939}, 'multiverseid': 381939}, {'name': '集市节庆', 'text': '结附于地\\n每当所结附的地横置以产生法术力时，其操控者加两点法术力到其法术力池中，其颜色组合由他选择。（会得到原本该有的法术力，并加上此份法术力。）', 'type': '结界～灵气', 'flavor': '贸易向来是和平的基础。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380619&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61100b4c-004e-4c9a-b192-6a7f8e8ec085', 'multiverseId': 380619}, 'multiverseid': 380619}, {'name': '集市節慶', 'text': '結附於地\\n每當所結附的地橫置以產生魔法力時，其操控者加兩點魔法力到其魔法力池中，其顏色組合由他選擇。（會得到原本該有的魔法力，並加上此份魔法力）。', 'type': '結界～靈氣', 'flavor': '貿易向來是和平的基礎。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380784&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ad34a995-5dc6-45f8-bbc7-a9c387d48729', 'multiverseId': 380784}, 'multiverseid': 380784}]", '[{\'name\': \'Münzschmied der Unterwelt\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn der Münzschmied der Unterwelt oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{W}{B}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Jeder Gegner verliert 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Mensch, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Die Münzen der Unterwelt werden aus tönernen Totenmasken gefertigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381019&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2027ef92-7091-4db4-b348-865103ff033a\', \'multiverseId\': 381019}, \'multiverseid\': 381019}, {\'name\': \'Forjamonedas del Inframundo\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que el Forjamonedas del inframundo u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas 1 vida.\\n{W}{B}, pagar 1 vida: Cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Clérigo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Las monedas del Inframundo están hechas a partir de máscaras funerarias de barro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a252519a-100d-49e1-b7f7-dfe13759d440\', \'multiverseId\': 382174}, \'multiverseid\': 382174}, {\'name\': \'Monnayeuse du Monde souterrain\', \'text\': \'Constellation — À chaque fois que la Monnayeuse du Monde souterrain ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{W}{B}, payez 1 point de vie : Chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : humain et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'La monnaie du Monde souterrain est créée à partir de masques funéraires en glaise.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381184&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f2e3862-2dba-47d3-963a-e4477c791585\', \'multiverseId\': 381184}, \'multiverseid\': 381184}, {\'name\': "Coniatrice dell\'Ade", \'text\': "Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta la Coniatrice dell\'Ade o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{W}{B}, Paga 1 punto vita: Ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Chierico Umano\', \'flavor\': "Le monete dell\'Ade sono create da maschere funebri di argilla.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2af8b71-1c97-483f-8be8-b0e7b9e57d1a\', \'multiverseId\': 381349}, \'multiverseid\': 381349}, {\'name\': \'死の国の造幣工\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 死の国の造幣工か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{W}{B}, ライフを１点支払う：各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 人間・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'死の国の貨幣は、粘土製の葬式用の仮面から成形されている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91b434f5-4098-4a1d-8d7d-b9a68c826da9\', \'multiverseId\': 381514}, \'multiverseid\': 381514}, {\'name\': \'저승 동전 대장장이\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 저승 동전 대장장이나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n{W}{B}, 생명 1점을 지불한다: 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 인간 성직자\', \'flavor\': \'지하세계의 동전은 진흙으로 된 장례식 가면으로부터 만들어진다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00248e27-f13a-47ab-a9eb-de108af96659\', \'multiverseId\': 381679}, \'multiverseid\': 381679}, {\'name\': \'Moedeiro do Submundo\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Moedeiro do Submundo ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{W}{B}, Pague 1 ponto de vida: Cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Humano Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'As moedas do submundo são moldadas com o barro de máscaras funerárias.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac752762-c1d3-4dc0-84c0-2f32a63693cc\', \'multiverseId\': 381844}, \'multiverseid\': 381844}, {\'name\': \'Чеканщик Подземного Царства\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Чеканщик Подземного Царства или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{W}{B}, заплатите 1 жизнь: каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Человек Священник\', \'flavor\': \'Монеты в Подземном царстве чеканят из глиняных похоронных масок.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7743fa2-c384-404c-82c7-c4ba2462f605\', \'multiverseId\': 382009}, \'multiverseid\': 382009}, {\'name\': \'冥界铸币匠\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当冥界铸币匠或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，你获得1点生命。\\n{W}{B}，支付1点生命：每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～人类／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'冥币由黏土制的葬仪面具铸成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'319c422c-caf3-4fc7-adf5-f329882fcb18\', \'multiverseId\': 380689}, \'multiverseid\': 380689}, {\'name\': \'冥界鑄幣匠\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當冥界鑄幣匠或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\\n{W}{B}，支付1點生命：每位對手各失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～人類／僧侶\', \'flavor\': \'冥幣由黏土製的葬儀面具鑄成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d7b08e-072f-4c7a-a3d9-e14094a05828\', \'multiverseId\': 380854}, \'multiverseid\': 380854}]', "[{'name': 'Nachdenklicher Minotaurus', 'type': 'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Krieger', 'flavor': 'Die Auserwählte und ihre Gefährten marschierten die ganze Nacht hindurch, aber die Schlacht war schon vorüber, als sie ankamen. Inmitten des Blutbades saß ein einzelner Minotaurus und der Auserwählten schien es, als wäre er in Gedanken versunken. —Die Theriaden', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380962&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73dfae2a-f950-4fe2-9cd1-c9bc23435cb4', 'multiverseId': 380962}, 'multiverseid': 380962}, {'name': 'Minotauro pensativo', 'type': 'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro', 'flavor': 'La Campeona y sus compañeros marcharon toda la noche, pero la batalla había terminado antes de que llegaran. En mitad de la carnicería estaba sentado un minotauro, perdido en lo que a la Campeona le parecieron pensamientos. —La Theríada', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382117&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1a73e23-1a2e-4662-a594-013f3b381094', 'multiverseId': 382117}, 'multiverseid': 382117}, {'name': 'Minotaure pensif', 'type': 'Créature : minotaure et guerrier', 'flavor': 'La Championne et ses compagnons marchèrent toute la nuit, mais la bataille était déjà terminée à leur arrivée. Au milieu du carnage se tenait un minotaure solitaire, perdu dans ce qui parut être des pensées à la Championne. —La Thériade', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381127&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f93adb90-2e85-487c-bd8c-b1c3fa2ca54f', 'multiverseId': 381127}, 'multiverseid': 381127}, {'name': 'Minotauro Meditabondo', 'type': 'Creatura — Guerriero Minotauro', 'flavor': 'La Campionessa e i suoi compagni marciarono per tutta la notte, ma la battaglia si concluse prima del loro arrivo. In mezzo alla carneficina sedeva un minotauro solitario, perso in qualcosa che alla Campionessa parve un pensiero. —La Theriade', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381292&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd66c6fd7-3fc0-4b9b-8bc3-7f0b0abeae1c', 'multiverseId': 381292}, 'multiverseid': 381292}, {'name': '悲しげなミノタウルス', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士', 'flavor': '女勇者とその従者たちは夜通しで行進を続けたが、彼女らが到着する前に戦いは終わっていた。殺戮の現場の中心に座っていたのは１体のミノタウルスであった。女勇者の目には、その者が何かを深く考え込んでいるかのように映った。 ――「テーリアス」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381457&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'daf862b3-6099-40b2-bef4-05bb20d71369', 'multiverseId': 381457}, 'multiverseid': 381457}, {'name': '고민하는 미노타우로스', 'type': '생물 — 미노타우로스 전사', 'flavor': '용사와 동료들은 밤새 진군하였지만, 전투는 그들이 도착하기도 전에 끝났다. 대학살의 현장 한가운데에 있던 단 한 마리의 미노타우로스는 용사가 보기에 깊은 생각에 잠겨 있는 것처럼 보였다. —테리아드', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381622&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0afe962-3f79-401b-898a-5ad42a8fc0ca', 'multiverseId': 381622}, 'multiverseid': 381622}, {'name': 'Minotauro Pensativo', 'type': 'Criatura — Minotauro Guerreiro', 'flavor': 'A Campeã e seus companheiros marcharam durante a noite, mas a batalha terminou antes que chegassem. Em meio à carnificina, estava sentado um solitário minotauro, perdido no que pareciam ser pensamentos para a Campeã. — A Teríada', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381787&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b988a4c-7037-4c20-b838-10ff4812930c', 'multiverseId': 381787}, 'multiverseid': 381787}, {'name': 'Задумчивый Минотавр', 'type': 'Существо — Минотавр Воин', 'flavor': 'Поборница и ее спутники шли всю ночь, но когда они прибыли на место, битва была уже закончена. Среди окровавленных тел сидел одинокий минотавр, погруженный в то, что показалось Поборнице раздумьями. — Териада', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381952&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '633d9e06-1bfb-4e72-b36e-6f02c77c25d0', 'multiverseId': 381952}, 'multiverseid': 381952}, {'name': '沉思牛头怪', 'type': '生物～牛头怪／战士', 'flavor': '天尊和她的同伴连夜赶路，但是在他们赶到之前，战斗就结束了。一匹牛头怪孤独地坐在尸体中间，在天尊看来好像是思考出神了。 ～《塞洛亚特》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380632&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfa5d164-e0ed-424c-aceb-4e1566d67792', 'multiverseId': 380632}, 'multiverseid': 380632}, {'name': '沉思牛頭怪', 'type': '生物～牛頭怪／戰士', 'flavor': '天尊和她的同伴連夜趕路，但是在他們趕到之前，戰鬥就結束了。一匹牛頭怪孤獨地坐在屍體中間，在天尊看來好像是思考出神了。 ～《塞洛亞特》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380797&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af2f27f4-280f-4397-8808-3e5b3b34d31b', 'multiverseId': 380797}, 'multiverseid': 380797}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nachschub-Kraniche\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Nachschub-Kraniche ins Spiel kommen lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Sobald sie geschlüpft sind, werden sie darauf abgerichtet, Hilfsmittel dorthin zu bringen, wo sie am dringendsten benötigt werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d56ebc-bc00-461e-a72f-97de91700616\', \'multiverseId\': 381007}, \'multiverseid\': 381007}, {\'name\': \'Grullas de línea de suministro\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando las Grullas de línea de suministro entren al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Se los entrena desde que rompen el cascarón para que presten ayuda allí donde más se necesita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d42feb-0ed4-4898-9ce4-fe8366a933b5\', \'multiverseId\': 382162}, \'multiverseid\': 382162}, {\'name\': \'Grues de ravitaillement\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand les Grues de ravitaillement arrivent sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "Depuis leur éclosion, elles sont dressées pour apporter de l\'aide là où elle est le plus indispensable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'716112bb-7fa9-4bd9-87da-41c6ad1d1b28\', \'multiverseId\': 381172}, \'multiverseid\': 381172}, {\'name\': \'Gru di Rifornimento\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando le Gru di Rifornimento entrano nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': "Sono addestrate fin dalla schiusa a recare aiuto dove ce n\'è più bisogno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06110677-8076-4c33-bfdd-9effbfb01c0c\', \'multiverseId\': 381337}, \'multiverseid\': 381337}, {\'name\': \'補給線の鶴\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n補給線の鶴が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'彼らは雛鳥の頃から、最も必要とされている場所を支援するよう訓練されている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'044aedb5-ddad-498b-981f-d98431aea1ee\', \'multiverseId\': 381502}, \'multiverseid\': 381502}, {\'name\': \'학 보급부대\', \'text\': \'비행\\n학 보급부대가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류\', \'flavor\': \'알에서 깨어날 때부터 가장 필요한 곳에 구호물자를 나르도록 훈련받는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d71444-20c8-4ff7-a41e-d3860a8975cb\', \'multiverseId\': 381667}, \'multiverseid\': 381667}, {\'name\': \'Grous de Suprimento\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Grous de Suprimento entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Eles são treinados desde que nascem para ajudar onde for mais necessário.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'690d58b6-f035-4635-bfde-77d83fb33d92\', \'multiverseId\': 381832}, \'multiverseid\': 381832}, {\'name\': \'Снабжающие Журавли\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Снабжающие Журавли выходят на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'Еще птенцами их учат доставлять подмогу туда, где она нужна больше всего.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb11133a-648e-430f-8062-e6d9b1ae66ac\', \'multiverseId\': 381997}, \'multiverseid\': 381997}, {\'name\': \'补给鹤\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当补给鹤进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'它们自幼便受人驯养，知晓该向最需要的地方提供援助。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'013b0e7f-5a0d-42fc-8e4b-b01b3843a3de\', \'multiverseId\': 380677}, \'multiverseid\': 380677}, {\'name\': \'補給鶴\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當補給鶴進戰場時，在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'牠們自幼便受人馴養，知曉該向最需要的地方提供援助。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaf9d79b-3e70-49e7-bf94-dcbaced0014b\', \'multiverseId\': 380842}, \'multiverseid\': 380842}]', '[{\'name\': \'Narbenbalg-Krüppel\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {3}{B} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nDer Narbenbalg-Krüppel kann nicht blocken.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+1 und kann nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Minotaurus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4074f93-42cb-4220-97fb-e78b6a94a941\', \'multiverseId\': 380919}, \'multiverseid\': 380919}, {\'name\': \'Pielmarcada retorcido\', \'text\': \'Concesión {3}{B}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nEl Pielmarcada retorcido no puede bloquear.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+1 y no puede bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02866f3c-dceb-4943-9841-27496cbf40c2\', \'multiverseId\': 382074}, \'multiverseid\': 382074}, {\'name\': \'Gangréné noueux\', \'text\': "Grâce {3}{B} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nLe Gangréné noueux ne peut pas bloquer.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+1 et ne peut pas bloquer.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : minotaure\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0a22b47-ac7f-4b31-a2e4-f2385f1e7d31\', \'multiverseId\': 381084}, \'multiverseid\': 381084}, {\'name\': \'Vellosfregiato Deforme\', \'text\': \'Conferire {3}{B} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nIl Vellosfregiato Deforme non può bloccare.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+1 e non può bloccare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6868b886-439b-4f17-9a81-c9d6fe6cf6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 381249}, \'multiverseid\': 381249}, {\'name\': \'節くれの傷皮持ち\', \'text\': \'授与 {3}{B} （このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\n節くれの傷皮持ちではブロックできない。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、＋２/＋１の修整を受けるとともに、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ミノタウルス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d0ede0b-7979-4a07-8c97-9281fd6c0c09\', \'multiverseId\': 381414}, \'multiverseid\': 381414}, {\'name\': \'뒤틀린 흉터가죽\', \'text\': \'권능 {3}{B} (이 카드의 권능 비용을 지불하고 발동하면, 이 카드는 생물에게 부여하는 마법진 주문이다. 이 카드는 생물에 부착되지 않은 상태가 되면 다시 생물이 된다.)\\n뒤틀린 흉터가죽은 방어할 수 없다.\\n부여된 생물은 +2/+1을 받으며 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 미노타우로스\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495acf8a-1b5f-4136-acc0-4f69fffe4f3e\', \'multiverseId\': 381579}, \'multiverseid\': 381579}, {\'name\': \'Mutilado das Cicatrizes\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {3}{B} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nMutilado das Cicatrizes não pode bloquear.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+1 e não pode bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb05193-a7a4-49cd-9e90-7b8cd0c1c98b\', \'multiverseId\': 381744}, \'multiverseid\': 381744}, {\'name\': \'Покрытый Шрамами Калека\', \'text\': \'Дар {3}{B} (Если вы разыгрываете эту карту за ее стоимость Дара, она является заклинанием Ауры со способностью «зачаровать существо». Она снова становится существом, если не прикреплена к существу.)\\nПокрытый Шрамами Калека не может блокировать.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+1 и не может блокировать.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Минотавр\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c55cec15-4575-4eed-9e16-62da4c3cac36\', \'multiverseId\': 381909}, \'multiverseid\': 381909}, {\'name\': \'糙节覆痕怪\', \'text\': \'神授{3}{B}（如果你支付此牌的神授费用来施放它，则它便是具「结附于生物」的灵气咒语。如果它未结附于生物上，就会再度成为生物。）\\n糙节覆痕怪不能进行阻挡。\\n所结附的生物得+2/+1且不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～牛头怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1063e0cb-ab90-4b17-9b1a-c63a1f933a39\', \'multiverseId\': 380589}, \'multiverseid\': 380589}, {\'name\': \'糙節覆痕怪\', \'text\': \'神授{3}{B}（如果你支付此牌的神授費用來施放它，則它便是具「結附於生物」的靈氣咒語。如果它未結附於生物上，就會再度成為生物。）\\n糙節覆痕怪不能進行阻擋。\\n所結附的生物得+2/+1且不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～牛頭怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a3c29a5-d9ed-410e-835c-39423077886c\', \'multiverseId\': 380754}, \'multiverseid\': 380754}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nessischer Wildhüter\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Nessische Wildhüter ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek an, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Wäldern ist, die du kontrollierst. Du kannst davon eine Kreaturenkarte offen vorzeigen und sie auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa573d5b-67ee-4484-a781-8f2efe6b3328\', \'multiverseId\': 380954}, \'multiverseid\': 380954}, {\'name\': \'Protectora de presas nessiana\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Protectora de presas nessiana entre al campo de batalla, mira las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, donde X es la cantidad de bosques que controlas. Puedes mostrar una carta de criatura que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf7c6f0b-2c02-47c4-b58a-246ca735fc5c\', \'multiverseId\': 382109}, \'multiverseid\': 382109}, {\'name\': \'Garde-chasse nessian\', \'text\': "Quand le Garde-chasse nessian arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, X étant le nombre de forêts que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez révéler une carte de créature parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans n\'importe quel ordre.", \'type\': \'Créature : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381119&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d35d7ea1-89bd-43e7-9380-f31443110d8a\', \'multiverseId\': 381119}, \'multiverseid\': 381119}, {\'name\': \'Guardacaccia Nessian\', \'text\': \'Quando la Guardacaccia Nessian entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime X carte del tuo grimorio, dove X è il numero di Foreste che controlli. Puoi rivelare una carta creatura tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2318aab-ff11-4ef0-9c0c-b768d34a0f2a\', \'multiverseId\': 381284}, \'multiverseid\': 381284}, {\'name\': \'ネシアンの猟区管理者\', \'text\': \'ネシアンの猟区管理者が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードを見る。Ｘはあなたがコントロールする森の総数に等しい。あなたはその中からクリーチャー・カードを１枚公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cba1cad-4d75-4ad7-aa9d-89ce3a6e8ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 381449}, \'multiverseid\': 381449}, {\'name\': \'네시안 숲 금렵구 관리자\', \'text\': \'네시안 숲 금렵구 관리자가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드X장을 본다. X는 당신이 조종하는 숲의 수이다. 당신은 그 중에서 생물 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 당신이 원하는 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a93dfdf8-b0fb-4712-b43f-3f915ab60a30\', \'multiverseId\': 381614}, \'multiverseid\': 381614}, {\'name\': \'Protetor da Fauna Nessiana\', \'text\': \'Quando Protetor da Fauna Nessiana entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os X cards do topo do seu grimório, sendo X o número de Florestas que você controla. Você pode revelar um card de criatura dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o resto no fundo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e45278a-540f-421b-9af0-77ca7b0cd281\', \'multiverseId\': 381779}, \'multiverseid\': 381779}, {\'name\': \'Нессийский Страж Дичи\', \'text\': \'Когда Нессийский Страж Дичи выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите X верхних карт вашей библиотеки, где X — количество Лесов под вашим контролем. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них карту существа и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62972692-73b8-4c34-ac10-5dfc44e8e587\', \'multiverseId\': 381944}, \'multiverseid\': 381944}, {\'name\': \'奈西安猎护兽\', \'text\': \'当奈西安猎护兽进战场时，检视你牌库顶的X张牌，X为由你操控的树林数量。你可以展示其中的一张生物牌，并将其置于你手上。将其余的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'674c3a77-4217-4e65-ac2f-02bda0e544b1\', \'multiverseId\': 380624}, \'multiverseid\': 380624}, {\'name\': \'奈西安獵護獸\', \'text\': \'當奈西安獵護獸進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的X張牌，X為由你操控的樹林數量。你可以展示其中的一張生物牌，並將其置於你手上。將其餘的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f607775-fced-481c-b596-5bb0dfb163fd\', \'multiverseId\': 380789}, \'multiverseid\': 380789}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nyx-Bewaffnung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Doppelschlag, solange sie eine Verzauberung ist. Anderenfalls verhindere allen Schaden, der von der verzauberten Kreatur zugefügt würde. (Eine Kreatur mit Doppelschlag fügt sowohl Erstschlags- als auch normalen Kampfschaden zu.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3295c47-0df2-4885-9a3f-530d8ddcff59\', \'multiverseId\': 380866}, \'multiverseid\': 380866}, {\'name\': \'Armamento de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de dañar dos veces mientras sea un encantamiento. De lo contrario, prevén todo el daño que fuera a hacer la criatura encantada. (Una criatura con la habilidad de dañar dos veces daña primero y también hace daño de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ea14f9-f31c-46d0-afb3-62f557ae1257\', \'multiverseId\': 382021}, \'multiverseid\': 382021}, {\'name\': \'Armement de Nyx\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée a la double initiative tant qu\'elle est un enchantement. Sinon, prévenez toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées par la créature enchantée. (Une créature avec la double initiative inflige des blessures d\'initiative et des blessures de combat normales.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381031&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7599a69b-596a-4613-809b-d13929edd353\', \'multiverseId\': 381031}, \'multiverseid\': 381031}, {\'name\': \'Armamento di Nyx\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata ha doppio attacco fintanto che è un incantesimo. Altrimenti, previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto dalla creatura incantata. (Una creatura con doppio attacco infligge sia danno da combattimento da attacco improvviso che danno da combattimento regolare.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0942d02-31aa-427c-a943-119db51ac8ff\', \'multiverseId\': 381196}, \'multiverseid\': 381196}, {\'name\': \'ニクスの武装\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それがエンチャントであるかぎり二段攻撃を持つ。そうでないなら、エンチャントされているクリーチャーが与えるすべてのダメージを軽減する。（二段攻撃を持つクリーチャーは先制攻撃と通常の戦闘ダメージの両方を与える。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afbb7980-7312-4ee1-88b4-744e9984f5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 381361}, \'multiverseid\': 381361}, {\'name\': \'닉스의 무기\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 부여마법인 한 이단공격을 가진다. 그렇지 않다면, 부여된 생물이 입히려고 하는 모든 피해를 방지한다. (이단공격을 가진 생물은 선제공격과 일반 전투 피해를 모두 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77194dae-c21a-4ebc-8819-7bb5577f2100\', \'multiverseId\': 381526}, \'multiverseid\': 381526}, {\'name\': \'Armamento de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada terá golpe duplo enquanto for um encantamento. Do contrário, previna todo o dano que seria causado pela criatura encantada. (Uma criatura com golpe duplo causa tanto o dano de iniciativa quanto o de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7db01982-0ba9-4f16-8541-18d105a02fcd\', \'multiverseId\': 381691}, \'multiverseid\': 381691}, {\'name\': \'Вооружение Никса\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nПока зачарованное существо является чарами, оно имеет Двойной удар. В противном случае предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены зачарованным существом. (Существо с Двойным ударом наносит боевые повреждения как на этапе Первого удара, так и на этапе обычных повреждений.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21f5f930-dc9a-4c34-8dae-1b1561eca52f\', \'multiverseId\': 381856}, \'multiverseid\': 381856}, {\'name\': \'尼兹战具\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n只要所结附的生物是结界，它便具有连击异能。若否，则防止所结附的生物将造成的所有伤害。（具连击异能的生物能造成先攻与普通战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8b24b75-0eef-4c78-8c79-dba062ba4329\', \'multiverseId\': 380536}, \'multiverseid\': 380536}, {\'name\': \'尼茲戰具\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n只要所結附的生物是結界，它便具有連擊異能。若否，則防止所結附的生物將造成的所有傷害。（具連擊異能的生物能造成先攻傷害以及普通戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95afa061-bf70-4b1b-abb3-46623b148a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 380701}, \'multiverseid\': 380701}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nyx-Infusion\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2, solange sie eine Verzauberung ist. Anderenfalls erhält sie -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Balsam oder Gift, je nachdem wie und wem es verabreicht wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380956&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f55a2943-bd85-43a2-8719-6e91f547696f\', \'multiverseId\': 380956}, \'multiverseid\': 380956}, {\'name\': \'Tisana de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 mientras sea un encantamiento. En caso contrario, obtiene -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Un bálsamo o un veneno, según cómo se administre y a quién.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26cb997f-58ab-4882-b332-d169ed419d6c\', \'multiverseId\': 382111}, \'multiverseid\': 382111}, {\'name\': \'Infusion de Nyx\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 tant qu\'elle est un enchantement. Sinon, elle gagne -2/-2.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'Onguent ou poison selon la manière, et à qui, elle est administrée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381121&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08bd32fe-47e4-4520-8837-0ed5336ed65b\', \'multiverseId\': 381121}, \'multiverseid\': 381121}, {\'name\': \'Infusione di Nyx\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 fintanto che è un incantesimo. Altrimenti, prende -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Un balsamo o un veleno a seconda di come, e a chi, viene somministrato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'452c12f8-1d75-4ece-b561-4c4fda80e111\', \'multiverseId\': 381286}, \'multiverseid\': 381286}, {\'name\': \'ニクスの注入\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、それがエンチャントであるかぎり＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。そうでないなら、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'これは処方の仕方と患者によって、軟膏にも毒薬にもなる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e797e0f8-ff77-4547-b4aa-bc02b5c64f27\', \'multiverseId\': 381451}, \'multiverseid\': 381451}, {\'name\': \'닉스 주입\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 부여마법인 한 +2/+2를 얻는다. 아니라면, -2/-2를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'약이 되느냐 독이 되느냐는 누구에게 어떻게 쓰냐에 달려 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7733bf31-f9b0-43eb-81d3-d27278a3b2d1\', \'multiverseId\': 381616}, \'multiverseid\': 381616}, {\'name\': \'Infusão de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 enquanto for um encantamento. Do contrário, ela recebe -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Pode ser um bálsamo ou um veneno. Dependendo de como é administrado e a quem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'400af53d-1916-4b71-9957-e57d3f1f9224\', \'multiverseId\': 381781}, \'multiverseid\': 381781}, {\'name\': \'Вливание Никса\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2, пока оно является чарами. В противном случае оно получает -2/-2.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Лекарство или яд — зависит от того, как и на ком его применять.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a12ed21-fe4a-4693-bcb6-d842a4236b25\', \'multiverseId\': 381946}, \'multiverseid\': 381946}, {\'name\': \'尼兹灌输\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n只要所结附的生物是结界，它便得+2/+2。若否，则它得-2/-2。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'是药是毒，取决于它的服用方式和服用的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5af18d50-04b6-420d-bcad-4c620be45ca4\', \'multiverseId\': 380626}, \'multiverseid\': 380626}, {\'name\': \'尼茲灌輸\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n只要所結附的生物是結界，它便得+2/+2。若否，則它得-2/-2。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'是藥是毒，取決於它的服用方式和服用的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58e46411-0207-426b-a969-a04efdf916de\', \'multiverseId\': 380791}, \'multiverseid\': 380791}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nyx-Weberin\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nLege zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.\\n{1}{B}{G}, schicke die Nyx-Weberin ins Exil: Bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380957&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db7be3f4-9983-491a-b139-561307ff4a19\', \'multiverseId\': 380957}, \'multiverseid\': 380957}, {\'name\': \'Tejedora de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, pon las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.\\n{1}{B}{G}, exiliar la Tejedora de Nyx: Regresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Araña\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34693354-26e5-4c64-bca6-7ce06af66ad0\', \'multiverseId\': 382112}, \'multiverseid\': 382112}, {\'name\': \'Tisseuse de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nAu début de votre entretien, mettez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.\\n{1}{B}{G}, exilez la Tisseuse de Nyx : Renvoyez une carte ciblée de votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : araignée\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d467d21c-943c-4ac9-9d60-32895e1afa02\', \'multiverseId\': 381122}, \'multiverseid\': 381122}, {\'name\': \'Tessitrice di Nyx\', \'text\': "Raggiungere\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, metti nel tuo cimitero le prime due carte del tuo grimorio.\\n{1}{B}{G}, Esilia la Tessitrice di Nyx: Riprendi in mano una carta bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ragno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dc4eb9d-f75a-463a-9a81-d8aa0f9c619d\', \'multiverseId\': 381287}, \'multiverseid\': 381287}, {\'name\': \'ニクスの織り手\', \'text\': \'到達\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\\n{1}{B}{G}, ニクスの織り手を追放する：あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e69a56ec-6908-41b1-8017-bad5535e4a7e\', \'multiverseId\': 381452}, \'multiverseid\': 381452}, {\'name\': \'닉스 방직공\', \'text\': \'대공\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 당신의 무덤에 넣는다.\\n{1}{B}{G} 닉스 방직공을 추방한다: 당신의 무덤에 있는 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 거미\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3395c883-36c0-46ae-8812-86527ec2e1c7\', \'multiverseId\': 381617}, \'multiverseid\': 381617}, {\'name\': \'Tecedora de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nNo início de sua manutenção, coloque os dois cards do topo de seu grimório em seu cemitério.\\n{1}{B}{G}, Exile Tecedora de Nyx: Devolva o card alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Aranha\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77ad74db-0ea4-4531-9cce-0de7e128fa81\', \'multiverseId\': 381782}, \'multiverseid\': 381782}, {\'name\': \'Прядильщик Никса\', \'text\': \'Захват\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки положите две верхние карты вашей библиотеки на ваше кладбище.\\n{1}{B}{G}, изгоните Прядильщика Никса: верните целевую карту из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6fc139e-2005-4962-bf63-cae7fb3fc734\', \'multiverseId\': 381947}, \'multiverseid\': 381947}, {\'name\': \'尼兹蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'延势\\n在你的维持开始时，将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场。\\n{1}{B}{G}，放逐尼兹蜘蛛：将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50feffd4-bd2b-4901-ac08-a23377b0eb21\', \'multiverseId\': 380627}, \'multiverseid\': 380627}, {\'name\': \'尼茲蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'延勢\\n在你的維持開始時，將你牌庫頂的兩張牌置入你的墳墓場。\\n{1}{B}{G}，放逐尼茲蜘蛛：將目標牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76b1452f-073b-409f-9d93-15a80586c6a3\', \'multiverseId\': 380792}, \'multiverseid\': 380792}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nyxvlies-Widder\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Schaf\', \'flavor\': \'Kaum etwas fasziniert die Götter so sehr wie Unschuld. Womöglich da diese Eigenschaft unter ihresgleichen nicht zu finden ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380958&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eceedbc7-86f3-4429-a3e1-41d7967d7c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 380958}, \'multiverseid\': 380958}, {\'name\': \'Carnero vellocino de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Oveja\', \'flavor\': \'La inocencia fascina a los dioses, quizá porque es una cualidad de la que ellos carecen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50b47304-bf7b-47a7-ab1d-6f16a61f8894\', \'multiverseId\': 382113}, \'multiverseid\': 382113}, {\'name\': \'Bélier à toison de Nyx\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : mouton\', \'flavor\': "Les dieux sont fascinés par l\'innocence, peut-être parce qu\'il s\'agit d\'une qualité qui leur fait défaut.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41b86dfb-6005-40d4-9254-b6e0208c1d54\', \'multiverseId\': 381123}, \'multiverseid\': 381123}, {\'name\': \'Ariete dal Vello di Nyx\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Pecora\', \'flavor\': "Gli dei sono affascinati dall\'innocenza, forse perché è una qualità di cui loro stessi sono sprovvisti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b05dd8a-205d-4882-a30d-338c31e2510a\', \'multiverseId\': 381288}, \'multiverseid\': 381288}, {\'name\': \'ニクス毛の雄羊\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 羊\', \'flavor\': \'神々は無垢さというものに魅了されている。それは神々自身がそのような資質を持たないからなのかもしれない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e2a129c-bf08-437a-9c19-aa035654a000\', \'multiverseId\': 381453}, \'multiverseid\': 381453}, {\'name\': \'닉스 양털 산양\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 양\', \'flavor\': \'신들은 순수함에 매료되는데, 그건 아마도 그들에게는 없는 것이기 때문이라고 생각된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f6bc324-cf49-405a-b8e2-97863c0c2034\', \'multiverseId\': 381618}, \'multiverseid\': 381618}, {\'name\': \'Carneiro Velocino-de-Nyx\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Ovelha\', \'flavor\': \'Os deuses são fascinados pela inocência. Provavelmente porque essa é uma qualidade que eles próprios não têm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73946c75-48b7-4a80-a11b-67ed87148200\', \'multiverseId\': 381783}, \'multiverseid\': 381783}, {\'name\': \'Звезднорунный Овен\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Овца\', \'flavor\': \'Богов восхищает невинность — возможно, потому что это качество у них не встречается.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f62c1fd-4bc3-47d0-8825-a84ba54f6198\', \'multiverseId\': 381948}, \'multiverseid\': 381948}, {\'name\': \'星绒绵羊\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～绵羊\', \'flavor\': \'众神着迷于其无邪外表，或许是因为自身缺乏此特质。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc069af5-1c1b-4360-8fa3-9466997c0823\', \'multiverseId\': 380628}, \'multiverseid\': 380628}, {\'name\': \'星絨綿羊\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～綿羊\', \'flavor\': \'眾神著迷於其無邪外表，或許是因為自身缺乏此特質。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b75b3b70-3ad9-48ca-8d09-cb18c53536aa\', \'multiverseId\': 380793}, \'multiverseid\': 380793}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oreskos-Scharfkralle\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Nach der Schlacht um die Pharagax-Brücke verbrachte die Auserwählte viele Monate bei den Leoniden von Oreskos. Sie lernte, dass sie schnell zu den Waffen griffen, aber nicht etwa, da sie leicht reizbar waren, sondern da sie es genossen, in den Kampf zu ziehen. —Die Theriaden\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcdfaadd-6489-41d7-a704-58efa3886a2b\', \'multiverseId\': 380961}, \'multiverseid\': 380961}, {\'name\': \'Garraveloz de Oreskos\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero felino\', \'flavor\': \'Tras la batalla del Puente Faragax, la Campeona pasó varios meses en compañía de los leoninos de Oreskos. Descubrió que no costaba mucho ofenderlos, no porque fueran susceptibles, sino porque siempre estaban ansiosos por luchar. —La Theríada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45983a4-323d-466e-9902-bf4cda9b317e\', \'multiverseId\': 382116}, \'multiverseid\': 382116}, {\'name\': "Lestegriffe d\'Oreskos", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Après la Bataille du pont de Pharagax, la Championne resta des mois chez les léonins d\'Oreskos. Elle découvrit qu\'ils prenaient rapidement ombrage, non pas parce qu\'ils étaient susceptibles, mais parce qu\'ils cherchaient toujours une excuse pour se battre. —La Thériade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c8e94d1-9573-4a22-8eb6-70d2b59a1009\', \'multiverseId\': 381126}, \'multiverseid\': 381126}, {\'name\': \'Artiglio Rapido di Oreskos\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Felino\', \'flavor\': "Dopo la battaglia del Ponte di Faragax, la Campionessa trascorse molti mesi tra i leonid di Oreskos. Capì che erano facili all\'offesa non perché suscettibili, ma perché sempre ansiosi di combattere. —La Theriade", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09c140f-a0dc-4a34-9d45-92090a6bab20\', \'multiverseId\': 381291}, \'multiverseid\': 381291}, {\'name\': \'オレスコスの速爪\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'ファラガックス橋での戦いの後、女勇者はオレスコスのレオニンたちと共に何ヶ月もの時を過ごした。その中で彼女は、彼らが些細なことで怒るのは気難しいからではなく、常に喧嘩をする機会を求めているからなのだという事が分かってきた。 ――「テーリアス」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59a2d205-26c7-4da9-b733-f8129ba7adc7\', \'multiverseId\': 381456}, \'multiverseid\': 381456}, {\'name\': \'빠른발톱 오레스코스\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 전사\', \'flavor\': \'파라각스 다리 전투 이후, 엘스페스는 오레스코스의 레오닌 무리 사이에서 여러 달을 보냈다. 그녀는 레오닌들이 예민해서가 아니라 싸움을 원하기 때문에 자주 화를 낸다는 것을 깨달았다. —테리아드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7c6289-e699-4ff0-8235-71e7af4d9911\', \'multiverseId\': 381621}, \'multiverseid\': 381621}, {\'name\': \'Garra-veloz de Oreskos\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Depois da Batalha da Ponte Faragax, a Campeã passou vários meses entre os leoninos de Oreskos. Ela descobriu que eles se ofendem facilmente. Não por serem especialmente sensíveis, mas porque estão sempre ansiosos por uma briga. — A Teríada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dc106b1-0175-40a6-820e-4f12e84034e7\', \'multiverseId\': 381786}, \'multiverseid\': 381786}, {\'name\': \'Быстрый Коготь из Ореска\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Воин\', \'flavor\': \'После битвы на мосту Фарагакс Поборница долго жила среди леонинцев Ореска. Оказалось, что леонинцев очень легко оскорбить. Но не потому, что они такие чувствительные, а потому, что они всегда готовы подраться. — Териада\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4957efc5-7456-4c54-9d4b-b419e43430b5\', \'multiverseId\': 381951}, \'multiverseid\': 381951}, {\'name\': \'俄瑞恣迅爪兵\', \'type\': \'生物～猫／战士\', \'flavor\': \'法拉伽斯桥之战过后，天尊与俄瑞恣狮族共处了数月。她发现，他们的性情火爆并不是因为敏感易怒，而是因为天性好战。 ～《塞洛亚特》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8222fe5-0d4d-46fe-b80b-c438d7d8b13c\', \'multiverseId\': 380631}, \'multiverseid\': 380631}, {\'name\': \'俄瑞恣迅爪兵\', \'type\': \'生物～貓／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'法拉伽斯橋之戰過後，天尊與俄瑞恣獅族共處了數月。她發現，他們的性情火爆並不是因為敏感易怒，而是因為天性好戰。 ～《塞洛亞特》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02d68797-1e66-405d-9f82-e8142a2f62a1\', \'multiverseId\': 380796}, \'multiverseid\': 380796}]', '[{\'name\': \'Phalanx-Formation\', \'text\': \'Streben — Die Phalanx-Formation kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1}{W} mehr.\\nEine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Doppelschlag. (Sie fügen sowohl Erstschlags- als auch normalen Kampfschaden zu.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'109afcc4-a4cd-4a12-8284-70e98d8fc4c7\', \'multiverseId\': 380963}, \'multiverseid\': 380963}, {\'name\': \'Formación de falange\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Formación de falange cuesta {1}{W} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nCualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo ganan cada una la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno. (Esas criaturas dañan primero y también hacen daño de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5230a7cd-bcff-484c-942d-0acbcf249736\', \'multiverseId\': 382118}, \'multiverseid\': 382118}, {\'name\': \'Formation de la phalange\', \'text\': "Obstination — La Formation de la phalange coûte {1}{W} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nN\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées acquièrent chacune la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elles infligent des blessures de combat d\'initiative et des blessures de combat normales.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381128&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d42139f-4bec-4d4e-b692-a26d5943e451\', \'multiverseId\': 381128}, \'multiverseid\': 381128}, {\'name\': \'Falange Serrata\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — La Falange Serrata costa {1}{W} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno. (Infliggono sia danno da combattimento da attacco improvviso che danno da combattimento regolare.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'034d536c-0dd3-4a83-829f-f329b9803153\', \'multiverseId\': 381293}, \'multiverseid\': 381293}, {\'name\': \'密集軍の隊形\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 密集軍の隊形を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}{W}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはターン終了時まで二段攻撃を得る。（それらは先制攻撃と通常の戦闘ダメージの両方を与える。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c179aa51-feee-4b81-9534-2c1ae61080a3\', \'multiverseId\': 381458}, \'multiverseid\': 381458}, {\'name\': \'팔랑크스 대형\', \'text\': \'분투 — 팔랑크스 대형은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {1}{W}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 각각 이단공격을 얻는다. (그 생물들은 선제공격 전투피해와 일반 전투피해를 둘 다 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7de5c43e-622b-4a7e-9365-02bede365289\', \'multiverseId\': 381623}, \'multiverseid\': 381623}, {\'name\': \'Formação de Falange\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Formação de Falange custa {1}{W} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nQualquer número de criaturas alvo ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno. (Elas causam tanto o dano de iniciativa quanto o dano de combate normal.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be1f755-ffe5-434d-a0ff-8fdd38106329\', \'multiverseId\': 381788}, \'multiverseid\': 381788}, {\'name\': \'Построение Фалангой\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Построения Фалангой стоит на {1}{W} больше.\\nЛюбое количество целевых существ получают Двойной удар до конца хода. (Они наносят боевые повреждения как на этапе Первого удара, так и на этапе обычных повреждений.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07fd0df2-b978-4a4a-a4f3-8f47dbfa200f\', \'multiverseId\': 381953}, \'multiverseid\': 381953}, {\'name\': \'方阵队型\', \'text\': \'积力～方阵队型在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{1}{W}来施放。\\n任意数量的目标生物各获得连击异能直到回合结束。（它们能造成先攻与普通战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86b6d700-9182-43a3-ba68-6a30de80cea3\', \'multiverseId\': 380633}, \'multiverseid\': 380633}, {\'name\': \'方陣隊型\', \'text\': \'積力～方陣隊型在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{1}{W}來施放。\\n任意數量的目標生物各獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。（它們能造成先攻與普通戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d8e783f-4a31-44f2-8a42-59f10810feef\', \'multiverseId\': 380798}, \'multiverseid\': 380798}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pharika, Göttin der Gebrechen\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\nSolange deine Hingabe zu Schwarz und Grün weniger als sieben beträgt, ist Pharika keine Kreatur.\\n{B}{G}: Schicke eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil. Ihr Besitzer bringt einen 1/1 schwarzen und grünen Ophis-Verzauberungskreaturenspielstein mit Todesberührung ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Verzauberungskreatur — Gott\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6cd47e9-055f-42d1-b18f-ed79852c0e86\', \'multiverseId\': 380964}, \'multiverseid\': 380964}, {\'name\': \'Farika, diosa de la aflicción\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\nMientras tu devoción al negro y al verde sea menor que siete, Farika no es una criatura.\\n{B}{G}: Exilia la carta de criatura objetivo de un cementerio. Su propietario pone en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura encantamiento Víbora negra y verde 1/1 con la habilidad de toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento legendaria — Deidad\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12c6c5f8-9505-4bf6-932b-a97c592dcc1f\', \'multiverseId\': 382119}, \'multiverseid\': 382119}, {\'name\': "Pharika, déesse de l\'Affliction", \'text\': "Indestructible\\nTant que votre dévotion au noir et au vert est inférieure à sept, Pharika n\'est pas une créature.\\n{B}{G} : Exilez une carte de créature ciblée d\'un cimetière. Son propriétaire met sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature-enchantement 1/1 noir et vert Serpent avec le contact mortel.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement légendaire : dieu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381129&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'471a756f-1bb1-43c2-8adb-1b615868ab80\', \'multiverseId\': 381129}, \'multiverseid\': 381129}, {\'name\': "Farika, Dea dell\'Afflizione", \'text\': \'Indistruttibile\\nFintanto che la tua devozione al nero e al verde è inferiore a sette, Farika non è una creatura.\\n{B}{G}: Esilia una carta creatura bersaglio da un cimitero. Il suo proprietario mette sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura incantesimo Serpente 1/1 nera e verde con tocco letale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo Leggendaria — Dio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7d62412-17b1-4c67-b46f-d91066666567\', \'multiverseId\': 381294}, \'multiverseid\': 381294}, {\'name\': \'苦悶の神、ファリカ\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\nあなたの黒と緑への信心が７未満であるかぎり、苦悶の神、ファリカはクリーチャーではない。\\n{B}{G}：いずれかの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。それのオーナーは、接死を持つ黒であり緑である１/１の蛇・クリーチャー・エンチャント・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー・エンチャント — 神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8875d80a-01da-4c8f-9bda-64fc1307ac7c\', \'multiverseId\': 381459}, \'multiverseid\': 381459}, {\'name\': \'고통의 신 파리카\', \'text\': \'무적\\n당신의 흑녹 신앙심이 7 미만인 한, 파리카는 생물이 아니다.\\n{B}{G}: 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 그 카드의 소유자는 치명타 능력을 가진 1/1 흑색 및 녹색 뱀 부여마법 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 부여마법 생물 — 신\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcadb8e5-6c85-4eb4-8c94-a526f87fe77f\', \'multiverseId\': 381624}, \'multiverseid\': 381624}, {\'name\': \'Fárica, Deusa do Padecimento\', \'text\': \'Indestrutível\\nEnquanto sua devoção ao preto e ao verde for menor que sete, Fárica não será uma criatura.\\n{B}{G}: Exile o card de criatura alvo de um cemitério. Seu dono coloca no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura encantamento preta e verde 1/1 do tipo Cobra com toque mortífero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento Lendária — Deus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f739c8ef-b6b9-4403-8832-fba4f2b5f05d\', \'multiverseId\': 381789}, \'multiverseid\': 381789}, {\'name\': \'Фарика, Богиня Недуга\', \'text\': \'Неразрушимость\\nПока ваша Преданность черному и зеленому меньше семи, Фарика не является существом.\\n{B}{G}: изгоните целевую карту существа из кладбища. Ее владелец кладет на поле битвы одну фишку чар существа 1/1 черная и зеленая Змея со Смертельным касанием.\', \'type\': \'Легендарные Чары Существо — Бог\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af233e99-ebd8-4c09-a89c-930d2120ac29\', \'multiverseId\': 381954}, \'multiverseid\': 381954}, {\'name\': \'折磨神芳瑞卡\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n只要你的黑绿两色献力小于七，芳瑞卡便不是生物。\\n{B}{G}：将目标生物牌从坟墓场放逐。其拥有者将一个1/1黑绿双色，具死触异能的蛇衍生结界生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇结界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c4693bd-8b0b-43c4-a017-0886568d7320\', \'multiverseId\': 380634}, \'multiverseid\': 380634}, {\'name\': \'折磨神芳瑞卡\', \'text\': \'不滅\\n只要你的黑綠兩色獻力小於七，芳瑞卡便不是生物。\\n{B}{G}：將目標生物牌從墳墓場放逐。其擁有者將一個1/1黑綠雙色，具死觸異能的蛇衍生結界生物置入戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇結界生物～神\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a79d12dd-3dbc-46a3-bccb-467f7aa2e187\', \'multiverseId\': 380799}, \'multiverseid\': 380799}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pharikas Auserwählte\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis\', \'flavor\': \'Die Schlangennester, die in die Statuen der Pharika eingearbeitet sind, sollen ihre Tempel nicht nur weihen, sondern auch verteidigen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e75ffd4-c8b4-4770-8b09-c703a4206a73\', \'multiverseId\': 380965}, \'multiverseid\': 380965}, {\'name\': \'Elegida de Farika\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que esto haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Víbora\', \'flavor\': \'Los nidos de serpiente construidos en las estatuas de Farika no solo sirven para consagrar sus templos, sino también como una línea de defensa oculta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf5d962d-d2bb-4e07-a542-49bffbc8b584\', \'multiverseId\': 382120}, \'multiverseid\': 382120}, {\'name\': \'Élue de Pharika\', \'text\': "Contact mortel (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : serpent\', \'flavor\': \'Les nids de serpents creusés dans les statues de Pharika servent non seulement à consacrer ses temples, mais aussi à les défendre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381130&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4117c40-d31b-450f-a807-ce8114ee0ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 381130}, \'multiverseid\': 381130}, {\'name\': \'Prescelta di Farika\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Serpente\', \'flavor\': \'I nidi di serpenti ricavati nelle statue di Farika servono non solo per consacrare i suoi templi, ma anche come forma di protezione occulta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48e59f6c-38af-4625-9660-37aa183eb5c2\', \'multiverseId\': 381295}, \'multiverseid\': 381295}, {\'name\': \'ファリカに選ばれしもの\', \'text\': \'接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇\', \'flavor\': \'ファリカの像に作られた蛇の巣は、その神殿を聖成するだけでなく、隠れた防衛線としての役目も持つ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad891c74-982c-4731-8ef4-6d41b6b41c26\', \'multiverseId\': 381460}, \'multiverseid\': 381460}, {\'name\': \'파리카의 정예병\', \'text\': \'치명타 (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 뱀\', \'flavor\': \'파리카의 석상 안에 지은 이무기의 동굴은 그녀의 사원에 봉헌되었을 뿐만 아니라 숨겨진 방어선의 역할도 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2d81748-98fb-42f1-ad75-4007b3e62ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 381625}, \'multiverseid\': 381625}, {\'name\': \'Escolhida de Fárica\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero (Qualquer quantidade de dano que esta criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cobra\', \'flavor\': \'Os ninhos de serpente feitos nas estátuas de Fárica servem não só para consagrar seus templos, mas também como uma linha de defesa oculta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6481743-73e6-4968-b31b-fa2a5ca59681\', \'multiverseId\': 381790}, \'multiverseid\': 381790}, {\'name\': \'Избранница Фарики\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание (Любое количество повреждений, которое этот объект наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Змея\', \'flavor\': \'Змеиные гнезда, которые устраивают в статуях Фарики, служат не только для освящения ее храмов. Дерзнувших напасть на святилище ждет неприятный сюрприз.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a022cf8e-d0ce-48ea-acfe-627ccfa92bed\', \'multiverseId\': 381955}, \'multiverseid\': 381955}, {\'name\': \'芳瑞卡的精卫\', \'text\': \'死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蛇\', \'flavor\': \'蛇穴与芳瑞卡的雕像化为一体，不仅可以用来献祭神庙，还可以当作隐秘防线。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aeaf3b0-b5ad-4b10-bb2e-a8774bdbf777\', \'multiverseId\': 380635}, \'multiverseid\': 380635}, {\'name\': \'芳瑞卡的精衛\', \'text\': \'死觸（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蛇\', \'flavor\': \'蛇穴與芳瑞卡的雕像化為一體，不僅可以用來獻祭神廟，還可以當作隱秘防線。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a1cd892-78aa-4b15-9beb-56cfbcea005d\', \'multiverseId\': 380800}, \'multiverseid\': 380800}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pionierin der Lagonna-Herde\', \'text\': \'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der die Pionierin der Lagonna-Herde als Ziel hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Pionierin der Lagonna-Herde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zentaur, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Ziehe aus mit Ehre, kehre zurück mit Ruhm.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8faec564-2f17-4d82-91f3-5cac74b19f64\', \'multiverseId\': 380943}, \'multiverseid\': 380943}, {\'name\': \'Pionera del clan Lagonna\', \'text\': \'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo a la Pionera del clan Lagonna, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Pionera del clan Lagonna.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador centauro\', \'flavor\': \'Parte con honor, regresa con gloria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96b13fd-7c31-4cf3-bed1-cbc2a6ad6121\', \'multiverseId\': 382098}, \'multiverseid\': 382098}, {\'name\': \'Pionnière du clan Lagonna\', \'text\': \'Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible la Pionnière du clan Lagonna, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la Pionnière du clan Lagonna.\', \'type\': \'Créature : centaure et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Partez avec l\'honneur, revenez avec la gloire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a2f0e9-6270-4b67-96a4-61f69c32a746\', \'multiverseId\': 381108}, \'multiverseid\': 381108}, {\'name\': \'Scopripista della Banda Lagonna\', \'text\': \'Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia la Scopripista della Banda Lagonna, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sulla Scopripista della Banda Lagonna.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Centauro\', \'flavor\': \'Parti con onore, torna nella gloria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e4c9220-d2ce-4118-8088-25afcb1537d6\', \'multiverseId\': 381273}, \'multiverseid\': 381273}, {\'name\': \'ラゴンナ団の先駆者\', \'text\': \'英雄的 ― あなたがラゴンナ団の先駆者を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、ラゴンナ団の先駆者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ケンタウルス・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'名誉とともに出撃し、栄光とともに凱旋せよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5222d44e-9539-4549-9633-0b421c8750b5\', \'multiverseId\': 381438}, \'multiverseid\': 381438}, {\'name\': \'라곤나 무리 개척자\', \'text\': \'영웅 — 당신이 라곤나 무리 개척자를 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 라곤나 무리 개척자에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 켄타우로스 정찰병\', \'flavor\': \'명예를 품고 나아가 영광과 함께 돌아오라.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a152a39d-3ae8-4dcf-8508-a4b09f95ce16\', \'multiverseId\': 381603}, \'multiverseid\': 381603}, {\'name\': \'Pioneira do Bando de Lagonna\', \'text\': \'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica que tenha como alvo Pioneira do Bando de Lagonna, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Pioneira do Bando de Lagonna.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Centauro Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Vá com honra, retorne com glória.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1309971d-182a-4f62-9bdc-4a661b9f9e78\', \'multiverseId\': 381768}, \'multiverseid\': 381768}, {\'name\': \'Путница Племени Лагонна\', \'text\': \'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Путница Племени Лагонна, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Путницу Племени Лагонна.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кентавр Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Ступай с честью, возвращайся со славой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cd744cc-67cb-4c60-8c24-b166f295e42b\', \'multiverseId\': 381933}, \'multiverseid\': 381933}, {\'name\': \'拉苟那族开路人\', \'text\': \'勇行～每当你施放一个以拉苟那族开路人为目标的咒语时，在拉苟那族开路人上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～半人马／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'秉誉前行，光荣归返。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4835e2ca-9ce0-442a-9ec5-41a7f242179f\', \'multiverseId\': 380613}, \'multiverseid\': 380613}, {\'name\': \'拉苟那族開路人\', \'text\': \'勇行～每當你施放一個以拉苟那族開路人為目標的咒語時，在拉苟那族開路人上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～半人馬／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'秉譽前行，光榮歸返。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9034bfc1-826e-4b8a-add2-00347b6b4058\', \'multiverseId\': 380778}, \'multiverseid\': 380778}]', '[{\'name\': \'Polymorpher Ansturm\', \'text\': \'Streben — Polymorpher Ansturm kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1}{U} mehr.\\nBestimme eine Kreatur im Spiel. Eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer Kopie dieser Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3297db3-ea44-4665-b0e3-e8c6d17146f8\', \'multiverseId\': 380969}, \'multiverseid\': 380969}, {\'name\': \'Embestida polimórfica\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Embestida polimórfica cuesta {1}{U} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nElige una criatura en el campo de batalla. Cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo que controlas se convierten cada una en una copia de esa criatura hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'785c49f6-9d47-4d21-b410-3f0f593ea122\', \'multiverseId\': 382124}, \'multiverseid\': 382124}, {\'name\': \'Ruée polymorphe\', \'text\': "Obstination — La Ruée polymorphe coûte {1}{U} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nChoisissez une créature sur le champ de bataille. N\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez deviennent chacune une copie de cette créature jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381134&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35fd2d9f-823a-4904-ab10-e5122e94c116\', \'multiverseId\': 381134}, \'multiverseid\': 381134}, {\'name\': \'Carica dei Polimorfi\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — La Carica dei Polimorfi costa {1}{U} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli una creatura sul campo di battaglia e un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio che controlli. Ognuna di esse diventa una copia di quella creatura fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f7f8a4-5569-4652-bb35-936784b39296\', \'multiverseId\': 381299}, \'multiverseid\': 381299}, {\'name\': \'変身体の殺到\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 変身体の殺到を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}{U}多くなる。\\n望む数のあなたがコントロールするクリーチャーを対象とする。戦場に出ているクリーチャー１体を選ぶ。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで選ばれたクリーチャーのコピーになる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b61bec94-dc97-4d49-a50e-d3ef43fad810\', \'multiverseId\': 381464}, \'multiverseid\': 381464}, {\'name\': \'변이하는 돌진\', \'text\': \'분투 — 변이하는 돌진은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는데 {1}{U}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n전장에 있는 생물 하나를 선택한다. 당신이 조종하는 생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들은 턴종료까지 선택한 생물의 복사본이 된다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbbb6f6a-c4cd-4e62-b88a-3d4e7c5d7c5c\', \'multiverseId\': 381629}, \'multiverseid\': 381629}, {\'name\': \'Corrida Polimórfica\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Corrida Polimórfica custa {1}{U} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nEscolha uma criatura no campo de batalha. Qualquer número de criaturas alvo que você controla se torna uma cópia daquela criatura até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0712fb8a-300b-4a8b-9a0b-8eae7f99bdd7\', \'multiverseId\': 381794}, \'multiverseid\': 381794}, {\'name\': \'Изменчивый Натиск\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Изменчивого Натиска стоит на {1}{U} больше.\\nВыберите существо на поле битвы. Любое количество целевых существ под вашим контролем становятся копией того существа до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e64b0018-f4ec-4d30-b2bc-836cd033a7d9\', \'multiverseId\': 381959}, \'multiverseid\': 381959}, {\'name\': \'幻型涌现\', \'text\': \'积力～幻型涌现在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{1}{U}来施放。\\n选择战场上的一个生物。直到回合结束，任意数量目标由你操控的生物成为该生物的复制品。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'596c96b7-6ba8-4a13-976a-1e7c02c954ae\', \'multiverseId\': 380639}, \'multiverseid\': 380639}, {\'name\': \'幻型湧現\', \'text\': \'積力～幻型湧現在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{1}{U}來施放。\\n選擇戰場上的一個生物。直到回合結束，任意數量目標由你操控的生物成為該生物的複製品。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'927bd0fd-374d-4309-94e3-da1efd9e1b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 380804}, \'multiverseid\': 380804}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prophetischer Flammenseher\', \'text\': \'Doppelschlag, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Prophetische Flammenseher einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Feuer, um zu zerstören. Feuer, um zu erschaffen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcf471a2-826a-414d-9530-003617112821\', \'multiverseId\': 380970}, \'multiverseid\': 380970}, {\'name\': \'Portavoz ígneo profético\', \'text\': \'Daña dos veces, arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Portavoz ígneo profético haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'Fuego para destruir. Fuego para crear.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6840e65e-8f21-4de0-a82c-771236ab2e1e\', \'multiverseId\': 382125}, \'multiverseid\': 382125}, {\'name\': \'Orateur de feu prophétique\', \'text\': "Double initiative, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Orateur de feu prophétique inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la jouer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'Du feu pour détruire. Du feu pour créer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381135&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2761bef2-b27c-4493-8725-1105a254ad38\', \'multiverseId\': 381135}, \'multiverseid\': 381135}, {\'name\': \'Profeta Oratore delle Fiamme\', \'text\': \'Doppio attacco, travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta il Profeta Oratore delle Fiamme infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocarla in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Fuoco per distruggere. Fuoco per creare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d5021a8-98cf-4154-bfee-72160dfd05b8\', \'multiverseId\': 381300}, \'multiverseid\': 381300}, {\'name\': \'予言の炎語り\', \'text\': \'二段攻撃、トランプル\\n予言の炎語りがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを追放する。このターン、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'破壊のための炎。創造のための炎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24451407-e377-4cf6-b16f-e3c54f2ccbd2\', \'multiverseId\': 381465}, \'multiverseid\': 381465}, {\'name\': \'예언하는 화염술사\', \'text\': \'이단공격, 돌진\\n예언하는 화염술사가 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 추방한다. 당신은 이 턴에 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'파괴의 불. 창조의 불.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3085ebfa-e62c-43a6-ac67-a28a86202949\', \'multiverseId\': 381630}, \'multiverseid\': 381630}, {\'name\': \'Flamividente Profético\', \'text\': \'Golpe duplo, atropelar\\nToda vez que Flamividente Profético causar dano de combate a um jogador, exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogá-lo neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Fogo para destruir. Fogo para criar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67fb9cd-f36a-4cd1-ab15-1a1d631d2bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 381795}, \'multiverseid\': 381795}, {\'name\': \'Огнеречивый Пророк\', \'text\': \'Двойной удар, Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Огнеречивый Пророк наносит боевые повреждения игроку, изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Огонь, чтобы разрушать. Огонь, чтобы творить.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc36c784-81d4-457f-8fa8-5e844ff9ad75\', \'multiverseId\': 381960}, \'multiverseid\': 381960}, {\'name\': \'焰语预言师\', \'text\': \'连击，践踏\\n每当焰语预言师对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'火能灭世，也能创生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223f2399-a520-4e82-9a48-b4ab284a1679\', \'multiverseId\': 380640}, \'multiverseid\': 380640}, {\'name\': \'焰語預言師\', \'text\': \'連擊，踐踏\\n每當焰語預言師對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，放逐你的牌庫頂牌。本回合中，你可以使用該牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'火能滅世，也能創生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6339b61-f1c5-42fd-ab90-1003f5f25dcb\', \'multiverseId\': 380805}, \'multiverseid\': 380805}]', "[{'name': 'Quell der Fruchtbarkeit', 'text': '{1}{G}, opfere den Quell der Fruchtbarkeit: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Nimm einen kräftigen Schluck und entdecke den Pfad ins Herz der Wildnis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380912&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b24ab43-c6b0-4019-9864-ec75deced0d5', 'multiverseId': 380912}, 'multiverseid': 380912}, {'name': 'Fuente de la fertilidad', 'text': '{1}{G}, sacrificar la Fuente de la fertilidad: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Bebe hasta saciarte y conoce el camino al corazón de lo salvaje.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382067&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c57ed24e-f768-44f5-a4ba-63e7f55d7274', 'multiverseId': 382067}, 'multiverseid': 382067}, {'name': 'Fontaine de fertilité', 'text': '{1}{G}, sacrifiez la Fontaine de fertilité : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Buvez, et vous connaîtrez le chemin du cœur des terres sauvages.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381077&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3105f851-376b-424b-82c0-d641d92faaca', 'multiverseId': 381077}, 'multiverseid': 381077}, {'name': 'Fonte della Fertilità', 'text': '{1}{G}, Sacrifica la Fonte della Fertilità: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Placa la sete e scopri il cammino per il cuore delle terre selvagge.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381242&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72085265-67d9-4355-a153-9a4c6cf9e3e0', 'multiverseId': 381242}, 'multiverseid': 381242}, {'name': '豊穣の泉', 'text': '{1}{G}, 豊穣の泉を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カードを１枚探してそれをタップ状態で戦場に出し、その後、あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '大いに飲むがいい、さすればお前は未踏の最奥に至る道を知るようになるだろう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381407&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a0faf99f-4e1e-4af4-b451-bc6af803be04', 'multiverseId': 381407}, 'multiverseid': 381407}, {'name': '풍요의 세례반', 'text': '{1}{G}, 풍요의 세례반을 희생한다: 당신의 서고에서 기본 대지 카드 한 장을 찾아 탭된 채로 전장에 놓은 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': '쭉 들이키면 황무지의 심장으로 가는 길이 보일 것이네.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381572&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd3d949a-b340-4aa5-83fa-eb7276e26584', 'multiverseId': 381572}, 'multiverseid': 381572}, {'name': 'Fonte da Fertilidade', 'text': '{1}{G}, Sacrifique Fonte da Fertilidade: Procure um card de terreno básico no seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe seu grimório.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Beba com vontade e conheça o caminho para o coração da natureza.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381737&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9b03637a-6de9-4d44-8b67-0b06a4a091f5', 'multiverseId': 381737}, 'multiverseid': 381737}, {'name': 'Источник Плодородия', 'text': '{1}{G}, пожертвуйте Источник Плодородия: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': 'Испей, и узнаешь путь к сердцу природы.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381902&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '368328ca-b2b4-45fd-b364-32712f80b2ca', 'multiverseId': 381902}, 'multiverseid': 381902}, {'name': '富饶洗礼池', 'text': '{1}{G}，牺牲富饶洗礼池：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '饮尽此水，得晓通野路途。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380582&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b33d391-c1cf-4025-b410-fc671c9f6210', 'multiverseId': 380582}, 'multiverseid': 380582}, {'name': '富饒洗禮池', 'text': '{1}{G}，犧牲富饒洗禮池：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之橫置進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': '飲盡此水，得曉通野路途。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380747&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82a9f444-0c44-488f-a2c9-acc44ef74f4b', 'multiverseId': 380747}, 'multiverseid': 380747}]", "[{'name': 'Quell der Lebenskraft', 'text': '{2}{W}, opfere den Quell der Lebenskraft: Du erhältst 7 Lebenspunkte dazu.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Nimm einen kräftigen Schluck und stärke dich.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380916&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30b61ab3-7fa6-4731-a574-48368ae06a53', 'multiverseId': 380916}, 'multiverseid': 380916}, {'name': 'Fuente del vigor', 'text': '{2}{W}, sacrificar la Fuente del vigor: Ganas 7 vidas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Bebe hasta saciarte y recupera tus fuerzas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382071&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe092ec0-0c9b-408b-b4c5-588ca67db2ad', 'multiverseId': 382071}, 'multiverseid': 382071}, {'name': 'Fontaine de vigueur', 'text': '{2}{W}, sacrifiez la Fontaine de vigueur : Vous gagnez 7 points de vie.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Buvez, et recouvrez vos forces.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381081&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '55f081f4-fb89-4884-b53e-bce5577a0f2d', 'multiverseId': 381081}, 'multiverseid': 381081}, {'name': 'Fonte del Vigore', 'text': '{2}{W}, Sacrifica la Fonte del Vigore: Guadagni 7 punti vita.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Placa la sete e ritempra il tuo spirito.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381246&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c93b37b4-c06b-4453-9aec-7f3f72a69e2a', 'multiverseId': 381246}, 'multiverseid': 381246}, {'name': '活力の泉', 'text': '{2}{W}, 活力の泉を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは７点のライフを得る。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '大いに飲むがいい、さすればお前の健康は取り戻せるだろう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381411&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '251c8df6-c7e9-4c7a-8814-f3427e1ca3a4', 'multiverseId': 381411}, 'multiverseid': 381411}, {'name': '활력의 세례반', 'text': '{2}{W}, 활력의 세례반을 희생한다: 당신은 생명 7점을 얻는다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': '쭉 들이키면 상처가 나을 걸세.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381576&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71943b42-51f8-4acf-b8c3-11320a8b8919', 'multiverseId': 381576}, 'multiverseid': 381576}, {'name': 'Fonte do Vigor', 'text': '{2}{W}, Sacrifique Fonte do Vigor: Você ganha 7 pontos de vida.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Beba com vontade e seja restaurado.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381741&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0301ff3-e93c-4b47-933f-0bd73861029f', 'multiverseId': 381741}, 'multiverseid': 381741}, {'name': 'Источник Сил', 'text': '{2}{W}, пожертвуйте Источник Сил: вы получаете 7 жизней.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': 'Испей, и восстановишь силы.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381906&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38e39cf9-445f-4b4a-b0aa-27a8fc907627', 'multiverseId': 381906}, 'multiverseid': 381906}, {'name': '活力洗礼池', 'text': '{2}{W}，牺牲活力洗礼池：你获得7点生命。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '饮尽此水，得享活力复还。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380586&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6ea5087-c15e-4f59-a93f-bb984fbb3aa5', 'multiverseId': 380586}, 'multiverseid': 380586}, {'name': '活力洗禮池', 'text': '{2}{W}，犧牲活力洗禮池：你獲得7點生命。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': '飲盡此水，得享活力復還。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380751&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '001109ba-cddc-4c4c-bd1c-dad0b885ae2d', 'multiverseId': 380751}, 'multiverseid': 380751}]", "[{'name': 'Quell der Schicksale', 'text': '{1}{U}, opfere den Quell der Schicksale: Ziehe zwei Karten.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': 'Nimm einen kräftigen Schluck und lasse deinen Gedanken freien Lauf.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380913&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e7d1f99-f437-446b-a6f5-460ba98e9f87', 'multiverseId': 380913}, 'multiverseid': 380913}, {'name': 'Fuente de la fortuna', 'text': '{1}{U}, sacrificar la Fuente de la fortuna: Roba dos cartas.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': 'Bebe hasta saciarte y tus pensamientos fluirán libremente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382068&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6501f650-222a-4569-849c-cbea7bb0b1dd', 'multiverseId': 382068}, 'multiverseid': 382068}, {'name': 'Fontaine des fortunes', 'text': '{1}{U}, sacrifiez la Fontaine des fortunes : Piochez deux cartes.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': 'Buvez, et vos pensées circuleront librement.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381078&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5f67221-cd79-41c1-aa04-ca916ef5ed40', 'multiverseId': 381078}, 'multiverseid': 381078}, {'name': 'Fonte della Fortuna', 'text': '{1}{U}, Sacrifica la Fonte della Fortuna: Pesca due carte.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': 'Placa la sete e i tuoi pensieri scorreranno liberi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381243&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8fab4c5c-0b2f-4f7c-8071-10b85cc8ab48', 'multiverseId': 381243}, 'multiverseid': 381243}, {'name': '運命の泉', 'text': '{1}{U}, 運命の泉を生け贄に捧げる：カードを２枚引く。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': '大いに飲むがいい、さすればお前の思考は淀みなく流れるようになるであろう。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381408&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '239792e1-828f-4e02-91c2-8e5474f66da8', 'multiverseId': 381408}, 'multiverseid': 381408}, {'name': '행운의 세례반', 'text': '{1}{U}, 행운의 세례반을 희생한다: 카드 두 장을 뽑는다.', 'type': '부여마법', 'flavor': '쭉 들이키면 생각이 자유롭게 날아다닐 것이네.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381573&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08a82eae-f893-47af-9fde-f9950a5848fc', 'multiverseId': 381573}, 'multiverseid': 381573}, {'name': 'Fonte das Fortunas', 'text': '{1}{U}, Sacrifique Fonte das Fortunas: Compre dois cards.', 'type': 'Encantamento', 'flavor': 'Beba com vontade e seus pensamentos fluirão livremente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381738&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71d183bd-d98d-4cb8-b89f-b3740d9ad238', 'multiverseId': 381738}, 'multiverseid': 381738}, {'name': 'Источник Судеб', 'text': '{1}{U}, пожертвуйте Источник Судеб: возьмите две карты.', 'type': 'Чары', 'flavor': 'Испей, и мысли твои потекут свободнее.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381903&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc6df1b4-588c-4d3c-ac30-35fba9a294d3', 'multiverseId': 381903}, 'multiverseid': 381903}, {'name': '命运洗礼池', 'text': '{1}{U}，牺牲命运洗礼池：抓两张牌。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': '饮尽此水，得保思绪永畅。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380583&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9bbe3ae1-98e8-4d28-81ab-6004b894e975', 'multiverseId': 380583}, 'multiverseid': 380583}, {'name': '命運洗禮池', 'text': '{1}{U}，犧牲命運洗禮池：抽兩張牌。', 'type': '結界', 'flavor': '飲盡此水，得保思緒永暢。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380748&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '39b04d91-763d-47c8-8a00-378f1bed1150', 'multiverseId': 380748}, 'multiverseid': 380748}]", '[{\'name\': \'Quell der Wiederkehr\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}, opfere den Quell der Wiederkehr: Bringe bis zu drei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Nimm einen kräftigen Schluck und der Tod wird vor dir zurückweichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380915&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecc76591-084b-4173-ab73-8b9d6a41a6dc\', \'multiverseId\': 380915}, \'multiverseid\': 380915}, {\'name\': \'Fuente del regreso\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}, sacrificar la Fuente del regreso: Regresa hasta tres cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Bebe hasta saciarte y la muerte reculará ante ti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ac9a5b3-173e-47d2-bd39-4b33e96ecaa0\', \'multiverseId\': 382070}, \'multiverseid\': 382070}, {\'name\': \'Fontaine de réapparition\', \'text\': "{3}{B}, sacrifiez la Fontaine de réapparition : Renvoyez jusqu\'à trois créatures ciblées de votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Buvez, et la mort vous fuira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381080&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'514572d4-e632-4977-9327-1133c26c8b99\', \'multiverseId\': 381080}, \'multiverseid\': 381080}, {\'name\': \'Fonte del Risveglio\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}, Sacrifica la Fonte del Risveglio: Riprendi in mano fino a tre carte creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Placa la sete e la morte si allontanerà da te.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec9e06c-b982-4bde-9e9a-8afa03308162\', \'multiverseId\': 381245}, \'multiverseid\': 381245}, {\'name\': \'回帰の泉\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}, 回帰の泉を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードを最大３枚まで対象とし、それらをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'大いに飲むがいい、さすれば死すらお前を忌避するようになるであろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1248db5e-5597-468f-9f08-353d8950de22\', \'multiverseId\': 381410}, \'multiverseid\': 381410}, {\'name\': \'귀환의 세례반\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}, 귀환의 세례반을 희생한다: 최대 세 개까지 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드들을 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'쭉 들이키면 죽음이 물러날 것이네.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c8175a-bd62-47f0-bb12-02906fcd7f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 381575}, \'multiverseid\': 381575}, {\'name\': \'Fonte do Ressurgimento\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}, Sacrifique Fonte do Ressurgimento: Devolva até três cards de criatura alvo do seu cemitério para a sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Beba com vontade e a morte se afastará de você.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80c479ef-df0a-40fa-91f3-7b87b142ac61\', \'multiverseId\': 381740}, \'multiverseid\': 381740}, {\'name\': \'Источник Возвращения\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}, пожертвуйте Источник Возвращения: верните не более трех целевых карт существ из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Испей, и смерть отвернется от тебя.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'900ce83f-72d1-40a4-a100-5eb3c1a7e1b8\', \'multiverseId\': 381905}, \'multiverseid\': 381905}, {\'name\': \'转世洗礼池\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}，牺牲转世洗礼池：将至多三张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'饮尽此水，得令死亡趋辟。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cca28d7-35a5-47ea-86cf-bbd2635464f4\', \'multiverseId\': 380585}, \'multiverseid\': 380585}, {\'name\': \'轉世洗禮池\', \'text\': \'{3}{B}，犧牲轉世洗禮池：將至多三張目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'飲盡此水，得令死亡趨避。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff08fa6c-1aeb-4951-8aee-fba85b69a72b\', \'multiverseId\': 380750}, \'multiverseid\': 380750}]', '[{\'name\': \'Quell des Zorns\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}, opfere den Quell des Zorns: Der Quell des Zorns fügt einem Spieler deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Nimm einen kräftigen Schluck und deine Rache wird sich erfüllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380914&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59e2c73b-3852-43a4-95f4-e44982d7f309\', \'multiverseId\': 380914}, \'multiverseid\': 380914}, {\'name\': \'Fuente de la ira\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}, sacrificar la Fuente de la ira: La Fuente de la ira hace 5 puntos de daño al jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Bebe hasta saciarte y contempla cómo se cumple tu venganza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4967100-c0ed-4d23-9ded-6b852dcf5077\', \'multiverseId\': 382069}, \'multiverseid\': 382069}, {\'name\': "Fontaine d\'ire", \'text\': "{3}{R}, sacrifiez la Fontaine d\'ire : La Fontaine d\'ire inflige 5 blessures au joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Buvez, et votre vengeance sera assouvie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6054713-e9b7-4713-9bbd-637c486ac92e\', \'multiverseId\': 381079}, \'multiverseid\': 381079}, {\'name\': \'Fonte della Collera\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}, Sacrifica la Fonte della Collera: La Fonte della Collera infligge 5 danni a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Placa la sete e la tua vendetta sarà compiuta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dbe5812-1b27-4af8-837b-4d33d4ff7db5\', \'multiverseId\': 381244}, \'multiverseid\': 381244}, {\'name\': \'激憤の泉\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}, 激憤の泉を生け贄に捧げる：プレイヤー１人を対象とする。激憤の泉はそのプレイヤーに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'大いに飲むがいい、さすればお前の復讐は遂げられるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98d05cb6-45cd-4ff3-b144-0860b214d405\', \'multiverseId\': 381409}, \'multiverseid\': 381409}, {\'name\': \'분노의 세례반\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}, 분노의 세례반을 희생한다: 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 분노의 세례반은 그 플레이어에게 피해 5점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'깊게 들이마시면 복수를 이루게 될 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1c2bbba-661a-440c-af72-e37cd77c5a1c\', \'multiverseId\': 381574}, \'multiverseid\': 381574}, {\'name\': \'Fonte da Ira\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}, Sacrifique Fonte da Ira: Fonte da Ira causa 5 pontos de dano ao jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Beba com vontade e veja sua vingança se cumprir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3f0f9de-2763-4a94-af9e-195af3ac4630\', \'multiverseId\': 381739}, \'multiverseid\': 381739}, {\'name\': \'Источник Гнева\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}, пожертвуйте Источник Гнева: Источник Гнева наносит 5 повреждений целевому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Испей, и свершится твоя месть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'878d7288-3bb8-4b19-84f5-f25df5fe14ad\', \'multiverseId\': 381904}, \'multiverseid\': 381904}, {\'name\': \'愤怒洗礼池\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}，牺牲愤怒洗礼池：愤怒洗礼池对目标牌手造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'饮尽此水，得见仇恨洗雪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e5737ff-ba8e-42ad-87d7-608ba9c549ca\', \'multiverseId\': 380584}, \'multiverseid\': 380584}, {\'name\': \'憤怒洗禮池\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}，犧牲憤怒洗禮池：憤怒洗禮池對目標玩家造成5點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'飲盡此水，得見仇恨洗雪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ffe33bd-1a91-4d4a-a1fa-60fee8fb1563\', \'multiverseId\': 380749}, \'multiverseid\': 380749}]', '[{\'name\': \'Quälende Gedanken\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um die Quälenden Gedanken zu wirken.\\nEin Spieler deiner Wahl wirft so viele Karten aus seiner Hand ab, wie die Stärke der geopferten Kreatur beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Nicht allen Albträumen entkommt man durch Erwachen." —Ashiok der Albtraumweber\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'650712e7-f61b-49af-a317-4a20776340da\', \'multiverseId\': 381015}, \'multiverseid\': 381015}, {\'name\': \'Pensamientos atormentados\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar los Pensamientos atormentados, sacrifica una criatura.\\nEl jugador objetivo descarta una cantidad de cartas igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay pesadillas de las que no se puede escapar despertando". —Ashiok, urdidor de pesadillas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19d70a36-44eb-4f16-a092-411141eb5be9\', \'multiverseId\': 382170}, \'multiverseid\': 382170}, {\'name\': \'Pensées tourmentées\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer les Pensées tourmentées, sacrifiez une créature.\\nLe joueur ciblé se défausse d\'un nombre de cartes égal à la force de la créature sacrifiée.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« On ne peut pas échapper à tous les cauchemars en s\'éveillant. » —Ashiok, tisseur de cauchemars", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381180&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'989b313c-d9b4-4323-a19e-2697d0182204\', \'multiverseId\': 381180}, \'multiverseid\': 381180}, {\'name\': \'Pensieri Strazianti\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare i Pensieri Strazianti, sacrifica una creatura.\\nUn giocatore bersaglio scarta un numero di carte pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Non tutti gli incubi si possono scacciare al risveglio." —Ashiok, Tessitore di Incubi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb7b6f11-3969-4cd4-b4b7-8c204af70c7b\', \'multiverseId\': 381345}, \'multiverseid\': 381345}, {\'name\': \'苛まれし思考\', \'text\': \'苛まれし思考を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャーを１体生け贄に捧げる。\\nプレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「目覚めても逃れられない悪夢もあるのだよ。」 ――悪夢の織り手、アショク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'014ce022-11f3-426f-bba8-bbcc68c3f15a\', \'multiverseId\': 381510}, \'multiverseid\': 381510}, {\'name\': \'고통 받는 생각\', \'text\': \'고통 받는 생각을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 희생된 생물의 공격력만큼의 카드를 버린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': "\'깨어나는 것으로 모든 악몽에서 벗어날 수 있는 건 아니지.\' —악몽을 부르는 아시오크", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c60b1559-ec01-4b39-9961-b639aeb1ee0b\', \'multiverseId\': 381675}, \'multiverseid\': 381675}, {\'name\': \'Pensamentos Atormentados\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar Pensamentos Atormentados, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nO jogador alvo descarta um número de cards igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nem todos os pesadelos terminam ao acordar." — Ashiok, Tecedor de Pesadelos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa5bd86-edc3-4702-88b1-8c5bad69ec19\', \'multiverseId\': 381840}, \'multiverseid\': 381840}, {\'name\': \'Мучительные Мысли\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания Мучительных Мыслей пожертвуйте существо.\\nЦелевой игрок сбрасывает количество карт, равное силе пожертвованного существа.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Не от всех кошмаров можно сбежать, проснувшись». — Ашиок, Ткач Кошмаров\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d014ea1f-7dc4-4c7e-9000-e4e64a424887\', \'multiverseId\': 382005}, \'multiverseid\': 382005}, {\'name\': \'受虐思绪\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放受虐思绪的额外费用。\\n目标牌手弃若干牌，其数量等同于所牺牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「并非所有梦魇都能靠醒转摆脱。」 ～织魇师安梭苛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7865e844-171d-480a-ae0b-660038560993\', \'multiverseId\': 380685}, \'multiverseid\': 380685}, {\'name\': \'受虐思緒\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放受虐思緒的額外費用。\\n目標玩家棄若干牌，其數量等同於所犧牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「並非所有夢魘都能靠醒轉擺脫。」 ～織魘師安梭苛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1731ac83-8c1b-4b59-9dfb-1e117a0d4107\', \'multiverseId\': 380850}, \'multiverseid\': 380850}]', '[{\'name\': \'Revolte\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Stärke 4 oder größer. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Eine winzige Flamme vermag die Nacht zu vertreiben." —Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6242277b-3eb0-4ca2-aec6-24a73e5b68db\', \'multiverseId\': 380975}, \'multiverseid\': 380975}, {\'name\': \'Represalia\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con fuerza de 4 o más. No puede ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una llama pequeña basta para disipar la noche". —Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a340c9b-cbda-41a1-90b6-e9d2d4baaaf4\', \'multiverseId\': 382130}, \'multiverseid\': 382130}, {\'name\': \'Représailles\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature ciblée de force supérieure ou égale à 4. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Une flamme minuscule suffit pour éloigner la nuit. » —Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a56550-22be-4086-b838-d7bee6f6d3bd\', \'multiverseId\': 381140}, \'multiverseid\': 381140}, {\'name\': \'Rappresaglia\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con forza pari o superiore a 4. Non può essere rigenerata.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Una fiamma minuscola è sufficiente per scacciare la notte." —Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce4e8860-085e-44a1-8ce8-ba3d08709b2c\', \'multiverseId\': 381305}, \'multiverseid\': 381305}, {\'name\': \'復仇\', \'text\': \'パワーが４以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。それは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「闇夜を照らすには、小さな炎があれば十分です。」 ――エルズペス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bba7be08-5841-4d9c-8ad6-a8775cf9d546\', \'multiverseId\': 381470}, \'multiverseid\': 381470}, {\'name\': \'보복\', \'text\': \'공격력이 4 이상인 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다. 그 생물은 재생될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': "\'작은 불꽃 하나로도 밤을 물리칠 수 있습니다.\' —엘스페스", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83c07457-b381-4261-91e0-f5676fb936b1\', \'multiverseId\': 381635}, \'multiverseid\': 381635}, {\'name\': \'Represália\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com poder maior ou igual a 4. Ela não pode ser regenerada.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Uma minúscula chama é suficiente para dissipar a noite." — Elspeth\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b649e9d1-9340-4ac1-a90e-9b0915025b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 381800}, \'multiverseid\': 381800}, {\'name\': \'Воздаяние\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с силой 4 или больше. Оно не может быть регенерировано.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Даже небольшого огня хватит, чтобы разогнать ночную тьму». — Элспет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381965&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e4bcb62-7cff-4f90-86ae-0df01dcdf85c\', \'multiverseId\': 381965}, \'multiverseid\': 381965}, {\'name\': \'报复\', \'text\': \'消灭目标力量等于或大于4的生物。它不能重生。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「点滴星火就足以耀亮夜空。」 ～艾紫培\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c3839d-cf21-4f81-8951-a91eaded637c\', \'multiverseId\': 380645}, \'multiverseid\': 380645}, {\'name\': \'報復\', \'text\': \'消滅目標力量大於或等於4的生物。它不能重生。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「點滴星火就足以耀亮夜空。」 ～艾紫培\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c9b1195-408f-4dd3-9ff2-c7b04c52255f\', \'multiverseId\': 380810}, \'multiverseid\': 380810}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ritual der Wiedergekehrten\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Bringe einen schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein ins Spiel. Seine Stärke und Widerstandskraft sind gleich der Stärke und Widerstandskraft der ins Exil geschickten Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Maske, geschmiedet, um einen vergessenen Tod zu rächen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a81f5e9b-60f8-43a8-8461-b076d7df31b4\', \'multiverseId\': 380982}, \'multiverseid\': 380982}, {\'name\': \'Ritual de los Resurgidos\', \'text\': \'Exilia la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio. Pon en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Zombie negra. Su fuerza es igual a la fuerza de esa carta y su resistencia es igual a la resistencia de esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Una máscara forjada para vengar una muerte olvidada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'285b6baf-ab87-4f37-a8ee-5e1525b8ec59\', \'multiverseId\': 382137}, \'multiverseid\': 382137}, {\'name\': \'Rituel des Reparus\', \'text\': "Exilez une carte de créature ciblée de votre cimetière. Mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature noire Zombie. Sa force est égale à la force de cette carte et son endurance est égale à l\'endurance de cette carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Un masque forgé pour venger une mort oubliée.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381147&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9859171c-1a5a-4159-b0a6-60af80d8bda3\', \'multiverseId\': 381147}, \'multiverseid\': 381147}, {\'name\': \'Rituale dei Risvegliati\', \'text\': \'Esilia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero. Metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Zombie nera. La sua forza è pari alla forza di quella carta e la sua costituzione è pari alla costituzione di quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Una maschera forgiata per vendicare una morte dimenticata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fa407f5-3217-40a0-a817-b827253fddb3\', \'multiverseId\': 381312}, \'multiverseid\': 381312}, {\'name\': \'蘇りし者の儀式\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを追放する。黒のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。それのパワーはそのカードのパワーに等しく、それのタフネスはそのカードのタフネスに等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'忘れられた死に報復するために作られた、黄金の仮面。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de9da89a-4b59-4738-a1d1-e6e16541a172\', \'multiverseId\': 381477}, \'multiverseid\': 381477}, {\'name\': \'되살아난 자들의 의식\', \'text\': \'당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 추방한다. 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 토큰의 공격력은 추방한 카드의 공격력과 같고 방어력은 추방한 카드의 방어력과 같다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'잊혀진 죽음을 복수하기 위해 만들어진 가면.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8b49899-d24b-4373-bf71-9a4aae4ac219\', \'multiverseId\': 381642}, \'multiverseid\': 381642}, {\'name\': \'Ritual dos Ressurgidos\', \'text\': \'Exile o card de criatura alvo do seu cemitério. Coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura preta do tipo Zumbi. Seu poder é igual ao poder daquele card e sua resistência é igual à resistência daquele card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Uma máscara forjada para vingar uma morte esquecida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8fd905a-f8ee-4075-b3af-cbc54814f90e\', \'multiverseId\': 381807}, \'multiverseid\': 381807}, {\'name\': \'Ритуал Возвращенных\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища. Положите на поле битвы одну фишку существа черный Зомби. Ее сила равна силе той карты, а ее выносливость равна выносливости той карты.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Маска, выкованная, чтобы отомстить за забытую смерть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81dbfc00-5a26-4744-989f-f804966c13f1\', \'multiverseId\': 381972}, \'multiverseid\': 381972}, {\'name\': \'转世者祭礼\', \'text\': \'将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场放逐。将一个黑色灵俑衍生生物放进战场。其力量等同于该牌的力量，其防御力等同于该牌的防御力。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'报复莫名之死所铸成的面具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b00d8870-545e-4e75-b2a5-c6d58b30c494\', \'multiverseId\': 380652}, \'multiverseid\': 380652}, {\'name\': \'轉世者祭禮\', \'text\': \'將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場放逐。將一個黑色殭屍衍生生物放進戰場。其力量等同於該牌的力量，其防禦力等同於該牌的防禦力。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'報復莫名之死所鑄成的面具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15ad3e2e-5c91-4d21-ba0b-efaa754cb47b\', \'multiverseId\': 380817}, \'multiverseid\': 380817}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rätselhaftes Gewitter\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eine Kreatur oder einen Spieler deiner Wahl. Hellsicht 3, decke dann die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Das Rätselhafte Gewitter fügt dieser Kreatur oder diesem Spieler so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie die umgewandelten Manakosten dieser Karte betragen. (Betrachte für Hellsicht 3 die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek und lege dann eine beliebige Anzahl davon unter deine Bibliothek und den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben darauf.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2f52800-5bc5-4d55-871d-c79e799e7122\', \'multiverseId\': 380979}, \'multiverseid\': 380979}, {\'name\': \'Acertijo de relámpago\', \'text\': \'Elige una criatura o jugador objetivo. Adivina 3, luego muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. El Acertijo de relámpago hace daño igual al coste de maná convertido de esa carta a esa criatura o jugador. (Para adivinar 3, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, luego pon cualquier cantidad de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y el resto en la parte superior en cualquier orden.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6aa0e3e7-c1b2-4f49-b020-2da8980c7296\', \'multiverseId\': 382134}, \'multiverseid\': 382134}, {\'name\': "Crible d\'éclairs", \'text\': "Choisissez une cible, créature ou joueur. Regard 3, puis révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Le Crible d\'éclairs inflige un nombre de blessures égal au coût converti de mana de cette carte à cette créature ou à ce joueur. (Pour appliquer regard 3, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez n\'importe quel nombre d\'entre elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque et le reste au-dessus, dans n\'importe quel ordre.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381144&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a49c4a-2d2d-4b00-bdd4-07f97515ed14\', \'multiverseId\': 381144}, \'multiverseid\': 381144}, {\'name\': \'Indovinello del Fulmine\', \'text\': "Scegli una creatura o un giocatore bersaglio. Profetizza 3, poi rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. L\'Indovinello del Fulmine infligge a quella creatura o a quel giocatore danno pari al costo di mana convertito di quella carta. (Per profetizzare 3, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi mettine un qualsiasi numero in fondo al tuo grimorio e le altre in cima in qualsiasi ordine.)", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d8ba1a-c3ea-4319-a6be-94fc10a900e6\', \'multiverseId\': 381309}, \'multiverseid\': 381309}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の謎\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。占術３を行い、その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。稲妻の謎はそのクリーチャーかプレイヤーに、そのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい点数のダメージを与える。（占術３を行うには、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードを見て、そのうちの望む枚数のカードを望む順番であなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、残りを望む順番で一番上に置く。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fd6947f-8d9b-4243-b626-ee8de1f4ee3c\', \'multiverseId\': 381474}, \'multiverseid\': 381474}, {\'name\': \'번개의 수수께끼\', \'text\': \'생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 점술 3을 한 후, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드를 공개한다. 번개의 수수께끼는 그 생물이나 플레이어에게 그 카드의 전환마나비용 만큼의 피해를 입힌다. (점술 3을 하려면, 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드들 중 원하는 만큼을 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓고 나머지를 당신의 서고 맨 위에 원하는 순서대로 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'284388c7-2067-485a-b25e-e1748416d269\', \'multiverseId\': 381639}, \'multiverseid\': 381639}, {\'name\': \'Enigma do Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Escolha uma criatura ou jogador alvo. Use vidência 3 e revele o card do topo do seu grimório. Enigma do Relâmpago causa àquela criatura ou jogador uma quantidade de dano equivalente ao custo de mana convertido daquele card. (Para usar vidência 3, olhe os três cards do topo do seu grimório. Depois, coloque qualquer número deles no fundo do seu grimório e o resto no topo em qualquer ordem.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf4c239e-3d7d-4db5-8883-4f6e4ab1f0df\', \'multiverseId\': 381804}, \'multiverseid\': 381804}, {\'name\': \'Загадка Молнии\', \'text\': \'Выберите целевое существо или игрока. Предскажите 3, затем покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Загадка Молнии наносит тому существу или игроку повреждения, равные конвертированной мана-стоимости той карты. (Чтобы предсказать 3, посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите любое количество из них в низ вашей библиотеки, а остальные на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b47a00-8751-4a93-9d7f-35f1a37713f5\', \'multiverseId\': 381969}, \'multiverseid\': 381969}, {\'name\': \'闪电谜题\', \'text\': \'选择目标生物或牌手。占卜3，然后展示你的牌库顶牌。闪电谜题对该生物或牌手造成伤害，其数量等同于所展示牌的总法术力费用。（占卜3的流程是检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将其中任意数量的牌以任意顺序置于你牌库底，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库顶。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af11d29a-5560-47ad-9e4b-ac69caa31c82\', \'multiverseId\': 380649}, \'multiverseid\': 380649}, {\'name\': \'閃電謎題\', \'text\': \'選擇目標生物或玩家。占卜3，然後展示你的牌庫頂牌。閃電謎題對該生物或玩家造成傷害，其數量等同於所展示牌的總魔法力費用。（占卜3的流程是檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌，然後將其中任意數量的牌以任意順序置於你牌庫底，其餘則以任意順序置於你牌庫頂。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85c211db-2d4f-405d-ac43-774b856a1efc\', \'multiverseId\': 380814}, \'multiverseid\': 380814}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rüstzeug der Natur\', \'text\': \'Streben — Rüstzeug der Natur kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{G} mehr.\\nBestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl. Lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf jede davon.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Natur weiß sich selbst zu schützen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380953&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f7fceb6-fa99-4009-8b8a-9874ba2a26d5\', \'multiverseId\': 380953}, \'multiverseid\': 380953}, {\'name\': \'Panoplia de la naturaleza\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar la Panoplia de la naturaleza cuesta {2}{G}) más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nElige cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo. Pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una de ellas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La naturaleza protege a los suyos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f7a69fe-04d3-458f-9d95-f9e595d3ab6d\', \'multiverseId\': 382108}, \'multiverseid\': 382108}, {\'name\': \'Panoplie de la nature\', \'text\': "Obstination — La Panoplie de la nature coûte {2}{G} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nChoisissez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La nature protège les siens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381118&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a5768a8-28b1-4c23-99a6-6231c0f36ff4\', \'multiverseId\': 381118}, \'multiverseid\': 381118}, {\'name\': \'Panoplia della Natura\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — La Panoplia della Natura costa {2}{G} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La natura protegge la propria progenie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56a1d68b-1fab-48c0-acdb-c7b234668217\', \'multiverseId\': 381283}, \'multiverseid\': 381283}, {\'name\': \'自然からの武装\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 自然からの武装を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{G}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらの上に、それぞれ＋１/＋１カウンターを１個ずつ置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'自然は己を防衛する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0650fb78-9f35-43bc-9f10-43e40bda2afd\', \'multiverseId\': 381448}, \'multiverseid\': 381448}, {\'name\': \'자연의 집합\', \'text\': \'분투 — 자연의 집합은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{G}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 목표로 정한 각 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'자연은 스스로를 보호한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51390b4d-f9e3-4168-bcbb-93693e3c4c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 381613}, \'multiverseid\': 381613}, {\'name\': \'Panóplia da Natureza\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Panóplia da Natureza custa {2}{G} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nEscolha qualquer número de criaturas alvo. Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma delas.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A natureza protege os seus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf5ac9ca-92af-4e59-9286-e557e7514df1\', \'multiverseId\': 381778}, \'multiverseid\': 381778}, {\'name\': \'Паноплия Природы\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Паноплии Природы стоит на {2}{G} больше.\\nВыберите любое количество целевых существ. Положите по одному жетону +1/+1 на каждое из них.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Природа защитит свое.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd8f2de9-4261-488f-abc5-e6bbda10cb07\', \'multiverseId\': 381943}, \'multiverseid\': 381943}, {\'name\': \'自然华彩\', \'text\': \'积力～自然华彩在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{G}来施放。\\n选择任意数量的目标生物。在这些生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'自然会自我保护。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e55619f2-d7dd-4ed7-a9a2-9baf53b61d91\', \'multiverseId\': 380623}, \'multiverseid\': 380623}, {\'name\': \'自然華彩\', \'text\': \'積力～自然華彩在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{G}來施放。\\n選擇任意數量的目標生物。在這些生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'自然會自我保護。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'732b0cac-b710-4509-8782-ddb243b2f535\', \'multiverseId\': 380788}, \'multiverseid\': 380788}]', '[{\'name\': \'Satyr-Haintänzerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Satyr-Haintänzerin ins Spiel kommt, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Manche Satyre tanzen für sich selbst, ohne einen höheren Sinn. Nylea schenkt mir einen Sinn und dadurch Stärke."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fe75990-2efa-4fd6-b06f-b2bba601ffde\', \'multiverseId\': 380987}, \'multiverseid\': 380987}, {\'name\': \'Bailarina de la arboleda sátira\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Bailarina de la arboleda sátira entre al campo de batalla, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Algunos de los míos bailan para sí mismos, sin un propósito mayor. Nylea me da un propósito, y este a su vez me da fuerza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47ec6d70-c8ee-4785-8953-1ba1cc98f126\', \'multiverseId\': 382142}, \'multiverseid\': 382142}, {\'name\': \'Dansebosquet satyre\', \'text\': \'Quand la Dansebosquet satyre arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : satyre et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Certains de mes congénères dansent égoïstement, sans autre objectif. Nyléa me donne un but, et avec lui la force. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381152&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b04ed74d-71e3-4ce0-bb9a-b0081b506d84\', \'multiverseId\': 381152}, \'multiverseid\': 381152}, {\'name\': \'Danzatrice del Boschetto\', \'text\': \'Quando la Danzatrice del Boschetto entra nel campo di battaglia, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni della mia razza danzano per se stessi, senza un fine superiore. Nylea mi dona uno scopo e, con esso, potere."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1db53748-2d4c-4aa1-afe4-3f46c87189cd\', \'multiverseId\': 381317}, \'multiverseid\': 381317}, {\'name\': \'サテュロスの木立ち踊り\', \'text\': \'サテュロスの木立ち踊りが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「私の同族のなかには、大いなる目的も無く、自分たちのために踊るものもいるわ。ナイレア様が私に目的を与え、そして力も与えてくださるの。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0a07c06-bdcd-44ed-a74a-bdc99c4f681e\', \'multiverseId\': 381482}, \'multiverseid\': 381482}, {\'name\': \'숲 춤꾼 사티로스\', \'text\': \'숲 춤꾼 사티로스가 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사티로스 주술사\', \'flavor\': "\'내 동족들 중 몇몇은 별다른 대의 없이 자기들만을 위해 춤을 춘다. 닐리아는 내게 목적을, 그리고 힘도 같이 주었다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef8104a-0ed4-4754-8699-9c28e9c5ebdb\', \'multiverseId\': 381647}, \'multiverseid\': 381647}, {\'name\': \'Sátiro Dançarino do Bosque\', \'text\': \'Quando Sátiro Dançarino do Bosque entrar no campo de batalha, coloque um marcador +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Alguns da minha espécie dançam para si mesmos, sem propósito maior. Niléia me deu um propósito, e com ele, veio a força."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecd7623d-da4a-4755-a303-cab611ef03d3\', \'multiverseId\': 381812}, \'multiverseid\': 381812}, {\'name\': \'Сатир, Лесная Плясунья\', \'text\': \'Когда Сатир, Лесная Плясунья выходит на поле битвы, положите один жетон +1/+1 на целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сатир Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Мои сородичи пляшут для себя, без какой-то цели. Нилея дает мне цель, а вместе с ней — силу».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37e706fa-2837-4dcf-a178-ed9fadb9a9af\', \'multiverseId\': 381977}, \'multiverseid\': 381977}, {\'name\': \'林舞羊蹄人\', \'text\': \'当林舞羊蹄人进战场时，在目标生物上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～羊蹄人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「我有些同胞仅为自己起舞，别无他求。倪勒娅赐予我目标，以及伴随而来的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f96e81-2b37-4937-9aa7-ca059777102e\', \'multiverseId\': 380657}, \'multiverseid\': 380657}, {\'name\': \'林舞羊蹄人\', \'text\': \'當林舞羊蹄人進戰場時，在目標生物上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～羊蹄人／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「我有些同胞僅為自己起舞，別無他求。倪勒婭賜予我目標，以及伴隨而來的力量。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28484d87-f5f8-41a8-88e0-9dd8fbef00aa\', \'multiverseId\': 380822}, \'multiverseid\': 380822}]', '[{\'name\': \'Satyr-Hoplitin\', \'text\': \'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der die Satyr-Hoplitin als Ziel hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Satyr-Hoplitin.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Xenagos wurde das, was er am meisten verabscheute: ein Tyrann und Unterdrücker."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80282eb1-cb4a-4fe7-9712-aaecd163b2c1\', \'multiverseId\': 380988}, \'multiverseid\': 380988}, {\'name\': \'Hoplita sátira\', \'text\': \'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo a la Hoplita sátira, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre la Hoplita sátira.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Xenagos se ha convertido en lo que antes despreciaba: un tirano y un opresor".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb8257b-123b-40a4-94a8-d7bbfe0220de\', \'multiverseId\': 382143}, \'multiverseid\': 382143}, {\'name\': \'Hoplite satyre\', \'text\': \'Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible le Hoplite satyre, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Hoplite satyre.\', \'type\': \'Créature : satyre et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Xénagos est devenu ce qu\'il méprisait jadis : un tyran et un oppresseur. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a487d32-1861-4d40-9908-f95649d977aa\', \'multiverseId\': 381153}, \'multiverseid\': 381153}, {\'name\': \'Satiro Oplita\', \'text\': \'Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia il Satiro Oplita, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Satiro Oplita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Satiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Xenagos è divenuto ciò che un tempo disprezzava: un tiranno e un oppressore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e9ee4d4-8ba7-4185-abb2-dc8f31884777\', \'multiverseId\': 381318}, \'multiverseid\': 381318}, {\'name\': \'サテュロスの重装歩兵\', \'text\': \'英雄的 ― あなたがサテュロスの重装歩兵を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、サテュロスの重装歩兵の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ゼナゴスはかつての彼が嫌っていた、暴君、圧政者に成り果ててしまいました。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4331526a-72cb-4f67-9779-07873b2ede74\', \'multiverseId\': 381483}, \'multiverseid\': 381483}, {\'name\': \'사티로스 중장보병\', \'text\': \'영웅 — 당신이 사티로스 중장보병을 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 사티로스 중장보병에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 사티로스 병사\', \'flavor\': "\'제나고스는 한때 자신이 경멸했던 폭군이자 압제자가 되었다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5ec392d-cd40-4da4-9ea0-fb4ccb5eddab\', \'multiverseId\': 381648}, \'multiverseid\': 381648}, {\'name\': \'Hoplita Sátiro\', \'text\': \'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Hoplita Sátiro, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Hoplita Sátiro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Xenagos transformou-se naquilo que ele outrora desprezara: um tirano opressor."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb1d8374-58cf-454a-9585-db358b220be1\', \'multiverseId\': 381813}, \'multiverseid\': 381813}, {\'name\': \'Сатир-Гоплит\', \'text\': \'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Сатир-Гоплит, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Сатира-Гоплита.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сатир Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Ксенаг сам стал тем, кого когда-то презирал, — тираном и притеснителем».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e0221ae-677c-46de-81b6-8633c390e830\', \'multiverseId\': 381978}, \'multiverseid\': 381978}, {\'name\': \'羊蹄人重装步兵\', \'text\': \'勇行～每当你施放一个以羊蹄人重装步兵为目标的咒语时，在羊蹄人重装步兵上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～羊蹄人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「谢纳戈斯已成为他一度厌弃的人：暴君和压迫者。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f54a8f6f-78d5-4867-afc3-8078afe513c5\', \'multiverseId\': 380658}, \'multiverseid\': 380658}, {\'name\': \'羊蹄人重裝步兵\', \'text\': \'勇行～每當你施放一個以羊蹄人重裝步兵為目標的咒語時，在羊蹄人重裝步兵上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～羊蹄人／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「謝納戈斯已成為他一度厭棄的人：暴君和壓迫者。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'560b3020-37d8-4930-b70c-20aaed629489\', \'multiverseId\': 380823}, \'multiverseid\': 380823}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schauderbalg-Versteinerer\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nAndere Minotaurus-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Unter Minotauren ist es Sitte, die Köpfe der Besiegten als Trophäen zu behalten. So manche Trophäe erweist sich zudem als überaus nützlich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'879b1def-7d5b-43f5-8857-0ebe86d31f50\', \'multiverseId\': 380908}, \'multiverseid\': 380908}, {\'name\': \'Petrificador pielacre\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nLas otras criaturas Minotauro que controlas tienen la habilidad de toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Entre los minotauros es práctica habitual conservar las cabezas de sus víctimas como trofeo. A veces los trofeos demuestran tener más valor que el ornamental.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f49edbd-94d8-4282-b5a7-c0d0bb282956\', \'multiverseId\': 382063}, \'multiverseid\': 382063}, {\'name\': \'Pétrificateur Fangepeau\', \'text\': \'Contact mortel\\nLes autres créatures Minotaure que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.\', \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Il est d\'usage que les minotaures gardent les têtes de leurs victimes comme trophées. Parfois, elles ne sont pas réservées à la décoration.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381073&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bd1a874-9d88-42c9-992d-4890f127b9d3\', \'multiverseId\': 381073}, \'multiverseid\': 381073}, {\'name\': \'Pietrificatore Velloirsuto\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nLe altre creature Minotauro che controlli hanno tocco letale.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'È pratica comune tra i minotauri conservare le teste delle vittime come trofei. Talvolta, questi si rivelano più di un ornamento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28a14d4d-cddb-49a1-8e97-b7bf5f5a4df0\', \'multiverseId\': 381238}, \'multiverseid\': 381238}, {\'name\': \'悪魔の皮の石化使い\', \'text\': \'接死\\nあなたがコントロールする他のミノタウルス・クリーチャーは接死を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'ミノタウルスの間では、戦利品として犠牲者の首を収集するのが習わしとなっている。時には、単なる飾りではないものもある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aba9bd5f-7d07-48a0-8d7b-22346b19d1b0\', \'multiverseId\': 381403}, \'multiverseid\': 381403}, {\'name\': \'썩은가죽 석화자\', \'text\': \'치명타\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 미노타우로스 생물들은 치명타를 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스 전사\', \'flavor\': \'희생자들의 머리를 전리품으로 수집하는 것은 미노타우로스가 흔히 하는 일이다. 가끔 그런 전리품들은 장식품 이상의 가치가 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8bc3ae8-0a09-4911-9ad3-ec491ac9f428\', \'multiverseId\': 381568}, \'multiverseid\': 381568}, {\'name\': \'Petrificador Courovil\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nAs outras criaturas do tipo Minotauro que você controla têm toque mortífero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'É comum entre os minotauros guardar as cabeças das vítimas como troféus. Às vezes, os troféus servem como mais do que enfeites.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6891518-e933-4986-bbeb-f21acb1641ca\', \'multiverseId\': 381733}, \'multiverseid\': 381733}, {\'name\': \'Скверношкурый Окаменитель\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nДругие существа-Минотавры под вашим контролем имеют Смертельное касание.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Минотавры нередко забирают головы своих жертв в качестве трофеев. Иногда такой трофей оказывается не только украшением.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61331cfa-8711-4e54-9914-2154298be53b\', \'multiverseId\': 381898}, \'multiverseid\': 381898}, {\'name\': \'惊怖石化师\', \'text\': \'死触\\n由你操控的其他牛头怪生物具有死触异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛头怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'收集受害者的头颅当作战利品是牛头怪的习俗。有时这些战利品不仅仅是装饰。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ad16cb0-743a-4555-91ac-ad295414d74a\', \'multiverseId\': 380578}, \'multiverseid\': 380578}, {\'name\': \'驚怖石化師\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n由你操控的其他牛頭怪生物具有死觸異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～牛頭怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'收集受害者的頭顱當作戰利品是牛頭怪的習俗。有時這些戰利品不僅僅是裝飾。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2b24dbb-b5c3-4d11-981a-e816f6b1b817\', \'multiverseId\': 380743}, \'multiverseid\': 380743}]', "[{'name': 'Schiffswrack-Koloss', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': 'Der Koloss erhob sich aus dem Meer und türmte sich vor der Auserwählten auf. Eingeklemmt in den verrotteten Holzplanken war die Leiche von Kaliaros, dem Steuermann ihrer ehemaligen Besatzung, und neben ihm Phione, die Kapitänin. —Die Theriaden', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380984&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0dca7c09-77f8-490e-93d6-85faaeb3dfa5', 'multiverseId': 380984}, 'multiverseid': 380984}, {'name': 'Titán putrefacto', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': 'El titán se alzó del mar y se cernió sobre la Campeona. Atrapado bajo las planchas podridas y retorcidas de madera estaba el cuerpo de Kaliaros, el timonel de lo que fue su tripulación, y a su lado la capitana, Fotine. —La Theríada', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382139&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc1eb466-296d-4928-acb1-237080a364e3', 'multiverseId': 382139}, 'multiverseid': 382139}, {'name': 'Carcasse putréfiée', 'type': 'Créature : élémental', 'flavor': 'La carcasse surgit de la mer et menaça la Championne. Coincés sous les planches de bois pourries et tordues, elle vit le corps de Kaliaros, le timonier de son ancien équipage, et près de lui, Photine, le capitaine. —La Thériade', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381149&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f241a6e6-27ae-4ac5-8076-1bd27246d856', 'multiverseId': 381149}, 'multiverseid': 381149}, {'name': 'Carcassa Marcita', 'type': 'Creatura — Elementale', 'flavor': 'La carcassa si levò dal mare, sovrastando la Campionessa. Schiacciato dalle assi di legno contorte e marcite giaceva il corpo di Kaliaros, il timoniere di quella che era stata la sua ciurma, e accanto a lui il capitano, Folinia. —La Theriade', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381314&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a714c6fd-7fb9-420f-9f93-e9ab3473d293', 'multiverseId': 381314}, 'multiverseid': 381314}, {'name': '腐敗した大男', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '大男は海から姿を現し、女勇者の前に立ちふさがった。ねじくれ、腐った木の板の間に挟まっていたのは、彼女のかつての乗組員であり操舵手であったカリアロスと、船長のフォティネらの遺体であった。 ――「テーリアス」', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381479&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4076163d-967f-4948-a8f1-0e3e705a1fd5', 'multiverseId': 381479}, 'multiverseid': 381479}, {'name': '썩은 거대괴물', 'type': '생물 — 정령', 'flavor': '바다에서 솟아오른 거대괴물이 용사에게 다가갔다. 뒤틀리고 썩은 판자 아래 못 박힌 것은 그녀의 조타수였던 칼리아로스였고 그의 옆에는 선장이었던 포티네였다. —테리아드', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381644&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0079a622-083d-4ae0-bdef-fc55fc250fa1', 'multiverseId': 381644}, 'multiverseid': 381644}, {'name': 'Brutamontes Apodrecido', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': 'O brutamontes ergueu-se do mar e avultou-se diante da Campeã. Preso dentre as tábuas de madeira apodrecida estava o corpo de Caliaros, o timoneiro de sua antiga tripulação, e ao lado dele estava o capitão Folineu. — A Teríada', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381809&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60db210c-5d1e-426d-9b8a-6adc15f34f9f', 'multiverseId': 381809}, 'multiverseid': 381809}, {'name': 'Прогнивший Великан', 'type': 'Существо — Элементаль', 'flavor': 'Великан поднялся из моря и навис над Поборницей. Между искореженными и прогнившими досками было зажато тело Калиара, рулевого из ее бывшей команды, а рядом с ним — труп капитана Фотины. — Териада', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381974&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfd6471c-5475-43b7-abdb-a945e6e67a1d', 'multiverseId': 381974}, 'multiverseid': 381974}, {'name': '腐坏巨汉', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '船身自海中升起，挡在天尊前方。她的前舵手卡利阿罗斯的尸体压在折断腐坏的碎木板下面，在他旁边则是船长福提涅。 ～《塞洛亚特》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380654&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee91a4ae-8ed4-415c-ba69-bcbf3074679a', 'multiverseId': 380654}, 'multiverseid': 380654}, {'name': '腐壞巨漢', 'type': '生物～元素', 'flavor': '船身自海中升起，擋在天尊前方。她的前舵手卡利阿羅斯的屍體壓在折斷腐壞的碎木板下面，在他旁邊則是船長福提涅。 ～《塞洛亞特》', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380819&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '222eef69-87c7-4f25-8c3b-ddd049109f10', 'multiverseId': 380819}, 'multiverseid': 380819}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schildwache der Götter\', \'text\': \'Du hast Fluchsicherheit. (Du kannst nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Athreos bedeuten die Konflikte anderer Götter mit den Sterblichen wenig. Er kümmert sich einzig um die sichere Überfahrt der Toten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380859&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77233626-fbf7-425a-ac70-92b80a02f593\', \'multiverseId\': 380859}, \'multiverseid\': 380859}, {\'name\': \'Égida de los dioses\', \'text\': \'Tienes la habilidad de antimaleficio. (No puedes ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'A Atreos le importa poco el conflicto de los demás dioses con los mortales. Solo le preocupa que los muertos tengan una travesía segura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85e2e22d-81a1-4759-bbd3-928b5cfe264a\', \'multiverseId\': 382014}, \'multiverseid\': 382014}, {\'name\': \'Égide des dieux\', \'text\': \'Vous avez la défense talismanique. (Vous ne pouvez pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Athréos ne se préoccupe pas du conflit opposant les autres dieux aux mortels. Tout ce qui l\'intéresse, c\'est d\'assurer le passage des morts.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381024&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00045ff8-2987-4867-a655-9f44b9218ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 381024}, \'multiverseid\': 381024}, {\'name\': \'Egida degli Dei\', \'text\': \'Hai anti-malocchio. (Non puoi essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Atreo non ha interesse per i conflitti degli altri dei con i mortali. Si cura solo di garantire un passaggio sicuro ai morti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70cec281-4074-4d8a-9493-81c0e0354e0c\', \'multiverseId\': 381189}, \'multiverseid\': 381189}, {\'name\': \'神々の神盾\', \'text\': \'あなたは呪禁を持つ。（あなたはあなたの対戦相手がコントロールする呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'エイスリオスは他の神々と定命の者たちとの戦いにさしたる興味は無かった。彼の唯一の関心は、死者の無事な通過だけにあった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'786f8cb9-181d-4524-b8a8-dca694b41e59\', \'multiverseId\': 381354}, \'multiverseid\': 381354}, {\'name\': \'신들의 방패\', \'text\': \'당신은 방호를 가진다. (당신은 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표로 정해질 수 없다.)\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': \'에스리오스는 필멸자와 다른 신들의 싸움에는 별 관심이 없다. 오직 죽은 자들의 안전한 여행만이 그의 관심사이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469c0c94-4121-441d-9c67-198e5bcc721b\', \'multiverseId\': 381519}, \'multiverseid\': 381519}, {\'name\': \'Égide dos Deuses\', \'text\': \'Você tem resistência a magia. (Você não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Atreos não se importa com os conflitos dos outros deuses com os mortais. Sua única preocupação é garantir uma passagem segura aos mortos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66fb58de-9b01-430a-8373-3cc107c3a62e\', \'multiverseId\': 381684}, \'multiverseid\': 381684}, {\'name\': \'Эгида Богов\', \'text\': \'Вы имеете Порчеустойчивость. (Вы не можете быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Атрею нет дела до борьбы богов и смертных. Его заботит лишь безопасность пути для павших.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98dc468c-1b1f-4f24-90b8-5e65d46ee189\', \'multiverseId\': 381849}, \'multiverseid\': 381849}, {\'name\': \'庇佑神使\', \'text\': \'你具有辟邪异能。（你不能成为由对手所操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\', \'type\': \'结界生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'雅睿欧斯对诸神与凡人间的争斗兴味索然，安全渡亡为其唯一专念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36362ad8-12f7-4287-b22b-f2b26be82064\', \'multiverseId\': 380529}, \'multiverseid\': 380529}, {\'name\': \'庇佑神使\', \'text\': \'你具有辟邪異能。（你不能成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\', \'type\': \'結界生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'雅睿歐斯對諸神與凡人間的爭鬥興味索然，安全渡亡為其唯一專念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0429cc69-06ab-41c7-8106-b1647a275f6c\', \'multiverseId\': 380694}, \'multiverseid\': 380694}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlachtfeld-Thaumaturg\', \'text\': \'Alle Spontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken für jede Kreatur, die sie als Ziel haben, {1} weniger.\\nHeroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der den Schlachtfeld-Thaumaturgen als Ziel hat, erhält der Schlachtfeld-Thaumaturg Fluchsicherheit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed162b38-7b5e-4a97-bf11-816437fafb8c\', \'multiverseId\': 380872}, \'multiverseid\': 380872}, {\'name\': \'Taumaturgo del campo de batalla\', \'text\': \'Lanzar cada hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro te cuesta {1} menos por cada criatura a la que haga objetivo.\\nHeroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo al Taumaturgo del campo de batalla, el Taumaturgo del campo de batalla gana la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'163ae1fa-ef8c-4254-8679-6eb4bea653cd\', \'multiverseId\': 382027}, \'multiverseid\': 382027}, {\'name\': \'Thaumaturge de campagne\', \'text\': "Chaque sort d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque créature qu\'il cible.\\nHéroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible le Thaumaturge de campagne, le Thaumaturge de campagne acquiert la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381037&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f20155-c3d7-4656-bee8-17d0adf9b0f1\', \'multiverseId\': 381037}, \'multiverseid\': 381037}, {\'name\': \'Taumaturgo Combattente\', \'text\': \'Ogni magia istantaneo e stregoneria che lanci costa {1} in meno per essere lanciata per ogni creatura che bersaglia.\\nEroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia il Taumaturgo Combattente, il Taumaturgo Combattente ha anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4c64ee8-2196-4319-b519-88f1104433f2\', \'multiverseId\': 381202}, \'multiverseid\': 381202}, {\'name\': \'戦場の秘術師\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱えるインスタント呪文とソーサリー呪文を唱えるためのコストは、それが対象としたクリーチャー１体につき{1}少なくなる。\\n英雄的 ― あなたが戦場の秘術師を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、戦場の秘術師はターン終了時まで呪禁を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c20d5fc-8ba0-42db-9ad5-8d80a60d6947\', \'multiverseId\': 381367}, \'multiverseid\': 381367}, {\'name\': \'전장의 요술사\', \'text\': \'당신이 발동하는 모든 순간마법 및 집중마법은 목표로 정한 생물의 수 만큼 발동하는 데 {1}이 덜 든다.\\n영웅 — 당신이 전장의 요술사를 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 전장의 요술사는 턴종료까지 방호를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4666e5bb-5026-4afc-ab42-6ee41eb068aa\', \'multiverseId\': 381532}, \'multiverseid\': 381532}, {\'name\': \'Taumaturgo da Batalha\', \'text\': \'Cada mágica instantânea e feitiço que você conjura custa {1} a menos para ser conjurado para cada criatura que tiver como alvo.\\nHeroico — Toda vez que você conjura uma mágica cujo alvo é Taumaturgo da Batalha, Taumaturgo da Batalha ganha resistência a magia até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'361eaa89-dbc2-4537-8bb2-9f5c6095a788\', \'multiverseId\': 381697}, \'multiverseid\': 381697}, {\'name\': \'Боевой Тавматург\', \'text\': \'Каждое разыгрываемое вами мгновенное заклинание и заклинание волшебства стоит на {1} меньше за каждое существо, являющееся его целью.\\nГероизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Боевой Тавматург, Боевой Тавматург получает Порчеустойчивость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bfbda32-70a8-42d7-89e1-1152d2341c48\', \'multiverseId\': 381862}, \'multiverseid\': 381862}, {\'name\': \'战场奇术师\', \'text\': \'对你施放的每个瞬间与法术咒语而言，该咒语每指定一个生物为目标，便减少{1}来施放。\\n勇行～每当你施放一个以战场奇术师为目标的咒语时，战场奇术师获得辟邪异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15656855-8e39-4d96-a4b6-f87131a662ad\', \'multiverseId\': 380542}, \'multiverseid\': 380542}, {\'name\': \'戰場奇術師\', \'text\': \'對你施放的每個瞬間與巫術咒語而言，該咒語每指定一個生物為目標，便減少{1}來施放。\\n勇行～每當你施放一個以戰場奇術師為目標的咒語時，戰場奇術師獲得辟邪異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7bd882-2d28-4f33-9493-f03821d14a68\', \'multiverseId\': 380707}, \'multiverseid\': 380707}]', "[{'name': 'Schlimmste Befürchtungen', 'text': 'Du kontrollierst einen Spieler deiner Wahl während des nächsten Zugs dieses Spielers. Schicke die Schlimmsten Befürchtungen ins Exil. (Du siehst alle Karten, die dieser Spieler sehen könnte, und triffst alle Entscheidungen für diesen Spieler.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Elspeth befürchtete, dass ihr Eindringen nach Nyx geahndet werden würde.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381023&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd8e1c6ea-0acc-482f-91cc-2ab4a4318887', 'multiverseId': 381023}, 'multiverseid': 381023}, {'name': 'Los más indecibles temores', 'text': 'Controlas al jugador objetivo durante el próximo turno de ese jugador. Exilia Los más indecibles temores. (Ves todas las cartas que ese jugador podría ver y tomas todas las decisiones en su lugar.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Elspeth temía que su entrada indebida a Nyx no pasara inadvertida.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382178&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ecac4861-9a4c-4a01-aa33-8937ebd6c1cb', 'multiverseId': 382178}, 'multiverseid': 382178}, {'name': 'Pires craintes', 'text': 'Vous contrôlez le joueur ciblé pendant son prochain tour. Exilez les Pires craintes. (Vous voyez toutes les cartes que ce joueur pourrait voir et vous prenez toutes les décisions pour ce joueur.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Elspeth craignait que son intrusion dans Nyx ne soit pas sans conséquences.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381188&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e793f8d2-21ac-42e0-85d1-93a51650f595', 'multiverseId': 381188}, 'multiverseid': 381188}, {'name': 'Paure Recondite', 'text': 'Controlli un giocatore bersaglio durante il prossimo turno di quel giocatore. Esilia le Paure Recondite. (Vedi tutte le carte che quel giocatore può vedere e prendi tutte le decisioni per quel giocatore.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Elspeth temeva che la sua intrusione in Nyx non sarebbe stata ignorata.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381353&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45a805bb-27e2-4c0c-b58a-5bf57991911e', 'multiverseId': 381353}, 'multiverseid': 381353}, {'name': '最悪の恐怖', 'text': 'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの次のターンの間、あなたはそのプレイヤーをコントロールする。最悪の恐怖を追放する。（あなたはそのプレイヤーが見ることのできるカードをすべて見て、そのプレイヤーが行うすべての決定を行う。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'エルズペスは、自分がニクスの領域に侵入したことにより、何らかの報復があることを恐れていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381518&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40b2c368-4b2b-4182-9cbd-3a9679aad7df', 'multiverseId': 381518}, 'multiverseid': 381518}, {'name': '최악의 공포', 'text': '플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어의 다음 턴 동안 그 플레이어를 조종한다. 최악의 공포를 추방한다. (그 플레이어가 보는 카드를 모두 보고 그 플레이어 대신 모든 결정을 내린다.)', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': '엘스페스는 닉스에 들어온 자신을 신들이 가만히 두지 않으리라는 생각에 두려워했다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381683&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '151a45bb-0977-45b5-8261-332d9d7e227e', 'multiverseId': 381683}, 'multiverseid': 381683}, {'name': 'Piores Medos', 'text': 'Você controla o jogador alvo durante o próximo turno dele. Exile Piores Medos. (Você vê todos os cards que aquele jogador poderia ver e toma todas as decisões pelo jogador.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Elspeth temia que sua invasão a Nyx não ficaria impune.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381848&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce0f0661-2af8-47a2-8add-1fad84251f97', 'multiverseId': 381848}, 'multiverseid': 381848}, {'name': 'Худшие Страхи', 'text': 'Вы контролируете целевого игрока во время его следующего хода. Изгоните Худшие Страхи. (Вы видите все карты, которые мог бы видеть тот игрок, и принимаете все решения за того игрока.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Элспет боялась, что ее вторжение в Никс не останется без ответа.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382013&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a347518-2d6f-4d65-ae5c-7d06fdd47991', 'multiverseId': 382013}, 'multiverseid': 382013}, {'name': '极端恐惧', 'text': '目标牌手在他下个回合由你来操控。放逐极端恐惧。（你能看所有该牌手能看到的牌，并代该牌手作出所有决定。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '艾紫培害怕的就是她擅闯尼兹的下场。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380693&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60c45c1a-0f59-4129-a02a-f8478f84a854', 'multiverseId': 380693}, 'multiverseid': 380693}, {'name': '極端恐懼', 'text': '目標玩家在他下個回合由你來操控。放逐極端恐懼。（你能看所有該玩家能看到的牌，並代該玩家作出所有決定。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '艾紫培害怕的就是她擅闖尼茲的下場。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380858&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1331b15-ae9b-42a2-ad62-237cdc896475', 'multiverseId': 380858}, 'multiverseid': 380858}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schmatzende Egel\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft der Schmatzenden Egel sind gleich der Anzahl an Sümpfen, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Egel\', \'flavor\': \'Egel sind den Anhängern der Pharika heilig, da sie das Gift aus Wunden saugen. Alle anderen fürchten sie jedoch, da sie dem Fleisch Blut entziehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f67f77f-1a82-4ff5-b926-f31bd720ca4b\', \'multiverseId\': 381002}, \'multiverseid\': 381002}, {\'name\': \'Sanguijuelas viscosas\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia de las Sanguijuelas viscosas son iguales al número de pantanos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sanguijuela\', \'flavor\': \'Las sanguijuelas son sagradas para los seguidores de Farika porque extraen el veneno de las heridas, pero temidas por todos los demás porque extraen la sangre de la carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8e3131a-ec8d-4047-bdc5-4da407bdf1a9\', \'multiverseId\': 382157}, \'multiverseid\': 382157}, {\'name\': \'Sangsues grouillantes\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance des Sangsues grouillantes sont chacune égales au nombre de marais que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature : sangsue\', \'flavor\': "Les sangsues sont sacrées pour les adorateurs de Pharika parce qu\'elles vident les blessures du poison, mais craintes de tous parce qu\'elles vident le corps de son sang.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d5f274e-e222-42e9-abb3-17bc223e0281\', \'multiverseId\': 381167}, \'multiverseid\': 381167}, {\'name\': \'Sanguisughe Sguazzanti\', \'text\': \'La forza e la costituzione delle Sanguisughe Sguazzanti sono pari al numero di Paludi che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sanguisuga\', \'flavor\': \'I seguaci di Farika venerano le sanguisughe perché estraggono il veleno dalle ferite; chiunque altro le teme perché estraggono il sangue dal corpo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'808dd9d9-7602-4781-a3f6-75067cb106d8\', \'multiverseId\': 381332}, \'multiverseid\': 381332}, {\'name\': \'押し潰すヒル\', \'text\': \'押し潰すヒルのパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールする沼の総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヒル\', \'flavor\': \'ヒルはファリカの信徒にとって傷口から毒を吸い出す聖なる生き物とされているが、他の者たちからは肉体から血を吸い出すことで恐れられている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06936f4f-21cc-4ec0-ae82-afc6a081954c\', \'multiverseId\': 381497}, \'multiverseid\': 381497}, {\'name\': \'짓누르는 거머리\', \'text\': \'짓누르는 거머리의 공격력과 방어력은 각각 당신이 조종하는 늪의 개수와 같다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거머리\', \'flavor\': \'파리카의 추종자들은 거머리가 상처에서 독을 빨아내기에 신성하게 여기지만 다른 자들은 살에서 피를 빨아내기에 끔찍하게 여긴다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eb415b8-6572-4c2c-87fa-a46e6bd16b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 381662}, \'multiverseid\': 381662}, {\'name\': \'Sanguessugas Famintas\', \'text\': \'O poder e a resistência de Sanguessugas Famintas são iguais ao número de Pântanos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sanguessuga\', \'flavor\': \'As sanguessugas são sagradas para os seguidores de Fárica por sugarem o veneno das feridas, mas são temidas por todos os outros por sugarem o sangue da carne.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01118ed2-e713-4761-bcd6-36395b07fe2d\', \'multiverseId\': 381827}, \'multiverseid\': 381827}, {\'name\': \'Хлюпающие Пиявки\', \'text\': \'Сила и выносливость Хлюпающих Пиявок равны количеству Болот под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Пиявка\', \'flavor\': \'Последователи Фарики почитают пиявок за то, что они вытягивают яд из раны. Остальные же боятся их за то, что они вытягивают кровь из тела.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40faa01e-28e9-40e4-83cc-c1cec8b51db8\', \'multiverseId\': 381992}, \'multiverseid\': 381992}, {\'name\': \'吱响蛭群\', \'text\': \'吱响蛭群的力量及防御力各等同于由你操控的沼泽数量。\', \'type\': \'生物～蛭\', \'flavor\': \'蛭群是芳瑞卡追随者的圣物，因为可以吸出伤口中的毒液，但是其他人很怕它们，因为会吸走身体里的血液。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b221009-f484-4f69-8869-072abf1748c1\', \'multiverseId\': 380672}, \'multiverseid\': 380672}, {\'name\': \'吱響蛭群\', \'text\': \'吱響蛭群的力量及防禦力各等同於由你操控的沼澤數量。\', \'type\': \'生物～蛭\', \'flavor\': \'蛭群是芳瑞卡追隨者的聖物，因為可以吸出傷口中的毒液，但是其他人很怕牠們，因為會吸走身體裡的血液。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c91326-5113-44b8-ad7d-fd851205f371\', \'multiverseId\': 380837}, \'multiverseid\': 380837}]', "[{'name': 'Schmiedegeborene Oreaden', 'text': 'Konstellation — Immer wenn die Schmiedegeborenen Oreaden oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügen die Schmiedegeborenen Oreaden einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe', 'flavor': 'Purphoros formte die Oreaden aus verstreuten Kohlen seiner Schmiede.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380917&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6405d18-3396-49da-9479-e759e89455b3', 'multiverseId': 380917}, 'multiverseid': 380917}, {'name': 'Oréades nacidas de la forja', 'text': 'Constelación — Siempre que las Oréades nacidas de la forja u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, las Oréades nacidas de la forja hacen 1 punto de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura encantamiento — Ninfa', 'flavor': 'Purforos moldeó a las oréades a partir de carbones que se habían caído de su forja.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382072&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ead1a47f-59fc-417f-a601-e8fe8d5174c9', 'multiverseId': 382072}, 'multiverseid': 382072}, {'name': 'Oréades nées des forges', 'text': 'Constellation — À chaque fois que les Oréades nées des forges ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, les Oréades nées des forges infligent 1 blessure à une cible, créature ou joueur.', 'type': 'Créature-enchantement : nymphe', 'flavor': 'Purphoros façonna les oréades à partir de charbons échappés de sa forge.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381082&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8e218935-c826-4cde-9c5c-810b8c50c3aa', 'multiverseId': 381082}, 'multiverseid': 381082}, {'name': 'Oreadi Plasmate nella Forgia', 'text': 'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta le Oreadi Plasmate nella Forgia o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, le Oreadi Plasmate nella Forgia infliggono 1 danno a una creatura o un giocatore bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura Incantesimo — Ninfa', 'flavor': 'Purforos diede forma alle oreadi da tizzoni sfuggiti alla sua forgia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381247&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77a48964-a587-4827-afbe-c75e30b5ec62', 'multiverseId': 381247}, 'multiverseid': 381247}, {'name': '炉生まれのオリアード', 'text': '星座 ― 炉生まれのオリアードか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。炉生まれのオリアードはそれに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ', 'flavor': 'パーフォロスはその炉の余った石炭からオリアードたちを作った。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381412&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd01fb6f0-835f-47cf-b353-5afc2b299a9c', 'multiverseId': 381412}, 'multiverseid': 381412}, {'name': '용광로에서 태어난 오레아드', 'text': '성좌 — 용광로에서 태어난 오레아드나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 용광로에서 태어난 오레아드는 그 목표에게 피해 1점을 입힌다', 'type': '부여마법 생물 — 님프', 'flavor': '퍼포로스는 자신의 대장간에서 굴러다니는 석탄으로 오레아드를 만들었다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381577&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5577a19c-d108-47a8-a1fc-8492000179b6', 'multiverseId': 381577}, 'multiverseid': 381577}, {'name': 'Oréades Nascidas da Forja', 'text': 'Constelação — Toda vez que Oréades Nascidas da Forja ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, Oréades Nascidas da Forja causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura Encantamento — Ninfa', 'flavor': 'Púrforo talhou as oréades dos carvões excedentes em sua forja.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381742&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e6818a7-0aa3-41d0-90dd-8747a6dfbb91', 'multiverseId': 381742}, 'multiverseid': 381742}, {'name': 'Рожденные в Горниле Ореады', 'text': 'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Рожденные в Горниле Ореады или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, Рожденные в Горниле Ореады наносят 1 повреждение целевому существу или игроку.', 'type': 'Чары Существо — Нимфа', 'flavor': 'Пирфор сотворил ореад из угольков, вылетевших из его горна.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381907&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01258131-015f-4f1e-af38-747d091cc75c', 'multiverseId': 381907}, 'multiverseid': 381907}, {'name': '锻生山灵', 'text': '星彩～每当锻生山灵或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，锻生山灵对目标生物或牌手造成1点伤害。', 'type': '结界生物～宁芙', 'flavor': '普罗烽斯用锻炉里零星的煤渣塑出了山灵。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380587&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97b88583-37fe-4e69-9657-619bab03a476', 'multiverseId': 380587}, 'multiverseid': 380587}, {'name': '鍛生山靈', 'text': '星彩～每當鍛生山靈或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，鍛生山靈對目標生物或玩家造成1點傷害。', 'type': '結界生物～寧芙', 'flavor': '普羅烽斯用鍛爐裡零星的煤渣塑出了山靈。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380752&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30d992fe-a532-45d3-9351-c04f0bce2fab', 'multiverseId': 380752}, 'multiverseid': 380752}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schwarmgeborener Riese\', \'text\': \'Wenn dir Kampfschaden zugefügt wird, opfere den Schwarmgeborenen Riesen.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Monstrum 2. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nSolange der Schwarmgeborene Riese monströs ist, hat er Reichweite.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3172a225-165c-4fe8-a323-9bad916b687c\', \'multiverseId\': 381008}, \'multiverseid\': 381008}, {\'name\': \'Gigante nacido del enjambre\', \'text\': \'Cuando te hagan daño de combate, sacrifica el Gigante nacido del enjambre.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Monstruosidad 2. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nMientras el Gigante nacido del enjambre sea monstruoso, tiene la habilidad de alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bf5db25-081d-40dd-bd62-951feec23e3d\', \'multiverseId\': 382163}, \'multiverseid\': 382163}, {\'name\': "Géant né de l\'essaim", \'text\': "Quand vous subissez des blessures de combat, sacrifiez le Géant né de l\'essaim.\\n{4}{G}{G} : Monstruosité 2. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nTant que le Géant né de l\'essaim est monstrueux, il a la portée.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1041a351-09bd-4a57-a0ec-6bae18284803\', \'multiverseId\': 381173}, \'multiverseid\': 381173}, {\'name\': \'Gigante dello Sciame\', \'text\': \'Quando ti viene inflitto danno da combattimento, sacrifica il Gigante dello Sciame.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Mostruosità 2. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti due segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nFintanto che il Gigante dello Sciame è mostruoso, ha raggiungere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc9574d6-94d4-412d-8f23-570b859d4218\', \'multiverseId\': 381338}, \'multiverseid\': 381338}, {\'name\': \'群れ生まれの巨人\', \'text\': \'あなたに戦闘ダメージが与えられたとき、群れ生まれの巨人を生け贄に捧げる。\\n{4}{G}{G}：怪物化２を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\n群れ生まれの巨人が怪物的であるかぎり、これは到達を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c328d65-74e6-443d-9c2f-ea1280c90b24\', \'multiverseId\': 381503}, \'multiverseid\': 381503}, {\'name\': \'무리 거인\', \'text\': \'당신이 전투피해를 입을 때, 무리 거인을 희생한다.\\n{4}{G}{G}: 괴수화 2. (이 생물이 괴수화하지 않았다면, 이 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다. 이 생물은 괴수화한다.)\\n무리 거인이 괴수화했다면, 대공을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20941202-4646-46e0-af03-e0c9965754be\', \'multiverseId\': 381668}, \'multiverseid\': 381668}, {\'name\': \'Gigante do Enxame\', \'text\': \'Quando você sofrer dano de combate, sacrifique Gigante do Enxame.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Monstruosidade 2. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\\nEnquanto Gigante do Enxame for monstruoso, ele terá alcance.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66a65b95-7417-4805-851e-82f01f6ab341\', \'multiverseId\': 381833}, \'multiverseid\': 381833}, {\'name\': \'Гигант, Порождение Роя\', \'text\': \'Когда вам наносятся боевые повреждения, пожертвуйте Гиганта, Порождение Роя.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Чудовищность 2. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него два жетона +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\\nПока Гигант, Порождение Роя является чудовищным, он имеет Захват.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f564d2-b939-41b6-8c2a-9f8679e9c4ad\', \'multiverseId\': 381998}, \'multiverseid\': 381998}, {\'name\': \'群集巨人\', \'text\': \'当你受到战斗伤害时，牺牲群集巨人。\\n{4}{G}{G}：蛮化2。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置两个+1/+1指示物且它蛮化。）\\n只要群集巨人已蛮化，它便具有延势异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a895599-5358-4252-a734-363038f0e4d5\', \'multiverseId\': 380678}, \'multiverseid\': 380678}, {\'name\': \'群集巨人\', \'text\': \'當你受到戰鬥傷害時，犧牲群集巨人。\\n{4}{G}{G}：蠻化2。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置兩個+1/+1指示物且它蠻化。）\\n只要群集巨人已蠻化，它便具有延勢異能。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9eb792-92df-432f-8c72-b9271279c3e3\', \'multiverseId\': 380843}, \'multiverseid\': 380843}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schülerin der Täuschung\', \'text\': \'Inspiriert — Immer wenn die Schülerin der Täuschung enttappt wird, kannst du eine Karte, die kein Land ist, aus deiner Hand abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte mit den gleichen umgewandelten Manakosten wie diese Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4b236e5-5497-4b66-a0d1-9487c2a32a5c\', \'multiverseId\': 380899}, \'multiverseid\': 380899}, {\'name\': \'Discípula del engaño\', \'text\': \'Inspiración — Siempre que la Discípula del engaño se enderece, puedes descartar una carta que no sea tierra. Si lo haces, busca en tu biblioteca una carta con el mismo coste de maná convertido que esa carta, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99b11701-44c7-49af-90b5-477cae7105eb\', \'multiverseId\': 382054}, \'multiverseid\': 382054}, {\'name\': \'Disciple de la tromperie\', \'text\': "Inspiration — À chaque fois que la Disciple de la tromperie devient dégagée, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte non-terrain. Si vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte ayant le même coût converti de mana que cette carte, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main et mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381064&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7463b05-5b19-47c6-a7c0-823b0541de09\', \'multiverseId\': 381064}, \'multiverseid\': 381064}, {\'name\': "Discepola dell\'Inganno", \'text\': "Ispirazione — Ogniqualvolta la Discepola dell\'Inganno viene STAPpata, puoi scartare una carta non terra. Se lo fai, passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta con lo stesso costo di mana convertito di quella carta, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8638cf1-5177-47c9-afc8-2d19ab3bb3b9\', \'multiverseId\': 381229}, \'multiverseid\': 381229}, {\'name\': \'欺瞞の信奉者\', \'text\': \'神啓 ― 欺瞞の信奉者がアンタップ状態になるたび、あなたは土地でないカードを１枚捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーからそのカードと同じ点数で見たマナ・コストを持つカードを１枚探し、それを公開してあなたの手札に加え、その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9661528b-94b4-4bd9-8b55-7a0d1a721776\', \'multiverseId\': 381394}, \'multiverseid\': 381394}, {\'name\': \'속임수의 사도\', \'text\': \'영감 — 속임수의 사도가 언탭될 때마다, 당신은 대지가 아닌 카드 한 장을 버릴 수 있다. 그렇게 하면, 당신의 서고에서 그 카드와 전환마나비용이 같은 카드 한 장을 찾아서 공개한 후, 당신의 손으로 가져간 다음 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 도적\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ec35840-e96f-4f9a-83ee-9f6fabb67dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 381559}, \'multiverseid\': 381559}, {\'name\': \'Discípulo da Enganação\', \'text\': \'Inspirado — Toda vez que Discípulo da Enganação é desvirado, você pode descartar um card que não seja terreno. Se fizer isso, procure em seu grimório um card com o mesmo custo de mana convertido daquele card, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe o seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73ef5e4a-1a90-432f-a67f-036699856507\', \'multiverseId\': 381724}, \'multiverseid\': 381724}, {\'name\': \'Ученица Обмана\', \'text\': \'Одухотворение — Каждый раз, когда Ученица Обмана становится развернутой, вы можете сбросить карту, не являющуюся землей. Если вы это делаете, найдите в вашей библиотеке карту с такой же конвертированной мана-стоимостью, что и у той карты, покажите ее и положите в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b14f9845-56d4-43cf-ac74-a4d792648d54\', \'multiverseId\': 381889}, \'multiverseid\': 381889}, {\'name\': \'诡诈信徒\', \'text\': \'启悟～每当诡诈信徒成为未横置时，你可以弃一张非地牌。若你如此作，从你的牌库中搜寻一张总法术力费用与该牌相同的牌，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c96cd82-9955-4158-8c52-2cb73370e1d2\', \'multiverseId\': 380569}, \'multiverseid\': 380569}, {\'name\': \'詭詐信徒\', \'text\': \'啟悟～每當詭詐信徒成為未橫置時，你可以棄一張非地牌。若你如此作，從你的牌庫中搜尋一張總魔法力費用與該牌相同的牌，展示該牌，並將它置於你手上，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8af9f30c-25c6-469f-b273-6e38bcb4f47b\', \'multiverseId\': 380734}, \'multiverseid\': 380734}]', '[{\'name\': \'Setesser-Taktik\', \'text\': \'Streben — Die Setesser-Taktik kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {G} mehr.\\nBis zum Ende des Zuges erhält eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl +1/+1 und „{T}: Diese Kreatur kämpft gegen eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0456cb3f-a753-4711-9c5a-eb9a58ca8cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 380990}, \'multiverseid\': 380990}, {\'name\': \'Tácticas setessanas\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar las Tácticas setessanas cuesta {G} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nHasta el final del turno, cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo obtienen +1/+1 cada una y ganan "{T}: Esta criatura lucha contra otra criatura objetivo".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bdbb91f-ddaa-4af7-8047-fead1aae7844\', \'multiverseId\': 382145}, \'multiverseid\': 382145}, {\'name\': \'Tactiques setessiennes\', \'text\': "Obstination — Les Tactiques setessiennes coûtent {G} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nJusqu\'à la fin du tour, n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées gagnent chacune +1/+1 et acquièrent « {T} : Cette créature se bat contre une autre créature ciblée. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b7b4522-f504-4926-8e07-e22c721010e8\', \'multiverseId\': 381155}, \'multiverseid\': 381155}, {\'name\': \'Tattiche di Setessa\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Le Tattiche di Setessa costano {G} in più per essere lanciate per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Ognuna di esse prende +1/+1 e ha "{T}: Questa creatura lotta con un\\\'altra creatura bersaglio" fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0472195-6c99-4902-b5ad-ff2bd6c3be4d\', \'multiverseId\': 381320}, \'multiverseid\': 381320}, {\'name\': \'セテッサ式戦術\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― セテッサ式戦術を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{G}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それらはそれぞれターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受けるとともに「{T}：他のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれと格闘を行う。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71d8c539-21f2-48f9-b0d4-47c9a074fc59\', \'multiverseId\': 381485}, \'multiverseid\': 381485}, {\'name\': \'세테사식 전술\', \'text\': "분투 — 세테사식 전술은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 {G}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지, 그 생물들은 각각 +1/+1 을 받고 \'{T}: 다른 생물을 목표로 정한다. 이 생물은 그 생물과 서로 싸운다.\'를 얻는다.\'", \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15b5f79f-83b6-4578-aa4e-424d33eae873\', \'multiverseId\': 381650}, \'multiverseid\': 381650}, {\'name\': \'Táticas Setessanas\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Táticas Setessanas custa {G} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nAté o final do turno, qualquer número de criaturas alvo recebe +1/+1 e ganha "{T}: Esta criatura luta contra outra criatura alvo."\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad70e9a3-462b-4f18-a446-73bf2873d91b\', \'multiverseId\': 381815}, \'multiverseid\': 381815}, {\'name\': \'Сетесская Тактика\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Сетесской Тактики стоит на {G} больше.\\nДо конца хода любое количество целевых существ получают по +1/+1 и способность «{T}: это существо дерется с другим целевым существом».\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'405ef6b4-150d-40fe-99d8-e404be864a3c\', \'multiverseId\': 381980}, \'multiverseid\': 381980}, {\'name\': \'瑟特萨式战法\', \'text\': \'积力～瑟特萨式战法在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{G}来施放。\\n直到回合结束，任意数量的目标生物得+1/+1且获得「{T}：此生物与另一个目标生物互斗。」\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'610e90c8-cce7-4cab-aaff-3095e85878a2\', \'multiverseId\': 380660}, \'multiverseid\': 380660}, {\'name\': \'瑟特薩式戰法\', \'text\': \'積力～瑟特薩式戰法在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{G}來施放。\\n直到回合結束，任意數量的目標生物得+1/+1且獲得「{T}：此生物與另一個目標生物互鬥。」\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'772616a1-5cdb-469b-a52e-1e05f87530c8\', \'multiverseId\': 380825}, \'multiverseid\': 380825}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sigill-Seestern\', \'text\': \'{T}: Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Seestern\', \'flavor\': \'Kruphix versteckte die düstersten Prophezeiungen über die Menschheit dort, wo die Menschen sie nie finden und die Tritonier ihnen keine Beachtung schenken würden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15369245-30bb-46ac-b6af-4d88bd5866f8\', \'multiverseId\': 380993}, \'multiverseid\': 380993}, {\'name\': \'Estrella de mar con runas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Estrella-de-mar\', \'flavor\': \'Krufix ocultó las profecías más nefastas acerca de la humanidad donde los humanos jamás pudieran hallarlas y los tritónidos no se tomaran la molestia de leerlas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'414289c1-ed5b-47b4-9c77-14428f0eb51a\', \'multiverseId\': 382148}, \'multiverseid\': 382148}, {\'name\': \'Étoile de mer sigillaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : étoile de mer\', \'flavor\': "Kruphix dissimula les prophéties les plus horribles sur l\'humanité là où les humains ne pourraient jamais les retrouver. Les tritons, eux, ne s\'y intéresseraient pas.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381158&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a045b1a-784b-4746-9a51-b8d11e3f9de4\', \'multiverseId\': 381158}, \'multiverseid\': 381158}, {\'name\': \'Stella Marina dei Sigilli\', \'text\': \'{T}: Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Stella Marina\', \'flavor\': "Krufix nascose le profezie più catastrofiche sull\'umanità in un luogo dove gli umani non avessero mai possibilità di trovarle, né i marinidi interesse a leggerle.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6041dbf2-d49c-441d-92bd-09a60d1f8ec6\', \'multiverseId\': 381323}, \'multiverseid\': 381323}, {\'name\': \'印章持ちのヒトデ\', \'text\': \'{T}：占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ヒトデ\', \'flavor\': \'クルフィックスは人間たちに関する最も恐ろしい予言を、人間たちに見つかることもなく、またトリトンがそれを読むほどの興味を持つことのない場所に隠した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f05cf80-f8fe-45b4-8ba7-7ffa636a9883\', \'multiverseId\': 381488}, \'multiverseid\': 381488}, {\'name\': \'인장박힌 불가사리\', \'text\': \'{T}: 점술 1. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 불가사리\', \'flavor\': \'크루픽스는 인간이 가장 두려워하는 예언을 심해에 숨겨두었다. 인간은 결코 찾을 수 없고 트리톤들은 굳이 찾아보려 하지 않기 때문이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15cefd7e-95bf-451e-b611-101d9ce39bd3\', \'multiverseId\': 381653}, \'multiverseid\': 381653}, {\'name\': \'Estrela-do-mar Rúnica\', \'text\': \'{T}: Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Estrela-do-mar\', \'flavor\': \'Crufix escondeu as profecias mais sinistras sobre a humanidade onde os humanos nunca as encontrariam e os talassidos não se preocupariam em ler.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2ecc65e-fadd-46ed-a93f-31817fc1fa25\', \'multiverseId\': 381818}, \'multiverseid\': 381818}, {\'name\': \'Покрытая Рунами Морская Звезда\', \'text\': \'{T}: предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Морская_звезда\', \'flavor\': \'Круфикс спрятал самые мрачные пророчества о судьбе человечества там, где людям их никогда не найти, а тритонам нет до них никакого дела.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73668808-6f94-4d1d-a9da-11f7c847b0df\', \'multiverseId\': 381983}, \'multiverseid\': 381983}, {\'name\': \'符印海星\', \'text\': \'{T}：占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～海星\', \'flavor\': \'克罗芬斯将对人类最可怕的预言藏起，让人类永远找不到，而屈东也不会费神去读。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98efe6b7-2f71-487d-89ee-3f18deb5deb0\', \'multiverseId\': 380663}, \'multiverseid\': 380663}, {\'name\': \'符印海星\', \'text\': \'{T}：占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～海星\', \'flavor\': \'克羅芬斯將對人類最可怕的預言藏起，讓人類永遠找不到，而屈東也不會費神去讀。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88a65c10-41ee-4b1e-a031-8f1165166920\', \'multiverseId\': 380828}, \'multiverseid\': 380828}]', "[{'name': 'Sigill-Skink', 'text': 'Immer wenn der Sigill-Skink angreift, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)', 'type': 'Kreatur — Eidechse', 'flavor': 'Wenn er sich bewegt, scheint es, als würden die Runen zum Leben erwachen und wie Flammen über seine Schuppen züngeln.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380992&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7fe9f9e4-355f-4691-a8be-1a700d8de316', 'multiverseId': 380992}, 'multiverseid': 380992}, {'name': 'Lagarto con runas', 'text': 'Siempre que el Lagarto con runas ataque, adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Lagarto', 'flavor': 'Las runas parecen cobrar vida cuando se mueve, ondeando como tenues llamas por sus escamas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382147&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7254169d-8d20-4008-a7f0-641639608c09', 'multiverseId': 382147}, 'multiverseid': 382147}, {'name': 'Scinque sigillaire', 'text': 'À chaque fois que le Scinque sigillaire attaque, regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)', 'type': 'Créature : lézard', 'flavor': 'Les runes semblent prendre vie quand il bouge, dansant telles des flammes sur ses écailles.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381157&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8ac8554-b3d9-4fc2-8986-c19676267f28', 'multiverseId': 381157}, 'multiverseid': 381157}, {'name': 'Scinco dei Sigilli', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta lo Scinco dei Sigilli attacca, profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)', 'type': 'Creatura — Lucertola', 'flavor': 'Mentre si muove, le rune sembrano prendere vita e danzare lente come fiamme sulle sue squame.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381322&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0031dae6-71f2-4b83-acc2-91b6e556da88', 'multiverseId': 381322}, 'multiverseid': 381322}, {'name': '印章持ちのスキンク', 'text': '印章持ちのスキンクが攻撃するたび、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — トカゲ', 'flavor': 'それが動くたびに、その印章は鱗の上をゆっくりと生きている炎のように波打つ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381487&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5b91b4b-5126-483a-a38f-a74a8297cff8', 'multiverseId': 381487}, 'multiverseid': 381487}, {'name': '인장박힌 도마뱀', 'text': '인장박힌 도마뱀이 공격할 때마다, 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)', 'type': '생물 — 도마뱀', 'flavor': '도마뱀이 움직일 때마다, 룬이 비늘 위에서 불꽃처럼 천천히 파문을 그리며 살아 움직이는 것 같았다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381652&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffc607b2-5b56-4254-9848-c899541428da', 'multiverseId': 381652}, 'multiverseid': 381652}, {'name': 'Lagarto Rúnico', 'text': 'Toda vez que Lagarto Rúnico atacar, use vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)', 'type': 'Criatura — Lagarto', 'flavor': 'As runas parecem ganhar vida quando ele se move, ondulando por suas escamas como uma chama lenta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381817&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0db75e33-8c43-4164-a386-7ecf9d5d5590', 'multiverseId': 381817}, 'multiverseid': 381817}, {'name': 'Покрытый Рунами Сцинк', 'text': 'Каждый раз, когда Покрытый Рунами Сцинк атакует, предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)', 'type': 'Существо — Ящер', 'flavor': 'Когда он движется, руны оживают и, словно пламя, неторопливо играют на его чешуе.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381982&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '266225aa-ac4e-48c9-89b1-a7ee93b74966', 'multiverseId': 381982}, 'multiverseid': 381982}, {'name': '符印石龙子', 'text': '每当符印石龙子攻击时，占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）', 'type': '生物～蜥蜴', 'flavor': '符文在它移动时彷若活物，在其鳞片上起伏如火苗。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380662&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '990d708d-e50b-475d-9ffd-f72976e1c130', 'multiverseId': 380662}, 'multiverseid': 380662}, {'name': '符印石龍子', 'text': '每當符印石龍子攻擊時，占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）', 'type': '生物～蜥蜴', 'flavor': '符文在牠移動時彷若活物，在其鱗片上起伏如火苗。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380827&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b47eb389-585b-4698-8c5e-0ba5793db2c8', 'multiverseId': 380827}, 'multiverseid': 380827}]", '[{\'name\': \'Springflut-Chimäre\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nBringe zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Verzauberung, die du kontrollierst, auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Chimäre\', \'flavor\': \'„Will ich haben." —Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3232aed7-4fd2-47f5-9560-4d3de2381db4\', \'multiverseId\': 380980}, \'multiverseid\': 380980}, {\'name\': \'Quimera de resaca\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, regresa un encantamiento que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Quimera\', \'flavor\': \'"Quiero una". —Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d682b7-d452-4ff2-b3f0-5268b0cf2809\', \'multiverseId\': 382135}, \'multiverseid\': 382135}, {\'name\': \'Chimère du contre-courant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nAu début de votre entretien, renvoyez un enchantement que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : chimère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'en veux une. » —Kiora", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381145&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'126e7d55-d84f-4225-8583-a7fb5f8b5332\', \'multiverseId\': 381145}, \'multiverseid\': 381145}, {\'name\': \'Chimera delle Maree\', \'text\': "Volare\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, fai tornare un incantesimo che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.", \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Chimera\', \'flavor\': \'"Ne voglio una." —Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b976afc1-6560-4f85-8fde-83f6c7fecc8a\', \'multiverseId\': 381310}, \'multiverseid\': 381310}, {\'name\': \'激浪のキマイラ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがコントロールするエンチャント１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — キマイラ\', \'flavor\': \'「私も１匹欲しいわ。」 ――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d40709e-323e-4ca1-9a84-5b2239792a04\', \'multiverseId\': 381475}, \'multiverseid\': 381475}, {\'name\': \'역조 키메라\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신이 조종하는 부여마법 한 개를 소유자의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 키메라\', \'flavor\': "\'하나 갖고 싶군.\' —키오라", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dc561d1-3cd0-4513-a441-1a79627217f8\', \'multiverseId\': 381640}, \'multiverseid\': 381640}, {\'name\': \'Quimera da Rebentação\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nNo início da sua manutenção, devolva um encantamento que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Quimera\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu quero uma." — Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35afe737-47bd-4873-9d66-21e20ca2538e\', \'multiverseId\': 381805}, \'multiverseid\': 381805}, {\'name\': \'Химера Разрывного Течения\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки верните чары под вашим контролем в руку их владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Химера\', \'flavor\': \'«Хочу такую». — Киора\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8310e928-371c-4ec7-afe7-54b386447acb\', \'multiverseId\': 381970}, \'multiverseid\': 381970}, {\'name\': \'急流盖美拉\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的维持开始时，将一个由你操控的结界移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～盖美拉\', \'flavor\': \'「我要一个。」 ～奇奥拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228f114b-f7e4-436d-b1ba-e8ce3ce0d209\', \'multiverseId\': 380650}, \'multiverseid\': 380650}, {\'name\': \'急流蓋美拉\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n在你的維持開始時，將一個由你操控的結界移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～蓋美拉\', \'flavor\': \'「我要一個。」 ～奇奧拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380815&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3292e3c-a01b-4be4-880e-63907eaebd08\', \'multiverseId\': 380815}, \'multiverseid\': 380815}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stachelrücken\', \'text\': \'Göttergabe {4}{G} (Falls du diese Karte für ihre Göttergabe-Kosten wirkst, ist sie ein Aura-Zauberspruch und verzaubert eine Kreatur. Die Aura wird wieder zu einer Kreatur, falls sie nicht an eine Kreatur angelegt ist.)\\nDer Stachelrücken blockt in jedem Zug, falls möglich.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +4/+1 und blockt in jedem Zug, falls möglich.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86baa536-346a-418e-96f4-59bb27f9560d\', \'multiverseId\': 380999}, \'multiverseid\': 380999}, {\'name\': \'Espinaguja\', \'text\': \'Concesión {4}{G}. (Si lanzas esta carta pagando su coste de concesión, es un hechizo de aura con encantar criatura. Si no está anexada a una criatura, se convierte en una criatura de nuevo.)\\nLa Espinaguja bloquea cada turno si puede.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +4/+1 y bloquea cada turno si puede.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27fed2ae-ab2a-476b-9c79-e8d9eea6dfe5\', \'multiverseId\': 382154}, \'multiverseid\': 382154}, {\'name\': \'Dardépic\', \'text\': "Grâce {4}{G} (Si vous lancez cette carte pour son coût de grâce, c\'est un sort d\'aura avec enchanter : créature. Elle redevient une créature si elle n\'est pas attachée à une créature.)\\nLe Dardépic bloque à chaque tour si possible.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +4/+1 et bloque à chaque tour si possible.", \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a3a89a8-f16a-4edc-9562-9a8dbf0e70f4\', \'multiverseId\': 381164}, \'multiverseid\': 381164}, {\'name\': \'Colossospino\', \'text\': \'Conferire {4}{G} (Se lanci questa carta per il suo costo di conferire, è una magia Aura con incanta creatura. Diventa una creatura se non è assegnata a una creatura.)\\nIl Colossospino blocca ogni turno, se può farlo.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +4/+1 e blocca ogni turno, se può farlo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d4011a-6068-40c9-a481-36d70dfffd1f\', \'multiverseId\': 381329}, \'multiverseid\': 381329}, {\'name\': \'トガリトゲ\', \'text\': \'授与 {4}{G} （このカードを授与コストで唱えたなら、これはエンチャント（クリーチャー）を持つオーラ呪文である。クリーチャーにつけられていないなら、これは再びクリーチャーになる。）\\nトガリトゲは可能なら毎ターンブロックする。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋４/＋１の修整を受けるとともに、可能なら毎ターンブロックする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077bbf30-3248-4176-930e-27d816fa03d2\', \'multiverseId\': 381494}, \'multiverseid\': 381494}, {\'name\': \'뾰족가시\', \'text\': \'권능 {4}{G} (이 카드의 권능 비용을 지불하고 발동하면, 이 카드는 생물에게 부여하는 마법진 주문이다. 이 카드는 생물에 부착되지 않은 상태가 되면 다시 생물이 된다.)\\n뾰족가시는 가능하면 매 턴마다 방어한다.\\n부여된 생물은 +4/+1을 받고 가능하면 매 턴마다 방어한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 야수\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee7725b-c720-4072-8f02-97b51d8f2b08\', \'multiverseId\': 381659}, \'multiverseid\': 381659}, {\'name\': \'Ouriço Longispino\', \'text\': \'Agraciar {4}{G} (Se você conjurar este card pagando seu custo de agraciar, ele será uma mágica de Aura com encantar criatura. Ele se tornará novamente uma criatura se não estiver anexado a uma criatura.)\\nOuriço Longispino bloqueia a cada turno se estiver apto.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +4/+1 e bloqueia a cada turno se estiver apta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Besta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2905cb01-d200-497b-87d3-e4f7a584148b\', \'multiverseId\': 381824}, \'multiverseid\': 381824}, {\'name\': \'Спиношип\', \'text\': \'Дар {4}{G} (Если вы разыгрываете эту карту за ее стоимость Дара, она является заклинанием Ауры со способностью «зачаровать существо». Она снова становится существом, если не прикреплена к существу.)\\nСпиношип блокирует в каждом ходу, если может.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +4/+1 и блокирует в каждом ходу, если может.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Зверь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33b3f0ea-4684-4ee3-bbe5-052b5fbe8773\', \'multiverseId\': 381989}, \'multiverseid\': 381989}, {\'name\': \'尖刺豪猪\', \'text\': \'神授{4}{G}（如果你支付此牌的神授费用来施放它，则它便是具「结附于生物」的灵气咒语。如果它未结附于生物上，就会再度成为生物。）\\n尖刺豪猪每回合若能进行阻挡，则必须阻挡。\\n所结附的生物得+4/+1且每回合若能进行阻挡，则必须阻挡。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b54ec54-8da9-4163-89c2-a5b9535c8f22\', \'multiverseId\': 380669}, \'multiverseid\': 380669}, {\'name\': \'尖刺豪豬\', \'text\': \'神授{4}{G}（如果你支付此牌的神授費用來施放它，則它便是具「結附於生物」的靈氣咒語。如果它未結附於生物上，就會再度成為生物。）\\n尖刺豪豬每回合若能進行阻擋，則必須阻擋。\\n所結附的生物得+4/+1且每回合若能進行阻擋，則必須阻擋。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～野獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a61ed89-1008-4b0d-8ea4-3a982f31e934\', \'multiverseId\': 380834}, \'multiverseid\': 380834}]', "[{'name': 'Steinbruch-Koloss', 'text': 'Wenn der Steinbruch-Koloss ins Spiel kommt, lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl unter die obersten X Karten der Bibliothek ihres Besitzers, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Ebenen ist, die du kontrollierst.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Riese', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380972&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a098f3e-3a60-418f-8ebc-1272b1254b83', 'multiverseId': 380972}, 'multiverseid': 380972}, {'name': 'Coloso de la cantera', 'text': 'Cuando el Coloso de la cantera entre al campo de batalla, pon la criatura objetivo en la biblioteca de su propietario justo debajo de las X primeras cartas de la biblioteca, donde X es la cantidad de llanuras que controlas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gigante', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382127&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbd30474-a95c-4426-9f4e-40c363ae9576', 'multiverseId': 382127}, 'multiverseid': 382127}, {'name': 'Colosse des carrières', 'text': 'Quand le Colosse des carrières arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez une créature ciblée dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire, juste au-dessous des X cartes du dessus de cette bibliothèque, X étant le nombre de plaines que vous contrôlez.', 'type': 'Créature : géant', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381137&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ecb74d4-0e8b-49d1-b8a3-f2bb964fa0b3', 'multiverseId': 381137}, 'multiverseid': 381137}, {'name': 'Colosso della Cava', 'text': 'Quando il Colosso della Cava entra nel campo di battaglia, metti una creatura bersaglio nel grimorio del suo proprietario subito sotto le prime X carte di quel grimorio, dove X è il numero di Pianure che controlli.', 'type': 'Creatura — Gigante', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381302&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c578faf1-8fc2-4fbd-b0b0-b7d1da0f4b85', 'multiverseId': 381302}, 'multiverseid': 381302}, {'name': '採石場の巨人', 'text': '採石場の巨人が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上からＸ枚のカードの直下に置く。Ｘはあなたがコントロールする平地の総数に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381467&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7af12e45-39f2-4ed0-9fb9-771493ec19f0', 'multiverseId': 381467}, 'multiverseid': 381467}, {'name': '채석장 거인', 'text': '채석장 거인이 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 소유자의 서고 맨 위에서 X장째의 카드 아래에 놓는다. X는 당신이 조종하는 들의 수와 같다.', 'type': '생물 — 거인', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381632&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'be9e1ae1-30e9-491a-a1c3-82cbc9cee746', 'multiverseId': 381632}, 'multiverseid': 381632}, {'name': 'Colosso da Pedreira', 'text': 'Quando Colosso da Pedreira entrar no campo de batalha, coloque a criatura alvo no grimório de seu dono sob X cards, sendo X o número de Planícies que você controla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gigante', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381797&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbea6a74-73e6-4419-8ca9-dbc167c22097', 'multiverseId': 381797}, 'multiverseid': 381797}, {'name': 'Колосс Каменоломни', 'text': 'Когда Колосс Каменоломни выходит на поле битвы, положите целевое существо в библиотеку его владельца под X верхних карт той библиотеки, где X — количество Равнин под вашим контролем.', 'type': 'Существо — Гигант', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381962&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '261b4261-6b0a-4a5e-9764-418165801b4a', 'multiverseId': 381962}, 'multiverseid': 381962}, {'name': '采石场巨像', 'text': '当采石场巨像进战场时，将目标生物置于其拥有者的牌库顶第X张牌正下面，X为由你操控的平原数量。', 'type': '生物～巨人', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380642&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd504f251-62eb-4284-b74f-57ec2acc7642', 'multiverseId': 380642}, 'multiverseid': 380642}, {'name': '採石場巨像', 'text': '當採石場巨像進戰場時，將目標生物置於其擁有者的牌庫頂第X張牌正下面，X為由你操控的平原數量。', 'type': '生物～巨人', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380807&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e4e8bdb-7adf-44c2-b11c-430c5e4c5fbf', 'multiverseId': 380807}, 'multiverseid': 380807}]", '[{\'name\': \'Steinkundiger Wächter\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Verhindere allen Schaden, der dem Steinkundigen Wächter in diesem Zug von einer Kreatur deiner Wahl zugefügt würde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Ephara lehrte einige Sterbliche, mit Marmor so eins zu werden, dass ihnen war, als würde ihr eigenes Blut das Gestein durchströmen und ihm die Zeichnung verleihen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d23d674-9919-455b-ad16-c6f391644ef8\', \'multiverseId\': 381004}, \'multiverseid\': 381004}, {\'name\': \'Fortificador rocasagaz\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Prevén todo el daño que la criatura objetivo le fuera a hacer al Fortificador rocasagaz este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Efara enseñó a algunos mortales a sentir cada vena del mármol como si a través de ellas fluyera su propia sangre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c94e7e-6666-42f6-92cb-ef23a7387f50\', \'multiverseId\': 382159}, \'multiverseid\': 382159}, {\'name\': \'Fortificateur sophiolithe\', \'text\': \'{4}{W} : Prévenez, ce tour-ci, toutes les blessures qui devraient être infligées au Fortificateur sophiolithe par une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Éphara enseigna à certains mortels à ressentir les veines du marbre comme si en elles coulait leur propre sang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4106c75b-b8cc-45a8-923c-a3bff52cd0b3\', \'multiverseId\': 381169}, \'multiverseid\': 381169}, {\'name\': \'Saggio della Pietra Fortificatore\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Previeni tutto il danno che verrebbe inflitto al Saggio della Pietra Fortificatore da una creatura bersaglio in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': "Efara istruì alcuni mortali nell\'arte di percepire le venature del marmo come se in esse scorresse il proprio sangue.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4b9e1f2-4141-43ac-b8d3-fa082c7b62c8\', \'multiverseId\': 381334}, \'multiverseid\': 381334}, {\'name\': \'石識の防衛者\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それが石識の防衛者に与えるすべてのダメージを軽減する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'エファラは少数の定命の者たちに、大理石の模様を自らの血が通う血管の如く感じることを教えた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccdcad63-4b5c-4364-bed0-28c95f02f915\', \'multiverseId\': 381499}, \'multiverseid\': 381499}, {\'name\': \'돌마도사 축성가\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 이번 턴에 그 생물이 돌마도사 축성가에게 입히려고 하는 모든 피해를 방지한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'에파라는 필멸자들에게 대리석의 모든 결에 자신의 피가 흐르는 것처럼 느끼라고 가르쳤다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f765395-efec-4a48-8056-3e1d36b5aa59\', \'multiverseId\': 381664}, \'multiverseid\': 381664}, {\'name\': \'Fortificador Petrisábio\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: Previna todo o dano que seria causado a Fortificador Petrisábio pela criatura alvo neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Efara ensinou alguns mortais a sentir cada veia no mármore como se fluísse com seu próprio sangue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acecbea7-6e89-46de-8659-8273e9a73566\', \'multiverseId\': 381829}, \'multiverseid\': 381829}, {\'name\': \'Укрепляющий Камнезнатец\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}: предотвратите все повреждения, которые должны быть нанесены Укрепляющему Камнезнатцу целевым существом в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Эфара научила некоторых из людей так чувствовать все прожилки в мраморе, будто по ним бежит их собственная кровь.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf92208-749b-42aa-867f-df8e00031604\', \'multiverseId\': 381994}, \'multiverseid\': 381994}, {\'name\': \'擅雕筑匠\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：于本回合中，防止目标生物将对擅雕筑匠造成的所有伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'有些凡人受厄芳拉教导，会将石脉当作自身血脉一般细心体会每处纹理。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40ec08fd-bd91-446a-8870-dd4fdaba807a\', \'multiverseId\': 380674}, \'multiverseid\': 380674}, {\'name\': \'擅雕築匠\', \'text\': \'{4}{W}：於本回合中，防止目標生物將對擅雕築匠造成的所有傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'有些凡人受厄芳拉教導，會將石脈當作自身血脈一般細心體會每處紋理。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf2dbd6e-917c-43fe-b35e-16916d4f8d78\', \'multiverseId\': 380839}, \'multiverseid\': 380839}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sternenfall\', \'text\': \'Sternenfall fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu. Falls diese Kreatur eine Verzauberung ist, fügt Sternenfall dem Beherrscher dieser Kreatur 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Die hellsten Sterne kommen nicht aus Nyx." —Rhexenor, akroischer Flammenseher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9ebc55b-1e55-4496-83c7-06eab2f230b3\', \'multiverseId\': 381003}, \'multiverseid\': 381003}, {\'name\': \'Lanzaestrella\', \'text\': \'Lanzaestrella hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo. Si esa criatura es un encantamiento, Lanzaestrella hace 3 puntos de daño al controlador de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Las estrellas más brillantes no nacieron en Nyx". —Rexenor, portavoz ígneo akroniense\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e122099d-0101-4813-894f-1c81011995e1\', \'multiverseId\': 382158}, \'multiverseid\': 382158}, {\'name\': \'Chute stellaire\', \'text\': \'La Chute stellaire inflige 3 blessures à une créature ciblée. Si cette créature est un enchantement, la Chute stellaire inflige 3 blessures au contrôleur de cette créature.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Les étoiles les plus brillantes ne sont pas nées de Nyx. » —Rhexénor, orateur de feu akroen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5469f7d0-fe9b-4ca8-a0c8-95181aee2c2a\', \'multiverseId\': 381168}, \'multiverseid\': 381168}, {\'name\': \'Caduta degli Astri\', \'text\': \'La Caduta degli Astri infligge 3 danni a una creatura bersaglio. Se quella creatura è un incantesimo, la Caduta degli Astri infligge 3 danni al controllore di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le stelle più splendenti non nascono in Nyx." —Rexenor, oratore delle fiamme di Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894d4264-6dad-4fa1-a67c-a10e464a61ae\', \'multiverseId\': 381333}, \'multiverseid\': 381333}, {\'name\': \'落星\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。落星はそれに３点のダメージを与える。そのクリーチャーがエンチャントであるなら、落星はそのクリーチャーのコントローラーに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「最も明るい星は、ニクスから生まれたものではない。」 ――アクロスの炎語り、レクセノール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfae920f-9ccc-4928-be5d-51a10207a2e3\', \'multiverseId\': 381498}, \'multiverseid\': 381498}, {\'name\': \'별똥별\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 별똥별은 그 생물에게 피해 3점을 입힌다. 그 생물이 부여마법이면, 별똥별은 그 생물의 조종자에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': "\'가장 밝게 빛나는 별은 닉스에서 태어나지 않는다.\' —아크로스 화염술사 렉세노르", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8550727-113b-47b9-afb2-514ff5b625e7\', \'multiverseId\': 381663}, \'multiverseid\': 381663}, {\'name\': \'Chuva de Estrelas\', \'text\': \'Chuva de Estrelas causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura alvo. Se aquela criatura for um encantamento, Chuva de Estrelas causará 3 pontos de dano ao controlador daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"As estrelas mais brilhantes não nasceram do Nyx." — Rexenor, flamividente acrosano\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b154ed71-841a-452a-8418-ffc97064b81d\', \'multiverseId\': 381828}, \'multiverseid\': 381828}, {\'name\': \'Звездопад\', \'text\': \'Звездопад наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу. Если то существо является чарами, Звездопад наносит 3 повреждения игроку, контролирующему то существо.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Самые яркие звезды — не из Никса». — Рексенор, акросский огнеречивый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b771afc6-41d9-4aca-aaa8-c298fd156d36\', \'multiverseId\': 381993}, \'multiverseid\': 381993}, {\'name\': \'星坠击\', \'text\': \'星坠击对目标生物造成3点伤害。如果该生物是结界，则星坠击对该生物的操控者造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「最耀眼的星光绝非尼兹造物。」 ～阿喀洛斯焰语者瑞谢诺耳\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'735f7f08-05b1-42f5-8cab-e4853e285371\', \'multiverseId\': 380673}, \'multiverseid\': 380673}, {\'name\': \'星墜擊\', \'text\': \'星墜擊對目標生物造成3點傷害。如果該生物是結界，則星墜擊對該生物的操控者造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「最耀眼的星光絕非尼茲造物。」 ～阿喀洛斯焰語者瑞謝諾耳\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83272b14-b1fc-4c9a-a729-21cb66d3c619\', \'multiverseId\': 380838}, \'multiverseid\': 380838}]', '[{\'name\': \'Streitwagen des Sieges\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Erstschlag, Eile und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Den größten Ruhm ernten jene Helden, die als Erste zu den Waffen greifen und als Erste dem Feind gegenübertreten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380879&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0067056-baa9-4de7-aa96-e73deeb2b643\', \'multiverseId\': 380879}, \'multiverseid\': 380879}, {\'name\': \'Carro de la victoria\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de dañar primero, arrollar y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Los héroes más grandes son los primeros en alzarse, los primeros en tomar las armas y los primeros en colocarse frente al enemigo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ce9233-8741-4a6a-94bd-7945b7dd4880\', \'multiverseId\': 382034}, \'multiverseid\': 382034}, {\'name\': \'Char de la victoire\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a l\'initiative, le piétinement et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Les plus grands héros sont les premiers à se lever, à prendre les armes et à affronter l\'ennemi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381044&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06318f42-bcbc-4ea5-92b5-a513d0b05665\', \'multiverseId\': 381044}, \'multiverseid\': 381044}, {\'name\': \'Carro della Vittoria\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha attacco improvviso, travolgere e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Gli eroi più grandi sono i primi ad alzarsi, i primi a sollevare le armi e i primi a scontrarsi con il nemico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d02c3d9b-78ba-489d-9827-6a6c2dbbc6df\', \'multiverseId\': 381209}, \'multiverseid\': 381209}, {\'name\': \'勝利の戦車\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは、先制攻撃とトランプルと速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'最も偉大な英雄とは最初に立ち上がり、最初に武器を取り、最初に敵と相対する者である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b4298a-c9df-4486-831d-e57054caf4c3\', \'multiverseId\': 381374}, \'multiverseid\': 381374}, {\'name\': \'승리의 전차\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 선제공격, 돌진, 신속을 가진다.\\n장착 {1}\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'가장 위대한 영웅은 제일 앞에 서고 제일 먼저 무기를 들며 제일 먼저 적을 맞이한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'501c3f65-78c0-4ed2-9d66-8bba1d1b818d\', \'multiverseId\': 381539}, \'multiverseid\': 381539}, {\'name\': \'Biga da Vitória\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem iniciativa, atropelar e ímpeto.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Os maiores heróis são os primeiros a se erguer, os primeiros a empunhar as armas, e os primeiros a enfrentar os inimigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48db2f40-252c-47df-a189-f0a7c54dd30d\', \'multiverseId\': 381704}, \'multiverseid\': 381704}, {\'name\': \'Колесница Победы\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Первый удар, Пробивной удар и Ускорение.\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Величайшие герои первыми берутся за оружие, первыми идут в бой и первыми встречают врага.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84c21007-2f53-4fb6-9c7e-12bd932c3a60\', \'multiverseId\': 381869}, \'multiverseid\': 381869}, {\'name\': \'胜利战车\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有先攻，践踏，与敏捷异能。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'身先受命、身先备战、身先赴敌，如此方为至勇英雄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e99bf7fd-1389-4d1f-be51-eb263acce913\', \'multiverseId\': 380549}, \'multiverseid\': 380549}, {\'name\': \'勝利戰車\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有先攻，踐踏，與敏捷異能。\\n佩帶{1}\', \'type\': \'神器～武具\', \'flavor\': \'身先受命、身先備戰、身先赴敵，如此方為至勇英雄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e895f80d-ca3b-42e5-9ab0-641d2cbe226d\', \'multiverseId\': 380714}, \'multiverseid\': 380714}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stunde der Not\', \'text\': \'Streben — Stunde der Not kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {1}{U} mehr.\\nSchicke eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil. Für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Kreatur bringt ihr Beherrscher einen 4/4 blauen Sphinx-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31d62562-f28c-4e6e-837a-b79a99641597\', \'multiverseId\': 380930}, \'multiverseid\': 380930}, {\'name\': \'Momento de necesidad\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar el Momento de necesidad cuesta {1}{U} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nExilia cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo. Por cada criatura exiliada de esta manera, su controlador pone en el campo de batalla una ficha de criatura Esfinge azul 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58fd1e87-1845-45ca-a693-7ee781d75e34\', \'multiverseId\': 382085}, \'multiverseid\': 382085}, {\'name\': \'Heure du besoin\', \'text\': "Obstination — L\'Heure du besoin coûte {1}{U} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nExilez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées. Pour chaque créature exilée de cette manière, son contrôleur met sur le champ de bataille un jeton de créature 4/4 bleue Sphinx avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381095&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'341c16b0-9b6e-42f3-ab06-e0f058a52a29\', \'multiverseId\': 381095}, \'multiverseid\': 381095}, {\'name\': \'Ora del Bisogno\', \'text\': "Sforzo — L\'Ora del Bisogno costa {1}{U} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nEsilia un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio. Per ogni creatura esiliata in questo modo, il suo controllore mette sul campo di battaglia una pedina creatura Sfinge 4/4 blu con volare.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae3a3492-79bc-4132-a7ab-c9b9e26a132c\', \'multiverseId\': 381260}, \'multiverseid\': 381260}, {\'name\': \'難局\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 難局を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{1}{U}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とし、それらを追放する。これにより追放されたクリーチャー１体につき、そのコントローラーは飛行を持つ青の４/４のスフィンクス・クリーチャー・トークンを１体戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12dd739-4c88-496f-a680-5dc79c29d510\', \'multiverseId\': 381425}, \'multiverseid\': 381425}, {\'name\': \'필요의 시간\', \'text\': \'분투 — 필요의 시간은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {1}{U}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들을 추방한다. 이렇게 추방당한 생물 한 개마다, 그 조종자는 비행을 가진 4/4 청색 스핑크스 생물 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cb02c99-3f0a-47e6-9e60-84329554d5bf\', \'multiverseId\': 381590}, \'multiverseid\': 381590}, {\'name\': \'Hora da Necessidade\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Hora da Necessidade custa {1}{U} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nExile qualquer número de criaturas alvo. Para cada criatura exilada desta forma, seu controlador coloca no campo de batalha uma ficha de criatura 4/4 azul do tipo Esfinge com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c26825-4540-4114-b053-ab8b7e71ebb9\', \'multiverseId\': 381755}, \'multiverseid\': 381755}, {\'name\': \'Час Нужды\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Часа Нужды стоит на {1}{U} больше.\\nИзгоните любое количество целевых существ. За каждое существо, изгнанное таким образом, контролировавший его игрок кладет на поле битвы одну фишку существа 4/4 синий Сфинкс с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faa14b3a-8f19-44f4-b707-4c06d98cc94c\', \'multiverseId\': 381920}, \'multiverseid\': 381920}, {\'name\': \'危急关头\', \'text\': \'积力～危急关头在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{1}{U}来施放。\\n放逐任意数量的目标生物。每以此法放逐一个生物，其操控者便将一个4/4蓝色，具飞行异能的史芬斯衍生生物放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e0b9053-ac4d-462a-aa9c-3b2b22e243c8\', \'multiverseId\': 380600}, \'multiverseid\': 380600}, {\'name\': \'危急關頭\', \'text\': \'積力～危急關頭在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{1}{U}來施放。\\n放逐任意數量的目標生物。每以此法放逐一個生物，其操控者便將一個4/4藍色，具飛行異能的史芬斯衍生生物放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2bee895-e3a8-437f-93dc-4c13237beff0\', \'multiverseId\': 380765}, \'multiverseid\': 380765}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sturheit der Sterblichen\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du die Sturheit der Sterblichen opfern. Falls du dies tust, zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380952&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a06d775-ff21-434c-b5e7-15ac2bd43ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 380952}, \'multiverseid\': 380952}, {\'name\': \'Obstinación de mortal\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controlas.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes sacrificar la Obstinación de mortal. Si lo haces, destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'431773d9-583f-4183-8664-e0a1dbb81b7e\', \'multiverseId\': 382107}, \'multiverseid\': 382107}, {\'name\': \'Obstination mortelle\', \'text\': "Enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez sacrifier l\'Obstination mortelle. Si vous faites ainsi, détruisez l\'enchantement ciblé.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcd0474f-3ee8-45ac-851f-e0f409e6bf28\', \'multiverseId\': 381117}, \'multiverseid\': 381117}, {\'name\': \'Ostinazione Mortale\', \'text\': "Incanta creatura che controlli\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi sacrificare l\'Ostinazione Mortale. Se lo fai, distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8370b216-90ab-44d1-8147-ba160483b1a2\', \'multiverseId\': 381282}, \'multiverseid\': 381282}, {\'name\': \'定命の者の強情\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは定命の者の強情を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、エンチャント１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'020680cc-1075-4a57-af68-0cadb291b849\', \'multiverseId\': 381447}, \'multiverseid\': 381447}, {\'name\': \'필멸자의 끈기\', \'text\': \'자신이 조종하는 생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n부여된 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신은 필멸자의 끈기를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 하면, 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 그 부여마법을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'946258e9-fe4b-4d85-8a88-b540e6f6b62f\', \'multiverseId\': 381612}, \'multiverseid\': 381612}, {\'name\': \'Obstinação dos Mortais\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que você controla\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode sacrificar Obstinação dos Mortais. Se fizer isso, destrua o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f21f439c-9ebe-436f-94ad-8f7c36e440be\', \'multiverseId\': 381777}, \'multiverseid\': 381777}, {\'name\': \'Упрямство Смертных\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо под вашим контролем\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете пожертвовать Упрямство Смертных. Если вы это делаете, уничтожьте целевые чары.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc4fe523-3c9f-4a6b-bfb5-101da28072b8\', \'multiverseId\': 381942}, \'multiverseid\': 381942}, {\'name\': \'凡尘执念\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1。\\n每当所结附的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以牺牲凡尘执念。若你如此作，则消灭目标结界。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a1a70f6-9e62-4d8b-8231-fd8f660af0ad\', \'multiverseId\': 380622}, \'multiverseid\': 380622}, {\'name\': \'凡塵執念\', \'text\': \'結附於由你操控的生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1。\\n每當所結附的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以犧牲凡塵執念。若你如此作，則消滅目標結界。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282ce784-d84d-4598-846d-3b97aefff393\', \'multiverseId\': 380787}, \'multiverseid\': 380787}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sturmjäger-Chimäre\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{2}{U}{R}: Hellsicht 1, decke dann die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf. Die Sturmjäger-Chimäre erhält +X/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich den umgewandelten Manakosten dieser Karte ist. (Betrachte für Hellsicht 1 die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek, dann kannst du diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Chimäre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381005&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'335bf026-b10e-410a-bdc5-2f27f50bcc8a\', \'multiverseId\': 381005}, \'multiverseid\': 381005}, {\'name\': \'Quimera cazatormentas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{2}{U}{R}: Adivina 1, luego muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. La Quimera cazatormentas obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es el coste de maná convertido de esa carta. (Para adivinar 1, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca, luego puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Quimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b642794-5843-43b7-b5e9-017d4b768778\', \'multiverseId\': 382160}, \'multiverseid\': 382160}, {\'name\': \'Chimère chassetempête\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{2}{U}{R} : Regard 1, puis révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. La Chimère chassetempête gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le coût converti de mana de cette carte. (Pour appliquer regard 1, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Créature : chimère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea9e9ddd-92a4-4ad3-bef4-ffce361ea9c9\', \'multiverseId\': 381170}, \'multiverseid\': 381170}, {\'name\': \'Chimera Cacciatempeste\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{2}{U}{R}: Profetizza 1, poi rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. La Chimera Cacciatempeste prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il costo di mana convertito di quella carta. (Per profetizzare 1, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio, poi puoi metterla in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2be75c04-83a8-4905-bbde-068ec338dadc\', \'multiverseId\': 381335}, \'multiverseid\': 381335}, {\'name\': \'嵐追いのキマイラ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}{U}{R}：占術１を行い、その後あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。嵐追いのキマイラはターン終了時まで＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはそのカードの点数で見たマナ・コストに等しい。（占術１を行うには、あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。その後そのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キマイラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8268a4a7-93f8-4370-b86d-de15aa5a20a5\', \'multiverseId\': 381500}, \'multiverseid\': 381500}, {\'name\': \'폭풍추적자 키메라\', \'text\': \'비행\\n{2}{U}{R}: 점술 1을 한 후, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 공개한다. 폭풍추적 키메라는 턴종료까지 +X/+0을 받는다. X는 그 카드의 전환마나비용이다. (점술 1을 하려면 당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 키메라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f28c45cd-e489-4fd4-a706-3bb51a8b94eb\', \'multiverseId\': 381665}, \'multiverseid\': 381665}, {\'name\': \'Quimera Caçadora de Tempestade\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{2}{U}{R}: Use vidência 1 e depois revele o card do topo do seu grimório. Quimera Caçadora de Tempestade recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X igual ao custo de mana convertido daquele card. (Para usar vidência 1, olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Depois, você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Quimera\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10897105-227c-43a3-912e-3c90494dd52b\', \'multiverseId\': 381830}, \'multiverseid\': 381830}, {\'name\': \'Преследующая Бурю Химера\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{2}{U}{R}: предскажите 1, затем покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Преследующая Бурю Химера получает +X/+0 до конца хода, где Х — конвертированная мана-стоимость той карты. (Чтобы предсказать 1, посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки, затем вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Химера\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a0eb82-1fe6-4b3e-9e63-204bbe0d227d\', \'multiverseId\': 381995}, \'multiverseid\': 381995}, {\'name\': \'逐岚盖美拉\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{2}{U}{R}：占卜1，然后展示你的牌库顶牌。逐岚盖美拉得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为该牌的总法术力费用。（占卜1的流程是检视你牌库顶的牌，然后你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～盖美拉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77cc2d8f-772d-4c91-967e-d36c00b96e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 380675}, \'multiverseid\': 380675}, {\'name\': \'逐嵐蓋美拉\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{2}{U}{R}：占卜1，然後展示你的牌庫頂牌。逐嵐蓋美拉得+X/+0直到回合結束，X為該牌的總魔法力費用。（占卜1的流程是檢視你牌庫頂的牌，然後你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'生物～蓋美拉\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ead8cb18-c55d-4ca7-b0e4-72648686b5ca\', \'multiverseId\': 380840}, \'multiverseid\': 380840}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stärke der Gefallenen\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn Stärke der Gefallenen oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +X/+X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof ist.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381006&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8184ff9-8076-46dd-9b66-bd6c3d7f38a6\', \'multiverseId\': 381006}, \'multiverseid\': 381006}, {\'name\': \'Fuerza de los caídos\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que la Fuerza de los caídos u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de cartas de criatura en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107d62dc-b73c-4adc-95c4-883f2b71bbef\', \'multiverseId\': 382161}, \'multiverseid\': 382161}, {\'name\': \'Force des déchus\', \'text\': "Constellation — À chaque fois que la Force des déchus ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la créature ciblée gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de cartes de créature dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381171&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c36b427d-a57e-4163-9b3f-96896d898798\', \'multiverseId\': 381171}, \'multiverseid\': 381171}, {\'name\': \'Potere dai Caduti\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta il Potere dai Caduti o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ba78e4-b63d-4163-b9cd-89cd3ee96723\', \'multiverseId\': 381336}, \'multiverseid\': 381336}, {\'name\': \'倒れた者からの力\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 倒れた者からの力か他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カードの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e365a7f-b10f-4e0b-971b-b1add915786a\', \'multiverseId\': 381501}, \'multiverseid\': 381501}, {\'name\': \'망자들이 주는 힘\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 망자들이 주는 힘이나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +X/+X를 받는다. X는 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드의 개수다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3297f56b-c973-464a-a219-e8d39011272b\', \'multiverseId\': 381666}, \'multiverseid\': 381666}, {\'name\': \'Força dos Caídos\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Força dos Caídos ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X o número de cards de criatura no seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a97cdb1b-d222-44af-aec7-709693f71a32\', \'multiverseId\': 381831}, \'multiverseid\': 381831}, {\'name\': \'Сила Павших\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Сила Павших или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, целевое существо получает +X/+X до конца хода, где Х — количество карт существ на вашем кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bfa9643-ed68-430a-8b7d-1b764f250420\', \'multiverseId\': 381996}, \'multiverseid\': 381996}, {\'name\': \'亡者赋力\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当亡者赋力或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，目标生物得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为你坟墓场中生物牌的数量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e2eafb-7d9c-42db-8849-92a321582270\', \'multiverseId\': 380676}, \'multiverseid\': 380676}, {\'name\': \'亡者賦力\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當亡者賦力或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，目標生物得+X/+X直到回合結束，X為你墳墓場中生物牌的數量。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9509d389-d34d-4bd7-9b8b-2bfb3b943eb7\', \'multiverseId\': 380841}, \'multiverseid\': 380841}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel der Eingebung', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Eingebung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Eingebung ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {U} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381009&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a10dfa8a-07fd-4788-a056-e1bdad2f20d8', 'multiverseId': 381009}, 'multiverseid': 381009}, {'name': 'Templo de la epifanía', 'text': 'El Templo de la epifanía entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo de la epifanía entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382164&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'efc0f862-b781-4669-9f33-a48365f21086', 'multiverseId': 382164}, 'multiverseid': 382164}, {'name': 'Temple de la révélation', 'text': 'Le Temple de la révélation arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la révélation arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381174&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3e0e6f9-82ef-43a1-ac8b-99df767de0cb', 'multiverseId': 381174}, 'multiverseid': 381174}, {'name': 'Tempio della Rivelazione', 'text': 'Il Tempio della Rivelazione entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio della Rivelazione entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {R} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381339&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13ee7828-faa3-4ea6-8525-1f7cbde8b0b0', 'multiverseId': 381339}, 'multiverseid': 381339}, {'name': '天啓の神殿', 'text': '天啓の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n天啓の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{U}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381504&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ad3e280-c547-4da6-86d8-bcf6641054b3', 'multiverseId': 381504}, 'multiverseid': 381504}, {'name': '강림의 신전', 'text': '강림의 신전은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n강림의 신전이 전장에 들어올 때, 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\\n{T}: {U} 또는 {R}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381669&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58534b32-3ba7-4619-b4c8-c0a7b2f8e3e2', 'multiverseId': 381669}, 'multiverseid': 381669}, {'name': 'Templo da Epifania', 'text': 'Templo da Epifania entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Templo da Epifania entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {R} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381834&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f28b7888-943f-465f-872d-45ecc62c26d9', 'multiverseId': 381834}, 'multiverseid': 381834}, {'name': 'Храм Прозрения', 'text': 'Храм Прозрения выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Храм Прозрения выходит на поле битвы, предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {R} в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381999&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40ae1321-5a89-4491-b50c-5e8005a4868b', 'multiverseId': 381999}, 'multiverseid': 381999}, {'name': '顿悟殿堂', 'text': '顿悟殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当顿悟殿堂进战场时，占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380679&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d554c27-fd02-4231-9331-b005e7db6780', 'multiverseId': 380679}, 'multiverseid': 380679}, {'name': '頓悟殿堂', 'text': '頓悟殿堂須橫置進戰場。\\n當頓悟殿堂進戰場時，占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}到你的魔法力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380844&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a801cfea-6446-4748-8750-569af9d53ecf', 'multiverseId': 380844}, 'multiverseid': 380844}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel des Siechtums', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Siechtums kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Siechtums ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\\n{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381010&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '68515a3f-249a-467d-b614-996e85a4ad0c', 'multiverseId': 381010}, 'multiverseid': 381010}, {'name': 'Templo del padecimiento', 'text': 'El Templo del padecimiento entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del padecimiento entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G} a tu reserva de maná.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382165&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1669ea07-c72e-4723-a8e5-658208a73e70', 'multiverseId': 382165}, 'multiverseid': 382165}, {'name': 'Temple de la maladie', 'text': 'Le Temple de la maladie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la maladie arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G} à votre réserve.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381175&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '57864972-6ca2-4334-83b5-4d32bbe912f4', 'multiverseId': 381175}, 'multiverseid': 381175}, {'name': 'Tempio della Malattia', 'text': 'Il Tempio della Malattia entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Tempio della Malattia entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G} alla tua riserva di mana.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381340&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a92b1a4-c310-41a3-a28b-bc95584e6cf7', 'multiverseId': 381340}, 'multiverseid': 381340}, {'name': '疾病の神殿', 'text': '疾病の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n疾病の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\\n{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381505&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c72b4942-6e7e-4595-b146-e479da2409af', 'multiverseId': 381505}, 'multiverseid': 381505}, {'name': '병폐의 신전', 'text': '병폐의 신전은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n병폐의 신전이 전장에 들어올 때, 점술 1을 한다. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\\n{T}: {B} 또는 {G}를 당신의 마나풀에 담는다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381670&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37dfdd2b-97da-499b-b47d-cde0ca49c055', 'multiverseId': 381670}, 'multiverseid': 381670}, {'name': 'Templo da Enfermidade', 'text': 'Templo da Enfermidade entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Templo da Enfermidade entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G} à sua reserva de mana.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381835&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa90f3ba-c2c6-4852-b947-dededec934ec', 'multiverseId': 381835}, 'multiverseid': 381835}, {'name': 'Храм Болезни', 'text': 'Храм Болезни выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Храм Болезни выходит на поле битвы, предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G} в ваше хранилище маны.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382000&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1475a3c-0ff8-4433-8ef0-ac2cfb8d41aa', 'multiverseId': 382000}, 'multiverseid': 382000}, {'name': '疫病殿堂', 'text': '疫病殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当疫病殿堂进战场时，占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}到你的法术力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380680&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e24a05c7-c4c1-4528-aeea-fa10be4a34b5', 'multiverseId': 380680}, 'multiverseid': 380680}, {'name': '疫病殿堂', 'text': '疫病殿堂須橫置進戰場。\\n當疫病殿堂進戰場時，占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}到你的魔法力池中。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380845&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1c765ac-d1d6-4d7e-9a9d-79231c83de0f', 'multiverseId': 380845}, 'multiverseid': 380845}]", '[{\'name\': \'Thassas Verschlinger\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn Thassas Verschlinger oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, legt ein Spieler deiner Wahl die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Sterblichen behaupten, es gäbe Orte, die Thassa nicht erreichen könne, kann sich die Meeresgöttin ein Lachen nicht verkneifen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49d6c05d-72b6-4e8e-8363-50c6a4bd1aee\', \'multiverseId\': 381012}, \'multiverseid\': 381012}, {\'name\': \'Devoradora de Tassa\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que la Devoradora de Tassa u otro encantamiento entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, el jugador objetivo pone las dos primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando los mortales afirman que hay lugares que Tassa no puede alcanzar, la diosa de los mares ríe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382167&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e91d5e40-b93f-4b9b-b6a6-a477b5c6ee65\', \'multiverseId\': 382167}, \'multiverseid\': 382167}, {\'name\': \'Dévoreur de Thassa\', \'text\': \'Constellation — À chaque fois que le Dévoreur de Thassa ou un autre enchantement arrive le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, le joueur ciblé met les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : élémental\', \'flavor\': "Lorsque les mortels prétendent qu\'il existe des lieux que Thassa ne saurait atteindre, la déesse de la mer éclate de rire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381177&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66982166-a515-4495-bc20-f752fa37242d\', \'multiverseId\': 381177}, \'multiverseid\': 381177}, {\'name\': \'Divoratrice di Thassa\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta la Divoratrice di Thassa o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, un giocatore bersaglio mette nel suo cimitero le prime due carte del suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Quando i mortali parlano di luoghi che Thassa non può raggiungere, la dea del mare ride.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9c29460-63ca-4211-aa7e-256826072467\', \'multiverseId\': 381342}, \'multiverseid\': 381342}, {\'name\': \'タッサの貪り食い\', \'text\': \'星座 ― タッサの貪り食いか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上から２枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'タッサが到達できない場所があると定命の者たちが吹聴するたびに、海の神は笑い声をあげる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'500e9306-2734-46fe-9405-9fcd8a2b6f25\', \'multiverseId\': 381507}, \'multiverseid\': 381507}, {\'name\': \'타사의 탐식자\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 타사의 탐식자나 다른 부여마법이 당신의 조종 하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 두 장을 무덤에 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 정령\', \'flavor\': \'필멸자들이 타사가 가지 못하는 곳이 있다고 주장할 때, 바다의 신은 웃는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99f0788c-7020-498c-94c7-041d68aa72c7\', \'multiverseId\': 381672}, \'multiverseid\': 381672}, {\'name\': \'Devoradora de Tassa\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Devoradora de Tassa ou outro encantamento entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, o jogador alvo coloca os dois cards do topo do grimório dele no próprio cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Quando os mortais dizem que há lugares que Tassa não pode alcançar, a deusa do mar dá gargalhadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b79ca2d9-4b28-4047-9b6f-5a552e8f73ad\', \'multiverseId\': 381837}, \'multiverseid\': 381837}, {\'name\': \'Пожиратель Тассы\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Пожиратель Тассы или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, целевой игрок кладет две верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': \'Когда смертные говорят про места, до которых Тассе не добраться, морская богиня смеется.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'613863fe-5d14-4cc4-b597-9033ad6a0e24\', \'multiverseId\': 382002}, \'multiverseid\': 382002}, {\'name\': \'塔萨的吞噬兽\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当塔萨的吞噬兽或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，目标牌手将其牌库顶的两张牌置入其坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'凡人宣称世上有塔萨能力未及之处，而海神发笑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d0bf834-d3b4-434e-82b5-589a2e1727d5\', \'multiverseId\': 380682}, \'multiverseid\': 380682}, {\'name\': \'塔薩的吞噬獸\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當塔薩的吞噬獸或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，目標玩家將其牌庫頂的兩張牌置入其墳墓場。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～元素\', \'flavor\': \'凡人宣稱世上有塔薩能力未及之處，而海神發笑。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62fc203f-1bae-410d-9de6-e73db54cc351\', \'multiverseId\': 380847}, \'multiverseid\': 380847}]', '[{\'name\': \'Thassas Zorn\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Du kannst eine Kreatur deiner Wahl tappen oder enttappen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Seefahrerin hatte noch nie zuvor einen Gott zu Gesicht bekommen. Nun hatte sie Thassa erblickt. Bald sollte sie Athreos begegnen und schließlich Erebos treffen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab9210a6-ed0b-4118-af8e-06bb87497754\', \'multiverseId\': 381013}, \'multiverseid\': 381013}, {\'name\': \'Ira de Tassa\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Puedes girar o enderezar la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La marinera nunca había visto a un dios hasta entonces. Ahora contemplaba a Tassa. En breve vería a Atreos, y luego conocería a Erebos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10250fd9-b7b8-43cf-a156-2141db8cd129\', \'multiverseId\': 382168}, \'multiverseid\': 382168}, {\'name\': \'Ire de Thassa\', \'text\': \'{3}{U} : Vous pouvez engager ou dégager la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Le marin n\'avait jamais vu de dieu auparavant. Mais maintenant qu\'il avait contemplé Thassa, il verrait bientôt Athréos, puis il rencontrerait Érébos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53254304-9eed-4cec-b745-2a861163f0bc\', \'multiverseId\': 381178}, \'multiverseid\': 381178}, {\'name\': \'Collera di Thassa\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Puoi TAPpare o STAPpare una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'La navigatrice non aveva mai visto un dio, prima. Ora aveva posato gli occhi su Thassa. Presto avrebbe visto Atreo e infine avrebbe incontrato Erebos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a478445-0dce-4c05-9e3a-efae23f4859c\', \'multiverseId\': 381343}, \'multiverseid\': 381343}, {\'name\': \'タッサの激憤\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれをタップまたはアンタップしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'船乗りはこれまで神を見たことが無かった。そして今はタッサを見上げることとなった。まもなく彼女はエイスリオスに会い、その後エレボスにも会うことになるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'133dd451-71d7-4213-b349-e8585eaefb0c\', \'multiverseId\': 381508}, \'multiverseid\': 381508}, {\'name\': \'타사의 분노\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 생물을 탭하거나 언탭할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'선원은 그때까지 신을 본 적이 없었다. 이제 그녀는 타사를 보았다. 그녀는 곧 에스리오스를 보게 될 것이고 그다음에는 에레보스를 보게 될 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ed423b4-d281-46fe-b750-717e33ff6d53\', \'multiverseId\': 381673}, \'multiverseid\': 381673}, {\'name\': \'Ira de Tassa\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: Você pode virar ou desvirar a criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'A marinheira nunca vira um deus antes. Agora ela estava olhando para Tassa. Logo ela veria Atreos e depois, Érebo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1300d740-d38e-40ef-845f-5c815d20244d\', \'multiverseId\': 381838}, \'multiverseid\': 381838}, {\'name\': \'Гнев Тассы\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}: вы можете повернуть или развернуть целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Мореплавательница раньше не встречалась с богами. Теперь же она пораженно глядела на Тассу. Вскоре она увидит Атрея, а потом встретится с Эребом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84f6de5c-1d18-483a-a661-4aa6a862ba05\', \'multiverseId\': 382003}, \'multiverseid\': 382003}, {\'name\': \'塔萨的怒火\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：你可以横置或重置目标生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'这水手以前从未见过神。现在她已看到塔萨。不久她将会看到雅睿欧斯，然后是厄睿柏斯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59040116-c12e-42b2-aae5-a403db13452a\', \'multiverseId\': 380683}, \'multiverseid\': 380683}, {\'name\': \'塔薩的怒火\', \'text\': \'{3}{U}：你可以橫置或重置目標生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'這水手以前從未見過神。現在她已看到塔薩。不久她將會看到雅睿歐斯，然後是厄睿柏斯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89ca760f-2aa0-457f-a596-4b90793020ee\', \'multiverseId\': 380848}, \'multiverseid\': 380848}]', "[{'name': 'Tritonier-Kavallerie', 'text': 'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der die Tritonier-Kavallerie als Ziel hat, kannst du eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurückbringen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Meervolk, Soldat', 'flavor': 'Die Tritonier griffen zu den Waffen und die Nyxgeborenen ergriffen die Flucht.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381016&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2c480983-a2d6-449d-a66b-6a4f3bedd8ce', 'multiverseId': 381016}, 'multiverseid': 381016}, {'name': 'Caballería tritónida', 'text': 'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo a la Caballería tritónida, puedes regresar el encantamiento objetivo a la mano de su propietario.', 'type': 'Criatura — Soldado tritón', 'flavor': 'En cuanto los tritónidos irrumpieron en la superficie, los nativos de Nyx rompieron filas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382171&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '298b8bee-4a95-43a2-8860-87b1360dd34c', 'multiverseId': 382171}, 'multiverseid': 382171}, {'name': 'Cavalerie tritonne', 'text': 'Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible la Cavalerie tritonne, vous pouvez renvoyer un enchantement ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire.', 'type': 'Créature : ondin et soldat', 'flavor': 'Les tritons surgirent à la surface et ceux nés de Nyx prirent la fuite.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381181&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ef905c87-b2b3-48b3-bbed-7a9ec16895bf', 'multiverseId': 381181}, 'multiverseid': 381181}, {'name': 'Cavalleria dei Marinidi', 'text': 'Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia la Cavalleria dei Marinidi, puoi far tornare un incantesimo bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario.', 'type': 'Creatura — Soldato Tritone', 'flavor': 'I marinidi uscirono in superficie e i Nyxiani uscirono dai ranghi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381346&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0500f22a-f00b-4e86-bfe3-9cab314e979c', 'multiverseId': 381346}, 'multiverseid': 381346}, {'name': 'トリトンの騎兵部隊', 'text': '英雄的 ― あなたがトリトンの騎兵部隊を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、エンチャント１つを対象とする。あなたはそれをオーナーの手札に戻してもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — マーフォーク･兵士', 'flavor': 'トリトンたちが水面から現れ、ニクス生まれの隊列は乱れた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381511&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c7c9704-f789-42f1-a7c7-812acb8f6695', 'multiverseId': 381511}, 'multiverseid': 381511}, {'name': '트리톤 기병', 'text': '영웅 — 당신이 트리톤 기병을 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다 부여마법을 목표로 정한다. 당신은 그 부여마법을 소유자의 손으로 되돌릴 수 있다.', 'type': '생물 — 인어 병사', 'flavor': '트리톤들이 수면에서 뛰쳐나왔고 닉스에서 태어난 자들은 전열을 부쉈다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381676&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7412f565-2f74-4f7a-8ebb-7fc4403216e7', 'multiverseId': 381676}, 'multiverseid': 381676}, {'name': 'Cavalaria Talassida', 'text': 'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Cavalaria Talassida, você poderá devolver o encantamento alvo para a mão de seu dono.', 'type': 'Criatura — Tritão Soldado', 'flavor': 'Os talassidos saíram da superfície e os nyxnatos das linhas de formação.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381841&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4cd8b467-0455-460d-8270-73e9c325e0a6', 'multiverseId': 381841}, 'multiverseid': 381841}, {'name': 'Верховые Тритоны', 'text': 'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого являются Верховые Тритоны, вы можете вернуть целевые чары в руку их владельца.', 'type': 'Существо — Мерфолк Солдат', 'flavor': 'Тритоны вырвались на поверхность. Бойцы из Никса обратились в бегство.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382006&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '075b72ea-0b36-4c41-a3fc-fabbc49e1bc6', 'multiverseId': 382006}, 'multiverseid': 382006}, {'name': '屈东骑队', 'text': '勇行～每当你施放一个以屈东骑队为目标的咒语时，你可以将目标结界移回其拥有者手上。', 'type': '生物～人鱼／士兵', 'flavor': '屈东跃出，天裔溃散。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380686&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4a3af47-9355-4dca-ab52-d4b4faf412a2', 'multiverseId': 380686}, 'multiverseid': 380686}, {'name': '屈東騎隊', 'text': '勇行～每當你施放一個以屈東騎隊為目標的咒語時，你可以將目標結界移回其擁有者手上。', 'type': '生物～人魚／士兵', 'flavor': '屈東躍出，天裔潰散。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380851&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '311550e8-2538-4f00-9dae-ab72e593feb2', 'multiverseId': 380851}, 'multiverseid': 380851}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tritonier-Küstenschleicher\', \'text\': \'Der Tritonier-Küstenschleicher kann nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wer soll dich schon vermissen, Trockenläufer? Deine Frau? Dein Kind? Vielleicht denken sie, die See hätte dich verschlungen, und werden ihren Nachkommen einschärfen, sich von ihr fernzuhalten."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381017&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c265d30-2780-4fd2-be0c-8391ce25bff5\', \'multiverseId\': 381017}, \'multiverseid\': 381017}, {\'name\': \'Vigilacostas tritónido\', \'text\': \'El Vigilacostas tritónido no puede ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Quién te añorará, pisatierra? ¿Una esposa? ¿Un hijo? Quizá culpen al mar de tu destino y enseñen a las nuevas generaciones a no acercarse a él".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2ded568-7a4d-4947-8b9d-fe82f8be5f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 382172}, \'multiverseid\': 382172}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur des côtes triton\', \'text\': \'Le Pisteur des côtes triton ne peut pas être bloqué.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "« Et à qui manqueras-tu, pied-sec ? Une épouse ? Un enfant ? Peut-être blâmeront-ils la mer pour ta mort, et apprendront-ils aux générations futures à rester à l\'écart des vagues. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ddb7d9c-6f23-4183-800e-a1842c33ce07\', \'multiverseId\': 381182}, \'multiverseid\': 381182}, {\'name\': \'Marinide Braccacoste\', \'text\': \'Il Marinide Braccacoste non può essere bloccato.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Chi ti piangerà, piediasciutti? Una moglie? Un figlio? Forse accuseranno il mare della tua fine e insegneranno alle generazioni future a tenersene lontani."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a0730b3-4447-47f0-80f7-b14726fdf1ca\', \'multiverseId\': 381347}, \'multiverseid\': 381347}, {\'name\': \'トリトンの岸忍び\', \'text\': \'トリトンの岸忍びはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お前がいなくなることで悲しむものは誰か、陸歩きよ？お前の妻か？お前の子か？彼らがお前の悲運の原因として海を責め、そして後に続く者たちに海には近づかぬよう教えるようになるやもしれぬ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bf75e87-a365-4d88-9115-af85f230ebb3\', \'multiverseId\': 381512}, \'multiverseid\': 381512}, {\'name\': \'트리톤 해안추적자\', \'text\': \'트리톤 해안추적자는 방어당할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인어 도적\', \'flavor\': "\'누가 널 그리워하겠는가, 마른땅을 걷는 자여? 아내? 자식? 네 죽음을 바다 탓으로 돌리며 후손들에게 바다에 접근하지 말라고 가르치겠지.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e43ad936-c17b-4018-b22f-f24337b79f05\', \'multiverseId\': 381677}, \'multiverseid\': 381677}, {\'name\': \'Talassido Vigia-costa\', \'text\': \'Talassido Vigia-costa não pode ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"Quem vai sentir sua falta, pé-seco? Uma esposa? Um filho? Talvez eles culpem o mar pelo seu destino e ensinem as futuras gerações a ficarem longe dele."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db83e721-db83-4983-a3dd-c38a1b405c7f\', \'multiverseId\': 381842}, \'multiverseid\': 381842}, {\'name\': \'Тритон, Береговой Охотник\', \'text\': \'Тритон, Береговой Охотник не может быть заблокирован.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Кто будет по тебе скучать, сухопутный? Жена? Ребенок? Быть может, они будут винить море в том, что случилось с тобой, и научат своих потомков держаться от него подальше».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a165ee96-3e7d-40c1-a412-d633396470d2\', \'multiverseId\': 382007}, \'multiverseid\': 382007}, {\'name\': \'岸袭屈东\', \'text\': \'岸袭屈东不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「地上人，谁会思念你？妻子？孩子？或许他们会将你的命运归咎于大海，教导后世子孙远离它。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0db190d8-2829-44a5-830c-2171566e2408\', \'multiverseId\': 380687}, \'multiverseid\': 380687}, {\'name\': \'岸襲屈東\', \'text\': \'岸襲屈東不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物～人魚／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「地上人，誰會思念你？妻子？孩子？或許他們會將你的命運歸咎於大海，教導後世子孫遠離它。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97fd3361-b4ac-4f0d-9169-9960b6362636\', \'multiverseId\': 380852}, \'multiverseid\': 380852}]', '[{\'name\': \'Träger des Himmels\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Träger des Himmels stirbt, zerstöre zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments alle bleibenden Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist kein Fluch, den Himmel von der Erde fernzuhalten, sondern eine titanische Verantwortung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a82f2ca8-2576-467c-a811-05c125a366d6\', \'multiverseId\': 380873}, \'multiverseid\': 380873}, {\'name\': \'Portador de los cielos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Portador de los cielos muera, destruye todos los permanentes al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Mantener los cielos separados de la tierra no es una maldición sino una responsabilidad gigantesca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36b6c463-15df-4858-880f-c0d526da979d\', \'multiverseId\': 382028}, \'multiverseid\': 382028}, {\'name\': \'Porteur des Cieux\', \'text\': \'Quand le Porteur des Cieux meurt, détruisez tous les permanents au début de la prochaine étape de fin.\', \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': "Tenir les cieux hors de terre n\'est pas une malédiction, mais une responsabilité titanesque.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381038&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a03c548c-8136-4d04-a3b1-5face56aca79\', \'multiverseId\': 381038}, \'multiverseid\': 381038}, {\'name\': \'Caposaldo della Volta Celeste\', \'text\': "Quando il Caposaldo della Volta Celeste muore, distruggi tutti i permanenti all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Sostenere i cieli sopra alla terra non è una maledizione, ma una responsabilità titanica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9750b3d-573a-468f-8f03-9859e84c5694\', \'multiverseId\': 381203}, \'multiverseid\': 381203}, {\'name\': \'天を支える者\', \'text\': \'天を支える者が死亡したとき、次の終了ステップの開始時に、すべてのパーマネントを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'地から天を支えるのは呪いではないが、巨大な責任を伴う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bcbcd45-5400-4410-bb43-962c0de9ca66\', \'multiverseId\': 381368}, \'multiverseid\': 381368}, {\'name\': \'하늘을 등에 진 거인\', \'text\': \'하늘을 등에 진 거인이 죽으면 다음 종료단 시작에 모든 지속물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인\', \'flavor\': \'천국을 지상과 떼어놓는 일은 저주가 아니라 막중한 책임감이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed786f7f-94c1-4753-81b6-bc2d34d6c786\', \'multiverseId\': 381533}, \'multiverseid\': 381533}, {\'name\': \'Sustentáculo do Firmamento\', \'text\': \'Quando Sustentáculo do Firmamento morrer, destrua todas as permanentes no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Manter o céu separado da terra não é uma maldição, é uma responsabilidade titânica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd95075e-799f-43b9-bc28-77acdbfb3d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 381698}, \'multiverseid\': 381698}, {\'name\': \'Подпирающий Небеса\', \'text\': \'Когда Подпирающий Небеса умирает, уничтожьте все перманенты в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Отделять небо от земли — не проклятие, а титаническая ответственность.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'201b2350-8ab6-4af1-9287-6e90bb5de9fe\', \'multiverseId\': 381863}, \'multiverseid\': 381863}, {\'name\': \'擎天巨人\', \'text\': \'当擎天巨人死去，在下一个结束步骤开始时消灭所有永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'擎天不是诅咒，而是庞大的责任。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5755ba1d-f169-4938-bd8a-a29e7aca22bc\', \'multiverseId\': 380543}, \'multiverseid\': 380543}, {\'name\': \'擎天巨人\', \'text\': \'當擎天巨人死去，在下一個結束步驟開始時消滅所有永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'擎天不是詛咒，而是龐大的責任。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaa75450-ba92-4b3c-9d78-0ff11030e5a4\', \'multiverseId\': 380708}, \'multiverseid\': 380708}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tückischer Schlag\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl und ein Land deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur ein Narr nimmt Phenax beim Wort. Was erwartest du auch von einem Gott, der aus Lügen und Verrat geborenen wurde?" —Verenes, Priester des Iroas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dadea905-8243-4938-be4f-941c156a7b42\', \'multiverseId\': 381001}, \'multiverseid\': 381001}, {\'name\': \'Impacto malévolo\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo y la tierra objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo un necio confía en la palabra de Fenax. ¿Qué se puede esperar de un dios nacido de las mentiras y la traición?". —Verenes, sacerdotisa de Iroas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9262a326-ef36-450e-9761-f7ab414b6fb8\', \'multiverseId\': 382156}, \'multiverseid\': 382156}, {\'name\': \'Coup de dépit\', \'text\': \'Détruisez la créature ciblée et le terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Il faut être idiot pour se fier à Phénax. Qu\'espérer d\'un dieu né du mensonge et de la trahison ? » —Vérènes, prêtre d\'Iroas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccc34683-ef98-47c5-bc56-84b87e27b214\', \'multiverseId\': 381166}, \'multiverseid\': 381166}, {\'name\': \'Colpo Astioso\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio e una terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo uno sciocco prende Fenax in parola. Cos\\\'altro vi aspettate da un dio nato da menzogne e tradimento?" —Verenes, sacerdote di Iroas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f52456cc-fa1d-4f52-8b37-cecfceb01d2b\', \'multiverseId\': 381331}, \'multiverseid\': 381331}, {\'name\': \'悪意ある一撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体と土地１つを対象とし、それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「フィナックスの言葉を鵜呑みにするのは、愚か者だけだ。嘘と背信の神に一体何を期待しているのか？」 ――イロアスの神官、ヴィリニーズ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93da8fba-d002-4cbd-b1b1-6b8eb6645ef3\', \'multiverseId\': 381496}, \'multiverseid\': 381496}, {\'name\': \'악의적인 일격\', \'text\': \'생물과 대지를 목표로 정한다. 그 목표들을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': "\'페낙스의 말을 믿는 건 바보뿐이다. 거짓말과 배신에서 태어난 신에게 뭘 더 바라는가?\' —이로아스의 사제 베레네스", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3da29c2-8491-4cf5-9d78-5b05949843a7\', \'multiverseId\': 381661}, \'multiverseid\': 381661}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Malévolo\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo e o terreno alvo.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Somente um tolo acredita nas palavras de Fenax. O que você esperava de um deus nascido das mentiras e traições?" — Verenes, sacerdote de Iroas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b5eaf5-a661-4f48-9263-d3be46b7ea4c\', \'multiverseId\': 381826}, \'multiverseid\': 381826}, {\'name\': \'Злобный Выпад\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо и целевую землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Лишь глупец поверит Фенаксу на слово. Чего ожидать от бога, порожденного ложью и предательством?» — Верен, жрец Ироя\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c91ecab-9a7f-44e6-921b-9663d6ce6e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 381991}, \'multiverseid\': 381991}, {\'name\': \'怨毒霆击\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物与目标地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「只有傻瓜才会信斐纳克的话。对一个为谎言和背叛而生的神，你还有什么好期待的？」 ～伊洛安斯的僧侣威瑞涅斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4ad1a45-75f4-4ac1-83d0-4485dc166057\', \'multiverseId\': 380671}, \'multiverseid\': 380671}, {\'name\': \'怨毒霆擊\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物與目標地。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「只有傻瓜才會信斐納克的話。對一個為謊言和背叛而生的神，你還有什麼好期待的？」 ～伊洛安斯的僧侶威瑞涅斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9725409-da4f-4821-9a94-7db3d43a3540\', \'multiverseId\': 380836}, \'multiverseid\': 380836}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wagenlenker der Morgenröte\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nHeroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der die Wagenlenker der Morgenröte als Ziel hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf die Wagenlenker der Morgenröte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Nyx mag den Göttern gehören, doch der Himmel über Theros ist zweifellos unser."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380889&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cab4dcb2-794b-4c88-b35d-59afbd53bcfb\', \'multiverseId\': 380889}, \'multiverseid\': 380889}, {\'name\': \'Aurigas portadores del alba\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nHeroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo a los Aurigas portadores del alba, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre los Aurigas portadores del alba.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nyx pertenece a los dioses, pero los cielos de Theros son nuestros".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62e927eb-202e-4376-ac51-cb00bad0c4fe\', \'multiverseId\': 382044}, \'multiverseid\': 382044}, {\'name\': "Auriges porteurs de l\'aube", \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nHéroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible les Auriges porteurs de l\'aube, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur les Auriges porteurs de l\'aube.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et soldat\', \'flavor\': \'« Nyx appartient peut-être aux dieux, mais les cieux de Theros, eux, sont à nous ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381054&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'531cc08d-dfbc-415a-a346-e7b4bac2d6c5\', \'multiverseId\': 381054}, \'multiverseid\': 381054}, {\'name\': "Aurighi dell\'Alba", \'text\': "Volare, legame vitale\\nEroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia gli Aurighi dell\'Alba, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sugli Aurighi dell\'Alba.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Nyx potrà anche appartenere agli dei, ma i cieli di Theros sono nostri."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'078da556-e42e-434e-8d1b-fca2f918916c\', \'multiverseId\': 381219}, \'multiverseid\': 381219}, {\'name\': \'黎明運びの戦車兵\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\n英雄的 ― あなたが黎明運びの戦車兵を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、黎明運びの戦車兵の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「ニクスは神々の領域かもしれないが、テーロスの空は我々のものだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b1fbcf4-d1bb-4d22-b4e0-3d67b9027a0e\', \'multiverseId\': 381384}, \'multiverseid\': 381384}, {\'name\': \'여명을 부르는 전차대\', \'text\': \'비행, 생명연결\\n영웅 — 당신이 여명을 부르는 전차대를 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 여명을 부르는 전차대에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 병사\', \'flavor\': "\'닉스는 신들의 것인지 몰라도 테로스의 하늘은 우리 것이다.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'457eff41-ac11-4e59-bf2a-682c6b5b3108\', \'multiverseId\': 381549}, \'multiverseid\': 381549}, {\'name\': \'Aurigas da Alvorada\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida\\nHeroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Aurigas da Alvorada, coloque um marcador +1/+1 em Aurigas da Alvorada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Nyx pode pertencer aos deuses, mas o céu de Theros é nosso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47a40a55-bbb9-4a89-84e8-8cd25f3c424f\', \'multiverseId\': 381714}, \'multiverseid\': 381714}, {\'name\': \'Колесничие Зари\', \'text\': \'Полет, Цепь жизни\\nГероизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого являются Колесничие Зари, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Колесничих Зари.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть Никс принадлежит богам, но небеса Тероса — наши».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58c73bef-0d64-4f9b-9796-211a43cd0280\', \'multiverseId\': 381879}, \'multiverseid\': 381879}, {\'name\': \'送晓御夫\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n勇行～每当你施放一个以送晓御夫为目标的咒语时，在送晓御夫上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人类／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「尼兹或归诸神所属，但塞洛斯的天空是我们的地盘。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1129ad7-e0ca-4424-afe4-5ef1fc17f441\', \'multiverseId\': 380559}, \'multiverseid\': 380559}, {\'name\': \'送曉御夫\', \'text\': \'飛行，繫命\\n勇行～每當你施放一個以送曉御夫為目標的咒語時，在送曉御夫上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～人類／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「尼茲或歸諸神所屬，但塞洛斯的天空是我們的地盤。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cbd6ae7-1ada-4d3d-81fa-d2d30e786fb5\', \'multiverseId\': 380724}, \'multiverseid\': 380724}]', "[{'name': 'Weiser der Zeit', 'text': 'Heroisch — Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, der den Weisen der Zeit als Ziel hat, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf ihn.\\nEntferne alle +1/+1-Marken vom Weisen der Zeit: Für je fünf auf diese Weise entfernte Marken erhältst du nach diesem Zug einen zusätzlichen Zug.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380986&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'edf8a050-a444-48ac-9e82-a49a448a7771', 'multiverseId': 380986}, 'multiverseid': 380986}, {'name': 'Sabio de las horas', 'text': 'Heroísmo — Siempre que lances un hechizo que haga objetivo al Sabio de las horas, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre el Sabio de las horas.\\nRemover todos los contadores +1/+1 del Sabio de las horas: Por cada 5 contadores removidos de esta manera, juega un turno adicional después de este.', 'type': 'Criatura — Hechicero humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382141&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e38f6ec-61d2-40b4-8fba-6976dfd6211e', 'multiverseId': 382141}, 'multiverseid': 382141}, {'name': 'Sage des heures', 'text': 'Héroïque — À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort qui cible le Sage des heures, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur lui.\\nRetirez tous les marqueurs +1/+1 du Sage des heures : Pour chaque cinq marqueurs retirés de cette manière, jouez un tour supplémentaire après celui-ci.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et sorcier', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381151&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34afe8bf-f012-48fa-baf0-eefd14363552', 'multiverseId': 381151}, 'multiverseid': 381151}, {'name': 'Saggio delle Ore', 'text': 'Eroismo — Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia che bersaglia il Saggio delle Ore, metti un segnalino +1/+1 sul Saggio delle Ore.\\nRimuovi tutti i segnalini +1/+1 dal Saggio delle Ore: Per ogni cinque segnalini rimossi in questo modo, gioca un turno extra dopo questo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Mago Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381316&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45bb6b07-6673-4b0c-bd43-775925d89498', 'multiverseId': 381316}, 'multiverseid': 381316}, {'name': '時の賢者', 'text': '英雄的 ― あなたが時の賢者を対象とする呪文を１つ唱えるたび、時の賢者の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n時の賢者の上からすべての＋１/＋１カウンターを取り除く：これにより取り除かれたカウンター５個につき、このターンの直後に追加の１ターンを得る。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381481&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '95997a30-b56e-4976-9d58-16517b3d3553', 'multiverseId': 381481}, 'multiverseid': 381481}, {'name': '시간의 현자', 'text': '영웅 — 당신이 시간의 현자를 목표로 주문을 발동할 때마다, 시간의 현자에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n시간의 현자에서 모든 +1/+1 카운터를 제거한다: 이렇게 제거한 카운터 5개마다, 이번 턴 이후에 추가로 한 턴을 얻는다.', 'type': '생물 — 인간 마법사', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381646&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ac36c24-5a91-41d0-9925-590b6ce5b6fa', 'multiverseId': 381646}, 'multiverseid': 381646}, {'name': 'Sábio das Horas', 'text': 'Heroico — Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica cujo alvo seja Sábio das Horas, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nele.\\nRemova todos os marcadores +1/+1 de Sábio das Horas: para cada cinco marcadores removidos desta forma, jogue um turno extra após este.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Mago', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381811&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b645f7c2-fe4c-42c6-a667-b30a48ef9808', 'multiverseId': 381811}, 'multiverseid': 381811}, {'name': 'Мудрец Времени', 'text': 'Героизм — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, целью которого является Мудрец Времени, положите один жетон +1/+1 на Мудреца Времени.\\nУдалите все жетоны +1/+1 с Мудреца Времени: за каждые пять жетонов, удаленных таким образом, сделайте дополнительный ход вслед за этим.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Чародей', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381976&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8723b59d-103a-4766-9c25-cbd69c14c6f4', 'multiverseId': 381976}, 'multiverseid': 381976}, {'name': '时光智者', 'text': '勇行～每当你施放一个以时光智者为目标的咒语时，在时光智者上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n移去时光智者上所有的+1/+1指示物：每以此法移去五个指示物，便于本回合后进行额外的一个回合。', 'type': '生物～人类／法术师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380656&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a394406-9aa3-4736-b38e-8ebe8beeadf2', 'multiverseId': 380656}, 'multiverseid': 380656}, {'name': '時光智者', 'text': '勇行～每當你施放一個以時光智者為目標的咒語時，在時光智者上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n移去時光智者上所有的+1/+1指示物：每以此法移去五個指示物，便於本回合後進行額外的一個回合。', 'type': '生物～人類／魔法師', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380821&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5ea0c81-1f2d-452c-adbc-2f2cf332f90a', 'multiverseId': 380821}, 'multiverseid': 380821}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wiederbelebende Melodie\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines oder beides — Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück; und/oder bringe eine Verzauberungskarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Hör mein Lied und du benötigst keine goldene Maske, um zu mir zurückzukehren."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c651350f-4ba3-4eed-9b01-af8194fea75c\', \'multiverseId\': 380978}, \'multiverseid\': 380978}, {\'name\': \'Melodía reanimadora\', \'text\': \'Elige uno o ambos: Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano; y/o regresa la carta de encantamiento objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Escucha mi canción y nunca tendrás que forjar una máscara dorada para volver a verme".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568e5741-0574-45af-b5c8-afd76620a4a6\', \'multiverseId\': 382133}, \'multiverseid\': 382133}, {\'name\': \'Mélodie ravivante\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un ou les deux — Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée de votre cimetière dans votre main ; et/ou renvoyez une carte d\'enchantement ciblée de votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Écoute mon chant et jamais tu n\'auras à forger un masque doré pour revenir vers moi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381143&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de28f85d-c825-43ea-adcd-0b65732a7a05\', \'multiverseId\': 381143}, \'multiverseid\': 381143}, {\'name\': \'Melodia Rianimante\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno o entrambi — Riprendi in mano una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero; e/o riprendi in mano una carta incantesimo bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ascolta il mio canto e non dovrai mai forgiare una maschera d\\\'oro per risvegliarti dal sonno che ci separa."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'607ad4c4-27f3-42c1-bf65-eb2bbdeb4f60\', \'multiverseId\': 381308}, \'multiverseid\': 381308}, {\'name\': \'蘇生の旋律\', \'text\': \'以下の２つから１つまたは２つを選ぶ。「あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。」「あなたの墓地にあるエンチャント・カード１枚を対象とし、それをあなたの手札に戻す。」\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「私の歌を聞けば、私の元に戻るために黄金の仮面を作りだす必要はなくなるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be0668a4-b4e2-4463-be96-2f5b344ae078\', \'multiverseId\': 381473}, \'multiverseid\': 381473}, {\'name\': \'부활의 선율\', \'text\': \'하나 또는 둘 다를 선택한다 — 당신의 무덤에 있는 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다; 그리고/또는 당신의 무덤에 있는 부여마법 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': "\'내 노래를 들어요. 내게 돌아오기 위해 황금 가면을 만들 필요는 없어요.\'", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5abae38b-37bd-480f-8bc6-9b518337464d\', \'multiverseId\': 381638}, \'multiverseid\': 381638}, {\'name\': \'Melodia Restauradora\', \'text\': \'Escolha um ou ambos — Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão; e/ou devolva o card de encantamento alvo de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Ouça a minha canção e você nunca precisará forjar uma máscara dourada para retornar para mim."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8f46b4f-fb03-4e10-8dd9-f2f693bc8a87\', \'multiverseId\': 381803}, \'multiverseid\': 381803}, {\'name\': \'Оживляющая Мелодия\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно или оба — верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища в вашу руку; и (или) верните целевую карту чар из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Слушай мою песню, и тебе не придется ковать золотую маску, чтобы вернуться ко мне».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'546315f7-bcab-469c-acc7-66f72c0d92fd\', \'multiverseId\': 381968}, \'multiverseid\': 381968}, {\'name\': \'复苏旋律\', \'text\': \'选择一项或都选～将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上；和／或将目标结界牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「聆听我的歌声，然后你根本不用靠金色面具就能回到我身边。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ebe213b-baf4-4437-8fec-507312fdc23f\', \'multiverseId\': 380648}, \'multiverseid\': 380648}, {\'name\': \'復甦旋律\', \'text\': \'選擇一項或都選～將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上；和／或將目標結界牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「聆聽我的歌聲，然後你根本不用靠金色面具就能回到我身邊。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abcbc4c6-d04e-49ab-a478-023f4075267a\', \'multiverseId\': 380813}, \'multiverseid\': 380813}]', "[{'name': 'Wiedergekehrter Hedonist', 'text': 'Wenn der Wiedergekehrte Hedonist stirbt, legt jeder Spieler die obersten drei Karten seiner Bibliothek auf seinen Friedhof.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Zombie, Satyr', 'flavor': 'Das Fleisch längst tot, das Leben längst vergessen, aber alte Gewohnheiten dauern an.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380976&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '731bcfab-7186-45d6-945d-1d1544f29c98', 'multiverseId': 380976}, 'multiverseid': 380976}, {'name': 'Juerguista resurgido', 'text': 'Cuando el Juerguista resurgido muera, cada jugador pone las tres primeras cartas de su biblioteca en su cementerio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Sátiro zombie', 'flavor': 'Su carne está muerta y su vida olvidada, pero las viejas costumbres persisten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382131&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8ed968c-8de2-4813-aeab-a1a204de5e2f', 'multiverseId': 382131}, 'multiverseid': 382131}, {'name': 'Fêtard reparu', 'text': 'Quand le Fêtard reparu meurt, chaque joueur met les trois cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque dans son cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature : zombie et satyre', 'flavor': 'Sa chair est inerte et sa vie oubliée, mais les vieilles habitudes persistent.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381141&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62400cc1-cc77-40c0-bb7c-8c5baf20b2c1', 'multiverseId': 381141}, 'multiverseid': 381141}, {'name': 'Risvegliato Dissoluto', 'text': 'Quando il Risvegliato Dissoluto muore, ogni giocatore mette nel proprio cimitero le prime tre carte del proprio grimorio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Satiro Zombie', 'flavor': 'La carne è morta e la vita dimenticata, ma le antiche abitudini restano.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381306&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e08131c-42f4-4f03-9b1c-8d94ce7a1ae5', 'multiverseId': 381306}, 'multiverseid': 381306}, {'name': '蘇りし歓楽者', 'text': '蘇りし歓楽者が死亡したとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のライブラリーの一番上から３枚のカードを自分の墓地に置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・サテュロス', 'flavor': '肉体は死に、命は忘れられたが、古い習慣だけは残る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381471&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a1846cc-344d-430b-9135-7c7458f54ec0', 'multiverseId': 381471}, 'multiverseid': 381471}, {'name': '되살아난 난봉꾼', 'text': '되살아난 난봉꾼이 죽을 때, 각 플레이어는 자신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 세 장을 자신의 무덤에 넣는다.', 'type': '생물 — 좀비 사티로스', 'flavor': '육체는 죽었고 생명도 잃었지만 오래된 버릇은 남아있다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381636&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb6e45d5-7142-46cc-800c-cdade6d755ee', 'multiverseId': 381636}, 'multiverseid': 381636}, {'name': 'Festeiro Ressurgido', 'text': 'Quando Festeiro Ressurgido morre, cada jogador coloca os três primeiros cards do próprio grimório no próprio cemitério.', 'type': 'Criatura — Zumbi Sátiro', 'flavor': 'Sua carne está morta e sua vida esquecida, mas os antigos hábitos perduram.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381801&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e08a88a7-f8a1-4cd8-90c1-9f8c71e91648', 'multiverseId': 381801}, 'multiverseid': 381801}, {'name': 'Возвращенный Гуляка', 'text': 'Когда Возвращенный Гуляка умирает, каждый игрок кладет три верхние карты своей библиотеки на свое кладбище.', 'type': 'Существо — Зомби Сатир', 'flavor': 'Плоть мертва, жизнь давно забыта, но старые привычки не искоренить.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381966&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b6ad8204-601f-4b24-b483-3aeec4d5cb5d', 'multiverseId': 381966}, 'multiverseid': 381966}, {'name': '转世贪欢者', 'text': '当转世贪欢者死去时，每位牌手各将其牌库顶的三张牌置入其坟墓场。', 'type': '生物～灵俑／羊蹄人', 'flavor': '纵使肉身已逝，前世均已忘怀，旧习依然难改。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380646&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27727d2b-123c-4a1b-8fb8-0235793293f8', 'multiverseId': 380646}, 'multiverseid': 380646}, {'name': '轉世貪歡者', 'text': '當轉世貪歡者死去時，每位玩家各將其牌庫頂的三張牌置入其墳墓場。', 'type': '生物～殭屍／羊蹄人', 'flavor': '縱使肉身已逝，前世均已忘懷，舊習依然難改。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380811&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa1cac11-f60f-42b2-b62f-fdec823dfbc6', 'multiverseId': 380811}, 'multiverseid': 380811}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wildwasser-Najaden\', \'text\': \'Konstellation — Immer wenn die Wildwasser-Najaden oder eine andere Verzauberung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kann eine Kreatur deiner Wahl in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Nymphe\', \'flavor\': \'Stell dich den brausenden Stromschnellen entgegen und du sollst die Kraft der Najaden zu spüren bekommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381021&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd96c6a9-f201-4164-b059-f83097bd6a17\', \'multiverseId\': 381021}, \'multiverseid\': 381021}, {\'name\': \'Náyades de aguablanca\', \'text\': \'Constelación — Siempre que las Náyades de aguablanca u otro encantamiento entren al campo de batalla bajo tu control, la criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'Trata de resistir el ímpetu de los rápidos del río y conocerás la fuerza de las náyades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d62e8dc2-0559-4c5a-9135-3ee980694aa0\', \'multiverseId\': 382176}, \'multiverseid\': 382176}, {\'name\': \'Naïades des eaux vives\', \'text\': \'Constellation — À chaque fois que les Naïades des eaux vives ou un autre enchantement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, la créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : nymphe\', \'flavor\': \'Pour connaître le pouvoir des naïades, essayez simplement de résister aux rapides du fleuve.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381186&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c95e54-cf5d-4b5b-9fd6-2ff8282c0070\', \'multiverseId\': 381186}, \'multiverseid\': 381186}, {\'name\': \'Naiadi delle Rapide\', \'text\': \'Costellazione — Ogniqualvolta le Naiadi delle Rapide o un altro incantesimo entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, una creatura bersaglio non può essere bloccata in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': "Opponiti all\'urto delle rapide del fiume e conoscerai il potere delle naiadi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'815e069a-356d-4a04-86ce-e3b8280a501f\', \'multiverseId\': 381351}, \'multiverseid\': 381351}, {\'name\': \'急流のナイアード\', \'text\': \'星座 ― 急流のナイアードか他のエンチャントが１つあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — ニンフ\', \'flavor\': \'川の急流に逆らってみることで、ナイアードの持つ力の大きさが分かるようになるだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'483c4025-a01b-4433-8f3d-ead298cb7c51\', \'multiverseId\': 381516}, \'multiverseid\': 381516}, {\'name\': \'급류 나이아드\', \'text\': \'성좌 — 당신이 조종하는 급류 나이아드나 다른 부여마법이 전장에 들어올 때마다, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이번 턴에 방어당할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 님프\', \'flavor\': \'강의 급류와 맞서 보면 나이아드의 힘을 알게 될 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c619b74-c82c-4d54-a036-f75cf98f98c6\', \'multiverseId\': 381681}, \'multiverseid\': 381681}, {\'name\': \'Náiades das Corredeiras\', \'text\': \'Constelação — Toda vez que Náiades das Corredeiras ou outro encantamento entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, a criatura alvo não poderá ser bloqueada neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Ninfa\', \'flavor\': \'Tente enfrentar a força da correnteza de um rio e você entenderá o poder das náiades.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0acef1-1ff7-422b-a9c9-1eae8c4017e5\', \'multiverseId\': 381846}, \'multiverseid\': 381846}, {\'name\': \'Наяды Порогов\', \'text\': \'Созвездие — Каждый раз, когда Наяды Порогов или другие чары выходят на поле битвы под вашим контролем, целевое существо не может быть заблокировано в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Нимфа\', \'flavor\': \'Попробуй выстоять в ревущем потоке воды на речной стремнине, и ты узнаешь силу наяд.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8aa0b96-4c5e-45c4-a36f-f23080158d45\', \'multiverseId\': 382011}, \'multiverseid\': 382011}, {\'name\': \'湍流水灵\', \'text\': \'星彩～每当湍流水灵或另一个结界在你的操控下进战场时，目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～宁芙\', \'flavor\': \'对抗过激流的冲击，你就能领教水灵的威力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bc847d7-9418-4412-938f-b4cf727764be\', \'multiverseId\': 380691}, \'multiverseid\': 380691}, {\'name\': \'湍流水靈\', \'text\': \'星彩～每當湍流水靈或另一個結界在你的操控下進戰場時，目標生物本回合不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～寧芙\', \'flavor\': \'對抗過激流的衝擊，你就能領教水靈的威力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8107043-ded8-48b5-8105-412146b420f5\', \'multiverseId\': 380856}, \'multiverseid\': 380856}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wille der Flammenseherin\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du den Willen der Flammenseherin opfern. Falls du dies tust, zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b79aae83-dd5b-4521-ba4d-f61e515aabda\', \'multiverseId\': 380909}, \'multiverseid\': 380909}, {\'name\': \'Voluntad del portavoz ígneo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controlas.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes sacrificar la Voluntad del portavoz ígneo. Si lo haces, destruye el artefacto objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'250b5e92-1838-45ea-afe8-84375db51195\', \'multiverseId\': 382064}, \'multiverseid\': 382064}, {\'name\': "Volonté de l\'oratrice de feu", \'text\': "Enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez sacrifier la Volonté de l\'oratrice de feu. Si vous faites ainsi, détruisez l\'artefact ciblé.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381074&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c861e27d-c372-48ae-8545-784a1b9622cd\', \'multiverseId\': 381074}, \'multiverseid\': 381074}, {\'name\': "Volontà dell\'Oratore delle Fiamme", \'text\': "Incanta creatura che controlli\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi sacrificare la Volontà dell\'Oratore delle Fiamme. Se lo fai, distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30dc7c8b-d3bd-4ad2-ac7c-7000234bdd46\', \'multiverseId\': 381239}, \'multiverseid\': 381239}, {\'name\': \'炎語りの意志\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールするクリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは炎語りの意志を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、アーティファクト１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02918199-1c48-4293-a8f7-3810235e4197\', \'multiverseId\': 381404}, \'multiverseid\': 381404}, {\'name\': \'화염술사의 의지\', \'text\': \'자신이 조종하는 생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n부여된 생물이 플레이어에게 전투피해를 입힐 때마다, 당신은 화염술사의 의지를 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 하면, 마법물체를 목표로 정한다. 그 마법물체를 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1682a8a6-62d0-48fb-99c5-60ebd977c0e8\', \'multiverseId\': 381569}, \'multiverseid\': 381569}, {\'name\': \'Vontade do Flamividente\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que você controla\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode sacrificar Vontade do Flamividente. Se fizer isso, destrua o artefato alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'395631b2-b25b-4251-a762-b711d35e073f\', \'multiverseId\': 381734}, \'multiverseid\': 381734}, {\'name\': \'Воля Огнеречивой\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо под вашим контролем\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете пожертвовать Волю Огнеречивой. Если вы это делаете, уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b24a21e0-1ba3-4fc6-88a2-18166bb094ff\', \'multiverseId\': 381899}, \'multiverseid\': 381899}, {\'name\': \'焰语者的意志\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1。\\n每当所结附的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以牺牲焰语者的意志。若你如此作，则消灭目标神器。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8637c67-93c1-4f8c-a9b4-911daae97ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 380579}, \'multiverseid\': 380579}, {\'name\': \'焰語者的意志\', \'text\': \'結附於由你操控的生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1。\\n每當所結附的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以犧牲焰語者的意志。若你如此作，則消滅目標神器。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8fa2dd0-340d-4a45-b2eb-52876ce680ce\', \'multiverseId\': 380744}, \'multiverseid\': 380744}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wissen und Macht\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Hellsicht anwendest, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, fügt Wissen und Macht einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Information ist eine mächtige Waffe." —Kymede, Königin von Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380940&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94d7a3a7-3d5a-404c-9532-d66289075f2f\', \'multiverseId\': 380940}, \'multiverseid\': 380940}, {\'name\': \'Conocimiento y poder\', \'text\': \'Siempre que adivines, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, Conocimiento y poder hace 2 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La información es un arma poderosa". —Cymeda, reina de Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a372929-86f6-4a71-ac4c-363e0bd9bdc5\', \'multiverseId\': 382095}, \'multiverseid\': 382095}, {\'name\': \'Savoir et puissance\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous appliquez le regard, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, Savoir et puissance inflige 2 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« L\'information est une arme puissante. » —Cymède, reine d\'Akros", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9cc2e5e-c966-4d7c-a2ba-ad8773c9a540\', \'multiverseId\': 381105}, \'multiverseid\': 381105}, {\'name\': \'Conoscenza e Potere\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta profetizzi, puoi pagare {2}. Se lo fai, Conoscenza e Potere infligge 2 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le informazioni sono armi potenti." —Cimede, regina di Akros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b07d9999-93ca-4381-961d-b09cab9d7cd1\', \'multiverseId\': 381270}, \'multiverseid\': 381270}, {\'name\': \'知識と力\', \'text\': \'あなたが占術を行うたび、あなたは{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。知識と力はそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「情報は、強力な武器です。」 ――アクロスの女王、サイミーディ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82807319-afd3-4127-aab7-6f099e1a261a\', \'multiverseId\': 381435}, \'multiverseid\': 381435}, {\'name\': \'지식과 힘\', \'text\': \'당신이 점술을 할 때마다, 당신은 {2}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 하면, 생물 또는 플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 지식과 힘은 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': "\'정보는 강력한 무기지.\' —아크로스의 왕비 사이미디", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc9afea6-98e7-4f0c-a58d-7def47d0380f\', \'multiverseId\': 381600}, \'multiverseid\': 381600}, {\'name\': \'Conhecimento e Poder\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você usar vidência, você poderá pagar {2}. Se fizer isso, Conhecimento e Poder causará 2 pontos de dano à criatura ou jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A informação é uma arma poderosa." — Ciméde, rainha de Ácros\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba1bdfab-4124-4f1f-9095-f669bc5a9af7\', \'multiverseId\': 381765}, \'multiverseid\': 381765}, {\'name\': \'Знание и Сила\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы предсказываете, вы можете заплатить {2}. Если вы это делаете, Знание и Сила наносит 2 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Знание — мощное оружие». — Кимеда, царица Акроса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b346d0c3-4081-485f-8e55-386aa8d08471\', \'multiverseId\': 381930}, \'multiverseid\': 381930}, {\'name\': \'知识与力量\', \'text\': \'每当你占卜时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，知识与力量对目标生物或牌手造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「信息是强力的武器。」 ～阿喀洛斯皇后赛美狄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f22da5cf-a895-45dc-befd-99e599eb45e2\', \'multiverseId\': 380610}, \'multiverseid\': 380610}, {\'name\': \'知識與力量\', \'text\': \'每當你占卜時，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，知識與力量對目標生物或玩家造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「資訊是強力的武器。」 ～阿喀洛斯皇后賽美狄\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a95f357a-0324-4313-aaeb-f082749ac870\', \'multiverseId\': 380775}, \'multiverseid\': 380775}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wutausbruch des Mogis\', \'text\': \'Der Wutausbruch des Mogis fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl so viele Schadenspunkte zu, wie Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof sind. Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst diese Karte unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbf994d8-422d-42ec-ae49-8fd9e1d96df8\', \'multiverseId\': 381000}, \'multiverseid\': 381000}, {\'name\': \'Rencor de Mogis\', \'text\': \'El Rencor de Mogis hace daño a la criatura objetivo igual a la cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio. Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'655f4937-1edb-4009-8ccb-1ba949997fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 382155}, \'multiverseid\': 382155}, {\'name\': \'Rancune de Mogis\', \'text\': "La Rancune de Mogis inflige à la créature ciblée un nombre de blessures égal au nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière. Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2126df6a-f524-40ce-b996-332b80147495\', \'multiverseId\': 381165}, \'multiverseid\': 381165}, {\'name\': \'Spregio di Mogis\', \'text\': \'Lo Spregio di Mogis infligge a una creatura bersaglio danno pari al numero di carte istantaneo e stregoneria nel tuo cimitero. Profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7d7d63a-c533-476b-9cce-80edbf32ef7e\', \'multiverseId\': 381330}, \'multiverseid\': 381330}, {\'name\': \'モーギスの悪意\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。モーギスの悪意はそれに、あなたの墓地にあるインスタント・カードとソーサリー・カードの総数に等しい点数のダメージを与える。占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d987eda-1cd1-47a2-821c-c246b6167d11\', \'multiverseId\': 381495}, \'multiverseid\': 381495}, {\'name\': \'모기스의 원한\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 모기스의 원한은 그 생물에 당신의 무덤에 있는 순간마법과 집중마법 카드 수의 합만큼의 피해를 입힌다. 점술 1. (당신의 서고 맨 위의 카드 한 장을 본다. 당신은 그 카드를 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓을 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4a4c603-9789-4312-b0bc-e3c4d0d93d6d\', \'multiverseId\': 381660}, \'multiverseid\': 381660}, {\'name\': \'Rancor de Mogis\', \'text\': \'Rancor de Mogis causa à criatura alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao número de cards de mágica instantânea e feitiço no seu cemitério. Vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b400156-1bbb-42e2-bb23-1da521590641\', \'multiverseId\': 381825}, \'multiverseid\': 381825}, {\'name\': \'Злоба Могия\', \'text\': \'Злоба Могия наносит целевому существу повреждения, равные количеству карт мгновенных заклинаний и волшебства на вашем кладбище. Предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37bc1328-a792-40d8-822e-8388ca4a878d\', \'multiverseId\': 381990}, \'multiverseid\': 381990}, {\'name\': \'墨癸斯的怨恨\', \'text\': \'墨癸斯的怨恨对目标生物造成伤害，其数量等同于你坟墓场中瞬间与法术牌的数量加总。占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84e45159-9142-48d2-87db-dcaadc3e98a3\', \'multiverseId\': 380670}, \'multiverseid\': 380670}, {\'name\': \'墨癸斯的怨恨\', \'text\': \'墨癸斯的怨恨對目標生物造成傷害，其數量等同於你墳墓場中瞬間與巫術牌的數量加總。占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dd50078-303d-4840-9f8a-6ef2ce01c90c\', \'multiverseId\': 380835}, \'multiverseid\': 380835}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zu Boden drücken\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält -6/-0.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Stärke der Sterblichen lässt sich so einfach auslöschen wie ihre Hoffnung." —Thassa, Göttin der Meere\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f19cbc-4eb5-4243-b0da-cdd91f4d3a26\', \'multiverseId\': 380968}, \'multiverseid\': 380968}, {\'name\': \'Anclar al suelo\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene -6/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"La fuerza de los mortales, así como su esperanza, se ahoga muy fácilmente". —Tassa, diosa del mar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a3d8bc6-dcbb-4709-a9cd-e9740ec60bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 382123}, \'multiverseid\': 382123}, {\'name\': \'Clouer au sol\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne -6/-0.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« La force des mortels, comme leur espoir, est si facilement écrasée. » —Thassa, déesse de la Mer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381133&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b58c3708-7890-43a3-8e27-99063c1d59d5\', \'multiverseId\': 381133}, \'multiverseid\': 381133}, {\'name\': \'Inchiodare a Terra\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende -6/-0.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"La forza dei mortali, come la loro speranza, può essere facilmente soppressa." —Thassa, dea del mare\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'947193fc-9e59-4823-9d24-0071233faf98\', \'multiverseId\': 381298}, \'multiverseid\': 381298}, {\'name\': \'大地への縫い止め\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは－６/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「定命の者の力とはその者たちが抱く希望の如く、押し潰すことなど造作も無い。」 ――海の神、タッサ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b9200ce-3060-4475-bff0-784706de7aa3\', \'multiverseId\': 381463}, \'multiverseid\': 381463}, {\'name\': \'땅에 고정시키다\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 -6/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': "\'필멸자의 힘은 필멸자의 희망과 마찬가지로 쉽게 부서지지.\' —바다의 신 타사", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'970e9411-aa4d-49e3-939f-3a5769692d60\', \'multiverseId\': 381628}, \'multiverseid\': 381628}, {\'name\': \'Cravar na Terra\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe -6/-0.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"A força dos mortais, assim como a esperança deles, pode ser facilmente esmagada." — Tassa, deusa do mar\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e7bd3f8-731e-48ee-8ac0-29db47b5cbae\', \'multiverseId\': 381793}, \'multiverseid\': 381793}, {\'name\': \'Пришпилить к Земле\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает -6/-0.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Силу смертных, как и их надежду, легко сокрушить». — Тасса, богиня моря\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1373514f-f153-4b7f-bc63-736e89e649c3\', \'multiverseId\': 381958}, \'multiverseid\': 381958}, {\'name\': \'钉牢在地\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得-6/-0。\', \'type\': \'结界～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「凡人的力量，就如凡人的希望，如此不堪一击。」 ～海神塔萨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09219b4d-6b3a-49dd-a07f-34a432093650\', \'multiverseId\': 380638}, \'multiverseid\': 380638}, {\'name\': \'釘牢在地\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得-6/-0。\', \'type\': \'結界～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「凡人的力量，就如凡人的希望，如此不堪一擊。」 ～海神塔薩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb338c7-baa9-459f-8a69-dd9e3fd121d7\', \'multiverseId\': 380803}, \'multiverseid\': 380803}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zum Schweigen bringen\', \'text\': \'Streben — Zum Schweigen bringen kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{B} mehr.\\nSchicke eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl und alle an sie angelegten Auren ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34cabade-2257-4b31-b774-cd75e6f46197\', \'multiverseId\': 380994}, \'multiverseid\': 380994}, {\'name\': \'Silenciar a los creyentes\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar Silenciar a los creyentes cuesta {2}{B} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nExilia cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo y todas las auras anexadas a ellas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f5357b6-7f9c-4920-badc-a8589706e33e\', \'multiverseId\': 382149}, \'multiverseid\': 382149}, {\'name\': \'Réduire les croyants au silence\', \'text\': "Obstination — Réduire les croyants au silence coûte {2}{B} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nExilez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées et toutes les auras qui leur sont attachées.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83ac5ffc-0d22-422d-962e-48f1a738b02b\', \'multiverseId\': 381159}, \'multiverseid\': 381159}, {\'name\': \'Zittire i Credenti\', \'text\': \'Sforzo — Zittire i Credenti costa {2}{B} in più per essere lanciato per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nEsilia un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio e tutte le Aure ad esse assegnate.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0218c65-e363-4d6b-a8df-68726d820bc4\', \'multiverseId\': 381324}, \'multiverseid\': 381324}, {\'name\': \'信者の沈黙\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 信者の沈黙を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{B}多くなる。\\n望む数のクリーチャーを対象とし、それらとそれらにつけられているすべてのオーラを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3cd0dd1-a18a-4976-81d8-cc961eab6229\', \'multiverseId\': 381489}, \'multiverseid\': 381489}, {\'name\': \'믿는 자들을 침묵시키다\', \'text\': \'분투 — 믿는 자들을 침묵시키다는 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{B}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들과 그 생물들에 부착된 모든 마법진을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b841eae1-79d5-4618-9547-709f5dfc86ad\', \'multiverseId\': 381654}, \'multiverseid\': 381654}, {\'name\': \'Silenciar os Crentes\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Silenciar os Crentes custa {2}{B} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nExile qualquer número de criaturas alvo e todas as Auras anexadas a elas.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b90e99-3ba5-4b93-9138-afde842af3b7\', \'multiverseId\': 381819}, \'multiverseid\': 381819}, {\'name\': \'Подавление Верующих\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Подавления Верующих стоит на {2}{B} больше.\\nИзгоните любое количество целевых существ и все прикрепленные к ним Ауры.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d27a4c06-e623-4bfa-934b-bec4aa408a14\', \'multiverseId\': 381984}, \'multiverseid\': 381984}, {\'name\': \'信者噤声\', \'text\': \'积力～信者噤声在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{B}来施放。\\n放逐任意数量的目标生物与结附于其上的所有灵气。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77231bf3-4861-4df0-8c0e-7935a60d419b\', \'multiverseId\': 380664}, \'multiverseid\': 380664}, {\'name\': \'信者噤聲\', \'text\': \'積力～信者噤聲在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{B}來施放。\\n放逐任意數量的目標生物與結附於其上的所有靈氣。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbfc1735-41cf-41f2-9c2c-166ecbb3ab2d\', \'multiverseId\': 380829}, \'multiverseid\': 380829}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zwillingsflamme\', \'text\': \'Streben — Zwillingsflamme kostet beim Wirken für jedes Ziel außer dem ersten {2}{R} mehr.\\nBestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst. Bringe für jede dieser Kreaturen einen Spielstein ins Spiel, der eine Kopie dieser Kreatur ist. Diese Spielsteine haben Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381018&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17fe927-19d0-4b9e-884c-9077c30988b3\', \'multiverseId\': 381018}, \'multiverseid\': 381018}, {\'name\': \'Gemelo ígneo\', \'text\': \'Esfuerzo — Lanzar el Gemelo ígneo cuesta {2}{R} más por cada objetivo después del primero.\\nElige cualquier cantidad de criaturas objetivo que controlas. Por cada una de ellas, pon en el campo de batalla una ficha que es una copia de esa criatura. Esas fichas tienen la habilidad de prisa. Exílialas al comienzo del próximo paso final.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6554124c-04c7-4bee-8c7b-df46da107ef9\', \'multiverseId\': 382173}, \'multiverseid\': 382173}, {\'name\': \'Pyrojumeau\', \'text\': "Obstination — Le Pyrojumeau coûte {2}{R} de plus à lancer pour chaque cible après la première.\\nChoisissez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures ciblées que vous contrôlez. Pour chacune d\'elles, mettez sur le champ de bataille un jeton qui est une copie de cette créature. Ces jetons ont la célérité. Exilez-les au début de la prochaine étape de fin.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381183&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afc4e918-622d-4004-9da3-ffa058505b4c\', \'multiverseId\': 381183}, \'multiverseid\': 381183}, {\'name\': \'Fiamma Gemella\', \'text\': "Sforzo — La Fiamma Gemella costa {2}{R} in più per essere lanciata per ogni bersaglio oltre il primo.\\nScegli un qualsiasi numero di creature bersaglio che controlli. Per ognuna di esse, metti sul campo di battaglia una pedina che è una copia di quella creatura. Quelle pedine hanno rapidità. Esiliale all\'inizio della prossima sottofase finale.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a0486f-6121-4193-8513-d9e2c6d551d5\', \'multiverseId\': 381348}, \'multiverseid\': 381348}, {\'name\': \'双つ身の炎\', \'text\': \'奮励 ― 双つ身の炎を唱えるためのコストは、２つ目以降の対象１つにつき{2}{R}多くなる。\\nあなたがコントロールする望む数のクリーチャーを対象とする。それら１体につき、それのコピーであるトークンを１体戦場に出す。それらのトークンは速攻を持つ。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらをすべて追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c246de9-3e83-489f-82ac-027c99596641\', \'multiverseId\': 381513}, \'multiverseid\': 381513}, {\'name\': \'쌍둥이 불꽃\', \'text\': \'분투 — 쌍둥이 불꽃은 한 개를 초과하는 목표의 수만큼 발동하는 데 {2}{R}씩 비용이 더 든다.\\n당신이 조종하는 생물을 원하는 수만큼 목표로 선택한다. 목표로 한 각 생물마다, 그 생물의 복사본인 토큰 한 개를 전장에 놓는다. 그 토큰들은 신속을 가진다. 다음 종료단 시작에 그 토큰들을 추방한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e97419c-4536-4b51-ba1d-dc7a575e5bba\', \'multiverseId\': 381678}, \'multiverseid\': 381678}, {\'name\': \'Gêmeo Incandescente\', \'text\': \'Esforço — Gêmeo Incandescente custa {2}{R} a mais para ser conjurado para cada alvo além do primeiro.\\nEscolha qualquer número de criaturas alvo que você controla. Para cada uma delas, coloque no campo de batalha uma ficha que seja uma cópia daquela criatura. Aquelas fichas têm ímpeto. Exile-as no início da próxima etapa final.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d996c50-3560-4ed9-b413-0c9f4c5e8a77\', \'multiverseId\': 381843}, \'multiverseid\': 381843}, {\'name\': \'Пламенный Двойник\', \'text\': \'Стремление — За каждую цель после первой разыгрывание Пламенного Двойника стоит на {2}{R} больше.\\nВыберите любое количество целевых существ под вашим контролем. Для каждого из них положите на поле битвы одну фишку, являющуюся копией того существа. У тех фишек есть Ускорение. Изгоните их в начале следующего заключительного шага.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed3545e7-a8d7-455b-a3db-d1ea6fda4bb6\', \'multiverseId\': 382008}, \'multiverseid\': 382008}, {\'name\': \'焰塑双身\', \'text\': \'积力～焰塑双身在第一个目标之外每有一个目标，便增加{2}{R}来施放。\\n选择任意数量目标由你操控的生物。对每个这类生物而言，各将一个衍生物放进战场，此衍生物为该生物的复制品。这些衍生物具有敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它们放逐。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f0af440-688e-4660-b90d-e4ee08e04deb\', \'multiverseId\': 380688}, \'multiverseid\': 380688}, {\'name\': \'焰塑雙身\', \'text\': \'積力～焰塑雙身在第一個目標之外每有一個目標，便增加{2}{R}來施放。\\n選擇任意數量目標由你操控的生物。對每個這類生物而言，各將一個衍生物放進戰場，此衍生物為該生物的複製品。這些衍生物具有敏捷異能。在下一個結束步驟開始時，將它們放逐。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b47fa22-25a1-424b-9ead-0b4a01a96b79\', \'multiverseId\': 380853}, \'multiverseid\': 380853}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zyklop des ewigen Zorns\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Eile.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberungskreatur — Zyklop\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Zorn, der in ihm wütet, ist ansteckend." —Anthusa von Setessa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2417e7d6-e478-4b71-8430-62af76666c4e\', \'multiverseId\': 380886}, \'multiverseid\': 380886}, {\'name\': \'Cíclope de la furia eterna\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura encantamiento — Cíclope\', \'flavor\': \'"La cólera que supura es contagiosa". —Anthousa de Setessa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=382041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a79490-6494-4cd5-a786-98374d912c73\', \'multiverseId\': 382041}, \'multiverseid\': 382041}, {\'name\': \'Cyclope de la fureur éternelle\', \'text\': \'Les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Créature-enchantement : cyclope\', \'flavor\': \'« La rage qui le consume intérieurement est contagieuse. » —Anthousa de Setessa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd6dfb43-bb15-4cdb-ad0e-12be05e6c8dd\', \'multiverseId\': 381051}, \'multiverseid\': 381051}, {\'name\': \'Ciclope della Furia Eterna\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Incantesimo — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'ira che lo infetta è contagiosa." —Anthousa di Setessa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9719ee02-8832-4a77-9865-71d4354dbb67\', \'multiverseId\': 381216}, \'multiverseid\': 381216}, {\'name\': \'永遠憤怒のサイクロプス\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールするクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー・エンチャント — サイクロプス\', \'flavor\': \'「こいつの中に巣食う怒りは伝染するわ。」 ――セテッサのアンソーザ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b719b4c-e964-4d61-96fb-673c04fc0392\', \'multiverseId\': 381381}, \'multiverseid\': 381381}, {\'name\': \'영원한 분노의 키클롭스\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 신속을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 생물 — 키클롭스\', \'flavor\': "\'이 안에서 곪고 있는 분노는 전염될 것입니다.\' —세테사의 안투사", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56f5e679-9625-4310-b111-b1992a104593\', \'multiverseId\': 381546}, \'multiverseid\': 381546}, {\'name\': \'Ciclope da Fúria Eterna\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla têm ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Encantamento — Ciclope\', \'flavor\': \'"A ira que supura dentro dele é contagiosa." — Antousa de Setessa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c0f4a4e-fd5a-4486-9f7f-d80393e24758\', \'multiverseId\': 381711}, \'multiverseid\': 381711}, {\'name\': \'Циклоп Вечной Ярости\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем имеют Ускорение.\', \'type\': \'Чары Существо — Циклоп\', \'flavor\': \'«Гнев, что терзает его, заразен». — Антуза из Сетессы\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=381876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee995f3a-408e-427c-85f5-478b957fa90a\', \'multiverseId\': 381876}, \'multiverseid\': 381876}, {\'name\': \'恒怒独眼巨人\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'结界生物～独眼巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「这家伙心中日益加深的愤怒会传染。」 ～瑟特萨的安陶莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e070610c-49d5-48f1-a7a6-5245fa8f3149\', \'multiverseId\': 380556}, \'multiverseid\': 380556}, {\'name\': \'恆怒獨眼巨人\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物具有敏捷異能。\', \'type\': \'結界生物～獨眼巨人\', \'flavor\': \'「這傢伙心中日益加深的憤怒會傳染。」 ～瑟特薩的安陶莎\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=380721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1543fde-07e1-444e-973f-0e22a9a535c2\', \'multiverseId\': 380721}, \'multiverseid\': 380721}]']
printings: ['2X2', '40K', '6ED', '7ED', 'A25', 'AJMP', 'AKH', 'AKR', 'ALA', 'ALL', 'BBD', 'BRC', 'C15', 'C16', 'C18', 'C20', 'C21', 'CLB', 'CM2', 'CMM', 'CMR', 'CN2', 'CP1', 'DDG', 'DDJ', 'DDO', 'DDR', 'DDU', 'EA2', 'EA3', 'EXP', 'F14', 'FUT', 'HA2', 'HBG', 'IMA', 'J22', 'JMP', 'JOU', 'KHC', 'LTC', 'M13', 'M15', 'M19', 'M20', 'M21', 'ME2', 'MED', 'MOC', 'NCC', 'ONC', 'ORI', 'OTC', 'PIP', 'PJOU', 'PLST', 'PM20', 'PM21', 'PRM', 'SCD', 'SCH', 'SLD', 'THB', 'TSR', 'UMA', 'WC02', 'WHO', 'WOC', 'ZEN', 'ZNC']
original_text: ['+1: Distribute three +1/+1 counters among one, two, or three target creatures you control.\\n+1: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal an Aura, creature, or planeswalker card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.\\n-8: You gain 100 life.', 'All creatures get +2/-2 until end of turn.', 'As Hall of Triumph enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\nCreatures you control of the chosen color get +1/+1.', "As an additional cost to cast Tormented Thoughts, sacrifice a creature.\\nTarget player discards a number of cards equal to the sacrificed creature's power.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you gain 1 life.', "Bestow {2}{R} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached to a creature.)\\nMogis's Warhound attacks each turn if able.\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and attacks each turn if able.", "Bestow {3}{B} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached to a creature.)\\nGnarled Scarhide can't block.\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+1 and can't block.", 'Bestow {3}{U}{U} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it\'s an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it\'s not attached to a creature.)\\nWhen Crystalline Nautilus becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it.\\nEnchanted creature gets +4/+4 and has "When this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it."', "Bestow {4}{G} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached to a creature.)\\nSpirespine blocks each turn if able.\\nEnchanted creature gets +4/+1 and blocks each turn if able.", "Bestow {4}{W} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached to a creature.)\\nSightless Brawler can't attack alone.\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+2 and can't attack alone.", "Bestow {5}{U}{U} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached to a creature.)\\nFlying\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has flying.", 'Choose one or both — Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand; and/or return target enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Choose target creature or player. Scry 3, then reveal the top card of your library. Riddle of Lightning deals damage equal to that card's converted mana cost to that creature or player. (To scry 3, look at the top three cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)", "Constellation — Whenever Agent of Erebos or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, exile all cards from target player's graveyard.", 'Constellation — Whenever Doomwake Giant or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn.', "Constellation — Whenever Dreadbringer Lampads or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, target creature gains intimidate until end of turn. (It can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)", 'Constellation — Whenever Eidolon of Blossoms or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.', 'Constellation — Whenever Forgeborn Oreads or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, Forgeborn Oreads deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Constellation — Whenever Goldenhide Ox or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, target creature must be blocked this turn if able.', 'Constellation — Whenever Grim Guardian or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, each opponent loses 1 life.', 'Constellation — Whenever Harvestguard Alseids or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, prevent all damage that would be dealt to target creature this turn.', 'Constellation — Whenever Humbler of Mortals or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, creatures you control gain trample until end of turn.', 'Constellation — Whenever Oakheart Dryads or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Constellation — Whenever Skybind or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, exile target nonenchantment permanent. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Constellation — Whenever Strength from the Fallen or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', "Constellation — Whenever Thassa's Devourer or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, target player puts the top two cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.", 'Constellation — Whenever Thoughtrender Lamia or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, each opponent discards a card.', 'Constellation — Whenever Underworld Coinsmith or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.\\n{W}{B}, Pay 1 life: Each opponent loses 1 life.', "Constellation — Whenever Whitewater Naiads or another enchantment enters the battlefield under your control, target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'Counter target spell. Its controller puts the top four cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.', 'Creatures you control have haste.', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Deathtouch\\nOther Minotaur creatures you control have deathtouch.', 'Destroy all nonenchantment creatures.', 'Destroy target creature and target land.', "Destroy target creature with power 4 or greater. It can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target enchanted creature or enchantment creature.', 'Destroy target enchantment or land.', 'Double strike, trample\\nWhenever Prophetic Flamespeaker deals combat damage to a player, exile the top card of your library. You may play it this turn.', 'Each instant and sorcery spell you cast costs {1} less to cast for each creature it targets.\\nHeroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Battlefield Thaumaturge, Battlefield Thaumaturge gains hexproof until end of turn.', "Each player can't cast more than one spell each turn.", "Enchant creature you control\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to a player, you may sacrifice Flamespeaker's Will. If you do, destroy target artifact.", 'Enchant creature you control\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals combat damage to a player, you may sacrifice Mortal Obstinacy. If you do, destroy target enchantment.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block unless its controller pays {3}.\\nActivated abilities of enchanted creature cost {3} more to activate.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+3 and has deathtouch. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 as long as it's an enchantment. Otherwise, it gets -2/-2.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-0 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -6/-0.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has double strike as long as it's an enchantment. Otherwise, prevent all damage that would be dealt by enchanted creature. (A creature with double strike deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)", 'Enchant creature\\nWhen Lightning Diadem enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to target creature or player.\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.', 'Enchant land\\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds two mana in any combination of colors to his or her mana pool (in addition to the mana the land produces).', "Equipped creature gets +3/+3.\\nWhenever equipped creature blocks or becomes blocked by one or more creatures, you may exile one of those creatures.\\nOpponents can't cast cards with the same name as cards exiled with Godsend.\\nEquip {3}", 'Equipped creature has first strike, trample, and haste.\\nEquip {1}', "Exile target creature card from your graveyard. Put a black Zombie creature token onto the battlefield. Its power is equal to that card's power and its toughness is equal to that card's toughness.", "Exile target enchantment. If the exiled card is a God card, search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for any number of cards with the same name as that card and exile them, then that player shuffles his or her library.", 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nFlying', "Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nFlying, deathtouch\\n{5}{G}{U}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)", "Flash\\nAt the beginning of each player's draw step, that player draws an additional card.", 'Flash\\nCreatures you control get +2/+2.', 'Flash\\nIf a source would deal damage to a permanent or player, it deals double that damage to that permanent or player instead.', 'Flash\\nWhenever a creature you control dies, each opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'Flash\\nWhenever a player taps a land for mana, that player adds one mana to his or her mana pool of any type that land produced.', 'Flying', 'Flying, lifelink\\nHeroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Dawnbringer Charioteers, put a +1/+1 counter on Dawnbringer Charioteers.', 'Flying, vigilance', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, each opponent draws a card.', "Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, return an enchantment you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nDouble strike (This creature deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Flying\\nHeroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets War-Wing Siren, put a +1/+1 counter on War-Wing Siren.', 'Flying\\nWhen Spawn of Thraxes enters the battlefield, it deals damage to target creature or player equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Flying\\nWhen Supply-Line Cranes enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "Flying\\n{2}{U}{R}: Scry 1, then reveal the top card of your library. Stormchaser Chimera gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is that card's converted mana cost. (To scry 1, look at the top card of your library, then you may put that card on the bottom of your library.)", "Godhunter Octopus can't attack unless defending player controls an enchantment or an enchanted permanent.", "Heroes' Bane enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{2}{G}{G}: Put X +1/+1 counters on Heroes' Bane, where X is its power.", 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Akroan Line Breaker, Akroan Line Breaker gets +2/+0 and gains intimidate until end of turn.', 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Bloodcrazed Hoplite, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nWhenever a +1/+1 counter is placed on Bloodcrazed Hoplite, remove a +1/+1 counter from target creature an opponent controls.', 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Lagonna-Band Trailblazer, put a +1/+1 counter on Lagonna-Band Trailblazer.', 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Leonin Iconoclast, destroy target enchantment creature an opponent controls.', 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Pheres-Band Thunderhoof, put two +1/+1 counters on Pheres-Band Thunderhoof.', 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Sage of Hours, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nRemove all +1/+1 counters from Sage of Hours: For each five counters removed this way, take an extra turn after this one.', 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Satyr Hoplite, put a +1/+1 counter on Satyr Hoplite.', 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Tethmos High Priest, return target creature card with converted mana cost 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.', "Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Triton Cavalry, you may return target enchantment to its owner's hand.", 'Hexproof, reach', "Indestructible\\nAs long as your devotion to black and green is less than seven, Pharika isn't a creature.\\n{B}{G}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Its owner puts a 1/1 black and green Snake enchantment creature token with deathtouch onto the battlefield.", "Indestructible\\nAs long as your devotion to blue and red is less than seven, Keranos isn't a creature.\\nReveal the first card you draw on each of your turns. Whenever you reveal a land card this way, draw a card. Whenever you reveal a nonland card this way, Keranos deals 3 damage to target creature or player.", "Indestructible\\nAs long as your devotion to green and blue is less than seven, Kruphix isn't a creature.\\nYou have no maximum hand size.\\nIf unused mana would empty from your mana pool, that mana becomes colorless instead.", "Indestructible\\nAs long as your devotion to red and white is less than seven, Iroas isn't a creature.\\nCreatures you control can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.\\nPrevent all damage that would be dealt to attacking creatures you control.", "Indestructible\\nAs long as your devotion to white and black is less than seven, Athreos isn't a creature.\\nWhenever another creature you own dies, return it to your hand unless target opponent pays 3 life.", 'Inspired — Whenever Daring Thief becomes untapped, you may exchange control of target nonland permanent you control and target permanent an opponent controls that shares a card type with it.', 'Inspired — Whenever Disciple of Deceit becomes untapped, you may discard a nonland card. If you do, search your library for a card with the same converted mana cost as that card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'Inspired — Whenever King Macar, the Gold-Cursed becomes untapped, you may exile target creature. If you do, put a colorless artifact token named Gold onto the battlefield. It has "Sacrifice this artifact: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool."', "Intimidate (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or creatures that share a color with it.)", 'Magma Spray deals 2 damage to target creature. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Put four 2/2 red and green Satyr creature tokens with haste onto the battlefield.', 'Put two 2/2 blue Bird enchantment creature tokens with flying onto the battlefield. Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Put two 2/3 red Minotaur creature tokens with haste onto the battlefield.', 'Reach\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard.\\n{1}{B}{G}, Exile Nyx Weaver: Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target creature and all Auras attached to it to their owners' hands.", 'Return up to one target instant card and up to one target sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand. Exile Pull from the Deep.', 'Reveal the top six cards of your library. Put up to three enchantment cards from among them into your hand and the rest of the revealed cards into your graveyard.', "Scry 3, then reveal the top card of your library. Draw cards equal to that card's converted mana cost. (To scry 3, look at the top three cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)", 'Spite of Mogis deals damage to target creature equal to the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard. Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', "Squelching Leeches's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Swamps you control.", "Starfall deals 3 damage to target creature. If that creature is an enchantment, Starfall deals 3 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Strive — Aerial Formation costs {2}{U} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nAny number of target creatures each get +1/+1 and gain flying until end of turn.', 'Strive — Ajani\'s Presence costs {2}{W} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nAny number of target creatures each get +1/+1 and gain indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', "Strive — Blinding Flare costs {R} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nAny number of target creatures can't block this turn.", 'Strive — Colossal Heroics costs {1}{G} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nAny number of target creatures each get +2/+2 until end of turn. Untap those creatures.', 'Strive — Consign to Dust costs {2}{G} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nDestroy any number of target artifacts and/or enchantments.', 'Strive — Cruel Feeding costs {2}{B} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nAny number of target creatures each get +1/+0 and gain lifelink until end of turn. (Damage dealt by a creature with lifelink also causes its controller to gain that much life.)', 'Strive — Desperate Stand costs {R}{W} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nAny number of target creatures each get +2/+0 and gain first strike and vigilance until end of turn.', 'Strive — Harness by Force costs {2}{R} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nGain control of any number of target creatures until end of turn. Untap those creatures. They gain haste until end of turn.', 'Strive — Hour of Need costs {1}{U} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nExile any number of target creatures. For each creature exiled this way, its controller puts a 4/4 blue Sphinx creature token with flying onto the battlefield.', "Strive — Kiora's Dismissal costs {U} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nReturn any number of target enchantments to their owners' hands.", 'Strive — Launch the Fleet costs {1} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nUntil end of turn, any number of target creatures each gain "Whenever this creature attacks, put a 1/1 white Soldier creature token onto the battlefield tapped and attacking."', "Strive — Nature's Panoply costs {2}{G} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nChoose any number of target creatures. Put a +1/+1 counter on each of them.", 'Strive — Phalanx Formation costs {1}{W} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nAny number of target creatures each gain double strike until end of turn. (They deal both first-strike and regular combat damage.)', 'Strive — Polymorphous Rush costs {1}{U} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nChoose a creature on the battlefield. Any number of target creatures you control each become a copy of that creature until end of turn.', 'Strive — Rouse the Mob costs {2}{R} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nAny number of target creatures each get +2/+0 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Strive — Setessan Tactics costs {G} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nUntil end of turn, any number of target creatures each get +1/+1 and gain "{T}: This creature fights another target creature."', 'Strive — Silence the Believers costs {2}{B} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nExile any number of target creatures and all Auras attached to them.', 'Strive — Solidarity of Heroes costs {1}{G} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nChoose any number of target creatures. Double the number of +1/+1 counters on each of them.', "Strive — Twinflame costs {2}{R} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nChoose any number of target creatures you control. For each of them, put a token that's a copy of that creature onto the battlefield. Those tokens have haste. Exile them at the beginning of the next end step.", 'Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of cards in your hand.', 'Temple of Epiphany enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Epiphany enters the battlefield, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R} to your mana pool.', 'Temple of Malady enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Malady enters the battlefield, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G} to your mana pool.', "Triton Shorestalker can't be blocked.", 'Vigilance, trample\\nOther Centaur creatures you control get +1/+1 and have vigilance and trample.', "Vigilance\\n{6}{G}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)", "When Banishing Light enters the battlefield, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Banishing Light leaves the battlefield. (That permanent returns under its owner's control.)", 'When Bearer of the Heavens dies, destroy all permanents at the beginning of the next end step.', 'When Brain Maggot enters the battlefield, target opponent reveals his or her hand and you choose a nonland card from it. Exile that card until Brain Maggot leaves the battlefield.', 'When Nessian Game Warden enters the battlefield, look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of Forests you control. You may reveal a creature card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "When Quarry Colossus enters the battlefield, put target creature into its owner's library just beneath the top X cards of that library, where X is the number of Plains you control.", 'When Returned Reveler dies, each player puts the top three cards of his or her library into his or her graveyard.', 'When Satyr Grovedancer enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', "When Scourge of Fleets enters the battlefield, return each creature your opponents control with toughness X or less to its owner's hand, where X is the number of Islands you control.", "When you're dealt combat damage, sacrifice Swarmborn Giant.\\n{4}{G}{G}: Monstrosity 2. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put two +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nAs long as Swarmborn Giant is monstrous, it has reach.", 'Whenever Sigiled Skink attacks, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', 'Whenever a player casts a spell with converted mana cost 3 or less, Eidolon of the Great Revel deals 2 damage to that player.', 'Whenever equipped creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nEquip {2}', 'Whenever you scry, you may pay {2}. If you do, Knowledge and Power deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', "You control target player during that player's next turn. Exile Worst Fears. (You see all cards that player could see and make all decisions for the player.)", "You have hexproof. (You can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", "You may choose not to untap Deserter's Quarters during your untap step.\\n{6}, {T}: Tap target creature. It doesn't untap during its controller's untap step for as long as Deserter's Quarters remains tapped.", '{1}{G}, Sacrifice Font of Fertility: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', '{1}{G}, Sacrifice Renowned Weaver: Put a 1/3 green Spider enchantment creature token with reach onto the battlefield. (It can block creatures with flying.)', '{1}{U}, Sacrifice Font of Fortunes: Draw two cards.', '{2}{W}, Sacrifice Font of Vigor: You gain 7 life.', '{3}{B}, Sacrifice Font of Return: Return up to three target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', '{3}{R}, Sacrifice Font of Ire: Font of Ire deals 5 damage to target player.', '{3}{U}: You may tap or untap target creature.', '{4}{W}: Prevent all damage that would be dealt to Stonewise Fortifier by target creature this turn.', "{5}{R}{R}: Monstrosity 1. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nWhen Wildfire Cerberus becomes monstrous, it deals 2 damage to each opponent and each creature your opponents control.", "{5}{R}{R}: Monstrosity 3. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put three +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)", '{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', '{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom of your library.)', "{U}, {T}: Each player reveals the top card of his or her library. You may put the revealed cards into their owners' graveyards. If you don't, each player draws a card.", '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.', "{X}{X}{G}: Monstrosity X. (If this creature isn't monstrous, put X +1/+1 counters on it and it becomes monstrous.)\\nWhen Hydra Broodmaster becomes monstrous, put X X/X green Hydra creature tokens onto the battlefield."]
original_type: ['Artifact', 'Artifact Creature — Chimera', 'Artifact — Equipment', 'Creature — Beast', 'Creature — Bird', 'Creature — Boar', 'Creature — Cat Cleric', 'Creature — Cat Monk', 'Creature — Cat Warrior', 'Creature — Centaur Scout', 'Creature — Centaur Warrior', 'Creature — Chimera', 'Creature — Cockatrice', 'Creature — Cyclops', 'Creature — Dragon', 'Creature — Elemental', 'Creature — Elk', 'Creature — Giant', 'Creature — Hound', 'Creature — Human Archer', 'Creature — Human Rogue', 'Creature — Human Shaman', 'Creature — Human Soldier', 'Creature — Human Warrior', 'Creature — Human Wizard', 'Creature — Hydra', 'Creature — Kraken', 'Creature — Leech', 'Creature — Lizard', 'Creature — Merfolk Rogue', 'Creature — Merfolk Soldier', 'Creature — Merfolk Wizard', 'Creature — Minotaur Warrior', 'Creature — Octopus', 'Creature — Satyr Shaman', 'Creature — Satyr Soldier', 'Creature — Siren', 'Creature — Siren Soldier', 'Creature — Snake', 'Creature — Starfish', 'Creature — Zombie Satyr', 'Enchantment', 'Enchantment Creature — Beast', 'Enchantment Creature — Chimera', 'Enchantment Creature — Cyclops', 'Enchantment Creature — Demon', 'Enchantment Creature — Elemental', 'Enchantment Creature — Giant', 'Enchantment Creature — Hound', 'Enchantment Creature — Human Cleric', 'Enchantment Creature — Human Soldier', 'Enchantment Creature — Human Warrior', 'Enchantment Creature — Insect', 'Enchantment Creature — Lamia', 'Enchantment Creature — Minotaur', 'Enchantment Creature — Nautilus', 'Enchantment Creature — Nymph', 'Enchantment Creature — Nymph Dryad', 'Enchantment Creature — Ox', 'Enchantment Creature — Sheep', 'Enchantment Creature — Siren', 'Enchantment Creature — Spider', 'Enchantment Creature — Spirit', 'Enchantment Creature — Zombie', 'Enchantment — Aura', 'Instant', 'Land', 'Legendary Artifact', 'Legendary Artifact — Equipment', 'Legendary Creature — Human', 'Legendary Enchantment Creature — God', 'Planeswalker — Ajani', 'Sorcery']
